window.FWN_HERO_SUMMONING_PEACE_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_HERO_SUMMONING_PEACE_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1601,"title":"Chapter 1601 - Nebulas New Creation 2","paragraphs":["Nebula has cultivated new tea leaves specially designed for royal milk tea. Since the idea came to me, I immediately decided to go and give some as a gift to Ein-san and Jutia-san.","I really feel like bragging a lot about Nebula at the moment...... Or rather, me coming to visit them is almost mainly for that reason. I feel like I understand how parents feel when they want to brag about their children. Well, it’s not like Nebula is my child though......","And so, I asked Ein-san and Jutia-san if they had any time to chat, without telling them what I wanted to talk about. It’s important that I don’t reveal the subject matter here. I wanted to keep the tea leaves a surprise, but of course, that wasn’t the only reason.","In situations where I ask about their plans, asking them along the lines of “I have something I’d like to talk to you about, but I’d like to confirm if we’re both free”...... Putting Jutia-san aside, when it comes to Ein-san, it’s almost certain she will prioritize me over her other plans unless it involves something related to Kuro.","While she isn’t as extreme as Pandora-san saying stuff like “As one of the Ten Demons, aligning my schedule with Kaito-sama’s convenience is only natural.”, it’s certain that Ein-san will prioritize me, even if it means putting her other plans on hold, so with gratitude and apologies in mind, for the time being, I sent a hummingbird asking “What are you doing right now?”.","Ein-san was apparently attending an Opinion Exchange Meeting with the World Maid Association at the moment...... Alright, I guess I’ll leave talking to Ein-san later. I don’t really want to get in any way involved with what’s going on over there, so I’ll just send her a “Do your best over there” and leave it at that. I mean, I got a reply in an instant even when she was in that Opinion Exchange Meeting...... How typical of Ein-san.","Then, a little later, I received a reply from Jutia-san. She told me that she was currently by the Spirit Tree in Rigforeshia.","Guess I got lucky on this one. I could teleport to Rigforeshia with my Teleportation Magic Tool, and because I had visited there during the Sacred Tree Festival, I knew the location of the Spirit Tree Forest.","I thought it would be a good idea to visit Jutia-san, and when I asked her about her schedule, she said she had no particular plans at the moment and that there would be no problems if I came to see her, so I decided to go to the Spirit Tree Forest in Rigforeshia right away and activated my Teleportation Magic Tool.","Teleporting to Rigforeshia, I started walking around. To go to the Spirit Tree Forest, I don’t need to pass through Rigforeshia’s central area, and instead, I opted to veer significantly to the right from the front gate, the teleportation location I had registered, making my way to the forest.","Going through all this saves me trouble. I’ve become strangely famous in Rigforeshia, so I don’t want to walk around the town too much...... I think I understand a bit how Neun-san feels.","This being the case, I wish I had some kind of magic tool that could allow me to use Recognition Inhibition Magic...... but I guess that would be difficult huh? The fact that even the Count-rank Neun-san said she wasn’t good at it should mean it must be advanced magic, and in the first place, if there’s a magic tool like that, Neun-san would have used it.","When I first went to Archlesia Empire, I thought the cloak that the spies were using might have Recognition Inhibition Magic effects to it, but it turns out that the cloak only prevents Magic Detection and helps conceal the presence of a person’s magic power. Their ability to hide their physical presence is more of a technique exclusive to those spies, so even if I were to use it, it wouldn’t be of any use for me.","(Well, I have great news for you, Kaito-san. Oh my, for a limited time only, if you go on a lovey-dovey date with me, you can get your hands on an accessory that holds the effect of Recognition Inhibition Magic. Furthermore, if it’s an overnight date, we’ll add Information Concealment Magic as a bonus, and as a limited-time offer, we’ll even gift you another one of the same item as a present.)","Hey, that kinda sounded like a weird TV shopping channel’s promotion! N- No, but...... I honestly want that. I have many instances where I could use it, and if I get another one as an extra, I can give it to Neun-san as a gift.","Besides, it’s not like this is in any way disadvantageous to me. If it’s just a date with my lover, Shiro-san, I’ll usually agree even without such an exchange.","......It’s just, what I’m curious about was that lovey-dovey part she said earlier. It’s just my gut feeling, but I have a feeling she’s up to something...... Rather, I feel like she had stocked up on some kind of weird knowledge again.","Shiro-san, I don’t mind the date, and I have no problem with it being overnight either...... but what’s your plans for that date?","(Doki☆ A 2-Day 1-Night Onsen Trip Just for Two)","She really came up with something terrific...... And the completely monotone way she said that “Doki” really is something else.","(I have improved the onsen I went to with Kaito-san before. I’ve turned the onsen inn into something authentic, created dedicated spaces and even created extensive nature around. I also created a Mt. Fuji while I’m at it.)","Well, she made quite an amazing statement there...... I mean, even if you created something with exactly the same form as the real deal, is it really alright to call a mountain created in another world Mt. Fuji? No, well, I don’t really care about it myself...... Rather, since she already made all that, I guess she already assumed I’m giving her an OK in the first place?","(Is it no good?)","I think that way of asking is incredibly unfair. No, as I said before, I’m happy to go on a date with you, and I also have no problem with an overnight stay later.","(It’s decided then. Let’s talk about the date later...... I’ll also give you the promised gifts at that time.)","Hm? I was supposed to deliver tea leaves to Jutia-san, but somehow, a mysterious event occurred where an overnight onsen trip with Shiro-san was decided...... Well...... Alrighty then.","<Afterword>","? ? ? : [Look at that. The protagonist, who had just gone out and walked around, had triggered an event as abruptly as usual and overcame it. Those who already got the experience really are different.]","Serious-senpai : [His event outbreak resistance is too high.]"]},{"number":1602,"title":"Chapter 1602: Nebulas New Creation 3","paragraphs":["The Spirit Tree Forest is the last place I visited during the Sacred Tree Festival, and it’s been quite a while since then. Though I say that, Elven Spirit Mages and other people often enter the forest, and this place does serve as the venue for the Harvest Festival, so the paths are relatively well-maintained and easy to walk on.","And as soon as I entered the forest, several small lights appeared around me, and the Spirits revealed themselves.","[......!]","[Hello———- Whoa!?]","As these Spirits somewhat feel familiar, I couldn’t help thinking that they might be the ones who helped me during the Harvest Festival...... After the Spirits looked at me with surprised expressions on their faces, they simultaneously approached and crowded around me.","They then started happily patting my head, my shoulders and other parts of my body, joy visible on their faces. I could see through my Sympathy Magic that they were welcoming my visit with warmth and delight.","[I’m delighted by the welcome. Ahh, I brought cookies just like last time, so everyone eat them if you like.]","I was comforted by the sight of the happy Spirits, but there were so many that I couldn’t see the path in front of me. So, for the time being, I told them that I had brought cookies as a souvenir and taking out a large basket, I put it on the ground.","Thereupon, about half of the Spirits shifted their interest from me to the basket, and I was about to see the path in front of me to some extent. At that moment, I called out to a nearby Spirit.","[I’m here to see Jutia-san, but do you know where I can find her?]","[......!? ......!]","[Ah, you’re going to guide me to her? Thank you.]","The Spirit I spoke to nodded to my question, and after lightly tapping her chest, she started flying in front of me. As it seemed like she would be guiding me, I lightly waved goodbye to the other Spirits before following the Spirit guiding me deep into the forest.","After about 10 minutes of walking through the forest, we arrived at what looked like a small open space. In the center of it is a very huge tree...... A tree as big as the one in the center of Rigforeshia, and the Spirit points in that direction.","[Jutia-san is here?]","“Oya oya, oya oya, you’ve finally arrived. Welcome, Kaito, I bid you welcome!”","[Whoa...... Jutia-san?]","“Oops, my bad, my bad, I must have surprised you. Wait a moment, okay?”","I was surprised to suddenly hear a voice echoing from the big tree, but I think...... the big tree in the center of this open space is Jutia-san.","As if to affirm that thought, the large tree in front of me split from its center, seemingly forming into two branches, and from between them emerged Jutia-san.","The tree that had split into two branches began to twist, transforming into Jutia-san’s dragon-like wooden horns. I guess it’s like how Lillywood-san’s tree turns into her staff?","[That should do it.]","[Hello, Jutia-san.]","[Hello, Kaito. Glad you came, glad you came. Once again, I always welcome the visit of a friend.]","Jutia-san, who welcomed me with a bright and gentle smile, still exuded a warm and comforting aura that always seemed to carry kindness.","[Even so, even so, Kaito sure is liked by Spirits. The trees here in the Spirit Tree Forest are also accepting Kaito with open arms. That’s great, that’s great, loving nature and being loved by nature is fantastic.]","[I certainly am happy for the Spirits’ welcome. It reminded me of the time when we harvested Fruits of the Spirit Tree together at the Sacred Tree Festival.]","[That I heard, that I heard, Kaito got the highest record of all time then, right? Unnn, unnn, excellent, excellent.]","After a little while, Jutia-san, after giving me her unreserved praise, slightly tilted her head and spoke.","[So, so? You were looking for me, but what’s the matter? If you’re in some kind of trouble, I’d be happy to help you out.]","[Ahh, no, it’s not that I’m troubled with anything...... Jutia-san, do you remember the tea leaves Nebula made?]","[Of course I do. Those tea leaves were truly wonderful. Thinking about various combinations is so, so much fun. I also occasionally exchange opinions with Ein-sama and other tea enthusiasts, which adds to the enjoyment.]","[I’m glad you liked them. Actually, today, Nebula has cultivated new tea leaves———-]","[What did you say!?]","[———-Whoa!?]","Jutia-san was talking happily, but the moment she heard my words, she snapped at my words with tremendous vigor. To be more specific, she was already floating in front of me before I knew it, and in an instant, she came at a distance close enough for a kiss.","She has the nice smell of a forest, but putting that aside, her gaze towards me is incredibly intense......","[N- New tea leaves? A new creation from the revolutionary tea manufacturer? What kind, what kind? I’m curious, I’m curious!]","[Wait, Jutia-san!? Please calm down. I’ll properly explain it to you! Please move back......]","[Oops, my bad, my bad. Can’t help myself, can’t help myself......]","Hmmm. It seems that the impact of the previous tea leaves was even greater than I thought. Jutia-san was so enthusiastic about it that she looked frantic...... When I give Ein-san’s share to her, I’ll choose my words more carefully. Her coming at me with Jutia-san’s level of enthusiasm could be too overwhelming.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [I just thought of something. Being famous in the tea industry would mean they’ll inevitably be the center of attention in the Maid World...... Feels like they’re gonna start calling it mystical tea leaves or something along those lines."]},{"number":1603,"title":"Chapter 1603: Nebulas New Creation 4","paragraphs":["Prompted by Jutia-san’s keen interest in Nebula’s new tea leaves, I quickly took out the tea leaves dedicated to Royal Milk Tea and explained.","[I see, I see...... It’s specially made for royal milk tea. Interesting, interesting. I’m interested to see how it tastes like. Can I try brewing it right away?]","[Ah, yes. It’s alright...... Here though?]","I could sense that Jutia-san wanted to try the tea leaves right away, but even though we were in an open area, we were still in the middle of a forest. When I asked her that with such a thought in mind, Jutia-san grinned.","[That ain’t it, that ain’t it. I have all the tools and other stuff in hand, and I’m going to make it at my house. Also, also. I’d like to invite you, Kaito, but are you free?]","[Yes, I don’t have any urgent plans.]","[It’s decided then. Well then, well then, I’ll teleport us towards there...... I’ll touch you a bit, okay?]","I was invited by Jutia-san to her home, and just like that, Jutia-san, looking quite excited, lightly put her hand on my shoulder. Thereupon, the scenery changed in an instant and I found myself in a wooden room.","In the atmospheric room with stylish walls, the walls were lined with a variety of pots and cans filled with tea leaves, creating a tea-lover’s dream room. There were also numerous teapots and cups, adding to the overall tea-themed ambiance.","It was somewhat like a combination of a dining room and kitchen...... Looking around, I can see what seemed to be a forest outside the window, so I guess I’m in some forest somewhere...... most likely in the center of Great Forest in Yggfresis? Garden of Myriad Flowers, where Rosemary-san lives, is also in the center of the Great Forest......","[It’s amazing. Not just tea, you also had this many cups......]","[Tea, you see, while what you put directly into your mouth such as the tea leaves, its taste depends on the tools such as cups and pots. That’s why, that’s why, I also have a collection of cups and pots other than the ones shown here.]","[Heehhh...... I see, you sure are very particular about your tea leaves...... Ahh, that’s right.]","[Unnn?]","The fact that she’s fussy about not only the tea leaves but also the cups and pots gives me the impression that she’s a genuine tea lover. No, she actually seems to be interacting with Ein-san, so I guess her obsession with tea really is different.","At that moment, I suddenly remembered the pots and cups I once sold at Archlesia Empire’s Founding Festival. Even after I sold my stuff over there, Nebula and Illness-san usually make ceramics, so I have more on hand than just the ones Amel-san and I sold.","Well, for some reason, they continued labeling them with my brand mark even after the Founding Festival had ended, so I suppose Nebula and Illness-san’s products would continue having that brand mark.","[These teacups and pots are also made by Nebula and Illness-san...... so if Jutia-san wants, you can have these.]","[These are...... Is it alright? Is it alright? From what I see, these have a very good quality, you know? With the quality of these things, I will properly pay for them.]","[No, don’t worry about it. I have a good number of those, and I know that the tea-loving Jutia-san will take good care of them.]","[Thanks. Well then, well then, I’ll take you up for your word then. Unnn, unnn. It has good thickness, and since we’re at it, I’ll brew a pot of royal milk tea with it. Kaito, sit there and wait for me.]","[Ah, yes. I’m in your care.]","Jutia-san seemed to like the cups and pots I gave her, and after smiling happily, she asked me to sit down while she went into the kitchen area of the room.","And with very experienced movements, she started preparing to brew tea.","[I’ve got good tea leaves, so I think I’ll use good milk as well. I wonder if Kaito prefers it on the sweeter side or the lighter side?]","[Hmmm, sweet ones, I guess? I like sweet flavors quite a bit......]","[I see, I see, I like sweet flavors too. Having the same tastes as you makes me happy~~ It makes me happy~~]","With a cheerful and fun demeanor, the tea was skillfully prepared, and a little while later, a delicious-looking royal milk tea was placed in front of me.","[Thanks for waiting, thanks for waiting. Come on, here you go.]","[Thank you...... Unnn. It really is delicious.]","The royal milk tea, which was sweeter than the one I had at home, combined with the warm atmosphere of Jutia-san’s house, was truly heartwarming and delicious.","Sitting in the seat across from me, Jutia-san took a sip of royal milk tea and had a surprised expression on her face.","[......Oh my, amazing, this is amazing! Unlike when made with regular tea leaves, its harmony with milk is on a completely different level! How nice, how nice, this is excellent. There’s so much potential for further experimentation with this too...... K- Kaito...... If it’s possible, ummm......]","[Ah, yes. I thought you might ask me something like that, so I’ve brought a can of these tea leaves, and according to Nebula, if you want, she’s willing to periodically provide it just like the tea leaves from before.]","[Thanks! I’m so happy, I’m so happy. Seriously, I’m glad that I met Kaito...... Ahh, sorry, sorry. This could sound like I’m just being materialistic...... but, but, regardless of the tea leaves and all that, it’s true that I’m happy to have met Kaito.]","[Ahaha, thank you. Hearing you say that makes me happy.]","Jutia-san’s bashful smile, combined with her petite physique, made her look cute, and how should I say this...... Along with the taste of the royal milk tea, it makes me feel warm and cozy.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Jutia is, well, in any case...... The problem is what’s after. I wonder how that maid will react......]"]},{"number":1604,"title":"Chapter 1604: Nebulas New Creation 5","paragraphs":["After visiting Jutia-san, I finally went to visit Ein-san. It seems that the Opinion Exchange Meeting she had with the World Maid Association had already ended, and when I visited Kuro’s castle, she pleasantly welcomed me.","[Welcome, Kaito-sama.]","[Hello, I’m sorry for the sudden visit today.]","[No, Kaito-sama is always welcome here. It’s just, my apologies. Kuromu-sama is currently away at the moment, attending a regular meeting for her trading companies.]","[Ahh, no, this time, I didn’t come here for Kuro, but for you, Ein-san.]","It seems that Ein-san thought I came to visit Kuro. Indeed, after inquiring about her situation once, I simply said “Do your best over there” without stating the purpose of my inquiry before visiting them again. That being the case, it’s not surprising that Ein-san thought my business was for someone else, not for her.","The reason why I didn’t tell her my business when I first asked her via hummingbird was because I didn’t really want to get involved in whatever mysterious rituals the Maid World is doing......","[Kaito-sama wanted to see me?]","[Yes, actually, Nebula has cultivated new tea leaves and I’m shari———-]","[Thank you very much!!!]","[———–Wait, Ein-san!?]","I hadn’t fully conveyed all of my intentions yet, but before I knew it, Ein-san instantly appeared before me. She held my hands with both of hers, looking at me with sparkling eyes.","She’s just like Jutia-san...... No, her intensity felt even greater than hers. Moreover, she’s so close...... close enough that if I move a little bit, we would end up kissing.","[U- Umm, Ein-san?]","[Nebula-sama’s new creation! How wonderful. When one speaks of the new creation of Nebula-sama, the one who cultivated those tea leaves, embarrassing this may sound, but I couldn’t help feeling excited!]","[I- I guess so. You’re conveying that thought so much that I feel like it’s too much...... It’s just, umm, you’re pretty close, so let’s calm down a bit......]","[......Oya? Please excuse me.]","I could feel Ein-san’s enthusiasm, but in any case, her face is too close. It may be a bit late to say this, but Ein-san is an incredibly beautiful person. Being so close to her that I can feel her breath makes me nervous.","If you exclude her extreme obsession about maids, Ein-san exudes an atmosphere of a calm and composed capable adult woman, akin to her position as the eldest daughter of Kuro’s family...... No, seriously, if we exclude topics related to maids, I think Ein-san would have a relatively proper personality...... I’ll say this again, but that’s if we exclude topics related to maids......","[......Errr, Ein-san?]","[Face slightly reddening and body temperature rising...... Fumu, being close to my face, Kaito-sama became tense...... No, in this case...... Can I take it as Kaito-sama being conscious of me?]","Even though Ein-san apologized for being so close, she showed no sign of pulling away at all. On the contrary, she seemed quite interested, observing my behavior closely.","[Y- You’re right. I was surprised by the sudden situation, so I’m feeling tense.]","[I see...... I apologize for repeating the question, but in this case, is the nervousness due to surprise? Or perhaps, have you become somewhat conscious of me as someone of the opposite sex?]","[......I- If I really had to answer that...... It’s the latter, I guess?]","[I see, I see......]","Eh? The heck is with this embarrassment play? Why is it that I’m being asked such embarrassing questions? I was supposed to come here only to deliver tea...... but later on, I somehow feel like Ein-san seems to be enjoying herself.","Thinking that way, as the cool expression Ein-san usually has turning to a smile, she spoke.","[......Well then, why don’t we go further and have a kiss? Kaito-sama is the one I love second in the world, but as someone of the opposite sex, you are the one I love the most, so I’m completely fine with it, you know?]","[Hahh!? Wait, E- Ein-san!?? W- W- W- What are you suddenly......]","[......Fufu, please excuse me. I found myself wanting to tease Kaito-sama a little bit.]","Ein-san said, a mischievous smile on her lips...... Ein-san may appear cool, but she does have a reasonably playful side like this, so she occasionally engages in teasing words or actions like this.","It was the same when we were taking a mixed bath during the Six Kings Festival, but the fact that I couldn’t tell how serious she was being is somewhat bewitching.","As I was thinking this, Ein-san pulled her face away from mine, lightly stroking her lips with her finger. Due to her previous statement though, my gaze naturally shifts towards her lips.","[......By the way, Kaito-sama. Out of simple curiosity, I have a question......]","[Yes?]","[If one kisses while time is stopped, would those count in the number of kisses one does? Or perhaps, do kisses not count if the other party isn’t aware of it?]","[......Eh? W- Why are you asking...... Eh? D- Don’t tell me......]","[I wonder, what do you think? Fufufu.]","As I watched Ein-san giggle with a playful smile on her lips after saying that, I felt like my cheeks became warmer than they were just a moment ago.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Fuaaahhh———–!?]","? ? ? : [Ah, she got blown away by the unexpected surprise attack.]"]},{"number":1605,"title":"Chapter 1605: Nebulas New Creation 6","paragraphs":["Ein-san’s unexpected behavior brought my mind off-topic. S- She just said that in a teasing manner, but I don’t think she actually executed it. She...... didn’t actually execute it, right? W- What the heck happened?","I have Shiro-san’s Blessing that nullifies some magic, but I don’t know what the criteria were for it to nullify something. However, I do know that it nullifies magic that is judged to have hostile intent toward me.","For example, Alice’s magical transformations would normally not be canceled by my touch. However, according to Kuro, if Alice uses her magical transformation “with the intent to deceive my senses”, it would be judged as hostile magic.","Therefore, in Alice’s case, her magical transformation was canceled when we first met and when she touched me during the mixed bathing at the Six Kings Festival, but at other times, even when our bodies were in contact with each other, her transformation wasn’t canceled.","I think the same principle applies to Time Stop. In reality, I can’t perceive or move within Chronois-san’s Time Stop. However, I think that if the user, Chronois-san, were to try to restrain me or interfere with my action using Time Stop, it might be nullified...... I’m not quite sure about the criteria in that regard, and even if I were to ask Shiro-san, the response I’d undoubtedly get would be an “I dunno?”.","Or perhaps, since the Gods’ Authority is a degraded copy of Shiro-san’s power, it might still be effective...... Ahh, but what about Fate-san’s Authority of Fate though...... Or rather, it seems that Shiro-san has made significant adjustments compared to the Blessing she had on me before. Now, the effects of those like Recovery Magic that used to be blocked by the Blessing can be received normally, so I’m not quite sure about the specific conditions either.","Heck, if I’m gonna ask someone, I feel like Chronois-san might have a more accurate understanding of Shiro-san’s Blessing than Shiro-san, so I guess I should ask her about it next time.",".","Well, my thoughts went off on a tangent, but in the end, if you ask me if the act of “stopping time so that someone can kiss me” is a hostile act towards me...... I’m not so sure.","In a sense, you could say that such a thing was an action that disregards my will. However, if asked whether I would feel uncomfortable if Ein-san were to kiss me...... Well, that would be a definite no. Heck, being kissed is something that makes me happy.","[Kaito-sama?]","[Ah, no, I’m sorry. It’s nothing!]","Well, since I can’t really know for sure, there’s no point in dwelling on this. Let’s not worry too much about this matter. Overthinking might just lead me into a loop of uncertainty......","With that in mind, I switched my thoughts and brought out a can of tea leaves, the main subject of my visit, from my magic box.","[So this is Nebula-sama’s...... May I open it?]","[Ah, yes. Help yourself......]","[Please excuse me.]","Seeing Ein-san’s eyes fixated on the tea can, I handed it over to her. Without delay, Ein-san opened the can and started examining the tea leaves with great interest.","[You see, these are......]","[......Tea leaves suitable for milk tea...... No...... for royal milk tea, right?]","[Eh? You can tell just by looking at it?]","[Yes, for top-notch maids, being able to envision the perfect brew just by looking at the leaves and smelling their fragrance is but a matter of course.]","There it is again, the maids’ mysterious omnipotence. But in this person’s case, while her thoughts may be eccentric, she isn’t just being delusional. It’s nasty how she can actually execute what she imagines.","In front of me, with a mixture of surprise and astonishment on my face, Ein-san continues to gaze at the tea leaves with a serious expression on her face.","[......However, the finished product that I picture in my mind is somewhat blurred. Is the process different? ......I see, perhaps, the tea leaves do not require unfurling the tea leaves with a small amount of hot water and can be extracted with only 100% milk?]","[T- That’s right.]","[I knew that was the case. I can finally see a distinct image in mind. As expected of Nebula-sama, she’s truly amazing. Even with my abilities, it would take me some time to envision its completed form...... Fufu, this would indeed bring about a new revolution.]","No, it is quite amazing, or rather, it’s astonishing that she could seriously guess everything just by looking at the tea leaves. It seems that I don’t need to explain much anymore, but even still, I explained everything to her as Nebula told me, to which Ein-san nodded her head in understanding.","She seemed calm, but I could somewhat sense that she was getting excited and wanted to brew these tea leaves as soon as possible.","Wryly smiling at the sight of such an Ein-san, I suddenly remembered something and took out a wooden case from my magic box.","[By the way, Ein-san. Nebula said to hand this item to you...... It’s apparently something you commissioned from her?]","[Ahh, that’s the tea set I asked her to make for me. Being a top-notch maid myself, I have also indulged in the hobby of crafting tea cups and other items used for tea...... When she offered to make the trophy for the Maid Olympia, I knew that Nebula-sama’s pottery-making skills surpass mine, so I have often commissioned her to make ceramics for me. As expected, as a maid, I can’t compromise on my tea supplies.]","[......I- I see......]","I would like it if you’d refrain from assuming that being a top-notch maid automatically means being able to create a tea set. In normal circumstances, maids and pottery wouldn’t have any connection at all...... Wait, speaking of which, Illness-san can do it too...... Arehh? Does being a top-notch maid seriously mean they can also do pottery?","Geez, seriously, I don’t know how many times I’ve asked this already...... but what the heck is a maid......","<Afterword>","? ? ? : [That’s true. What’s tricky about Ein-san is that she may appear to be speaking delusions, but in reality, she can actually do everything she claims, which makes her quite troublesome.]"]},{"number":1606,"title":"Chapter 1606: Nebulas New Creation 7","paragraphs":["Regardless of how she constantly rambles about maid this and maid that all the time, witnessing Ein-san’s greatness, I’m torn between being impressed or dumbfounded, when Ein-san, holding the can of tea, spoke.","[Well then, I’m thinking of brewing royal milk tea using these tea leaves right away, but Kaito-sama, how about joining me for tea?]","[Ah, in that case, don’t mind if I do.]","[Then, let’s move to my room.]","[Yes...... Unnn? Ein-san’s room?]","Hearing the words she spoke quite casually, there was a slight delay in my reaction. No, thinking about it again, it’s only natural that Ein-san would have a room in Kuro’s castle but.......","[Yes, it was fortunately quite near from here, so it seems just right...... If you think such a place isn’t convenient, should we go to the dining room instead?]","[Ah, no, Ein–san’s room is alright.]","[This way then.]","Even so, Ein-san’s room huh...... I honestly can’t imagine what it was like. I’ve been to Kuro’s residence several times, and I’ve visited the rooms of the people I know.","The first is Neun-san’s room, which has a small house with a garden, the second is Raz-san’s room, which had small and fancy furniture, and the third is Acht and Eva-san’s room, which looked more like a brawling gym instead of a room...... Each of their rooms has the occupants’ characteristics.","That being the case, is Ein-san’s room gonna be full of maid goods all over the place or something like that? No, but even though Ein-san has an obsession with the word “maid”, it isn’t like she’s one of those who opt to collect maid-related items. If anything, it feels more like there would be a row of tea supplies like at Jutia-san’s house.","Thinking in such a way, I followed Ein-san and before long, we arrived at Ein-san’s room.","[Please come in. Well, it’s a room with nothing much in it......]","[Excuse my intrusion...... Ohh......]","Upon entering the room, I found it to be an extremely simple yet stylish room. It doesn’t have any particular decorations, and there were minimal furnishings, seemingly only having the bare essentials. However, this allowed the overall space of the room to appear larger, and despite the lack of ornaments, the arrangement was done in a way that felt stylish.","How should I say this...... It had the atmosphere of a stylish private space belonging to someone who is competent at their job.","[It’s beautiful. Even though the interior is simple, that’s kinda what makes it stylish......]","[Thank you. I’ve basically only laid out the bare essentials in this room. Of course, I do own many more items beyond what you see here, but most of them are stored using Time and Space Magic. I won’t spurn the act of decorating one’s room with various items, but personally, I don’t favor wastefulness and instead prioritize functionality.]","[I see, when you put it that way, this room certainly reflects Ein-san’s style...... It’s just, my apologies for saying something impolite, but because you were so dedicated to your job as a maid, I thought that you don’t use your room much and decided to only lay out the essential furniture. Hahaha......]","[.......................]","It isn’t like I actually meant those words. It was more like a joke that crossed my mind for a moment, so I said such a thing while chuckling. However, Ein-san, who had been walking just ahead of me, suddenly came to a stop. And then, I’m not sure if it was just my imagination or not, but Ein-san’s cheeks were twitching, which was rather unusual for Ein-san. It was as if “those words hit the bullseye”......","[......Errr, Ein-san?]","[............No, I do use it...... umm...... 30 minutes...... ah, no, about an hour a month......]","I wonder, can this really be called Ein-san’s room? Speaking of which, I remember Kuro mentioning something like how Ein-san never rests and occasionally has to be forced to take breaks...... This seriously feels more like she’s not using this room at all.","[I- I maintain my status as the resident maid. A maid should always be a maid, and a maid that I am, I should always be performing my duties.]","[......Kuro had complained to me that Ein-san doesn’t rest at all though.]","[......Well then, I will go and brew a pot of royal milk tea, so please wait here in this seat, Kaito-sama.]","She ran away!? With an awkward look on her face, she seriously ran away!? Seems like she really dislikes rest...... being in a state where she’s not working as a maid. How should I say this...... That certainly sounds very much like EIn-san, but I could also understand why Kuro complains about this.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [That’s strange, why the heck are they having that Ein Route-like exchanges? Just quickly make that royal milk tea and go on to the next arc......]"]},{"number":1607,"title":"Chapter 1607: Nebulas New Creation 8","paragraphs":["As I chuckled at Ein-san’s unexpected side...... No, I guess that workaholic side of her was understandable in some ways, but in any case, a little later, a cup of royal milk tea was placed in front of me.","[Thank you for waiting. The tea leaves really are wonderful. I brewed it simply this time, but I look forward to further research.]","[Thank you...... Oh, this is great. I’ve kinda had 3 cups of this so far, but this is the best I’ve tasted.]","The royal milk tea that Ein-san brewed for me was incredible, to say the least. What Illness-san brewed, as well as what Jutia-san brewed for me, were both very delicious, but this one was clearly one rank above the others. I mean, it perfectly matched my taste and resonated with me.","[The brewing method itself hasn’t changed much, but for royal milk tea, the temperature is something crucial. The way one perceives its taste can vary depending on its temperature. Of course, I am fully aware of Kaito-sama’s taste preferences, so I simply made adjustments to align with that.]","[Heehhh...... It certainly feels comforting, or rather, it does perfectly match my taste.]","I guess this is to be expected of Ein-san. For her to completely understand my preferences and make adjustments accordingly, Ein-san’s skill is truly remarkable...... As for why Ein-san understands my preferences perfectly, well, it’s Ein-san we’re talking about here, so her being able to do that isn’t surprising.","At that moment, a thought suddenly crossed my mind. As usual, after Ein-san served me the milk tea, she just stood by the side of the table, which slightly bothered me, so I decided to suggest sitting together.","[Ein-san, since we’re at it, how about drinking the tea together with me?]","[Fumu, but Kaito-sama, I am a maid, so it’s natural for me to stand and wait in situations like this.]","[That may be so, but isn’t it also a maid’s duty to respond to requests within a reasonable range?]","[......Mhmm? I see, now that you mentioned it, this is the request of Kaito-sama, our guest, and given that we’re in a private space, away from the eyes of others...... Indeed......]","When it comes to persuading Ein-san, the most effective approach, naturally, is to intertwine the discussion with one related to maids. While it might be questionable for maids to sit in during tea, Ein-san has consistently maintained her stance that the role of each maid is unique, just as how there are maids like Luna-san who do join their masters at the tea table.","While I’m not Ein-san’s master by any means, one can currently say that I’m a welcomed guest, and in such a situation, if it’s my request, there’s no reason for Ein-san to refuse.","After a brief moment of contemplation, Ein-san wryly smiled, and after briefly disappearing, she reappeared, holding her own teacup, taking the seat opposite mine.","[Well then, since Kaito-sama kindly invited me, I’ll take a seat at the same table.]","[Ah, yes...... Somehow, this feels a bit refreshing.]","[You’re right. For me as well, the opportunity to sit at the same table with someone and enjoy tea like this is extremely rare. ......Even so, fufu......]","[Unnn?]","[For one to preach the Way of the Maid to me, I suppose it’s to be expected of Kaito-sama. If I were to borrow Kuromu-sama’s words, she describes it as “Afexion Meter”, right? In any case, I feel that my fondness for Kaito-sama has grown even stronger.]","[A- Ahaha......]","Using the approach of involving maids in persuading Ein-san is indeed effective. However, I feel like one drawback is that the more I use this tactic...... the more the mysterious role of Maid Advisor Ein-san had established in her mind is being established.",".","In fact, Ein-san’s favorability of me seems to have increased, as she’s now looking at me with an even higher level of respect than before. I mean, even before it increased, I feel like her affection meters were already quite high...... but there’s still room for further increase huh.","[I find that my understanding of maids has deepened once again. This, too, is something for which I must express my gratitude to you, Kaito-sama.]","[Eh? Ahh, no, don’t worry about it. It’s not like you have to express your gratitude or anything like that......]","[Oya? Are you sure you don’t mind?]","[......Hmmm?]","[No, like I said, it’s my gratitude, you know? Not at least asking me what my gratitude would be———- would be a waste, don’t you think?]","[ ! ? ]","It was a momentary incident. In the middle of her sentence, Ein-san disappeared, and then, with her face so close that her breath was brushing against my ear, she whispered such alluring words to me.","As her breath brushed against my ear, her voice engulfing me with pleasant comfort, an indescribable shiver ran down my spine, leaving me in a state of astonishment. By the time I came to my senses though, Ein-san was already seated across from me, a smile visible on her lips.","[......E- Ein-san, are you teasing me?]","[Oh my? I wonder about that? There is indeed a part of me that finds Kaito-sama’s reactions adorable, so it is difficult to completely deny it. However...... the fondness I hold for you is by no means a joke nor a lie.]","As Ein-san said that with an impish smile, I could see that she was in a very cheerful mood. How should I say this...... While I was glad to see yet another new side of Ein-san, there was also this sense of embarrassment I’m feeling, as if I was being led around by the nose...... Well, not like this embarrassment makes me feel uncomfortable or anything like that......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Kuh, guaaahhh...... T- This is rough. As for what’s rough, well, even though it looks like an older person teasing someone younger than them, Ein’s Affection Meter is actually really high, so what she’s doing is no different from how she’d usually make her passes on someone...... I could feel the sweetness.]"]},{"number":1608,"title":"Chapter 1608: A Reward For Lilia 1","paragraphs":["There are hardly any days between Archlesia Empire’s Founding Festival and Hydra Kingdom’s Founding Festival. It’s barely a month away, and people who open stalls at both festivals are probably quite busy.","Festivals are the time when one rakes in the greatest profits, so I think it’s very important for those who are doing such business.","Well, regarding Hydra Kingdom’s Founding Festival, I’m just going to enjoy it like the other festival-goers, so I won’t be opening any stalls and won’t need to make any special preparations. In fact, even transportation is covered by Alice’s Teleportation Magic, so there really is no need for any preparations. It’s quite the carefree situation I have.","[......Eh? Then, is Lilia-san also attending Hydra Kingdom’s Founding Festival? That means it’s a complete All-Three Nation clear, isn’t it?]","[Yes, I mean...... My participation in Archlesia Empire’s Founding Festival may have been a sudden decision, but I originally planned to attend Hydra Kingdom’s Founding Festival. Her Majesty Laguna frequently comes to my household and I often interact with her after all......]","[Well, even if she says “she interacts with her”, Her Majesty Laguna just comes to have some heated battle with Milady......]","Speaking of which, I was wondering why Laguna-san comes here quite a bit, but so that’s how it was huh...... She fights with Lilia-san about once a month. And in those times, she would also drop by to visit me......","It seems that the current abilities of Lilia-san and Laguna-san are nearly equal, and they are continuously improving through their victories and defeats. However, according to Laguna-san, “I feel like I won’t be able to catch up with her within a few years”, so Lilia-san’s growth rate seems to be truly remarkable.","[The Founding Festival has also been quite a topic of conversation between us, and saying it’s rough would be an understatement. Fortunately, Kaito-san isn’t opening a stall, so the big names in attendance are relatively modest......]","[Hmmm? Is there something special happening in Hydra Kingdom as well?]","[Yes, there’s quite a buzz about the unveiling of a treasured monument that the First Hero-sama bestowed upon Her Majesty Laguna in Hydra Kingdom. It’s believed that this could provide evidence for the theory of First Hero-sama’s continued existence in this world, garnering significant attention from the public...... Well, I already know about the truth of this matter though......]","[Yeah......]","I see, so Laguna-san went with that kind of strategy huh. Thinking about it again, among Laguna-san’s connections, Neun-san could be considered as her ultimate trump card, with a level of fame comparable to the Six Kings and the Supreme Gods. I don’t think Neun-san was entirely enthusiastic about it, but Laguna-san probably managed to skillfully persuade her.","[Well, but as long as they’re just unveiling that monument, there shouldn’t be any particular concern for anything to happen to Lilia-san, so that’s a relief.]","[You’re right. I’m not particularly involved in this matter, so I’m just going to leisurely watch how things turn out.]","[Is that really how it would turn out though? Logically speaking, nothing should happen, but seeing Miyama-sama and Milady looking that optimistic about it makes me feel like something might actually occur.]","[......Don’t jinx it.]","Ahh~~ To be honest, I think I get what Luna-san feels. As the reason for most of the things that happened around us was me, so I can’t really say this out loud, when Lilia-san says “It’ll be alright”, I can’t shake off the feeling that some kind of trouble might actually occur.","However, it’s not like there’s any possibility of something happening to Lilia-san...... isn’t something I can really say. In the first place, the attendees have already been decided, so there wouldn’t be anyone else added other than those listed...... so it should be alright...... I think.","After chatting over tea with Kaito, Lilia, who was working in her office, was taking a break after asking Lunamaria to deliver some documents.","Thereupon, at that moment, she suddenly saw a light flash in front of her eyes...... and Eden appeared.","[E- Eden-sama!?]","[At ease. I’ve come this time to fulfill my promise. I had been indebted to you during Archlesia Empire’s Founding Festival after all.]","[Ah, no, it’s my honor to be of service.]","[I have prepared two things for you as a reward for your hard work. First would be this. Touch this cogwheel.]","[Eh? Ah, yes——— !?]","Upon touching the cogwheel Eden held out to her, Lilia immediately felt as if something was entering her body. Then, after about 5 seconds...... Her eyes opened wide.","[......Hauteclere?]","[Hou, so that’s the name of your Heart Tool...... You probably already understand how to use it and its effects, so while you think about it, I’ll provide you with fundamental knowledge about Heart Tools. However, know that there is a restriction on the Heart Tools, preventing it from being used by anyone other than their designated users. Well, you should confirm the detailed information in the knowledge I’m sending you.]","Immediately after Eden said this, the knowledge of Heart Tools flowed into Lilia’s head. She also understood the limitations that Eden had imposed on it, and nodded with a mysterious expression on her face.","[......So it’s the same ability as what Alice-sama was using. To be honest, it’s so overwhelmingly powerful that I can’t think of a suitable situation to use it......]","[Since Heart Tools’ abilities can vary greatly from person to person, if you happen to acquire a powerful one, then you’re fortunate. That being said, one other thing...... This is my main gift of gratitude from me. Allow me to present this to you.]","[......This is?]","[As a token of appreciation for your efforts, with permission from Shallow Vernal, in a rift between dimensions———— “I have created you a small world”. You are free to use it as you please.]","[—————————–Huh?]","Hearing the words Eden said as if it were a matter of course, Lilia looked at her with a blank expression on her face, her hands unconsciously holding onto her stomach.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [I guess, in a sense, the gift...... was a stomachache?]","? ? ? : [That aside, in just 5 seconds, Lilia-san seriously awakened her Heart Tool...... Her talent really is bug-like.]"]},{"number":1609,"title":"Chapter 1609: A Reward For Lilia 2","paragraphs":["Lilia, upon hearing that a world had been prepared for her as a token of Eden’s gratitude, was being guided through the world between dimensions created by Eden, her eyes like that of a dead fish.","When she arrived in the world, the first thing she saw was a vast expanse of grassland.","[Here we are. Well, even though I said it’s a world I created, it’s small in size. At best, it’s about the same size as the Human Realm.]","[......That’s already enough. Umm, let me say it again because it’s very important, but it’s already enough.]","Considering that it is the size of three countries, the size of said world is truly enormous. For her to create that much land on a whim, one could say it was just as expected of a World Creator.","[There are no living creatures in this world. Moreover, the items you bring into this world are automatically preserved in their original state and never deteriorate. And no one can enter this world except you, the world’s owner, or those you invite.]","[......Can I recognize this place as a considerably private space?]","[Yes. And with your mind, you can activate the system in place for this world. I won’t go into much detail about it, but you can think of it as the panel on which you manipulate the world.]","[Ah, yes...... You were talking about this floating board?]","As Eden told her to picture it in her mind, a translucent board-like object floating in the air appeared in front of Lilia’s eyes. As Lilia looked at the vast array of data on it, Eden gave her a series of instructions.","[......I see, so in other words, this world is currently entirely set as a grassy field, but by operating this...... panel, I can change it to a different landscape or even create structures in specific locations, right? Creating and altering a world...... I- It’s truly the actions of a God.]","[Well, I am in fact a God after all. Now then, as for the usage of this world...... I have prepared this world as a Collection Room for you. You’re about to run out of room for your models in your hidden room, right?]","[ ! ? ]","Lilia looked astonished at Eden’s words, but remembering that the person before her was an omniscient and omnipotent God, it can’t be helped if she knows about it.","And just as Eden said, Lilia’s Collection Room...... The room where she keeps her dragon-related items has become cramped, so much so that she had given up on purchasing some items at previous Six Kings Festivals.","Because of her desire to keep it as private as possible, she can’t even expand her Collection Room...... Considering this, this world gifted to her by Eden was quite attractive.","The fact that only Lilia herself or those invited by Lilia can enter serves as a significant advantage, mainly more about preventing Lunamaria, who was quite open with how she intruded her Collection Room at her own discretion, from entering. Moreover, with this world having the same size as Human Realm, it’s vast enough that she shouldn’t use up all the space.","Furthermore, the items brought in automatically undergo state preservation, and since buildings and such can be created at will, it’s possible for her to create something like a museum.",".","Moreover, according to Eden’s explanation, using the system panel, it’s also possible for her to instantly move to any location she desires in this world.","[Ahh, I’ve prepared some freebies for you.]","[Freebies?]","[Yes, they were of beings that don’t exist in Trinia, but I have prepared 5 worlds worth of life-sized models of creatures equivalent to the Dragons in Trinia, along with informational boards describing each species. In terms of total size, it takes up about a third of this world. We’ve placed them at a bit of a distance from each other, so check the system’s Map function to see where they are located.]","[..................]","Lilia’s face turned blank at Eden’s words, but her eyes soon began to sparkle. Lilia likes dragons. Otherworld creatures equivalent to dragons...... Life-sized models of dragons that Lilia isn’t familiar with, and descriptions for each species are written as well.","It was such a valuable experience for her to know and see dragons from another world that Lilia’s heart was so excited that she wanted to go there immediately to check it out, that is if she weren’t standing before Eden’s eyes.","[T- Thank you very much!]","[......I have a feeling that you’re quite enthusiastic more towards the freebies, but well, that is fine. In any case, thank you for all your hard work.]","[Yes! If there’s anything else I can be of service of, please let me know!!!]","After bidding farewell to Eden with a 90-degree bow while she vanished, Lilia, with a happy smile she couldn’t contain, operated the system. Thereupon, she teleported to the location where the models of unknown dragons await.","<Afterword>","Makina : [See that, even I give presents with the receiver in mind! Lilia isn’t my child, but I do appreciate her and will give her a reward commensurate with her work.]","? ? ? : [That’s fine and all but...... Oi, clunker brain. You manifesting Lilia-san’s Heart Tool, why don’t you explain yourself?]","Makina : [......Errr, well...... I just went with the moment? Just kid———— OUUUUUUCH!?]"]},{"number":1610,"title":"Chapter 1610: A Reward for Lilia 3","paragraphs":["I was called by Lilia-san as she apparently had something she’d like to consult with me, and when I came to her office to talk to her...... It seems that Lilia-san had awakened her Heart Tool.","After Eden-san asked Lilia-san to run an errand for her, Eden-san made it so Lilia-san would conceive a Heart Tool...... and awakened it in 5 seconds. I see, 5 seconds huh...... No, she really isn’t someone anyone should be comparing themselves to. According to Alice, my awakening rate was also on the faster side, and speed doesn’t necessarily equal strength, so I shouldn’t be bothered that much about it.","[I understand what you’re saying, but when it comes to Heart Tools, it’s better to consult with Alice rather than me. I think it would be better to ask Alice if you want to verify it or something.]","[He’s right. Well, I think you yourself should already understand your ability, but it’s also important to actually try using them in practice......]","[Eh? Alice, what’s that?]","[......Just rubbish. Kinda tore it off earlier. She can grow it back quickly as long as she just wants it anyway, so there shouldn’t be a problem.]","Alice muttered that with a steady gaze, but looking at the mechanical wing she was holding stained with blood, I could feel that she had inflicted considerable damage on the owner of that wing.","I was curious, but I didn’t really want to provoke Alice while she was emitting quiet anger, so I decided not to get closer in this matter any further.","[Even so, Lilia-san’s Heart Tool is a one-hit kill type huh...... There certainly are Heart Tools like that. Most of them would either have cooldown times or limited usages, but all Heart Tools in this category are comparatively stronger than others.]","[......Eh? Arehh? Ummm, Alice-sama? I still haven’t told you my Hauteclere’s ability, right?]","[Ahh, no, with my ?κατ?γχειρε?’s ability, even if the person themselves hasn’t awakened their Heart Tool yet, as long as I meet the conditions to which I could borrow their ability, I would be able to understand what ability they have......]","Alice then explained the ability of Lilia-san’s Heart Tool. Lilia-san’s Heart Tool is called “Hauteclere”, a Greatsword-type Heart Tool. Its ability allows Lilia-san to unleash her single most powerful strike she can use with her talent.","I heard that Fate-san can use her Authority to use something called Critical Point of Fate, can temporarily make the target grow to the limits of their talent, and Lilia-san’s Heart Tool seemed like a one-hit-only version of that power.","......Isn’t that powerful? No it might not be that impressive if someone else were to use it, but when held by Lilia-san, who is an unquestionable genius Alice described as having talent equivalent to a bug in this world, at least according to Alice’s estimation, her strike would apparently be able to rival even that of the Six Kings’ attacks.","It’s just, in accordance with its sheer power, it appears that there’s a 10-minute cooldown after using it, but this cooldown can apparently be shortened using Time-Space Magic...... Isn’t that too strong? Then, for Lilia-san, it’s like that ability virtually has no cooldown. Moreover, even without using its ability, that greatsword is incredibly sturdy so she can just use it as a weapon......","[Well, there’s still various things I’d like to verify about this Heart Tool myself. Does this “single strike” specifically refer to a slashing attack, or does it apply even if it’s just a strike using the hilt? Would this ability work when you throw your sword on the opponent? The moment you unleash that strike, will the amount of magic power you have or your defensive capabilities also change until you finish unleashing it?]","[Yes. Therefore, if it’s not too much trouble, I would greatly appreciate Alice-sama’s cooperation in this matter......]","[Fine by me. There’s no one more knowledgeable about Heart Tools than I am after all...... For the time being, shall we create a subspace and conduct tests there?]","Alice readily agrees with Lilia-san’s suggestion. In fact, upon closer consideration, while Lilia-san’s Heart Tool is undoubtedly strong, I think Alice’s ?κατ?γχειρε? is the most amazing.","I mean, she can also use Lilia-san’s Hauteclere with that if she wants......","[While we’re at it, why don’t Kaito-san watch as well? I’ll make sure to set up a barrier to block the aftermath, so you’ll be safe.]","[Then, I guess I’ll join an observer this time...... By the way, Alice? If you can tell what a Heart Tool’s ability is even if they hadn’t awakened yet, does that mean you also know what Hina-chan and Aoi-chan’s Heart Tools would be like?]","[I can tell. Hina-san’s Heart Tool is called “?χιλλε??”, while Aoi-san’s Heart Tool is called “ásgarer”. In terms of abilities, Hina-san seems more user-friendly, but was relatively unassuming, while Aoi-san’s Heart Tool has a powerful ability, yet selective with the situation. Well, revealing their detailed abilities here would also spoil the surprise, so let’s just wait until both of their Heart Tools awaken.]","(T/N: Hina’s Heart Tool is read as Achilles, while Aoi’s is, well, Asgard.)","Just as Lilia-san’s Heart Tool was referred to as a one-hit kill type, it’s likely that there are various types of Heart Tools. Alice’s Heart Tool also appears to be extraordinarily powerful, but the original ?κατ?γχειρε? apparently just transforms Alice herself, a Heart Tool that was originally challenging in many aspects, but it has become tremendously powerful through years of dedication and training.","[......I’ll say this now, Kaito-san. You might think Lilia-san and my Heart Tool are amazing, but when you just look at their base ability, your Heart Tool is pretty overpowered, you know? Not only does it not have any negative effects on the user, but the ability to buff regardless of the person’s ability limits alone makes it strong, a boost that, depending on the strength of the user’s heart, can even be described as not having any upper limits.? Not only that, there’s also its ability to summon deceased individuals as Heart Tools, which by the way, gives them strength that has practically no limits depending on the user’s growth......]","[U- Unnn. Now that you mentioned it, I guess you’re right?]","[For the time being, I’m curious to see if Kaito-san’s Αναμν?σει? buff can be applied to Lilia-san’s Hauteclere strike. I’ll ask for your cooperation on this later, Kaito-san.]","(T/N: Memories)","[Alright.]","Now that she described it like that, I guess my Heart Tool might be strong too. Even though the scope of my target is limited due to my own abilities and magic power being too low, this ability is truly powerful. Moreover, if Alice were to use it, she could summon a vast number of deceased individuals as Heart Tools and potentially grant a powerful buff to a large group of people simultaneously, so as a Support-type Heart Tool, I guess you could say that it’s an incredibly powerful Heart Tool.","<Afterword>","Makina : [She’s so cruel, isn’t she? Just because I can heal myself up, she decided to thoroughly beat me up......]","Serious-senpai : [Aren’t you just reaping what you sowed? It’s definitely because you said you’re just going with the moment, I tell you that.]"]},{"number":1611,"title":"Chapter 1611: A Reward for Lilia 4","paragraphs":["The subspace that Alice had prepared was an endless stretch of empty white ground.","[Alice, how did you prepare this space?]","[Eh? I created it. Putting aside if I’m gonna have to create something on the level of what World Creators create, if it’s just a temporary space, even I can easily create one of these.]","[I see, you’re also something like an omnipotent yourself......]","It seems that Alice created this space. For a moment, I wondered if this could also be described as creating a world but based on what Alice said, it seems like this space will disappear after a certain amount of time.","From my perspective, Alice also somewhat felt like an omnipotent being, but what she had done was apparently on a slightly different level from World Creation. Perhaps it’s similar to how each individual has varying levels of proficiency with Teleportation Magic.","The Evil God who created the world where Alice once resided was apparently weaker than the current Isis-san, which suggests that there might be significant factors beyond simple strength.","In any case, Lilia and Alice are facing each other in the subspace. I was a few distance away from them, within a barrier that Alice had put up, wearing the glasses that Shiro-san had given me and observing the battle.","No, rather than battle, the main subject today was the verification of Lilia-san’s Heart Tool.","[Well then, the stage is yours, Lilia-san.]","[Ah, yes. Awaken! The blade of my heart! Heaven-descending light in my heart———– Nourishing earth in my arms———– Trailblazers in my feet! Reach out! Unto the limits of possibilities! Manifest! Heavenly Sword———– Hauteclere!]","As Lilia-san chanted those powerful words, a beautifully decorated white and silver sword appeared in her hand. The sword feels more like a ceremonial sword than one you use in combat, but from the powerful magic power I can feel from it, it’s definitely Lilia-san’s Heart Tool.","[Then, let’s start by using its ability to deliver a straightforward strike...... Feel free to attack, I will not avoid it.]","[......Yes! I’m coming!]","In response to Alice’s words, Lilia-san charged forward and brandished her greatsword...... Up to that point, wearing my glasses, I was still able to see what was going on.","However, as for what happened after Lilia-san brandished her sword, well, I couldn’t see it at all. Before I knew it, Lilia-san had already swung down her greatsword, and Alice had caught it with one hand. Then, a little later, I heard the sound of the barrier surrounding me defending against what seemed to be the impact of their clash, accompanied by a roaring sound.","[......I see, it sure is a very powerful sword. Even if the opponent is one of the Six Kings, it has enough power to easily break through their defenses. Also, it seems that the effect is activated the moment you enter the attack stance.]","[Ah~~ Errr...... You stopped it so easily though.]","[Well, this attack is just a seriously normal strike. It isn’t imbued with any special effects like Causality Disruption or anything. Frankly speaking, if the other Six Kings realize that your attacks are just this level, they’ll just decide to receive it. At this point, it’s just a power modifier...... Count-ranks and above are essentially immortals, so unless you imbue your attacks with multitudes of enchantments like Recovery Obstruction, they’ll just regenerate the damage away.]","Even though she was praising the power of Lilia-san’s attack as being capable of inflicting damage even against the Six Kings, Alice caught it with one hand, and the expression on her face clearly showed that she was quite at ease.","[......I mean, even leaving that aside, doesn’t it seem like Alice got stronger?]","[Well, I’ve been training a lot recently, you know? To be honest, I’ve reached a point where I can have a good match against Kuro-san. And so, well, an attack of this level isn’t a problem. I did mention how Lilia-san’s current strike is at the limit of what she can achieve with her talent, but there are people in the world who surpass the limits of talent, and I am also an example of that. And so, if Lilia-san can go beyond the limits of her talent, she might be able to unleash even greater power. Well, she gotta train up to the limit of her talent first though.]","[How should I say this...... I’ve realized once again how amazing the Six Kings are.]","Come to think of it, Alice mentioned how she diligently trained herself to her limits, and it’s through the effects of ?κατ?γχειρε? Ultimate Battle Form that she’s currently growing beyond those limits, right? Well, even excluding all that, considering that she had exceeded the boundaries of what’s achievable for a human, she definitely is a being that goes beyond the limits of talent.","[This time’s for verification though, so let’s examine it through different patterns. If you learn to use it, you will be able to utilize its ability more effectively. If you can do that, you will be able to deal definite damage even against opponents on Six Kings level.]","[I understand. I’m in your care.]","[Yeah. Then, for the time being, use Space-Time Magic to reduce that ability’s cooldown. Let’s start with a light examination by going through “750 patterns”.]","[............Eh?]","[After that, we’ll test the results under different conditions, but for the time being, let’s go with the base patterns first.]","[Ah, no, umm, a- as expected, I don’t have the magic power to use Time Manipulation 750 times......]","[We’ll have Fruits of the World Tree prepared, so it’ll be alright.]","Lilia-san, looking into the distance with a distant expression on her face, a hand pressing on her stomach, looks quite impressive...... but well, for the time being, since it seemed like they’re gonna take a while, would they mind if I read a book or something while waiting here?","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Indeed, if it’s Alice, she’s definitely the type who would try to verify something with each of the possible patterns she could think in mind...... Guess they’re gonna take a while huh?]"]},{"number":1612,"title":"Chapter 1612: A Reward for Lilia 5","paragraphs":["While I was observing the event while reading a book inside my barrier, Alice and Lilia-san came by to take a break, seemingly having finished some of their verifications.","I brought out a table and chairs from inside my magic box so that they can take a break. Lilia-san’s face showed fatigue, looking tired from the verification while she was recovering her magic power.","[Thank you for the hard work, you two. Lilia-san, are you alright?]","[Yes, as expected, Space-Time Magic consumes a significant amount of magic power. However, as Alice-sama pointed out, this is my ability, and understanding oneself better than anyone else is essential, so having this verification is important.]","[That’s right. When one’s Heart Tool awakens, the wielder immediately understands its abilities and how to use it. However, that doesn’t mean they can just think they’ve understood everything about their Heart Tool. Just regarding the Heart Tool’s abilities and fundamental usage, there are many aspects that become clear through verification.]",".","Saying this, Alice smoothly wrote something on what seemed to be a booklet and handed it to me and Lilia-san. When I opened it, I could see the results of their earlier verification written inside, and after confirming that we were looking at our booklet, Alice began to explain.","[First, regarding Lilia-san’s ability, Hauteclere, its effect activates the moment Lilia-san assumes an attack stance until the attack is completed. This “completion” refers to the point where a strike is finished in some manner, and it ends even if the attack is intercepted along the way. Also, the enhancement doesn’t only apply to “offensive aspects”; it includes all abilities, including the wielder’s magic abilities and cognitive abilities. I think it really seems appropriate to recognize it as her body temporarily being under the effect of Critical Point of Fate.]","[Thanks to the increase in cognitive ability, I can handle the sudden physical reinforcement on me without feeling chaotic from the change, and since the effect starts from when I make my stance, it’s convenient how I can apply it even when I’m getting closer while in a stance.]","[Yes, but the key to activation is whether Lilia-san, as its user, has the intention of attacking. Even if Lilia-san assumes an attack stance, if she intends to use it as a feint within her mind, the ability won’t activate. Hauteclere’s ability is applied when its wielder takes actions such as assuming a stance with the intention of attacking and quickly evading an opponent’s attack. However, if the user is already considering approaches like getting closer while evading the enemy attack with Hauteclere’s physical enhancements, then the effect won’t activate. So, it’s essentially an ability specialized for offense.]","While it takes effect during an all-out battle, it won’t activate if they attempt more technical maneuvers like mixing in feints or trying to flank the enemy. Although powerful, its complete linearity towards offense may be considered a drawback.","Of course, the strongest attack Lilia-san is capable of with her talent, no matter how linear it may be, only the pinnacles of the world such as the Six Kings can handle it......","[As long as it’s an attack involving a sword, the type of attack doesn’t matter; Hauteclere’s effect can be triggered. Whether it’s a blow with the hilt, a magic-imbued wave slash, or even throwing that sword, Hauteclere’s effect would work. Also, naturally, it’s possible for the user not to activate the ability by their own will...... Its range of applications is quite wide.]","[Alice, can Heart Tools return if they’re thrown?]","[Heart Tools can be made to reappear instantly if the user inwardly thinks of it. Additionally, if a Heart Tool moves too far away from its wielder, it will automatically return to their hand. Heart Tools are technically weaponization of one’s heart, so they can’t exactly stray too far from their user.]","[I see...... What about my Αναμν?σει??]","[Kaito-san’s Αναμν?σει? also held quite a few exceptions. Regarding the range of the buff, as long as the conditions are met, it can work even across the barriers of space and time...... In other words, your buff can reach from Human Realm to the Demon Realm. Of course, that doesn’t mean it can extend those to other worlds though. Also, in the case of entities materialized by Αναμν?σει?’s ability, as long as Kaito-san’s magic power lasts, their materialization can be maintained, but the further the distance they have from you, the greater the magic power consumption becomes. There’s no restriction for how far the materialized entities can be, but since they aren’t weapons, they won’t come back to you even if you inwardly think about it. However, remote deactivation and re-summoning are possible for you.]","I wondered about distance limitations for my Αναμν?σει?, considering it doesn’t have a physical form, but it seems my Αναμν?σει? is quite unique as a Heart Tool, and the conditions it had was different to the usual Heart Tools in many ways.","I mean, Alice sure knows a lot about it huh...... She probably, or rather, she definitely must have thoroughly verified the effects of my Αναμν?σει? as well.","[Even so, things really become clearer when you actually verify them. By knowing the conditions in detail, it seems that the range of applications can also expand.]","[That’s right. Well then, let’s verify the patterns for special circumstances after the break. We have enough today, so let’s start with the bare minimum “1000 patterns” or so, and then we can handle the rest step by step.]","[......Bare minimum?]","[If we’re considering every possible scenario, we would have to verify billions of patterns. Of course, that would take a significant amount of time, and since we don’t have that, we’ll just go through that much.]","[.....................]","Lilia-san had a distant look in her eyes. Given that she had just emphasized the importance of verification herself, it would be hard for her to say she doesn’t wanna do it anymore cause it’s troublesome, and considering her personality, that’s probably gonna be impossible.","And so, it seems like she’s resigned herself to the idea of verifying all possible patterns. Well, as for whether she’s just unconsciously holding onto her stomach or if her stomach really hurts......","<Afterword>","Makina : [Hey, hey? By the way, did you also thoroughly verify my Factory Gear?]","? ? ? : [I did, but it really isn’t that strong. No, it is pretty strong at Human-level battles, but against Peak Count-ranks, Duke-ranks or beings on the level of the Six Kings, it’s better not to use it.]","Makina : [Should have known. Well, it would have been different if it’s a Special-type like Alice’s ?κατ?γχειρε? or something like the simple firepower enhancement of Iris’ ?ποκ?λυψι?, but in the first place, there are few Hear Tools that can be used in battles of that level.]"]},{"number":1613,"title":"Chapter 1613: A Reward for Lilia 6","paragraphs":["After a short break, the verification process continued, with me participating from time to time, verifying what it would be like with my Αναμν?σει? buff.","However, there weren’t many opportunities for me to help, as I spent most of my time reading books and relaxing, but by the end of their session, Lilia-san was quite exhausted and unusually tired.","[Changing the circumstances really makes things different, doesn’t it? Most buffs are ineffective, but the buffs from the Fruit of Nebula-san’s World Tree and Kaito-san’s Αναμν?σει? are exceptions. They add an extra layer to your abilities. Moreover, stacking these two buffs is also possible...... This is probably due to the special effects of the Fruit of Nebula-san’s World Tree and Kaito-san’s Αναμν?σει?? buff though.]","[......I’ve certainly learned a lot. However, as we had expected earlier, while powerful, it’s also a difficult ability to handle.]","[That, it is. The biggest drawback of Hauteclere’s ability is that it always unleashes the wielder’s theoretically maximum power, and the inability to adjust this could be a problem. Furthermore, this ability isn’t about determining the damage inflicted on the opponent; it’s more designed to ensure that Lilia-san’s attack can reach her maximum potential. This means that the moment Lilia-san assumes an attacking stance, it’s possible for one to instantly read the optimal and highest-rate attack that she can launch from that stance, making it possible for one to anticipate her next action. Well, in the first place, reaching a level where you can do that would mean your base abilities are at least Quasi-Omnipotent or greater......]","Lilia-san’s Hauteclere is undeniably a powerful ability, but due to its attack-focused nature, it inherently lacks the option to adjust its intensity. As a result, it seems that it was a skill that requires careful consideration of when and where to use it.","I think this inability to adjust its power could indeed be a significant constraint. Depending on the usage scenario, there’s a possibility that Lilia-san would cause significant collateral damage to the surroundings. However, it truly seems to have the ultimate efficacy as a one-hit-kill finishing move. It really embodies the concept of a lethal, decisive strike.","[On the other hand, Hauteclere’s ability, the automatic maximization is strictly for your attack’s power, so it seems you have a fair amount of freedom to customize your imbued spells and additional effects. If you choose the right options for the appropriate situations, it can certainly be quite powerful. Just from the description of its ability, I initially thought it wouldn’t have any effect on someone like me, who has already trained up to the limit of talent, but it does have the advantage of being able to deliver an attack through the ideal trajectory. I suppose this part is somewhat similar to Kaito-san’s Autopilot.]","[Ahh, now that you mentioned it, it does resemble it a bit...... including how hard it was to adjust it.]","Well, in an overall assessment, there’s no doubt that Lilia-san’s Hauteclere is a powerful Heart Tool, but mastering its use seems to be a bit challenging. Well, since it’s Lilia-san we’re talking about here, I have the feeling she’ll soon be able to handle it skillfully......","When we returned to Lilia-san’s mansion after the verifications...... I found that not a long time had passed. That subspace seems to have had its flow of time tampered with, as even though I must have been there for quite a long time, it seemed that almost no time had passed here outside.","And as Alice disappeared, saying she would continue with additional verifications later, Lilia-san watched her leave with eyes resembling those of a dead fish, when her expression suddenly changed, seemingly having remembered something.","[Ah, by the way, Kaito-san.]","[Yes?]","[Actually, I got another gift from Eden-sama...... I’m very tired, so I’m going there to heal my heart, so if it’s alright with you, how about going there with me?]","[Eh? Yes, that’s fine with me but...... a gift?]","[Yes. It seems like I got my own private world.]","[............I see.]","I initially thought she said something outrageous, but since it’s Eden-san we’re talking about, I just nodded, realizing that that might actually be possible. However, despite the clearly stomach-churning nature of that gift, Lilia-san instead seems fidgety and excited, brimming with eagerness to go to that world as soon as possible.","She also said that that place would heal her heart, so I guess that world is one that could make her heart at ease? Hmmm...... Then, that world probably got something dragon-related huh. Yep, that’s definitely it.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......The flow of the wind...... looks like it’s about to change...... (Despair)]"]},{"number":1614,"title":"Chapter 1614: A Reward for Lilia 7","paragraphs":["Lilia-san invited me to a world that Eden-san gave as a gift to Lilia-san. The world is about the size of the Human Realm, so rather than a world, it’s more like she was given a planet of her own...... No, well, the scale is more than large enough though......","[It’s beautiful, but there isn’t really anything here. Is it just grasslands everywhere?]","[The initial settings seem to be like this. However, by operating this, I can change it in various ways......]","When Lilia-san moved her hand, a sci-fi-like control panel appeared in the air. That looks interesting. Is that some sort of authority that Lilia-san, the owner of this world, can exercise?","The format may be a little different, but it’s somewhat similar to the control panel in the VR back home, so Lilia-san is familiar with how to operate it.","[And in this world, Eden-sama had them prepared for me. They’re apparently models of otherworld dragons. I haven’t had a chance to take a good look at them yet, but this is a wonderful place with so many unknown dragons.]","[Heehhh...... Otherworld dragons huh. Sounds interesting. I’m curious to see what kind of dragons they are.]","[I knew Kaito-san would say that. To rest one’s heart, spending time looking at things I love, to...... to...... t- to......]","[To?]","[......Together with...... ummm...... Together with the person I love, on a date...... is what I was thinking...... I- I’m in your care.]","[I see, now that you mentioned it...... I’ve also been tired for quite a long time myself, so I guess this is a good time to take some rest.]","Seeing Lilia-san, who even though she’s a bit embarrassed, saying that spending time looking at things she loves with the person she loves puts her heart at ease, I can’t help smiling at her cuteness.","When we went to the Dragon Carnival together before, she had been really excited, and since I already know that Lilia-san loves dragons, it seems like her thoughts have instead led her more into wanting to enjoy things together with me. Of course, that is something I’m very happy about.","[Then, let’s go right away.]","[Ah, yes. Let’s go!]","[Ahh, wait, that’s right. Lilia-san, since we’re at it, can we hold hands?]","[Eh? Ah, yes. Here you go......]","When I suggested so, Lilia-san shyly held out her hand. Thereupon, holding her hand with our fingers entwining with each other, we moved through a special means of teleportation under the operation of Lilia-san.","The place we arrived at after teleporting was, how should I say this...... It was like a huge building of the modern era. It looked like a warehouse and had no decoration at all, but it had quite the outrageous size, seemingly at least 100 meters high. As for how wide it was though, it was hard to tell how vast it was at a glance.","[......This place’s huge.]","[Other worlds must have lots of Colossal-type Dragons after all. From what Eden-sama explained to me, there are apparently hundreds of these storage-like structures in existence here.]","[Eh? There are hundreds of buildings this size? That’s kinda amazing...... Ahh, but if this world really has life-sized models of all Dragons in several worlds, I guess you would need that much huh.]","The world Shiro-san created, Trinia, was apparently quite small for a world. On the other hand, Eden-san’s world, including the universe our planet was in, is extremely vast, and just collecting all the creatures that resemble dragons would make her gather quite the amount. Since the size of each world is quite different, I think there must be a considerable number of models here.","As I was thinking about this, Lilia-san and I approached the entrance of the building and found what seemed to be an explanatory sign next to the entrance.","[......Let’s see...... Gathered inside this storage unit are beings that have evolved through the fusion of machinery and organic beings, creatures that inhabit stars and are classified as dragons...... Heehhh...... Are they gonna be robotic dragons?]","[When you say mashineri, is it like the cars we rode in that virtual space before? For that to be fused with dragons...... Iron Dragons?]","[Well, let’s just go inside and see.]","[Right. Let’s go in.]","Lilia nodded happily at my words and touched the door, to which the huge door soundlessly slid open, letting us in.","Once inside, the room was quite bright. I don’t understand how it works, but the world itself has many mysterious features due to God’s power, so I’ll decide not to worry about it.","[Hawawawa...... A- Amazing! So cool......]","Inside the storage room, as explained in the explanatory sign outside, were dragons evolved by merging with machinery. There was a lineup of dragons that looked straight out of mecha anime.","Some were made entirely of machines, while others had only parts of their bodies made of machines. In front of each of the huge models was an explanatory sign, which seemed to describe the details of the dragon it was in front of.","From what I see, this place includes not only the latest forms of the dragons, as I could also see several dragon models seemingly in the midst of evolving along with the progress of technology. It was as if the entire history of these dragons on the planet they lived in was depicted here.","I suppose I should say it’s as to be expected of Eden-san, when she actually does something, its scale would be grand. And for Lilia-san, it seems this is truly a meaningful gift, as she had this childlike sparkle in her eyes, which was truly striking and adorable.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [C- Calm down...... This is just a junction point, Kaito...... Listen here, okay? You are to just go about that world tourist-style, giving out more explanations to the dragons from other worlds. Even if you make some mistakes here or there, what you shouldn’t do is shift the focus away from dragons and end up having the date as your main priority...... You understand!?]"]},{"number":1615,"title":"Chapter 1615: A Reward for Lilia 8","paragraphs":["This unknown creature, which I temporarily dub mechanical dragon, seemed to greatly pique Lilia-san’s interest. She enthusiastically read the explanatory sign near it, her eyes shining before she repeatedly pulled me close, urging me to hurry to the next model.","[Kaito-san! Let’s go to the next one!!! Let’s see what’s over there!!!]","[This one has a completely mechanical body huh.]","[Its profound atmosphere is amazing, isn’t it? It has a shape that I almost never see in this world, which makes it interesting. There’s also what seemed to be a weapon over there......]","Perhaps due to being very excited, Lilia-san leaned in towards me and with an enthusiastic expression on her face, she began talking about the model dragon.","While Lilia-san is usually shy, her excitement seems to have raised her spirits, as even though she might not be aware of it, she’s much closer than usual.","Every time her hair gently sways, a pleasant fragrance wafts in the air, and I guessed, almost instinctively, that she had just taken a bath earlier.","I guessed that before we went to this world, she had probably returned to her room to get ready before meeting up with me. During that time, she likely took a quick bath to freshen up and wash away the sweat.","This is just my hunch, but I kinda feel like she was bothered about being sweaty and other stuff.","[......Unnn? Kaito-san, is something the matter?]","[Ahh, no, Lilia-san seems to be having fun...... You were visibly excited, so I was just thinking “Lilia-san must really like dragons huh”.]","[I guess so. I’m aware that I certainly am getting a bit carried away. Of course, part of it is because I love dragons...... but that isn’t really all to it...... errr......]","In response to my words, Lilia-san hesitated for a moment, her cheeks slightly blushing red. Thereupon, averting her gaze from me, she continued.","[......It’s just, you see...... It seems that no one can enter this world unless I invite them...... and so, since this is a place that is definitely away from anyone else’s gaze, my embarrassment is a bit more manageable, and in that sense...... errr, well, I can get into a romantic atmosphere with Kaito-san, which adds more enjoyment for me......]","[Lilia-san......]","[Ah, no, while I do want to behave a bit more lover-like even in our normal interactions, I often get overwhelmed by embarrassment, and there is also a part of me that finds it difficult to be straightforward...... Thinking that way, I also feel like this situation is an opportunity.]","It’s very rare to hear Lilia-san talk like that...... but at the same time, I couldn’t help feeling happy. After all, Lilia-san clearly expressed that she wants to behave more like a girlfriend.","In other words, well, to put it simply, it means she wanted to have some lovey-dovey moments with me. Lilia-san, who doesn’t usually hint out such things, thinking like that...... makes me quite happy.","[I’m glad to hear you say that...... Lilia-san, just a question, but can I embrace you by the shoulder?]","[Ah, s- shoulder huh...... T- That certainly feels lover-like, and it’s suitable for while the two of us look at the models. It feels embarrassing but...... p- please do.]","[Yes. Well then, if you’ll excuse me......]","With Lilia-san’s consent, I placed my hand around her shoulder and gently pulled her closer. As Lilia-san leaned against me, our closeness became much more intimate than just a moment ago.","[......S- Somehow, this feels really nice. It makes me feel at ease, I feel so close to Kaito-san...... I- It might sound strange, but I could feel this desire to seek comfort and affection from Kaito-san......]","[Actually though, the way I see it, I’d be more happy if you felt comfortable enough to act pampered around me, you know?]","[Ahh, t- that is, well, let’s just leave that for later...... when my heart can settle down a bit more......]","Saying that, Lilia-san looking up towards my face, a smile on her blushing red cheeks, gives a somewhat more youthful impression than usual...... How should I say this...... Well, she looks incredibly adorable.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [AAAAAAHHHHHHHHH!? YOU REALLY STEERED THAT WAY!!! Mnghh, I have a bad feeling about this......]","? ? ? : [Now, now, let’s calm down a little, Senpai.]","Serious-senpai : [Shut it, will you!? Just knowing that your date would be coming up after this gives me more headaches!!!]"]},{"number":1616,"title":"Chapter 1616: A Reward for Lilia 9","paragraphs":["The viewing of otherworld dragon models with the cheerful and happy Lilia-san was unexpectedly enjoyable and fulfilling. First of all, many of the dragons are cool and life-sized, so they held quite the intensity with them.","Each one of them has an explanatory sign nearby, so it’s easy to understand what they are, making things interesting. Lilia-san seemed to be having fun, which in turn made me happy.","[Fuu, they’re wonderful dragons, aren’t they? Feeling the accumulation of history and the process of their evolution is just happiness.]","[Ahaha, Lilia-san sure is enjoying yourself. It sure is refreshing seeing you having an atmosphere different from usual.]","[I- I guess so. I’m also aware that I’m getting a little bit excited. I always strive to behave like a lady in everyday situations but...... wait, Kaito-san!? What’s with that doubtful look in your face...... There’s no way you’re thinking my usual self isn’t particularly ladylike or anything like that, right?]","[......................]","Lilia-san does sometimes demonstrate a strong commitment to acting like a lady. I’ve seen many instances where she tries to behave in a ladylike manner, like when I just returned from staying for a couple of months in my previous world or in various other moments where she’s quite conscious about it...... but well, I haven’t seen it persist for long periods very often.","[Hmmm. I don’t fully understand your concept of ladylikeness, but the way I see it, Lilia-san comes across as someone approachable in a positive way rather than appearing overly noble-like. You just have this friendly feeling around you.]","[Aoi-san and Hina-san did mention something like that as well. I personally am glad to be able to foster a sense of closeness with everyone, and I have no complaints about our current relationship dynamics...... but the absence of noble traits in me is certainly something I’m troubled about.]","[Ahh, but I believe your lack of negative noble traits is precisely a good thing though.]","Indeed, when asked whether Lilia-san truly feels like a noble, I would be troubled to say she does...... no, perhaps, she might actually have done some noble-like interactions or subtle probings that we haven’t seen, but personally, my impression of Lilia-san is just that of a kind and approachable person.","After hearing my words, a complicated expression appeared on Lilia-san’s face, as she crossed her arms and tilted her head.","[......Hmmm, I, too, bear the responsibility of overseeing my Duchy, and considering I’m older than Kaito-san, even if only slightly, I would really like to present myself as someone more dependable.]","[Unnn? Putting being noble-like aside, Lilia-san is already usually very dependable though?]","[Eh? I- Is that so?]","[Yes, in fact, during events like the Six Kings Festival, as well as when everyone goes out together, Lilia-san is the reliable one among our group. In reality, me, Aoi-chan and Hina-chan rely on you, Lilia-san.]","[......S- So that’s how it is. T- Thank you.]","After hearing my words, Lilia-san’s cheeks flushed with a bashful expression on her face, yet she had a small smile that suggested she was happy. I think this kind of demeanor is actually quite adorable.","I don’t have the impression that Lilia-san is unreliable at all, and in fact, I rely on her quite a bit in our daily interactions. It’s just...... There are often stomachache-inducing situations occurring, with either of us getting caught up in some sort of trouble, which makes it so that I see her looking pitiful...... No, well, most of those situations are my fault, so I can’t really tell her how she looked pitiful those times......","[......A- Alright...... T- There should be a good atmosphere now. W- We’ve got a great date...... I think. Given the situation, this time I’ll properly take the lead...... a- and I should be able to...... k- k- k- kiss him...... probably...... I’m sure......]","[Lilia-san?]","[Ah, no, it’s nothing! Come on, let’s go to the next spot! I’ll be the one leading this time!!!]","[Eh? Ah, yes. I’ll be counting on you then.]","It seemed as if Lilia-san was whispering something, but I couldn’t make out what it was. When I called out to her, Lilia-san seemed slightly flustered as she held my hand, leading me to the next location.","It may just be my imagination, but I felt that she was a little more nervous than before, but even though I was tilting my head in wonder, I just followed Lilia-san’s lead as we moved on to our next location.",".","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [This feels like...... Lilia’s current state...... The next chapter seemed like it’s gonna be dangerous. Serious-senpai is just gonna make her cool withdrawal here......]","Doctor M : [......Where are you going?]","Serious-senpai : [Hyiiih......]"]},{"number":1617,"title":"Chapter 1617: A Reward for Lilia 10","paragraphs":["After looking at some dragon models, we decided to take a short break. Lilia-san seemed to have the freedom to modify this world as she pleased through the use of a terminal, so she teleported us to a grassy field, set up benches, and we took a break by sitting there.","[In the first place, it’s only natural since it’s just me and Lilia-san here, but it’s quiet and relaxing.]","[That’s right. Being left alone, away from others is quite comforting. Especially for me, who is usually burdened with the responsibilities of Albert Duchy, so whenever I go outside, I need to be mindful of how I appear to the public.]","Since only Lilia-san herself and those invited by her are allowed to enter this world, there really may not be any place better than this world in terms of resting.","Actually, Lilia-san seemed to be enjoying herself, more excited than usual.","[When you think about it, this really might be the best present there is for Lilia-san.]","[Indeed, I was surprised and my stomach hurt at first, but I really should be grateful to Eden-sama for this.]","For a noble like Lilia-san, a place where she can relax without worrying about her surroundings would likely be quite precious. Well, it’s really unexpected, but Eden-san’s gift is well thought out, or rather, it’s something that suits Lilia-san extremely well.","Come to think of it, Lilia-san did mention how Eden-san once gave her stomach medicines. I guess, in one way or another, it seems Eden-san also appreciates Lilia-san.","[In fact, Lilia-san seemed to be happy today and seemed cuter than usual.]","[Eh? T- Thank you...... Hearing you say that feels nice but...... hmmm.]","[Is something the matter? You kinda have this complicated expression on your face......]","[No, it’s just, I’m older than Kaito-san. I was originally just one year older than you, but due to the time difference while Kaito-san was back in the other world, you can say I’m now two years older than you.]","[I suppose so.]","[That’s why, if you ask me...... I should have this sense of seniority between us, like I would feel like the older lady next door...... but I really don’t feel that way huh?]","Her words weren’t complaints or expressions of her dissatisfaction, but rather just a question asked simply out of curiosity. Among her family dynamics, Lilia-san is the youngest child with Ryze-san as her older brother, but due to the timing of Amalie-san and her siblings’ birth, she’s also referred to as Elder Sister.","[I wonder about that? No, of course, there’s no doubt that Lilia-san is older than me...... but you see, if you exclude Anima, all of my lovers are older than me, and if you add her time as a monster, Anima would also be older than you. And so, when you ask me about this sense of seniority, I might not really understand it well.]","[Now that you mentioned it...... I mean, excluding Anima-san, I certainly would be the youngest among your lovers huh.]","No, I understand that in this context, when Lilia-san talks about a sense of seniority or feeling like the older lady next door, it’s not simply referring to age.","However, when it comes to that kind of discussion, Sieg-san and Dr. Vier would fit more into that category, and being compared with both of them might be a bit challenging for Lilia-san.","However, Lilia-san didn’t really ask me that question so seriously, as she just smiled wryly when she heard my response.","[Hmmm. I guess it would be difficult heading down the older, dependable adult lady route huh.]","[I think Lilia-san is dependable enough though...... but still, rather than someone older, my impression of Lilia-san is really more of a girl my age. Well, even though Lilia-san is older, you just have this atmosphere of someone studying in the same school year as me, which makes me find you easy to talk with.]","[......I see.]","[Lilia-san?]","[Ah, no, umm, that kinda...... makes me happier than I thought...... No, I truly understand that it’s simply about the timing of my birth, but even so...... being the closest in age with you kinda, errr...... It kinda makes me happy.]","Lilia-san, saying that with a bashful smile, is astonishingly cute. Although she understood that there isn’t necessarily any specific advantage being that way, she couldn’t help feeling delighted that she was the one closest in age with me, and the way she expressed her joy itself was incredibly charming, giving me this impulsive urge to embrace her.","However, Lilia-san is quite shy, so if I suddenly hugged her, there’s a good chance that she would get startled, so it’s probably better to give her a heads-up beforehand.","[......Errr, Lilia-san. This might be too sudden, but ummm, Lilia-san is just so cute...... Can I hug you?]","[Hoehh? Ahh, errr...... Yes. Ummm...... I- I’m in your care.]","Lilia-san seemed surprised by my words, but while her face blushed red, she accepted my request, as she gently spread her arms, taking on a posture of waiting for a hug.","It’s needless to say that Lilia-san is a beautiful woman, and I think she’s really cute as a lover. To see such a Lilia-san, slightly bashful yet opening her arms in acceptance...... How should I say this...... The destructive power of such a Lilia-san is quite immense.","Feeling myself being drawn closer by her cuteness, I gently embraced her, to which Lilia-san also wrapped her arms around my back, fitting snugly against my chest.","Her soft, fluffy touch, her pleasant fragrance...... Although I wasn’t hugging her tightly, this moment, as I felt Lilia-san’s body warmth, filled me with an indescribable sense of happiness.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Ghaak...... The simple sweetness is too intense...... The damage from orthodox sugar content is......]","Doctor M : [Are you okay? Do you want to talk about my child?]","Serious-senpai : [Can you not go naturally planning out your pursuing attack!?]"]},{"number":1618,"title":"Chapter 1618: A Reward for Lilia 11","paragraphs":["<Author’s Notes>","I don’t have much time, so today’s chapter is a bit short.","After embracing Lilia-san for a while, we took a break and went back to looking at models. Though I say that, this place has a collection of dragons from several worlds, so as expected, there were so many that it didn’t seem like we would finish looking at them all no matter how many we looked at.","In the first place, each model has its own explanatory sign, and Lilia-san was looking at them very intently, so we’d obviously take a long time. it would be impossible for us to go through all of them, at least not with the time we have today.","However, it seems that all of the dragons from one planet are gathered in one storage room, so many of them look similar to each other. While Lilia-san may have wanted to take her time looking at them, she arranged things in a way where we visit several storage rooms one after another, taking my feelings into consideration.","As we were leaving a storage room and heading to the next one, I suddenly thought of something and asked her about it.","[......Arehh? It just occurred to me, but how does weather work in this world?]","[Ahh, it seems that I can control that too. For example, if I operate it like this......]","[Ohh, it turned night.]","This world has been daytime all the time, and when I asked her about it, Lilia-san operated her terminal and switched the world to nighttime. The night sky is full of stars, and it’s quite beautiful.","If she can control even the weather at will, when it comes to this world, she really is just like a God.","[The starry sky is amazing. It’s overwhelming.]","[Yes, I just tried testing that out myself...... but it sure is amazing. You don’t usually see such a beautiful starry sky.]","[Since we’re at it, how about we look at the stars for a little while?]","[That sounds like a good idea. Let’s do that...... I’ll just make a hill over here......]","[Ohh, that kinda feels like you have creation power.]","[Fufu, it does feel like a World Creation power. Well, I’m just operating stuff on this terminal though...... In any case, since I’m able to do all this, let’s watch the night-time stars on top of a grassy hill.]","Agreeing with the words Lilia-san with a chuckle, we moved up the hill together. The atmosphere feels quite nice, feeling good with us sitting side by side, gazing at the star.","[It’s beautiful, and the peacefulness feels nice.]","[Yes, it’s probably the best setting for star gazing...... W- With this kind of mood......]","[Unnn?]","[Ah, no...... Errr, a- ahh, look over there, Kaito-san! The stars around that area are amazing!]","Eeehhh...... L- Lilia-san...... You’re someone who can’t tell lies as usual. I mean, it really feels like she’s trying to somehow get me to face that direction.","I don’t really know what she’s trying to do, but for the time being, I decided to just go along with it and turned my gaze in the direction Lilia-san was pointing.","[......Errr, that direction?]","[T- That’s right. A little higher up......]","[Higher up...... Fumu. That should be———-]","[Chu.]","[——–Eh?]","Feeling a soft sensation unexpectedly on my cheek, I turned around in surprise. Even though I did notice that Lilia-san was up to something, I never expected she was planning on kissing me.","While I was surprised that the extremely shy Lilia-san would actually do such a thing, Lilia-san spoke with her face blushing red, sweating profusely.","[U- U- U- Unpreparedness is a person’s greatest enemy, y- y- you know......]","[Let’s calm down, Lilia-san. You don’t look composed at all. You seem like you’re about to faint any moment now...... Take a deep breath......]","From Lilia-san’s perspective, she probably intended to say that with plenty of composure as the older one between us, but her face clearly conveys how extremely flustered she is.","In any case, I found myself struggling to calm down Lilia-san for a while.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Guaaaahhhh...... T- This is...... This thing’s still going on......?]"]},{"number":1619,"title":"Chapter 1619: A Reward for Lilia 12","paragraphs":["At any rate, after a few...... no, after quite a large amount of time, I somehow managed to calm down Lilia-san.","[Lilia-san, have you calmed down?]","[Y- Yes, I’m all better now.]","Her face was still as red as a boiled octopus, but if I point that out, she might end up getting even more embarrassed, so I’ll just keep quiet about it.","However, regarding that kiss just now...... should I touch upon that matter? It’s also difficult to completely avoid that topic, and the more time passes, the more likely Lilia-san will feel awkward about it...... Let’s just gather my courage and bring it up here.","[......Errr, Lilia-san. About what you did just now?]","[Ahh, no, that is...... Like I said before, I thought I should show a more adult-like attitude, like, showing my dignity as someone older...... s- so, sometimes, I wanted to be the one taking the initiative...... and so......]","As embarrassment makes Lilia-san’s face grow redder and redder, it seems like steam might start rising from her head any moment now.","[In other words, Lilia-san had...... so to speak, you wanted to do something lover-like on your own initiative, so you did something like that?]","[Y- Yes...... Y- You see. Even I, umm, wanted to do couple-like things with Kaito-san...... B- Being lovey-dovey is what you call it, yes? I want to do that too. However, I’d usually get embarrassed and hesitate, so I’ve just been secretly studying and doing image training in preparation for moments like this......]","[Studying?]","[I- I had studied popular romance novels and had done careful image training before going through the real deal but...... T- Things really just won’t go according to how you imagine it.]","While that was a bit surprising, it’s also quite heartwarming. Lilia-san certainly is quite the shy person; I remember she even fainted the first time we kissed.","However, even though she’s feeling embarrassed, it seems Lilia-san has the desire to do more lover-like things with me, and she’s actively making efforts within her capabilities to overcome it.","[......Ahh, ummm, in my image training, I did properly kiss you on the lips...... but when things are actually happening, I couldn’t summon the courage and resorted to that......","[I see......]","It seems that she herself was aware that her acting was a bit forced. Well, how should I say this...... I just couldn’t help thinking that Lilia-san is adorable.","Blushing with embarrassment, trying to escape the situation by pressing her index fingers together...... While she might not feel like someone older than me, her cuteness is absolutely overwhelming.","[In other words, Lilia-san was actually planning for a normal kiss?]","[Y- Yes. U- Ummm, t- that was a good mood we had earlier......]","[Well, would you mind if I’m the one initiating it?]","[Aeehh!?]","Upon hearing my words, Lilia-san’s face, which was already red enough, seemingly as if an explosion resounded, grew even redder.","Guess pursuing things any further here would be a bad idea. There’s a chance she might go overload, so I’ll just wait for Lilia-san’s reaction......","After waiting for Lilia-san’s statement without saying anything for a while...... Lilia-san’s eyes moved around restlessly several times, and slightly lowering her head, she quietly muttered her response.","[......I- I’m fine with it......]","[Then, if you’ll excuse me.]","[Ahh, y- yes.]","Having received Lilia-san’s approval, I gently reached out and, my hand tracing along her cheek, tilted her face upwards. With her face blushing red, looking up at me with teary eyes, Lilia-san’s gaze was so destructive that it made my heart skip a beat, but holding such emotions back, I slowly leaned in, ensuring not to make Lilia-san uneasy.","Lilia-san’s eyes moved here and there for a while, but when my face came closer to hers, seemingly having made up her mind, she closed her eyes and slightly pouted her lips.","As I felt my cheeks relax at her cute gesture, I moved my face even closer and our lips completely overlapped.","The softness of her lips, the warmth of her cheek transmitted to my hand...... I could strongly feel that I’m kissing Lilia-san, and how should I say this...... It was a moment filled with happiness.","It would have been alright to end it there, but the feeling was so pleasant that a desire to deepen the kiss further welled up within me.","Though I say that, I couldn’t just ignore Lilia-san’s intentions, so even though I didn’t know if it would work or not, while in the midst of our kiss, I lightly brushed her lips with my tongue to convey my intention.","Thereupon, after Lilia-san’s shoulders flinched...... It was only a little bit, but she definitely opened her lips slightly and positioned herself to accept me.","In that case, I couldn’t hold back anymore, and driven by desire, I kissed Lilia-san even deeper for a long time...... but after that, Lilia-san fainted, so it seems that she hadn’t done any image training as to what happens up to that point.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [.....................]","Doctor M : [Fumu, fumufumu...... Is it millet jelly this time? Unnn, it’s sweet and delicious.]"]},{"number":1620,"title":"Chapter 1620: Lost High Elf 1","paragraphs":["Regarding the Founding Festival of Hydra Kingdom, I’m not going to be a vendor, so I don’t need to do much preparation.","There’s no fixed time for us to go there, and we could just take it easy. The gates would normally be crowded, so I would have to be mindful of the time of arrival, but since I plan to go there with Alice’s Teleportation Magic, the traffic won’t be a problem at all.","And so, with the Founding Festival coming up in a few days, I was just hanging out and enjoying window shopping without doing anything in particular.","It is fun to go on a date with my lovers, but it’s also quite enjoyable to walk around the city alone without a particular purpose in mind.","Well, that’s what I was thinking...... when I suddenly saw a familiar figure at the end of the street.","The person was elegantly leaning against a lamppost with her arms crossed, watching the people waiting with a relaxed expression on her face.","At first glance, she had the aura of someone people watching, and due to her unique appearance, it was difficult for one to approach and start a conversation with her...... but from my knowledge of her, I understood that she was probably in trouble, so I decided to call out to her.","[......I’ll ask just in case, but are you lost, Fors-san?]","[O- Ohhh...... You always show up in times of my predicament. Your timing is great...... I mean, when you show up at a troubling time like this, my maidenly heart, which I should have forgotten long ago, beats loudly. Good gracious, I certainly couldn’t say that your timing is too good though, as I’d be too ashamed of how often I get lost and get troubled by it. It’s just, even though I’m well aware that getting lost isn’t a good thing, when I think about the encounters with you that happen as a result, I can’t help but feel that getting lost might not be all that bad. No, I do know that this is something that should be improved though......]","When I called out to Fors-san, who was loitering on the road with a seemingly relaxed atmosphere...... but in reality was lost and was standing there not knowing what to do, Fors-san’s eyes sparkled and she talked nimbly as usual.","I thought it would be better if she used that lively conversational skills to ask directions, but well, I guess there was a high possibility that they would think she was strange and avoid her.","[......Errr, so, why are you here?]","[Ahhh, I’d like to get to that, but it would take a while to explain. How about this——– since we met by chance, having a casual chat in the midst of the public’s hustle and bustle doesn’t seem appealing. If it’s convenient for you, how about we find a place to have a chat over tea? Ohh, don’t worry, I won’t make someone who I’ll undoubtedly be relying on from now on pay money. As remuneration for your assistance, I’d like you to enjoy as much food and drink as you’d like.]","[Well, I don’t have any plans, so I’m fine with it. I think there’s a cafe nearby, so how about we go there?]","[Ahh, Symphonia’s Royal Capital is your home after all. You’d undoubtedly be more familiar with the establishments here than I am, so I’ll leave the selection to you. If this were in the forest, or perhaps around the outskirts of Rigforeshia, I could have guided you myself. Well, with me being the guide, I myself am doubting if I could actually lead you to the right place.]","For the time being, although she might be lost, she seems to have an air of composure about me. However, I must not be deceived. Even during the Six Kings Festival, she was also as composed as this, but she actually ended up keeping Laguna-san waiting for several days.","[......I’ll ask just to make sure, but don’t you have any plans on meeting up with someone or some other plans in mind?]","[I do have such plans in mind, but it won’t be today. Ohh, please don’t misunderstand, I don’t mean that I have a scheduled meeting time that had already passed just like that time in the Six Kings Festival. My plans really will happen a few days from today. So, please rest assured that I am not keeping anyone waiting at this point or anything like that.]","[I see, well, we can talk about the rest of the details as we move along......]","At any rate, it doesn’t seem like it would be that pattern where her meeting time has already passed, so I can rest assured and continue talking with Fors-san as we move along.","[The fact that you’re lost today, is it related to how you’ll be meeting up with someone?","[Ohh, what discerning eyes. That’s right...... If anything, the person I will be meeting up with is just like last time, Laguna. Well, rather than us meeting up, it’s more like she demanded that I attend their Founding Festival that will take place in a few days. I couldn’t really refuse the request of my long-time friend, so I decided to attend.]","[Ahh, I see......]","[Laguna told me to stay at home as she would send someone to pick me up. Since I had a few errands to run though, I thought I might as well head to Hydra Kingdom a bit earlier. Well, no matter how directionally challenged I am, I figured I’d have enough time to get there with about 10 days to spare....... Ahaha, well, here we are.]","[......No, ummm...... This is Symphonia’s Royal Capital though?]","[......How mysterious, isn’t it?]","The words Laguna told her about her staying at home are indeed correct. This person is probably someone who shouldn’t be allowed to go out somewhere alone.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......A guy who shouldn’t be allowed to go out alone (as he’d definitely go triggering flags somewhere) met someone who shouldn’t be allowed to go out alone (as she’d end up getting lost).]"]},{"number":1621,"title":"Chapter 1621: Lost High Elf 2","paragraphs":["I brought Fors-san to a cafe with a chic atmosphere. I thought that since Fors-san is an Elf, it would be better to bring her to a wooden cafe, one brimming with nature, but then, I also thought that there would be many such places in Rigforeshia, so I just chose to bring her to a brick cafe.","......Well, there’s also the fact that this was simply the closest......","[Good gracious, what a nice atmosphere this place has. I’ve been thinking about this for a while now, but you really do have great taste. The fact that you can easily choose places with this kind of ambiance shows how experienced you are in the field of romance. I’m older than you in age, but I guess experience is important in this kind of thing.]","[Haha, thank you...... So, Fors-san. In the first place, why did you end up in Symphonia’s Royal Capital when you were planning to head to Hydra Kingdom? Did you simply have business to attend to over here?]","I was almost bewildered by how extremely poor her sense of direction is, considering she was supposed to attend Hydra Kingdom’s Founding Festival, but ended up here in Symphonia’s Royal Capital...... but upon closer recollection, she did say how she headed to Hydra Kingdom ahead of time for another errand, so there’s a significant possibility that she got lost and ended up in Symphonia’s Royal Capital for the sake of that errand.","[No, my errands ended in the neighborhood of my house though? Ah, I suppose you have misunderstood me. Simply because I’m reclusive by nature, even stepping outside of my home is quite unusual for me. Since I was going to go out of my home anyway, I decided to do my errands outside on my way to the Teleportation Gate leading to Hydra Kingdom. Well, that was what I was planning but......]","[That’s strange, isn’t it? If you were acting according to those assumptions, you wouldn’t have had the need to leave Rigforeshia in the first place, right?]","This is different from that time in the Six Kings Festival. She wouldn’t have to travel to the Teleportation Gate leading from the Human Realm to the Demon Realm, she would just be walking to a Teleportation Gate for traveling within the Human Realm, which is located within Rigforeshia.","Of course, Teleportation can be expensive, but it’s hard to believe that Fors-san wouldn’t be able to afford the cost of teleportation. In fact, from what I heard, she herself was planning to use the Teleportation Gate for her travels but......","[No, to begin with, my first errand involved gathering various herbs. Although it was quite close to my home in Rigforeshia, I still ventured outside and harvested them in the forest. So far, everything was going smoothly but......]","[You got lost in the forest and never made it back to Rigforeshia in the first place.]","[Your discernment ability truly is admirable. Yes, that is exactly the case. Given that I’m prone to getting lost even on regular paths, there’s no reason for me not to get lost in the forest...... Well, even though I may be referred to as the “Sage of the Forest”, such title is because of my proficiency with Nature Magic, not because I know the forest inside and out. Well, I usually procure supplies from shops, but since I was heading to Hydra Kingdom anyway, I thought I’d take the opportunity to get some exercise, given my usual lack of physical activity, and things ended up like this...... Thanks to that, I got far more exercise than I expected, so I suppose it was a success in a way, wasn’t it?]","[Isn’t it more like a total failure?]","It seems that due to a spur-of-the-moment decision, she ended up venturing outside from Rigforeshia when she could have stayed there, and as a result, she got lost in a nearby forest and ended up in this predicament.","It’s something I heard from Neun-san, but it seems that Fors-san tends to become absentminded when her research is involved. She impulsively puts her ideas into action, so she might casually go somewhere or deviate from the path to gather things that seem useful for her research, which leads to her ending up getting lost.","[......So, what happened then?]","[After quite a long time, I managed to get out of the forest, but I had apparently ended up near the side of the forest opposite of Rigforeshia, where I saw a different road. So, if I tried to go back to the forest and return to Rigforeshia, I would most likely get lost in the forest again. If that’s the case, if I walk along the well-developed road, even if I don’t arrive in Rigforeshia, there’s a good chance I’ll arrive in another city or town. Then, I would either ask for directions there or use their Teleportation Gate if available.]","[......There’s some stuff I’d like to throw a tsukkomi about, I understand your logic. Certainly, if you walk along a main path, you will eventually reach a relatively large town or a city.]","[Yeah, and that’s how I arrived here...... a big city.]","[Wait a moment there. How far do you think it is from Rigforeshia to the Royal Capital...... There should be several big towns before you get here, right!?]","[Well, even I find it strange, but the first place I arrived at really was Symphonia Kingdom’s Royal Capital. Well, I think I know the reason why it happened. I was walking along the road, you see, when I found some materials that might be useful for my research, and I got so absorbed in collecting them that I got off the road. A slight incident it was.]","[Rather than just a slight incident, isn’t that totally the main reason why you got lost!?]","Deviating from the main path and heading straight to the Royal Capital, a distance equivalent to crossing multiple mountains...... Moreover, for her to actually manage to completely bypass all the towns and cities in between and reach the Royal Capital, she’s quite skillful at getting lost. I now understand what Neun-san meant when she said she thought it was like Fors-san was getting lost on purpose.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Even though her speed is slow, it was a distance that even Anima took without sleep and rest.]"]},{"number":1622,"title":"Chapter 1622: Lost High Elf 3","paragraphs":["In regards to Fors-san’s story...... I mean, there are parts that amaze me at her lack of sense of direction, and I can really understand why Laguna-san felt like telling Fors-san not to go out.","[......Well, in short, you want to go to Hydra Kingdom, right?]","[Yeah, that’s right. The Founding Festival is still a few days away, but since Laguna’s pulling a shut-in like me out of my home, she’ll probably let me stay at the castle for a few days or provide accommodations. As long as I manage to reach Hydra Kingdom’s Royal Capital, I should be able to handle the rest.]","[This is just an innocent question, but can’t Fors-san use Teleportation Magic?]","Fors-san is one of the most outstanding magic-users in the Human Realm, holding the title “Sage of the Forest”. That being the case, I think it wouldn’t be surprising if she’s capable of using Teleportation Magic...... but well, Teleportation Magic is more like something one could excel at while others struggle at, so the possibility of her not being able to use it is also quite high.","I mean, considering how she’s trying to go towards a Teleportation Gate, it’s likely that she can’t use it......","[Unnn? Yeah, I can use it without any problems.]","[............Hmmm.]","[Oya? Why do you look like you just bit on a bitter bug?]","That’s strange. The answer she’s responding with here shouldn’t have been a “YES”....... After all, if that’s the case, all this conversation would end if she just used Teleportation Magic to go to Hydra Kingdom, right?","I’m thinking under the premise that Fors-san can’t use Teleportation Magic, which allows for the lengthy process of her getting lost or wandering for an extended period of time to make sense...... After all, if she’s able to use Teleportation Magic, she could have just gone to the conclusion “Well, if I’m lost, I will just teleport”.","[......Why is it that you still get lost when you can use Teleportation Magic?]","[Ahh, no, I suppose I hadn’t provided enough explanation. I am indeed capable of using Teleportation Magic, but I’m not skilled in using it. Ahh, in this case, when I say “not skilled”, I don’t mean I lack the aptitude for using it...... I’m extremely susceptible to Teleportation sickness, you see. If I use Teleportation Magic to move, I almost always end up getting so sick that everything from my stomach comes out. I assume you’re aware that the teleportation means between Teleportation Magic and Teleportation Gates differ, but I don’t get sick using Teleportation Gates. While I haven’t thoroughly investigated the details, I do believe that the difference in methods is a factor causing the sickness or preventing me from having one...... Honestly, even though I’m capable of doing so, I’m not very keen on experimenting and verifying this. Teleportation sickness is truly that severe for me...... I won’t just be vomiting; the discomfort persists for a while, and I become dizzy to the point that my head feels disoriented.]","[Ahh, so that’s how it was.]","It’s just like how people have severe motion sickness in a car, where even though she can use Teleportation Magic, but due to her constitution, she doesn’t want to use it. With that explanation, many aspects become understandable.","The option of using Teleportation Magic when she gets lost does come to her mind, but from what I can hear from her, it seems like she finds even the thought of considering it unpleasant, so Teleportation Magic really must lead to severe motion sickness for her.","[Ahh~~ But if that’s the case, then I suppose it’s not possible for me to use my Teleportation Magic Tool to bring you to Hydra Kingdom either.]","[Indeed. I’d like it if you excuse me from that. I don’t know which locations you registered with your Teleportation Magic Tool, but I’m not about to throw away my public decency for it. I’d prefer not to attract undue attention in public places, drawing pity-filled gazes on me.]","[You can handle Teleportation Gates, right?]","[Yeah, I don’t have a problem with those. I’m digressing here, but there are some who refer to those as “Teleportation Gates” and others who call them “Teleportation Portals”. There are also those who use the terms interchangeably depending on their mood. I wonder what caused this difference in naming? It would be interesting to research this, including whether there are regional variations on its naming. There’s also a possibility of discovering a third alternative name apart from those two.]","(T/N: I didn’t notice it myself, but Fors was talking about some people calling the gate “Teni-mon”, “mon” meaning gate, and other people calling it “Teni-geito”. Incidentally, Kaito and Fors call it “Teni-geito”.)","Using a Teleportation Gate would indeed be the best option to bring Fors-san, who struggles with Teleportation Magic, to Hydra. As for the portal-type magic tool at my house? Hmmm, I’m not sure if it could work for her...... I don’t experience Teleportation sickness myself, so I wouldn’t be able to differentiate between regular Teleportation Magic and Teleportation Gates based on what I personally feel.","She’d end up looking really pitiful if it didn’t work, so I suppose it would be better to play it safe and go to the city’s Teleportation Gate here.","[Then, when we finish our drinks, I’ll guide you to the Teleportation Gate.]","[Ahh, no, I’d feel really apologetic making you go through all that. Just providing me with directions would be sufficient. Even though you may forget about it, I am the Elves’ Head. I do come to Symphonia’s Royal Capital for events like Founding Festival, so I believe I have a decent grasp of the route.]","[I see...... Well then, let’s go there together after we finish our drinks.]","[......That’s strange? Even though I told you such a thing, why is it that you responded that way? Did you not hear what I said, or perhaps you didn’t catch what I meant...... Guess I’ll say it again. I don’t want to inconvenience you, so if you could just tell me the location————]","[After we finish our drinks! We will be going!!! Together!!!]","[————Ah, yes.]","I might not know Fors-san very well, but there’s one thing I can say with confidence. If I just do as she said and tell her directions, she will definitely get lost......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [I just thought about this, but even if the Hero Party has great fighting power, many of them have messy private lives. Isn’t Laguna the only decent one among them?]","? ? ? : [There’s also the Transcendental Beauty Thief Hapti-chan, you know?]","Serious-senpai : [Even though she tends to play hooky, Laguna really is just better compared to the others......]","? ? ? : [...................]"]},{"number":1623,"title":"Chapter 1623: Lost High Elf 4","paragraphs":["<Author’s Notes>","I’ve been working overnight due to a sudden change in work duties, so today’s chapter is short.","After chatting with Fors-san at the cafe, we went outside again and moved towards the Teleportation Gate. Since using my Teleportation Magic Tool doesn’t seem to be an option for us, we have to move on foot, but it isn’t really that far from here, so going there will not take much time.","[I mean, aren’t you even gonna contact Laguna-san?]","[Ahh, I suppose you’re right. Guess I’ll send out a hummingbird......? Fumu, something like this?]","[What did you write?]","As I watched the hummingbird soar upwards into the sky, I asked Fors-san, to which she casually replied.","[I told her the situation as it is. That I left home with the intention of heading to Laguna’s place beforehand, and currently, I’m in Symphonia Kingdom’s Royal Capital, where I will be using the Teleportation Gate to head towards Hydra.]","[That really was what happened...... but I think Laguna-san will tilt her head in wonder when she sees your hummingbird.]","When going from Rigforeshia to Hydra Kingdom, there should be no need to go through Symphonia Kingdom’s Royal Capital. Even if one travels through teleportation or by sea on a ship...... One would only arrive in the Royal Capital if they took a detour on land and deviated from their path, taking a considerably longer route.","Well, Laguna-san has known Fors-san for a long time, so she probably guessed that she was lost.","As I had such a thought in mind, a hummingbird came flying in. As it had arrived quickly, I guess Laguna-san must have responded in a hurry.","“Where are you!? Write down your location and don’t move a step from that spot!!!”","It’s a short sentence, yet it conveys a remarkable amount of intensity within it. I can strongly feel the struggles she usually experiences with Fors-san’s lack of sense of direction.","In any case, so that Laguna-san wouldn’t worry, I sent out a hummingbird stating that I’m with Fors-san.","A little later, I received a hummingbird addressed to me.","“I see, apologies for the troubles, Kaito...... I advise you to keep an eye on her...... If it’s possible, you should tie a cord or something around her. Better yet, if you have one, you should have her wear a collar and keep her on a leash.”","Well, that’s quite something she wrote there. I can only wonder just how much she’s been through...... As I involuntarily chuckled at such a thought, I shifted my gaze...... and noticed that Fors-san, who was supposed to be right beside me just a moment ago, had disappeared.","Huh? Eh? She suddenly disappeared!?","When I looked around in a panic, I saw her peering with interest at a stall a short distance away.","[Hohou, this looks like something I could use for research. Unusual things really can be found once I leave Rigforeshia, which excites my curiosity. While I’m here, I might as well buy several research materials. Come to think of it, there are some interesting stalls over there too......]","......Unnn. It seems like I seriously shouldn’t take my eyes off this person.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [She’s the type who erases everything out of her thoughts the moment she sees something that involves her research huh......]"]},{"number":1624,"title":"Chapter 1624: Lost High Elf 5","paragraphs":["In order to bring Fors-san to Hydra Kingdom, it’s necessary for us to reach the Teleportation Gate. The distance from here to there would normally be nothing to worry about, but I learned a while ago that you should never take your eyes off Fors-san, so this distance now ended up becoming a tricky one.","[......Fors-san, I wouldn’t have something like a collar and a leash, so how about we hold hands instead?]","[Whoa there, aren’t you making quite the violent remark there with a kind smile on your face...... Good gracious, I don’t know if I should be pleased or saddened that your understanding of me has become extremely high in just a short while...... Your words somewhat remind me of the old days. The passage of time can certainly be cruel. Even the gentle Hikari, by the latter half of our journey, had treated me so roughly, saying things like “Let’s just tie her to a post in front of our base with a rope and fix her in place”.]","It’s just my guess, but Neun-san had probably been gentle at her treatment towards her at the beginning, supporting Fors-san when she wandered off. However, the fact that she ended up being treated roughly indicates how often she had gotten lost.","As I had such a thought in mind, Fors-san looked unusually troubled about something as her gaze slightly wandered about.","[......Ahh, but even if I do understand your wariness, rest assured. I don’t intend to get lost any further, so there’s no need to hold hands.]","[I see...... Well then, shall we hold hands?]","[......Look at those eyes, so free from hesitation...... as if to say that this isn’t the first time you’ve dealt with a troubling person like I am. I can even feel your determination to never give in on this, as if to say conceding on this matter in itself is no different from acknowledgment......]","When one speaks of someone getting lost, Tre-san is also such a person, and I’ve also dealt with other troubling people...... various people with quite the habits.","When dealing with people like her, conceding here leads to failure. It truly requires the determination to forcefully assert one’s own opinion. Without that, control over the situation can’t be maintained.","[......W- Well, but you see, this is a bit inconvenient for me...... I have my own reasons why I’d like you to excuse myself from this...... No, of course, I’m well aware of my own lack of sense of direction. I also understand that what you propose is the best option there is. But you see, society doesn’t always view things under reason. Sometimes, we would have to make choices in which might be inefficient, yet inevitable.]","[Do you find something inconvenient with holding hands with me?]","It’s just that, Fors-san seemed unusually hesitant, or perhaps, somewhat embarrassed, so I tilted my head and asked...... to which Fors-san averted her gaze before speaking.","[......No, you see, I already told you before, didn’t I? I don’t intend to throw away my public decency as a woman. I still hold a certain amount of shame. So, ummm, I, you see...... Within the days I had gotten lost, bathing and stuff like that...... N- No, I’d like it if you do not misunderstand me! I’ve been using magic to keep my body clean and smelling good! H- However, even if my body is clean, my mind still holds some hesitation......]","[I see...... Even if there’s no problem at all, there’s still that part of you that feels concerned about it.]","[Ahh, you understand what I feel? I see...... I’m glad you understand.]","[Well then, for the time being, let’s just hold hands.]","[......That’s strange? Even though I should have conveyed my thoughts to you, I’m not getting the results I wanted. Your lack of hesitancy, it’s as if you’re saying me not getting lost is more important than my trivial worries...... almost as if you’re convinced that if we don’t hold hands, I’ll end up getting lost......]","Indeed, that’s what I think. I understand the reason behind Fors-san’s hesitation about holding hands. Of course, I am inclined to be considerate in that aspect, given that Fors-san is a woman. However, even if I do feel that way...... My intuition is telling me that if I back down here, this woman will definitely get lost...... then all that awaits me is a frantic search around the Royal capital.","[Fors-san, I don’t mind, so let’s hold hands. Come on, let’s get going.]","[......I don’t dislike pushy men but...... Ugh, uuuu...... A- Alright. Looking back, the reason I’m in this situation is me. I’ll take those terms......]","Seeing Fors-san nod with a faint blush on her cheeks while saying that, I start to feel like I’m doing something mischievous...... but unfortunately for her, based on my past experiences, I can’t give in here, so I have no choice but to push forward.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Isn’t this that? Putting aside what Kaito thinks, for Fors, this would be “something he’d have to take responsibility for”! I know a lot about this!!!]"]},{"number":1625,"title":"Chapter 1625: Lost High Elf 6","paragraphs":["Fors-san seemed hesitant, but perhaps sensing that I wouldn’t be conceding on this matter, she finally agreed and we walked hand in hand.","Even though she was under the influence of her experiment, Fors-san’s body had become quite small, so I was very prudent while holding her hand.","[......Hmmm. Your hands sure are big. Ahh, no, I see, it was because my body had shrunk huh...... Good gracious, I have almost no opportunity to hold hands with the opposite sex, so I’m somehow feeling strangely conscious of this. Well, it’s a rather pitiful story given I’ve lived for such a long time, but I have hardly had many opportunities to go outside in the first place, so the chance I’d interact with others is limited.]","[Have you always been a researcher like you are now?]","[Well, I’m quite the staunch recluse after all. If I were to state why such a thing happened, I probably may have been a recluse because I was directionally challenged. It was quite a long time ago, but when my parents were still alive, they didn’t let me out much because I would get lost if I went out alone. No, it may sound as if I was mistreated, but I simply got lost too much and they were genuinely worried about me...... Perhaps, the reason I was even called the Sage of the Forest was because I often wandered off into the woods.]","I don’t really think anything she said back there was a laughing matter, but Fors-san seems to be enjoying herself quite a bit. No, rather, she unexpectedly seemed to be really nervous about holding hands, as I could feel her eloquence in speaking was to gloss over that nervousness.","Well, in any case, since Fors-san says it was a long time ago, it really must have happened thousands of years ago. The typical lifespan of a normal Elf is approximately about 2000 years, but High Elves don’t have a lifespan, so it’s not entirely clear how long ago it was, but Alice said that the Human Realm was created at least within the past 20,000 years, so it is certain that it would be within that 20,000-year timeframe.","[By the way, Fors-san, is there anything that you have researched so far that you think is the best?]","[Oi, oi, are you out of your mind? Asking such a question to a researcher is no different from suicide. However, when asked that question, my blood started to boil. Indeed, my best research huh. Based on what I’ve researched in the past, the most socially impactful has been my research on High Elves’ Ecology and Evolutionary Conditions. I was the first individual to evolve into a High Elf in Elven history, and that had been the deciding factor for me receiving my title. I think you can understand this since you’ve also seen High Elves, but while High Elves are Special Individuals, there are hardly any visible changes in terms of appearance. That is why my first struggle back then was proving whether I was a being different from regular Elves and whether it was due to me being a Special Individual or not.]","[Ahh, I see...... For example, it can be like Lilia-san’s case, whether you yourself just have outstanding talent huh.]","[Indeed...... Well, that Duchess-dono is even more of an extraordinary example. After all, she isn’t a Special Individual or anything of that sort, she’s simply a being with an exceptionally abnormal level of talent. Oops, let’s get back on track. Anyhow, as you correctly surmised, as a? Special Individual that is a High Elf, which held no external changes from normal Elves, it posed me a challenge when it came to proving whether I, with my innate talent that simply made me exceptionally loved by nature, was a singular occurrence or if there could be second or third instances in the future and if such a thing was a species-exclusive aspect of ours.]","That certainly sounds quite the challenge...... That’s almost as if it could only be proven if another High Elf is born in the future. However, since we are talking about research done in the past, and since she even talked about it being the most socially impactful, she must have proven it in some way.","[Just a question, something related to our current topic, but are there any other High Elves besides Fors-san and Sieg-san?]","[There have been three others in the past. If I am the first, Sieglinde would be the fifth High Elf. In her case, however, the evolutionary process she went through is extremely rare. Evolution caused by the consumption of a Fruit of the World Tree...... While the Fruit of the World Tree certainly may be brimming with Nature magic power, it originally doesn’t possess the power to drive the evolution of Elves into High Elves. It’s likely her exceptional talent that enabled such evolution.]","[I see......]","[The original condition for evolving into a true High Elf lies in the transformation of internal organs. This aspect also decisively distinguishes High Elves from regular Elves. Over a long period of time, High Elves absorb Nature magic power into their bodies, resulting in a change in their internal organs through the influence of Nature magic power, leading the High Elves’ constitution into something akin to that of Spirits. Detailed explanations might get a little lengthy, but do you mind? Am I not talking too much?]","[Ahh, it’s alright. I know people much worse that you can’t even be compared with them, so it’s perfectly fine.]","[......I don’t know if I can really say it myself, but when you say they’re someone much worse than me, I can only think of them as someone considerably crazy......]","[Because they are considerably crazy.]","Unnn. Fors-san actually gives me the space to engage in conversation, so there’s actually no issue at all. Her level of gentleness is completely incomparable to Eden-san when her switch is flipped.","<Afterword>","Makina : [Good grief, for my beloved child to be saying that much, who in the world is this considera———– Me!?]","Serious-senpai : [No, rather, why the heck are you surprised?]","Makina : [Eh? Even though I’ve been talking reservedly and narrowing down what I’m talking about......]","Serious-senpai : [......The heck is this woman talking about?]"]},{"number":1626,"title":"Chapter 1626: Lost High Elf 7","paragraphs":["While we were heading for the Teleportation Gate, Fors-san seemed to have gotten into the mood as she began to give some sort of lecture on Special Individuals.","[To begin with, have you ever heard that there are two types of Special Individuals: Congenital and Acquired?]","[Ahh, I’ve heard of that. There are species in which being a Special Individual is something they’re born with, while there are species whose Special Individual state is something they acquired and evolved into, right?]","[Indeed, that is the current common understanding. However, I personally feel that there might be types other than these two. For instance, Elves may be a species that evolves into a Special Individual later in life, but even if that’s the case, I don’t think it should be definitely stated that Congenital Special Individuals could never be born under that species. Currently, there simply isn’t any precedent, but there’s still a possibility that a Congenital Special Individual could eventually be born under that species.]","Now that she mentioned it, it does seem like a plausible perspective. Only the Acquired Special Individuals in that species may have been confirmed, but the idea that Congenital Special Individuals could also be born under that species is indeed a plausible possibility.","[Moreover, as I mentioned earlier, the physical characteristics of the High Elves don’t change very much. This certainly may not be the case for every species, but usually, Special Individuals have distinguishing features that can be recognized at a glance, such as a change in color or unique characteristics on a part of their body.]","[Ahh~~ Right, the transformation that occurs for the Elves would be internal, so it’s slightly different from the other examples.]","[Yeah, it is as you said. This is purely my hypothesis, but rather than being Special Individuals, High Elves could just be a growth stage that regular Elves attain under certain conditions, and a true Special Individual Elf has yet to be born. Having such a thought holds its own romance, don’t you think?]","[It does give off this feeling of looking at something unknown, doesn’t it?]","[Right, isn’t it? Well, I’m not exactly a Special Individual Specialist, but as a researcher, I could feel this subject’s charm.]","As I was walking leisurely along the street, listening to Fors-san happily talking about this subject, she suddenly pulled me by the hand.","[Ohh, now that is quite a rare material. If I have such a thing in hand, it might open up new approaches for my ongoing research project. Hmmm, but the one over there seemed even more unusual...... I could smell it...... the scent of research!]","[Yes, yes. Let’s leave that to another time.]","[N- No way, can’t you just wait for a moment!? If I were to miss this opportunity, there’s a chance I won’t acquire any more of those......]","[Come now, we’re almost at the gate.]","While we were walking, her attention would often be drawn away by her research just like this time, so if we weren’t holding hands, I would have lost sight of her immediately.","In fact, it seemed that Fors-san had caused quite a lot of trouble to Laguna-san and the others...... It did make me curious which of them is better at getting lost, her or Tre-san......","[I wonder why? I feel like your treatment of me is becoming increasingly rougher. Should I be glad that the emotional distance between us has shortened, or should I lament that you’ve started responding to me like Laguna and Hikari did? This is quite the dilemma.]","[......Does Hapti-san treat you in a different way?]","[Ahh, as for Hapti...... Compared to the instances of me getting lost, Hapti gets involved in financial troubles far more frequently. She drew Hikari and Laguna’s attention more than I did. However, she’s quite clever, as she even uses their vigilance to skillfully manipulate us and make money for herself. Good gracious, Hapti was so much of a troublemaker during our adventure that my tendency to getting lost is getting overshadowed.]","How much of a troublemaker were you, Hapti-san...... No, guess I should be asking Alice that huh? Well, it is true that even back at the Six Kings Festival, Neun-san said that she was more of a troublemaker than Fors-san was, and the fact that Fors-san had described her should mean that she’s that much of a troublemaker.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [It’s to the extent where in their party of four, all three of her party members said she’s the biggest troublemaker.]"]},{"number":1627,"title":"Chapter 1627: Lost High Elf 8","paragraphs":["Once we reached the Teleportation Gate, we will soon be in Hydra Kingdom. Since today wasn’t a season brimming with events, the gate wasn’t so crowded, and we were able to teleport without much waiting time.","As soon as we arrived at Hydra Kingdom, I could smell the unique seaside scent and feel the hustle and bustle of the place.","[No matter how many times I visit this place, Hydra Kingdom really is always bustling.]","[It’s probably more accurate to call this place a huge port city. In fact, the markets near the sea are always quite lively. Hydra Kingdom has various innovative systems in place, particularly with their lower tax rate compared to others. The conditions are conducive for individuals to easily open shops, making it much easier for one to start a business. However, due to this nature of the Kingdom, there tends to be a large number of small to medium-sized shops and not many large commercial establishments.]","[I see, it certainly has that kind of atmosphere.]","Hydra Kingdom is a place where the authority held by the citizens is strong, while the nobles are almost all in name only and their authority isn’t much greater than the others. I even heard some saying that nobility in itself may eventually disappear in the country. I guess that country really seemed to be the most ahead of its time in the Human Realm.","As someone from a different world, I find this characteristic of Hydra Kingdom’s culture relatively easier to get used to compared to the other countries.","As we were walking down the street while I had such a thought in mind, a familiar old man walked up to me from the other side. It was Laguna-san, wearing the disguise she had when we first met.","[Fors-san, it looks like she’s come to pick you up.]","[Yeah, that indeed seems to be the case. She sure is as unskillful at Transformation Magic as usual...... Those well-versed in magic would notice the discrepancies fairly quickly. Well, she’s a staunch front-line type, so I suppose it’s inevitable......]","[Neun-san also mentioned how she’s not very good at Recognition Inhibition Magic either.]","[Well, magic is something that some are good while others aren’t. I might be referred to as a Sage, but it doesn’t mean I can use all sorts of magic. One could say I’m more specialized in Nature Magic and Earth Magic. On the other hand, I’m not very skilled in Fire and other such magic.]","Fors-san also seemed to notice Laguna-san immediately as she wryly smiled. Thereupon, Laguna-san seemed to know that we had noticed her, as she lightly signaled to us with a finger.","She was probably signaling us to go to an unpopulated area in the direction her finger was pointing to. Laguna-san is a King with a tremendous approval rating and is quite popular within Hydra Kingdom.","In fact, when I first met her, she was also using Transformation Magic, so I imagine it would be difficult for her to walk around in the street without a disguise.","We followed the disguised Laguna-san through several alleys until we came to an unpopulated seaside area, where Laguna-san took off her disguise.","[Fuuu...... Kaito, sorry for troubling you...... Fors!!! I told you not to go out, didn’t I!!!?]","[C- Calm down, Laguna...... F- For the time being, put down that fist you’re raising. Listen here, it’s the behavior of savage beasts to immediately resort to violence. We are rational creatures...... We must not let our anger get the better of us.]","[Even though I’ve kept on warning you about this repeatedly beforehand, for you to still get lost like that, I’d obviously get mad. In the first place...... Unnn? Hou...... fumu......]","[What is it? Laguna, that’s an unpleasant look you have there...... Those eyes, don’t you have those when you’re teasing me? I’m now inclined to ask for an explanation for why those eyes are directed towards me at a time like this...... but unfortunately, I do have a slight inkling as to why, so I also feel like not wanting to delve into it too much. If you’re gonna touch upon this matter, I’d appreciate holding onto some resolve to a certain extent.]","They had some sort of exchange that I didn’t quite understand, and Laguna-san, who should have been angry just now, is now grinning like a cheshire cat.","Then, as if to mock Fors-san’s attempt to somehow get the topic back to before, Laguna-san spoke.","[......Fors, aren’t you being unusually shy over there? Oh my, is that a faint blush on your cheeks I see? Hohou, who would have thought I’d get to see you looking like that...... The cause must be Kaito huh. Hahaha, I must say, as to be expected of him! For that Fors to be making such a face———– Whoa!? Hey, wait!?]","[I did warn you......]","Laguna-san was happily teasing Fors-san, but the ground beneath her feet suddenly turned into something like a swamp and her body sank, and even though she tried to resist, she was dragged into the ground.","Then, Fors-san, who was holding a wooden staff before I knew it, imbued it with magic power and tapped its base on the ground.","[......Earth Shaker.]","Thereupon, a big tremor...... an earthquake occurred, and considering we were on the seaside, I looked around in panic, but then I noticed that the sea wasn’t rippling at all...... It seemed that it was only the location we were in that were shaking.","It’s quite a mysterious situation, but most likely, to prevent any damage to the vicinity, a counteracting magic is being employed to induce an ultra-localized earthquake.","And then, a little later, when the shaking stopped...... the ground on which Laguna-san had sunk became as hard as steel.","[......Well then, since we’ve come all the way to Hydra Kingdom, let’s have a light lunch before we head to the royal castle. As thanks for this matter, allow me to treat you.]",".","[......Ah, no, what about Laguna-san?]","[......If she were to die from something like this, she would have died on that journey a thousand years ago. I’ve seriously solidified and reinforced that ground, but I’m sure she’ll be out in a few minutes. Well, just leave her be. Let’s go.]","[Ah, yes.]","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [This is unusual. I mean, I would like it if you would stop raising flags that make me feel uneasy...... You know, mainly the sugary flags.]"]},{"number":1628,"title":"Chapter 1628: Lost High Elf 9","paragraphs":["When Fors-san, who had buried Laguna-san underground, pulled me by the hand and tried to move away, the ground cracked at that moment.","[......Tsk, according to my calculations, we should be able to move away for three minutes...... Seems like what I heard was true, you really had been training these days.]","[Fhua! Fors! You trying to kill me!?]","Almost at the same time as Fors-san muttered so, Laguna-san jumped out, shattering the iron-colored ground.","And to Laguna-san, who shouted that in protest, Fors-san told her with a somewhat cold look in her eyes.","[Trying to kill you? I carried out such an action with the understanding that something like that wouldn’t be effective. If, hypothetically, I were genuinely intent on killing you, I wouldn’t engage in a straightforward battle, but instead use tactics from an advantageous position. I would primarily employ poisons. Of course, I wouldn’t be able to create a poison that could overcome your resistance and kill you, but I can still exploit a hole in your resistance to slightly slow down your movements. Using that opportunity, I would use Nature Magic to restrain you, embed as many Sealing Techniques as possible, and then toss you into a Spatial Isolation Barrier, aiming for death by starvation. This would likely be the strategy with the highest chance of success. No matter how powerful you are, you still require food and water. Even if you have provisions in your magic box or you possess resistance, after being confined for several decades, it’s reasonable to assume you would surely die of starvation. During that time, I would do my best to keep the barrier from being broken from the inside. It would become a test of endurance, but since I can’t win through a conventional battle, it can’t be helped.]","[......Ahh~~ I apologize for teasing you, but can you stop seriously talking about how you’d kill me!? That’s scary!]","It really is a seriously well-thought-out approach. She’s acknowledged that Laguna-san is stronger than her and that defeating her head-on is difficult, so instead, she’s focusing on finding a way to eliminate her without direct confrontation. A strategy of this level certainly is quite fitting for someone called a Sage; if things fall into place successfully, it seems like a strategy that could truly work.","[Somehow, that method felt like it could really beat Laguna-san huh.]","[Laguna isn’t good at Space-Time Magic. Confining someone within a Spatial Isolation Barrier is indeed an effective strategy. However, during this era of peace, there would be no opportunity to execute it. The moment a Spatial Isolation Barrier is being created is when it’s most vulnerable, so when facing someone formidable as Laguna, they would likely counterattack with a slap imbued with a high density of magic power the instant I try to activate it. That’s why, even if it’s just for a short time, I would need to seal her movements.]","[Well, that’s only because I’m not good at Space-Time Magic. If someone is skilled in Space-Time Magic, it might be possible for them to interfere with that Spatial Isolation Barrier. It’s quite likely that the caster outside the barrier would be vulnerable to attacks from within...... For example, if it’s young Lilia, she would be able to easily defeat her from inside that barrier.]","[In the first place, her talent for magic manipulation is too much of a genius that there’s a high likelihood she could instantly dismantle my Sealing Techniques. It’s truly enviable to have such an intuitive sense for countering magic techniques. Against someone like her, I think I might be better off focusing on long-range attacks?]","[No, young Lilia isn’t that easy of an opponent. Since young Lilia possesses Time Magic, she can instantly reduce the effective range of ordinary long-range attacks to zero. To engage in a battle with young Lilia, I suppose the minimum requirement would be to withstand even a single strike from her swordsmanship?]","[Seriously, she’s quite the absurd one. A true genius in combat. If only she had been born during the time we had our journey, defeating the Demon Lord would have been a piece of cake.]","Somehow, before I knew it, they had shifted to talking about countermeasures against Lilia-san. Fors-san didn’t seem to care about Laguna-san’s earlier teasing either, as they began talking amiably.","However, setting that aside, it seems that Lilia-san’s talent really is that astonishing, to the extent that two of the members of Hero Party, who are likely standing high up in the world, are speaking so highly of her. Well, Alice did call her a bug in this world, so they certainly raise many points that I find convincing.","[......Oops, we’re getting off track. Let’s get back on topic. If you’re going to have lunch, it would be better if you both just come with me back to the castle. I also have to show my gratitude to Kaito for this matter, so allow me to treat you to some exquisite cuisine. Also, even with Kaito around, leaving Fors unattended in the city just makes me uneasy...... No, seriously...... I almost feel like even if you part ways with Kaito in a place where you should be able to see the royal castle, you might end up in a different country without ever reaching the castle.]","[Oi, oi, isn’t that a bit too harsh? It’s true that I’m directionally challenged. I can’t argue with you on that point. However, I’m not so inept that I can’t reach a place that’s literally right in my line of sight.]","[......Didn’t you say back at the Six Kings Festival that you weren’t confident you could reach the Central Plaza even when it had that tall tower as a landmark?]","[............No, I think I have about a 30% chance of getting there, you know?]","No, rather, if the condition of having a landmark within her line of sight still results in a 70% chance of getting lost, I can understand Laguna-san’s strong desire to keep Fors-san within her sight.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Lilia is at a level where the two strongest beings in the Human Realm have no other choice but to face her head-on without any specific countermeasures huh.]","? ? ? : [Seriously, when dealing with someone like Lilia-san, unconventional tactics wouldn’t work. Even if there were poisons effective against her, she’s the type who would instantly produce antibodies the moment the poison touches her body, reaching an unreasonable level of adaptability against it. Well, stuff like it is something even I can do but...... well, including against me, all existing poisons are already ineffective against the Six Kings.]","Serious-senpai : [You’re also among the unreasonable ones after all......]"]},{"number":1629,"title":"Chapter 1629: Lost High Elf 10","paragraphs":["Guided by Laguna-san, we were to move to Hydra Kingdom’s royal castle, when I suddenly remembered that this was the first time for me to visit Hydra Kingdom’s royal castle.","[Come to think of it, this is the first time for me to visit Hydra Kingdom’s royal castle. I mean, from this position, I can’t really see that castle.]","[Ahh, I know what you mean. It’s not possible to see the castle from a distance unlike those from Symphonia or Archlesia, right? The reason is simple, Hydra’s Royal Castle is more characterized by its expansive grounds rather than the sheer size of the building itself. Well, though I say that, the royal castle still had the befitting appearance of one. It’s bigger than a normal house, so look, we’re almost there.]","Giving an explanation in anticipation of my question, I looked in the direction Fors-san had pointed and began to see something resembling the roof of a building.","That shape....... Rather than western castles, it feels more like Arabian or Middle Eastern palaces. I see, it’s almost a one-story building, and just as Fors-san said, it’s quite expansive......","[The center of Hydra Kingdom’s Royal Capital is the House of Parliament, not the castle. In the end, the castle is more of a symbol. The face of the country, per se...... It’s fine to perceive it as just a facility where the country’s military, the so-called Knight Order, operates. As for me, I don’t really see the need to call it a royal castle, nor do I see how a King was even needed...... but the people here just refuse to give this up.]","[Doesn’t that just show how much the people love you, Laguna-san?]","[That is, well, quite an honor...... but seriously, when will I be able to resign as King?]","[Isn’t that impossible? Have you ever calculated your approval rating? It’s overwhelmingly positive. If you were to step down from being the King, there’s no doubt that the Hydra Kingdom would fall into great turmoil. It’s also easy to surmise that your successor, after they get compared to you, would quickly succumb to mental distress. Furthermore, even if the position of King were removed, as long as the country maintains some form, representation would still be necessary in some way. If that were to happen, I believe that simply by occupying that position, you would essentially hold a position no different from being a King. Well, it would be a different story if you were to commit a serious scandal, but given your character, forcibly committing wrongdoings just so you can step down seemed impossible for you...... No matter how you look at it, there doesn’t seem to be any future where you can step down as King.]","It’s a speech indifferently spoken that seems to crush all the faint hope Laguna-san may have. In fact, what she said was so precise that Laguna-san could not even make a sound, an indescribable expression on her face as she had bitten down on a bitter bug.","[......W- Well, but you see...... They’re still doing things like voting for a King......]","[Which leads to a complete victory for you, right? I mean, from the perspective of the citizens, isn’t that King election almost more like a festival? It feels like they’re just going along with this event you started on a whim. In reality, the outcome is already predetermined, and even during that previous King election, everyone had set up various grand stalls and created an atmosphere almost like a festival, didn’t they? Without a doubt, it’s mostly seen as a festival to reaffirm your popularity. The voting is just a facade, it already has a predetermined outcome.]","[Fnghh......? That is something I also...... I understand that it’s hard to bring it to reality...... but couldn’t you even allow me to dream......]","With everything neatly laid out before her, Laguna-san murmured as she gazed into the void with a melancholic expression on her face. Well, to be honest, I also agree with Fors-san’s point of view. I mean, even though she says all that, Laguna-san always acts swiftly and accurately as the King.","Her ability to move swiftly with the agility of her footwork and make immediate decisions that benefit the country undoubtedly makes her an excellent King.","In fact, this year’s Founding Festival gained a lot of excitement even before it started due to Laguna-san’s unique move of presenting an item related to the First Hero. All things considered, her skill and talent are things one can undoubtedly be certain of.","[Rather, what are you even going to do after quitting as King? You don’t have the personality of someone who would just idly pass time, and I think it would just end up with the punchline being that you would quickly find yourself having too much free time. I can’t imagine you doing anything other than spending an entire day training or appearing idle by the seaside, fishing while eating rice crackers. In the end, isn’t being a King and managing your daily schedule just right for you? Ultimately, having a balance in life is essential. Even for someone like me who tends to be reclusive and focuses on research, having occasional opportunities to go outside like this helps maintain that balance too.]","[Mhmm...... If you put it that way, indeed...... I’d find myself having too much free time not knowing what to do with it.]","I mean, in fact, even if Laguna-san were to step down from the position of King, she might still find herself participating in governmental matters as one of the parliament or with a position resembling that, still involved with the administration of the country in one way or another.","That being the case, just as Fors-san said, even if she quits as King, I think she will just be placed as a representative with a different title attached to her name, and as a result, what she ends up doing does not change.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [In fact, she had just naturally invited and welcomed one of the First Hero’s party members and the World’s Singularity to the Royal Castle, a task that seems to be in the best interest of the country...... Well, I can’t see a future where she’ll get to quit.]"]},{"number":1630,"title":"Chapter 1630: Intermission: The Sage of the Forests Rumination","paragraphs":["Arriving at the castle and walking to the dining hall with Laguna-san’s guidance, while Fors was having a casual conversation with Kaito and Laguna, she was thinking about the situation.","(Thank goodness we made it to the castle in one piece. Although I wasn’t optimistic about my prospects, expecting it would take several days even under optimistic assumptions, so it was fortuitous that we made it here with time to spare. I have to give him my sincere thanks. Unnn...... No, but......)","Fors is conducting conversation as usual, and her demeanor is no different from normal times. However, if one were to ask whether she was the same as normal even in her heart, that was not really the case.","Although she is quite desperate in pretending to be calm, she’s considerably panicking deep inside, and the reason for that is......","(......H- How long are we going to hold hands like this?)","Yes, Fors is still walking hand in hand with Kaito, and that is the primary factor making Fors’ heart restless.","(His primary objective of making sure I don’t get lost until reaching the royal castle has already been accomplished. It should be okay to let go now. N- No, but why do I have to be the one to initiate such a thing? Moreover, the reason we’re holding hands is me in the first place, and he’s doing it out of pure goodwill, so wouldn’t me doing such a thing be no different from putting a damper on his intentions? Well, but if we consider arriving in the castle as the completion of the objective, then is it the right action to regard the moment we sit down in the dining hall as the endpoint and continue holding hands until then...... A- Alright. To begin with, this is the first time for me to walk hand in hand with someone of the opposite sex. I’m overwhelmingly lacking in knowledge and experience that could have guided my actions...... Rather, it would be best to wait for him to take action.)","Fors is basically a recluse who rarely ventures outside of Rigforeshia. She has never been conscious of the opposite sex, and being the oldest of the Elves, she has always regarded the Elves around her as children, either her nephews or nieces.","Perhaps that’s why, even though she was keeping up appearances on the surface, as Laguna had pointed out a while ago, Fors was embarrassed and in an unsettled state of mind.","(Kuh, while I’m in this state, you sure are quite composed over there. Shows how much of a playboy this guy is. No, in fact, in terms of romantic experience, I’m probably not anywhere close to his level. Kuh, is the act of holding hands really something that can disturb one’s heart to this extent?)","When she glanced at Kaito’s direction, he didn’t seem to be conscious of the fact that he was holding hands with Fors, and was just conversing with Laguna and Fors in a very relaxed way.","It doesn’t look like he was trying to keep up appearances like Fors, but rather, he seemed to be relatively accustomed to the act of walking hand in hand like this.","(Kuh...... Looking quite carefree...... Good grief, I feel like shouting at him at least once. “Are you not the slightest bit conscious of how I perceive you? Even if we exclude the individual preferences regarding facial beauty and the like, I want you to reflect on your actions up to this point. You have repeatedly appeared dashingly at the moments when I was in trouble and helped me out. I want you to thoroughly consider how moved my heart had been by such actions.”)","At the time of the Six Kings Festival, at the White God Festival, and again this time, Kaito appeared before Fors at truly opportune moments. Just when her thoughts were leaning towards optimism, only to be snapped back to reality, making her seriously start pondering what to do now, Kaito always appears.","She jokingly referred to him as the “Messiah”, but in fact, he’s like a Hero who appears at the right moment to save the day.","(Although getting lost is already a common occurrence to me, I still feel anxious and flustered when I get lost. If there’s a charming individual who appears dashingly and repeatedly helps me in such situations, given my limited social and romantic matters, it would be more than obvious that I would be easily charmed. I strongly hope you will take these aspects into consideration...... Ahh, no, even if I’m just having these thoughts in my mind, I’m well aware that these thoughts are quite nonsensical. Expecting you to understand this is probably unreasonable, and rather, even understanding this would also open up a new bag of troubles for me. Hmmm...... A person’s mind sure is beyond one’s control.)","After pondering all that, Fors let out a small wry smile and once again glanced briefly at Kaito.","[Unnn? Is something the matter?]","[Ahh, no, I was just thinking about what might be served for lunch. Since we’re in Hydra Kingdom, it would probably be seafood, right? I can’t imagine them not serving a signature delicacy that represents their country......]","[Ahh, fish sounds great. Symphonia hardly uses fish in their cuisine......]","As Kaito turned away and continued engaging in trivial conversation, just for a little bit, Fors subtly tightened the grip of the hand she was holding.","(Yeah, it truly is beyond one’s control. Even though I still consider when to let go of his hand, there’s still this part of me that doesn’t want to release it just yet. What contradictory and illogical thoughts. Truly perplexing...... It’s just, hopefully...... I’ll be able to let go before my heart beats too loudly and he accidentally hears it.)","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Wait...... Wait, wait, wait! The flow of things doesn’t look good! Doesn’t things look really bad there!?]"]},{"number":1631,"title":"Chapter 1631: Lost High Elf 11","paragraphs":["<Author’s Notes>","I was working overtime and came home late, so today’s chapter is short.","Laguna-san led us to the dining room, and as I sat down at the table alongside Fors-san, I suddenly thought of something. Somehow, our hands were still intertwined without any particular moment to let go, but what should I do?","No, of course, now that we are seated is the perfect time to let go, but since Fors-san is holding my hand quite firmly, I feel a bit awkward about letting go.","Though I said that, since we were about to eat, we couldn’t just keep on holding hands, so I called out to her while Laguna-san went to check on the kitchen.","[......Errr, we’re in the dining room now, so let’s let go of each other’s hands.]","[Ahh...... Yes, you’re right. It’s not like we can eat while holding hands, so this would be the appropriate moment. Good gracious, I’ve been constantly relying on you, and I apologize for that.]","A- Arehh? Did I make a mistake in my choice......? It seemed like, for a moment, she had this regretful or lonely expression on her face, as if she didn’t want to let go. I can’t help but feel a strange sense of guilt, but seriously, if we kept holding hands, we might end up having our meal while still holding hands, so it can’t be helped.","Well, I can understand the feeling of loneliness when you let go of the hands you’ve been holding for a long while, and I think everyone would have such a feeling.","While I was thinking about this, Laguna-san, who had gone to the kitchen, came back.","[It seems like they’ve already prepared, but should I have them bring it over?]","[Ah, yes. Thank you.]","After hearing my response, Laguna-san instructed the maids to bring the food, before sitting next to me...... at the seat opposite from Fors-san.","[......Laguna-san, may I ask you one question?]","[Unnn? What is it?]","[With how big this table is in such a large dining room...... Why are you sitting so close to me?]","[There’s no rule that says we would have to make use of all the space in the large tables, right? Besides, when you’re sitting next to each other flirting over there, isn’t it cruel to just exclude me?]","[......Laguna? If you want me to bury you back under the ground again, just say so. The fact that he and I are sitting next to each other is simply because we had been holding hands earlier. In the first place, the reason we were holding hands was because you gave him those strange instructions via hummingbird.]","[......Pretty sure I gave accurate instructions though......]","In fact, I think Laguna-san’s instructions were spot on too. If we had not held hands or taken some other action, Fors-san would almost certainly have ended up getting lost, so holding hands at that time was the right choice.","Laguna-san looked somewhat astounded as she replied, but then, a grin appeared on her lips. Lightly nudging my side with her elbow, she spoke.","[Hey, Kaito, you got two flowers in both hands, you know?]","[Ahh~~ Self-Proclaimed Flower-kun, let’s not bother him with strange entanglements, yes? Also, although he’s relatively accustomed to situations like this...... When you consider his impressive lineup of lovers, I’m impressed you can confidently call yourself a flower. Well, with girls of my level whose qualities aren’t even better than yours, wouldn’t I just be a common girl a playboy like him is used to seeing?]","[Eh? No, I think Fors-san is a very cute and attractive woman though?]","[........................Is...... that so? That is very......]","I spoke out my thoughts, but Fors-san turned away, perhaps feeling embarrassed, and she didn’t turn her face toward me again for a while.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......This isn’t good...... The atmosphere here doesn’t feel so good.]"]},{"number":1632,"title":"Chapter 1632: Lost High Elf 12","paragraphs":["The dishes that arrived a short time later were fragrant dishes with plenty of spices, giving off an atmosphere similar to that of ethnic cuisine like tandoori chicken.","Given that the royal palace has a tropical vibe, it seems to match the ambiance quite well.","[They look delicious. Is Hydra Kingdom famous for their spices?]","[Unnn? Kaito didn’t know huh....... Ahh, come to think of it, you’ve only been to our Royal Capital before. Due to its nature being a port city, the Royal Capital has a lot of stalls with fresh seafood dishes. However, when one speaks of Hydra Kingdom, it’s all about spice cuisine.]","[Hydra Kingdom produces over 70% of the spices that circulate in the Human Realm. As a result, their cuisine has a tendency to heavily feature spices in various dishes. While they may be known as “Hydra of Clothing”, “Symphonia of Food” and “Archlesia of Shelter”, that doesn’t mean they had neglected anything other than what they were known for. For example, Archlesia Empire, being in a colder region, is famous for their soups and stews. Each country has their own unique features, so if you find the subject interesting, examining this matter is actually quite fascinating.]","[I see......]","Indeed, just as Fors-san pointed out, it’s only natural that various food cultures would be developed in each country. Just like on Earth, where countries like Japan and the US have distinct food cultures due to their difference, it would be no wonder for the three countries in the Human Realm to have their unique cultures.","It seems that in Trinia, with its three different realms———- Demon realm, Human Realm and God Realm————- distinctions are often described on a realm-wide scale, but even within Human Realm, which is vast enough to comprise three countries, it’s only natural for each country to have their own unique culture.","Learning about such differences does seem refreshing and somewhat enjoyable. Thanks to Teleportation Magic, it’s easy for me to come here, but Hydra Kingdom is actually quite far from Symphonia’s Royal Capital, and having realized that I had actually gone on a trip abroad, this trip is turning out to be a bit more enjoyable.","[How should I say this...... Experiencing such cultural differences can be surprising, but it’s also enjoyable. I do feel like I’ve learned a lot, but I haven’t really been to places other than the countries’ Royal Capitals, including Symphonia’s.]","[Well, being the Royal Capital, they do gather a variety of things. There’s no inconvenience in living there, but it might be challenging to visit the rural areas if you don’t make a conscious effort to do so. However, your perspective is truly admirable. So is the case with our Rigforeshia, even within the same country, various unique cultures do exist. Having an interest in such a thing is wonderful. Intellectual curiosity is something to cherish.]","[I’d say you should hold back on your curiosity though...... but well, just as Fors said, Kaito does have a very good eye for things. Exploring tourist destinations in the Human realm should be quite interesting. As for Hydra Kingdom, I can introduce you to many things, so don’t hesitate to ask if you want to know more. If you want, should I arrange lodgings for you? As for what I recommend——— Mnghh!?]","[......Enough with your promotions of your country, oh Great Majesty. Discovering such things is part of the fun of traveling, and if someone who is knowledgeable explains everything from start to finish, it can diminish a person’s intrigue. It’s best to answer only when one asks questions.]","Despite her usual words, I’m not sure if it was because of that so-called King’s duty or she was just taking the opportunity to say this, but Laguna-san seemed eager to promote her country, but with a gentle smile on her lips, Fors-san calmly silenced by plugging a piece of bread in Laguna-san’s mouth.","Hmmm. Fors-san may have her quirks, like how she got a machine gun for a mouth, lacks in sense of direction and has this mad scientist-like side, she actually possesses a good deal of common sense...... I mean, I think she exudes a mature, composed aura.","[Incidentally, do you have any recommendations for places to go, Fors-san?]","[Oi, oi, you’re seriously asking me that here? You know how staunch of a recluse I am, so asking me that is just being mean. However, regarding that question...... Excluding Rigforeshia, since you should have visited it multiple times, do you know that there’s a trading city located between Symphonia’s Royal Capital and Rigforeshia?]","[Ahh, I’ve heard of it before...... Never went there though.]","[I see. It’s generally off the path of Flying Dragon Flights, so if you rely on Teleportation or Flying Dragons for transportation, you might not have the opportunity to visit it. Being a trading city, it’s bustling with the circulation of various goods, and you can find many items there that you wouldn’t typically see in the Royal Capital. Being able to come in contact with goods from various regions, if you’re interested, it might be a good place to visit.]","[I see, I’ll take that into consideration.]","As I had such a thought in mind, there really are a lot of places I’ve never been to. If I have the opportunity...... It should be fun to explore more places I haven’t been to before.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [I have a feeling that a certain Duchess is gonna hold on to her stomach when she learns how Kaito’s range of activities is gonna expand......]"]},{"number":1633,"title":"Chapter 1633: Omens Before the Festival","paragraphs":["Regarding Hydra Kingdom’s Founding Festival, the day of the event drew closer without anything particularly significant happening.","Fors-san had also been delivered, and Laguna-san made sure she would stay at the castle...... or rather, she would let her stay until the day of the event, so there’s no need to worry about Fors-san anymore.","It seemed like she had called several Court Mages to have a magic formation applied to Fors-san’s room, preventing her from coming out on her own...... but well, that certainly sounds like the right idea.","[Well, even so, despite all the hustle and bustle surrounding Symphonia Kingdom and Archlesia Empire’s Founding Festivals, it doesn’t seem like Hydra Kingdom’s Founding Festival will be like that, so I’m relieved.]","[......Hmmm. I wonder why? This is just a hunch of mine, but with Kaito-kun looking at it that optimistically, I kinda have a feeling that something might happen......]","[Can you not say something worrying like that......]","After I muttered those words, Kuro, who was eating baby castellas, delivered rather ominous words. Well, I can’t say I don’t understand what she’s feeling...... I mean, I actually have this feeling that things might be going a bit too smoothly, which is why I ended up saying those lines earlier.","[......Speaking of which, Kuro, how would the Six Kings’ attendance be like at Hydra Kingdom’s Founding Festival?]","[Ahh, Megiddo, who likes Hydra, and Lillywood, who was present in both Symphonia’s and Archlesia’s, will attend.]","[Fumu. In the end, Lillywood-san will have a perfect attendance huh.]","[Kaito-kun is also attending all three yourself.]","[Come to think of it, that’s right.]","With Megiddo-san and Lillywood-san in attendance, along with the First Hero’s Party Member Fors-san, and along with that, an exhibition of a message from Neun-san...... or rather, from the First Hero, in terms of relevance and interest, it doesn’t lag behind the other two countries at all.","It gives the impression that Symphonia Kingdom has deep connections with the Six Kings, Archlesia Empire with the Gods, and Hydra Kingdom with the First Hero.","Even so, well, the more I hear about it, the more it seems like nothing is going to happen, and it feels stable. Well, not having anything happen is probably the best scenario...... but well, the fact that there are no omens of anything happening at all up to this point in itself also makes me anxious.","[Well, even if something does happen, I don’t think it’s likely to escalate to a level surpassing those that occurred in Symphonia or Archlesia anytime soon.]","[I guess you’re right. As is the case with me and the other Six Kings, it’s not likely that more attendees would join at this point.]","[Indeed, the attendees are already decided, and as long as Shiro-san doesn’t unexpectedly show up, everything should be fine. Besides, she has already done that once back in the Archlesia Empire......]","[The Supreme Gods are also unlikely to attend without Shiro-san’s instructions, so it really seems like nothing unexpected is going to happen...... Ahh~~ But what about Earth God?]","[Eden-san? Hmmm, no, I was actually worried about this myself and confirmed this with her, but it seems like this time, it seems like she doesn’t have any intention of attending at all.]","Actually, I was concerned about Eden-san’s arrival, so I personally asked her. She calmly replied that she doesn’t feel like participating this time nor does she intend to suddenly intrude either, and it doesn’t seem like she’s lying.","However, back when I was talking to her, she seemed to be taking glances at something behind my back, something I didn’t see when I turned around, and that was something I’m not quite sure about.","In any case, with the situation like that, it doesn’t seem like something is about to happen...... Right?","While Kaito and Kuro were talking about this, Shallow Vernal was quietly pondering about something in the Sanctuary, God Realm.","(......Back in Symphonia Kingdom, I had received baby castellas from Kaito-san in advance, and back at Archlesia Empire’s Founding Festival, I had an agreement with Earth God not to visit the festival myself. However, we didn’t make any sort of promise for Hydra Kingdom...... I suppose it would not be a problem if I went there, right?)","Due to her position, Shallow Vernal hasn’t been able to visit Kaito’s shop in a proper manner during both the Founding Festivals of Symphonia Kingdom and Archlesia Empire.","......And this is something she was somewhat dissatisfied with. However, for Hydra Kingdom’s Founding Festival this year, Kaito had promised to go around with Alice, and she didn’t want to interfere with that.","But even if that were the case, she was thinking about taking some action and was in the process of looking for a good way to do so.","(......I will not interfere with Kaito-san’s date with Alice. However, for me to enjoy something festival-like with Kaito-san...... Fumu......)","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Whoa there, seems like a stomach ache flag has been raised......]"]},{"number":1634,"title":"Chapter 1634: Unexpected Invitation 1","paragraphs":["Sanctuary, God Realm. The World’s God, Shallow Vernal, and a God of another world, Eden, were facing each other. Hearing the words spoken by Shallow Vernal, her expression unchanging and her voice without inflection, Eden revealed her clear astonishment.","[......I- I see...... That’s a wonderful idea. In that case, I too can enjoy a moment with my beloved child......]","[No, I declare you this as the God of this world. I do not allow you to participate in this SUPER WIN system I have devised.]","[Wha!? Why!!!?]","[Because it was a system that held no limit. The use of this system is only allowed to those considered as Kaito-san’s lover. Being his mother doesn’t make you eligible.]","[Wha...... That’s ridiculous! There’s no way such absurdity should be allowed...... Guh, in the first place, if you’re gonna be like that, why did you even talk to me about this......]","The method conceived by Shallow Vernal to enjoy Hydra Kingdom’s Founding Festival with Kaito was groundbreaking for Eden, and if she wished, Eden could also utilize it.","However, in order to do so, she would require permission from Shallow Vernal, the God of this World, and if she was firmly refused, it would be difficult for her to implement it.","When asked by Eden why she had bothered bringing up this matter to her, Shallow Vernal replied calmly.","[Of course, it was to prevent you from copying. While it would be a breach of our contract to do so without permission, it would be troublesome if you kept persistently demanding this...... From the start, not only during Kaito-san’s housewarming party but even back then, you have always kept on copying the systems I painstakingly designed, do you not possess any sense of pride?]","[Gfuuu...... Kuh, i- if you say it like that...... Ghh......]","At Shallow Vernal’s words, Eden looks as if she has been hit where it hurts. She is a God from another world, and although she is powerful...... in Trinia, she can’t exercise large-scale power such as World Alteration out of consideration for Shallow Vernal.","This means that, to a certain extent, it makes sense for her to follow Shallow Vernal’s policies and implement them while assessing the degree to which her action is considered appropriate, given the circumstances and her position...... However, once it’s labeled as “copying”, she would have no room for argument.","[......I understand. I’ll give up this time. However, hypothetically, if I were to hold a deeper relationship with my beloved child in the future, I understand that you wouldn’t mind me carrying out that idea?]","[Indeed. If you and Kaito-san have become lovers, then I give you my permission.]","[I see...... I hadn’t really thought of such a thing until now, but I suppose it’s something worth considering huh......]","Eden’s stance has always been that she is Kaito’s mother, but if having the position of a lover is necessary for her to truly cherish Kaito, she had indeed considered pursuing it as an option.","However, she always prioritized Kaito’s will above all else, so even as she began entertaining misdirected thoughts like “Can he really see me, his mother, as a romantic partner?”, Eden quietly disappeared.","After seeing her off, Shallow Vernal muttered to herself.","[Now that the troublesome one has been restrained, there seems to be no problem with the implementation of the SUPER WIN plan. All that’s left for me to do is work out the details and leave the coordination of details to God of Time and Space.]","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Now then, how should I look at this...... Should I look at how that Airhead God thought of something dangerous, or should I look at how that mentally crazy, dangerous God got a strange goal...... Ah, there’s also Chronois who casually gets a stomach ache sent her way huh.]"]},{"number":1635,"title":"Chapter 1635: Unexpected Invitation 2","paragraphs":["Before I knew it, I found myself in a familiar flower garden. I mean, I’m most definitely in the Sanctuary...... Though it’s a truly abrupt summon, after experiencing this several times, I’ve already grown used to it, so rather than feeling surprised, my first thought was “Ah, it’s Shiro-san again huh”.","It’s just, while I’ve grown accustomed to the change of scenery, if I were to be asked if I’m currently calm...... then I can’t really say that is the case. Instead, my mental state is so tense that I wouldn’t be surprised if I’m overflowing with cold sweat.","After all, at the times when I was summoned on short notice like this...... I often find myself facing quite unreasonable or downright absurd requests.","[......Well, in any case, hello, Shiro-san.]","[Welcome, Kaito-san. I’m glad you came.]","[Putting aside whether I came or made to come...... So, what’s the matter this time?]","I thought it was quite unnecessary to forcibly summon me, but considering it’s Shiro-san we’re talking about here, I can understand the situation just fine.","What I’m curious about though is Shiro-san’s circumstances...... This may just be self-proclaimed, but I pride myself on being more attuned to the subtleties of Shiro-san’s emotions than anyone else in this world. Through my assessment, Shiro-san’s mood isn’t bad, and in fact, you could say she’s in quite a good mood.","At least, it seems that she hadn’t called me here because she was dissatisfied or sulking about something.","[Knowing about me better than anyone else in the world, so much so that you know about my everything...... Fufu, as to be expected of my lover. Such a bold thought you have there.]","[No, I hadn’t said...... thought that far but...... Well, if you’re happy with that, then so be it.]","I don’t really know why, but Shiro-san is in a good mood. However, that just amps the danger levels to yellow. While there are times when she’s simply in a good mood, there’s also a fair chance that she’d bring up some strange suggestions.","[Now then, about the subject of the matter...... Kaito-san, let’s go around Hydra Kingdom’s Founding Festival together.]","[......Eh? N- No, umm...... I’m planning to go around with Alice though?]","In response to the words she confidently said, while feeling slightly bewildered, I answered. Putting aside the potential commotion that would occur with Shiro-san coming to the Founding Festival, the most crucial point is that I’ve already promised to go there with Alice.","Shiro-san is at least considerate of such matters. She wouldn’t try to force me to change a schedule that had already been set.","In that case, if I were to interpret her invitation, she probably isn’t talking about the three of us, Alice, Shiro-san and I, going around together. In fact, I think Alice would likely strongly dislike the situation turning out that way. Even if she doesn’t look that way, she’s someone with a decent way of thinking, who properly looks at social etiquette, which could likely end up her having to support Shiro-san......","And as for whether Shiro-san would desire that outcome, the answer is probably no. If this were a promise for Kuro and me to go around with just the two of us, this may turn out into that “Just Kuro is unfair” scenario again, but with me going around with Alice, that scenario happening is highly unlikely.","That’s exactly why I was bewildered though, but while I was feeling that way, Shiro-san stated as if it were the most obvious thing in the world.","[Yes, I have no intention of interfering with your date with Alice. I’m fine with going with you on “the second day of the Founding Festival”.]","[......What...... are you talking about?]","Whoa there, she started saying something strange again. I mean, depending on how you interpret those words, that statement could potentially devastate the stomachs of multiple people, you know? Second day of the Founding Festival? No, no...... If Shiro-san were to force her will through, that second day may actually take place, but that would just be unreasonable.","However, as if to say that she has already anticipated my reaction, Shiro-san smiles.","[There’s no problem. It’s not like they will be having a two-day Founding Festival.]","[......T- Then, what do you mean by that?]","[Kaito-san is aware of the concept of parallel worlds, right? I am making use of such a concept...... In other words, standing before this moment opens up two separate timelines for Kaito-san for the same Founding Festival: one where “Kaito-san goes with Alice” and another where “Kaito-san goes with me”. By continuously sharing only your consciousness between the two timelines, Kaito-san can effectively experience the Founding Festival in two different ways, even though it’s just one day in reality.]","[........................]","This God has thought up something outrageous. She’s seriously making full use of her omnipotent power. In other words, even though it will only be for one day for the public, after experiencing the Founding Festival with Alice, I’ll go through the Founding Festival again in the scenario where I go around with Shiro-san.","Most likely, the timeline that would really apply in reality was my initial experience of going around with Alice, but Shiro-san and I will retain memories of our experience going around together in the Founding Festival...... I think.","[With this SUPER WIN system, it becomes possible to multiply one-day events like Christmas in Kaito-san’s world by the number of Kaito-san’s lovers, making it a groundbreaking system.]","[......I...... I see......]","The scale of what an almost omnipotent God can do really is beyond imagination, and my tsukkomis couldn’t catch up at all. Also, this SUPER WIN system she mentioned...... It feels like something my other lovers, starting with Kuro, would likely agree, and for me, there’s also the benefit of not having to worry about whom to spend seasonal events with.","The disadvantage is that I would have to repeat the same event with the same number of lovers I have, so I don’t really want this system to be used very often if possible......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [She seriously created a nightmare-like system!?]","? ? ? : [Hahh!? Don’t tell me...... The past Christmas and Valentine’s Day Special Chapters for each character were a foreshadowing of this system!?]","Serious-senpai : [Nah...... I don’t really think...... the Author had thought that far ahead......]"]},{"number":1636,"title":"Chapter 1636: Hydra Kingdom Founding Festival 1","paragraphs":["While I’m having mixed feelings in my mind, the day of Hydra Kingdom’s Founding Festival arrived. I thought things would be peaceful, only to find out that everyone’s gonna have a peaceful festival other than me.","I had promised Alice that I would go around with her beforehand, so using Alice’s Teleportation Magic, we went to Hydra Kingdom’s Royal Capital.","[......Ohh, it’s so crowded. The atmosphere of the festival here is more bustling than that of Symphonia’s or Archlesia’s.]","[Hydra is very lively with its citizens, with many of them being cultural adventurers, taking the initiative to open shops or try new things on occasions like this. And so, there are quite a few small individual vendors, making the festival diverse in terms of variety.]","[Heehhh...... Speaking of which, there are various subsidies and support systems in place, making this an environment where individuals can easily start their own business, right?]","[Yes, something like that. Though I say that, it’s worth noting that some areas are divided based on location. This area is a free zone, but there are sections with high stall fees where corporations or groups with significant financial resources tend to set up their stalls, rather than individuals. Well, as it’s still business, high foot traffic areas are popular to such corporations or groups, which can make it challenging for one to secure such a sport for setting up a stall.]","[I see......]","I can feel the vibrancy of the country as a whole, and the atmosphere in the area we are in is somewhat enjoyable...... but more than that, it’s reassuring to have Alice with me here.","In any case, Alice is like a walking dictionary, so even if there’s something I don’t know, it’s great that she’s here to inform me about it. I’ve never been to Hydra Kingdom that much, and I don’t know the area very well, but having her with me means I can be relieved on this matter.","[Well, it’s a relief when Alice is around. I can enjoy myself more comfortably. There are various food stalls here, so I think I’ll fill my stomach a little bit.]","[Sounds like a great idea. I agree...... Eh? An all-you-can-eat on Kaito-san’s tab? As expected of Kaito-san! You’re quite manly! Thanks for the treat!!!]","[I didn’t say anything like that———— Oi, don’t bring out my wallet as if it’s yours!!!]","[———-Ouch!?]","Even though I hadn’t said anything like that, Alice started talking about all-you-can-eat as she pleased, and seeing her holding my wallet before I knew it, I dropped my knuckle on Alice’s head.","No, well, while I was prepared to treat Alice to some extent when hanging out with her, I don’t know what would happen if I just let this idiot eat as much as she likes, so it’s important to strike a balance in that regard.","[......Well, I really would treat you to some extent, but you should really think about moderation.]","[Oh my, the technique of dropping me down only to gently lift me up...... Kyaaa~~ Kaito-san, you’re so dreamy~~]","[Errr, where’s my Piko Piko Hammer......]","[Even though I was praising you!?]","[Nah, that sounds more like you’re making fun of me......]","Even though her tone of voice and facial expression are mainly that of her goofball mode...... Her excitement seemed to be quite high and she’s in high spirits. Alice already seemed to be enjoying herself, and I feel happy about that.","Well, I won’t actually say that to her though. She might either get even more annoying and get carried away or turn into a blushing mess......","[Even so, there’s that, isn’t it? Kaito-san still got one more day, right? Good gracious, as expected of a World Creator, she sure came up with some strange ideas.]","[No, seriously...... I mean, I was too surprised...... but it’s not without advantages.]","[Well, that it does. For example, if you use that method...... Kaito-san may do it for several weeks, but the event happens only once for me, so I won’t have to scramble with your other lovers, which is advantageous for me. It would be rough for Kaito-san though.","[......You said it. Well, when it comes to events like the Founding Festival, there’s also the advantage of being able to see and explore various places that I hadn’t visited with Alice today.]","Shiro-san’s SUPER WIN system was born out of a God’s way of thinking. I lightly explained it to Alice this time, but I haven’t explained it to my other lovers yet.","No, this is also like a trial period for me, so I also feel that it’s good to experience what it’s like once. Otherwise, there’s a possibility that it won’t end with just experiencing this Founding Festival twice......","[Well, let’s just leave the future to the future us. For now, let’s just take it easy and have fun.]","[Guess you’re right. Nothing would happen even if I worry about it now, so let’s just have fun...... Give me back my wallet.]","[But Kaito-san, I can hear it! Your wallet, it whispers to me...... “I wanna treat Alice-cha———– Ouch!?]","Even as I dropped another knock on Alice’s head for joking around again, one way or another, I couldn’t help smiling. Hmmm, as expected, when I’m together with Alice, I really feel like I could enjoy the festival properly......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......It’s date time huh...... Alright. Since ??? isn’t around, this is the time......]","Makina : [——-Where it’s just the two of us, right!?]","Serious-senpai : [? ? ? , come back quickly!!!]"]},{"number":1637,"title":"Chapter 1637: Hydra Kingdom Founding Festival 2","paragraphs":["After buying some food, I walked around the festival with Alice while eating. I purchased small fish skewers, and they tasted like sweetfish with just the right amount of saltiness, making them very delicious. The downside is that they’re large enough that one skewer fills me up quite a bit...... but well, Alice is eating them as if she’s gobbling yakitori from a bar......","[Come to think of it, Alice, there was someone around the Royal Capital’s entrance talking about some same-day tickets, but what was that about?]","[Ahh, those were tickets to see the Sea Dragon Parade at noon. It’s a popular event and tickets are usually sold out long before the event starts, but if stuff happened like cancellations or such, same-day tickets like those are sometimes sold at the entrance on the day of the event.]","[Sea Dragon Parade?]","[If I were to explain it in a very simple way, I guess it’s like a mikoshi or a lion dance. A large dragon model is carried through the streets by a large number of people. The Hydra Kingdom historically originated from several nations that came together to form a single country. On the day of Hydra Kingdom’s Founding Festival, there used to be a festival that originally extolled sea dragons, and due to this tradition, the Sea Dragon Parade became a part of the Founding Festival.]","[......Fumu. Why sea dragons?]","Come to think of it, I remember reading in a book that Hydra Kingdom was formed when several nations that had been badly affected by the invasion of the Demon Lord joined forces to create a coalition army.","After the Demon Lord was defeated by the First Hero, the damage they received was still quite significant, and continuing to exist as several small nations proved to be unsustainable, so after several discussions, they had decided that Laguna-san would become their King, and the various nations unified to form one country, becoming Hydra Kingdom.","......Incidentally, Laguna-san was initially just on the throne because she was well known as a member of the Hero Party, as due to the chaotic circumstances and the need for someone with influence and recognition, and the initial plan was that she would abdicate once the country was stabilized...... Laguna-san herself complained about this in frustration.","However, unfortunately for her, Laguna-san was just that excellent of a King, and with the support of the people, she continues to be the King to this day.","[This is also a story from the past, but near one of the coastal nations, there was this massive dragon that ruled the sea, and it was believed that if the dragon’s mood was disturbed, a storm would break out. So, they held festivals in honor of that dragon to pray for good fishing weather and to prevent accidents from happening at sea.]","[That massive dragon that ruled the sea...... Is that Eingana-san?]","[I do believe the basis of that story is most likely Eingana-san. In the past, there weren’t as many Teleportation Gates scattered around as there are now, but there were still methods to travel between Demon Realm and Human Realm. Also, this is extremely rare, but there are times when, due to distortions in time and space, Humans have wandered into the Demon Realm, or Demons have wandered into the Human Realm. At those times, I...... or rather, the Phantasmal King camp was protecting and sending the target individuals back. Perhaps, during those times, upon seeing Eingana-san, they thought that there was a Dragon God in the sea...... There’s no Dragon of her size in the Human Realm after all.]","[Ahh, I see, Eingana’s size certainly was quite impactful......]","She’s an enormous Sea Dragon, 1 km in length, so if she appears out of the sea, it would be quite the sight to behold. It wouldn’t be surprising if one were to think that a God exists in the sea if one sees a being such as her.","As I nodded in understanding, Alice spoke with a wry smile.","[That Sea Dragon has become so famous here in Hydra Kingdom, yet the real Sea God...... God of Ocean isn’t so well-known. Well, she has always been someone who doesn’t stand out......]","[God of Ocean? Now that you mentioned it, I’ve met the God of Sky, Sky-san, and God of Earth, Gaia-san, but I haven’t met the God governing the seas.]","This is just my own impression, but I have this impression that the land, sea and sky were like a set of three, so now that she mentioned it, I couldn’t help wondering about it now.","No, well, putting aside Sky-san who was arranged to guide me, I just happened to meet Gaia-san back then, so it’s not really that strange that I haven’t met that God of Ocean but......","[Supreme Gods have two High-ranking Gods as their close confidants, and the God of Life, Life-san’s close confidants were Sky-san and Gaia-san. On the other hand, God of Ocean...... Marine-san is the third in the order of Life-san’s direct subordinates...... She comes right after Sky-san and Gaia-san in the hierarchy, but because she’s not considered a direct confidant, along with the fact that she doesn’t have any particular distinctive traits, she doesn’t stand out much. Well, the person herself is a reliable and sensible fellow though.]","Listening to Alice’s story, Camellia-san suddenly came to mind. Well, Camellia-san is World King’s Strongest Subordinate and a Super Maid, so she does have quite the distinctive traits...... but it seems that they share the common trait of not standing out much.","God of Ocean, Marine-san huh...... She sounds like an interesting person, so I’d like to get to know them someday.","<Afterword>","Makina : [God of Ocean Marine seemed like the excellent but inconspicuous type. Well, omniscient that I am, I can understand everything I want to know about her, but since she’s not my child, I have no interest in her.]","Serious-senpai : [Although she lacks individuality, she seems to be the competent type who gets her work done reliably...... She’s kinda like me.]","Makina : [......I feel like Serious-senpai has nothing but individuality...... There’s no way you can’t see yourself, right? Are you alright? Want to talk about my beloved child?]"]},{"number":1638,"title":"Chapter 1638: Hydra Kingdom Founding Festival 3","paragraphs":["Alice and I went around the Founding Festival while exchanging trivial conversations. Having had a quick bite to eat in the first area, the next thing I wanted to do was to see some sort of event.","There’s basically no shortage of events at the Founding Festival, a time when the entire Royal Capital is bustling with activity. There are events all over the place, and they seem to be a lot of fun.","[Is it not possible to watch that Sea Dragon Parade without a ticket? I’m a little curious about it......]","[We got tickets for it, you know? Here.]","[......You sure brought it out like it’s a given huh.]","[The capable Transcendental Beauty Alice-chan prepared it in advance just in case.]","Rather than just being well-prepared, it’s almost like she anticipates everything perfectly. Knowing Alice, she probably calculated that I would become interested in the Sea Dragon Parade as well.","Well, I’m grateful for the ticket, but we still have some time left since the parade starts in the afternoon.","[Until it starts, let’s look around at some of the small events that are going on around here and there......]","[I guess so. There’s a lot of stuff around, you know? Eating competition, auctions...... it’s quite diverse, isn’t it?]","[Well, I guess this jumbled-up feeling is probably just like Hydra Kingdom.]","While discussing such things, I moved my gaze, thinking about what to check out next. I’m interested in that auction she mentioned, but I don’t really have anything particular in mind that I want, so I suppose watching something like a competition could be fun too.","As I was thinking like that, I suddenly thought of something, so I called out to Alice.","[Come to think of it, Alice, just to confirm, but this is a date, right?]","[......I- I suppose...... W- Well, since Kaito-san and I are lovers, and we definitely arranged this outing for the two of us, it wouldn’t be entirely wrong to call it a d- date.]","[You sure are getting shaken at the mere mention of a date.]","[S- Shaken? Totally not? It ain’t no big deal to make me shaken......]","This is just a guess, but she’s probably consciously avoiding thinking about it, relegating that thought to the depths of her mind. It’s probably evident in how her eyes wander and her voice trembles.","Even though she’s all calm when she says it herself, she gets all shaken when I point it out...... How should I say this...... Alice sure is as consistently cute as always.","[Well, setting aside how you’re shaken and all that, since we’re on a date, how about we hold hands while walking......]","[Doing that in broad daylight, isn’t that too perverted?]","[......No, we’ve held hands on many dates before, haven’t we? Say, aren’t you overreacting more than usual today?]","[T- T- T- T- That totally isn’t the case, okay!? No, really, seriously! Hold hands? Yeah, I’m completely fine with that. Come on! Let’s hold hands!!!]","[O- Ou......]","Hmmm. As expected, I really feel like something’s strange. Alice has always been a shy person, often getting flustered or blushing when doing romantic lover-like things.","But this time, she’s acting really strange. Like, it’s as if she was being overly conscious of it. It doesn’t feel like she’s up to something but...... hmmm, I got too little information to tell.","Tilting my head in wonder, as I held Alice’s hand and we started walking again, I called out to her.","[......Alice, as expected, you’re being strangely nervous today. Aren’t you acting too different compared to before?]","[It’s nothing. Seriously, it’s nothing. If I say it’s nothing, then nothing it is...... Come on! Let’s put that aside and enjoy ourselves!!!]","[It really feels like something’s going on though......]","Even though I was astounded by Alice forcefully pulling my hand along, I just concluded that there was no need to press further. For the time being, I have this feeling that I will figure it out in time...... so for now, let’s just enjoy the festival and wait.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Fumu, I have a bad feeling about this, but I wonder what she’s thinking......]"]},{"number":1639,"title":"Chapter 1639: Hydra Kingdom Founding Festival 4","paragraphs":["Alice seemed to be in a slightly strange mood, but after a little while, she returned back to normal. No, she seemed to have forced herself back to normal.","It feels like she’s intentionally avoiding thinking about a certain something, but even when I ask her about it, she just responds with “That’s not relevant right now, so don’t worry about it!!!” in such a serious manner that I could only let the details remain unclear.","It’s just, when she says it’s not relevant right now....... Does that mean it would be relevant later? If so, will she tell me what’s going on at that time?","As I was walking along thinking about this, I suddenly heard a familiar voice.","[......No, that’s just strange, isn’t it!? That event you just participated in was mostly based on luck, so there should be no way you can keep winning like that, right!? You cheated, didn’t you?]","[I didn’t.]","[......You did, didn’t you?]","[Haahhh...... You sure are clueless, aren’t you? Cheating that isn’t detected isn’t cheating.]","[Then that means you did cheat!]","[It’s the fault of that guy for holding an event with prize money in front of me, where I could win so easily. In other words, I’m not the one at fault here.]","When I turned around at the sound of the voices I heard, there was Hapti-san...... and from the sound of her voice, someone who seemed to be Neun-san. No, rather than “seemed to be”, she definitely must be Neun-san......","[Oya? That one over there is Kaito and...... Geh, Alice-sama......]","[You sure have become remarkable enough to say “Geh” first thing you see your boss huh.]","[Well~~ Ahaha......]","Hapti-san noticed us, and when she saw Alice, the expression on her face clearly warped to a frown, which prompted a tsukkomi out of Alice. The two of them are actually the same person, but it seems like their established setting was that they were a boss and her subordinate.","Well, Alice also told me that Hapti-san is a clone of hers that she had used more resources into and does not need to be operated by her main body, but is a self-reliant clone that thinks and acts independently.","Although they share information in real-time, it’s easy to forget that they’re the same person when you see them talking naturally like this.","[Hello, Neun-san. What a coincidence, meeting you here.]","[I see you’re here too, Kaito-san. It may be a coincidence, but I’m glad to see you here.]","[......Yes, it’s just, ummm...... Errr, Neun-san? I’m sorry to be so blunt, but what’s with your outfit?]","Neun-san was currently out of her full-body armor, wearing plain clothes, but the problem was her face...... She was wearing this helmet-looking headpiece that hid the upper half of her face.","Frankly speaking, she really looks like a bundle of suspiciousness.","[Ahh, Hapti told me that wearing full-body wouldn’t suit the festive atmosphere, but as I was wondering how I should disguise myself as I’m not good with Recognition Inhibition Magic, Hapti told me that being in this outfit would be more suitable for the festival......]","[......I- Is that so...... Errr, Hapti-san?]","[To be honest, I recommended it more as a joke and was waiting for her tsukkomi, but she just executed with such enthusiasm that I didn’t know how to respond. I mean, she looks really suspicious, doesn’t she? She definitely looks like a pervert, right?]","[........................Huh?]","When I asked Hapti-san about it, she responded that she was taken seriously when she said it as a joke, but right after that, Neun-san’s voice resounded, spoken in a low, icy voice unimaginable from how gentle her voice usually is, sending shivers down my spine.","[......Hapti? What did you just say? Joke? ......When I showed up in this outfit, you said it looked good on me and that it was perfect, didn’t you?]","[H- Hmmm...... I think I said that, but I’m afraid of what I’ll go through if I say that here......]","[Hapti, please be honest while I can keep a smile on my face. Is this outfit of mine working as a disguise?]","[Nah, you look so damn weird that you draw all the attention. I mean, if you want to cover your eyes and hair, why don’t you just wear a hat and sunglasses?]","[I see...... Die!]","In response to Hapti-san’s nonchalant and unrepentant thumbs up, Neun-san, with an aura that was nothing like her usual gentle self, drew her sword resembling a ruthless demon.","W- Well, they’re just two good friends playing around, so it should be fine...... Unnn. Well, I mean, Hapti-san is Alice’s clone anyway, so worst-case scenario, even if she gets cut down, it doesn’t really matter......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [If we assume that Alice and Hapti are the same person, with Alice not wanting to bring up that subject from the previous chapter any further, Alice must have called Hapti in to distract Kaito......]"]},{"number":1640,"title":"Chapter 1640: Hydra Kingdom Founding Festival 5","paragraphs":["After Neun-san and Hapti-san stopped playing around...... I mean, after Neun-san finished scolding Hapti-san, Alice created a subspace, and just like how she did with Olivia-san before, she coordinated Neun-san’s disguise within it.","The result was that Neun-san’s image had completely changed from her usual self, wearing denim pants and a jacket, adopting a casual style. As for her face, she disguised it with a hat and sunglasses.","[......That’s quite a significant image change, isn’t it? Even people who are well acquainted with Neun-san might not immediately recognize her in that outfit. Even so, that casual attire suits you quite well.]","[T- Thank you very much. These are clothing I’m not very accustomed to wearing...... but it’s comfortable and easy to move in, isn’t it? Indeed, for my image to change just with clothing, a hat, and glasses...... Knowledge about Recognition Inhibition Magic may have made me overthink what “being in disguise” means. Sha..... Alice-sama, thank you very much.]","[No, no, something like that is no trouble at all.]","Perhaps having realized that even a simple disguise would allow her to go unnoticed, Neun-san happily thanked Alice, to which she responded with a gentle smile.","To an onlooker, this would have been a heartwarming scene where Alice provided helpful advice to Neun-san..... but considering that the bizarre disguise until just now was the result of Hapti-san’s suggestions, and Alice just provided follow-up and retouched her disguise...... As someone who knows their true identity, I couldn’t help having an indescribable expression on my face, seeing this situation as just profiting from solving a problem Alice herself created.","N- No, well, Hapti-san is a clone that acts independently, and that happening to Neun-san might just be the usual action for Hapti-san but...... Hmmm, this feels complicated.","Perhaps, regardless of the reality, in the interest of my peace of mind, it’s best for me to just think of Alice and Hapti-san as separate individuals.","[Unnn, unnn. You look good in it, Neun. That’s pretty much the get-up I advised, right?","[......Hapti, aren’t you going to reflect at all?]","[I will. I’m very much reflecting. With how much eye damage you inflicted on me, I’m really regretting what I did...... but well, I already consider that water under the bridge, so there’s no point dwelling on it too deeply.]","[Well, you sure don’t sound like you’re reflecting at all!]","While Hapti-san heartily laughed, Neun-san sharply threw her tsukkomi...... but while she might look angry, it somehow still looked like Neun-san was enjoying herself.","It seems that Neun-san truly considers Hapti-san someone she can open up her heart to. An especially close friend to whom Neun-san can express her anger in such a genuine way.","[Speaking of which, we got a bit off track, but are you two here sightseeing for the festival?]","[Right, right. Neun here was skillfully talked into coming by Laguna and she got tired, so we’re looking around for a change of pace.]","[Ahh, for “that thing”, right? So that really wasn’t something you had prepared in advance, but a last-minute item huh.]","[Yes, well, it’s not really that big of a deal. It’s not that I’m expressly hiding the fact that I’m living in this world, I just don’t like drawing attention to myself and being in the spotlight......]","Come to think of it, when she and Lilia-san met face to face, she also mentioned that she didn’t mind her true identity being revealed, and from Neun-san’s perspective, as long as she doesn’t stand out, she doesn’t seem to have a problem with others knowing that she’s alive.","The name value of the First Hero is indeed powerful, and if Neun-san were to take the center stage, there’s a high possibility that she would be perceived as being on par with Human Realm’s rulers and the Six Kings. Given Neun-san’s personality, she would definitely dislike that. In fact, she would probably hate it, which is why she usually wears full-body armor......","Moreover, from Neun-san’s perspective, she sees herself as someone who has “already fulfilled her role and exited the stage”, and I don’t think returning to the public’s eyes would sit well with her either.","[Well, since we’ve met here, how about going around together for a bit?]","[Ehh~~ Going around with my boss, what kinda punishment is this......]","[While you’re with us, everything will be Kaito-san’s treat, you know?]","[Even if it’s a chance encounter, it would be a shame to part ways so soon after meeting someone we’re familiar with, so we’d be delighted to join you!!!]","Oi, you b*stard! Not only are you starring in your own play, you’re even trying to double the spending speed of my wallet!? Hapti-san, being the tightwad she is, has her eyes gleamingly and readily agrees...... Looking at it this way, being the same person, the two of them really have some similarities huh......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [In reality, when Neun is with Hapti, she seems to be more excited than usual, and you can tell how close they are with each other. Now that they’re in touch, I feel like they’re doing things together quite often......]"]},{"number":1641,"title":"Chapter 1641: Hydra Kingdom Founding Festival 6","paragraphs":["At Alice’s suggestion of adding Neun-san and Hapti-san, our group of four decided to look around together. Well, strictly speaking, half of the members are just Alices......","[Which way are you planning to go, Kaito-san, Alice-sama?]","[We were just roaming around before watching the Sea Dragon Parade.]","[I see, that’s nice. The Sea Dragon Parade is somewhat reminiscent of a lion dance, and it’s fun to watch.","[Have you seen it before, Neun-san?]","While I can’t really picture Neun-san participating in such festivals, when I think about it again, Neun-san is also over a thousand years old, and considering that she’s best friends with Hydra Kingdom’s King Laguna-san,? it wouldn’t be surprising if she had come to watch it many times.","[I have seen it several times. This year too, Laguna gave me a ticket, so I thought I’d go see it with Hapti-san......]","[Having a friend who is a King certainly makes it easier to secure seats at these kinds of events, doesn’t it? Rather, I’m changing the subject a bit, but when I looked at the list of attendees for the ceremony, I saw the name “Fors” on it, so it seems like Fors is also attending huh.]","[Fors was? That is...... I wonder if she actually managed to arrive?]","[Ahh, I sent her here the other day.]","As I had expected, they are aware of Fors-san’s poor sense of direction, as they looked really worried about her. So, I briefly explained to them the incident from the other day.","When I told them the story about how I happened to find the lost Fors-san and safely delivered her to Laguna-san, Neun-san and Hapti-san both had wry smiles on their faces.","[How should I say this...... Fors is still as usual huh. She got lost at the Six Kings Festival too and was rescued by Kaito-san, wasn’t she?]","[Right. Arehh? Come to think of it, I just remembered this...... but at that time, when Neun-san saw Fors-san’s appearance, you were surprised back then, weren’t you?]","[Yes, her appearance had changed since the last time we met after all......]","[Ah, well, I don’t mean to be rude, but I’m just a little curious...... Have you not seen her in more than 15 years?]","[Uuuu...... T- That is, well......]","It was truly just a simple question that popped into my mind. Neun-san seemed to be close with the members of the Hero Party and I often see her with them. However, back at the Six Kings Festival, she seemed surprised by the changed appearance of Fors-san, whose appearance had apparently changed about 15 years ago. In that case, it’s likely that they hadn’t seen each other for at least 15 years.","Finding it a bit peculiar when I thought about it again, I asked Neun-san about it, to which she seemed a bit awkward, averting her gaze and hesitating to respond.","Thereupon, Alice explained with a wry smile.","[Ahh~~ Kaito-san. That’s something quite common among long-lived beings or individuals who have lived for a long time. How should I say this...... It’s like their sense of time has become numb. In the first 100 years or so, they would often keep in touch with acquaintances quite regularly...... Well, it’s similar to Kaito-san’s sense of time right now. As time goes on though, say around 300 to 500 years, they accumulate more acquaintances, and it becomes common to have not seen some of them for several years, which makes it so that even a few years can start to feel like it hasn’t been that long since they last met.]","[Yes, that’s the case. When you have acquaintances you haven’t seen for even longer periods of time, a few years of not meeting can start to feel like it’s not that significant. I used to think that the time intervals for long-lived beings like Fors and Laguna were far too imprecise and different from mine, but as I lived longer, my perception of time also changed...... When I’m not being consciously aware of it, those time intervals would turn out that way.]","[I- I see......]","For someone who had lived for up to about a century, even if one says they hadn’t met someone for a long time, they would typically be talking about just a few years or at most a few decades. However, when you live for a very long time, you start to have acquaintances you haven’t seen for several decades, or in some cases, even centuries, and that’s when their perception of time begins to shift...... Come to think of it, even though Sieg-san in her 30s is considered a long-lived species, her sense of time intervals is normal, similar to that of humans, but Rei-san and Fia-san have a more casual sense of time intervals and don’t consider several years to be a long time.","[This is something that you’ll also experience once you’ve truly lived for a long time. Your perception shifts without you realizing it, before suddenly noticing it one day...... I think when Kaito were to live for about 500 years, you yourself should start to feel it.]","[She’s right, Kaito-san. That really happens to people, so be really mindful of it. If you don’t consciously keep it in mind, there may be some among your acquaintances with whom you wouldn’t be in touch for more than a hundred years......]","[I- I’ll be careful.]","Neun-san also strongly agrees with Alice and Hapti-san’s words...... It certainly seems that a shift in the perception of time intervals is something more likely to be experienced when one has lived for a long time.","Being immortal myself, I guess I have to be careful not to have that happen to me later on......","<Afterword>","Makina : [Ahh, I get what they mean here. I also have World Creator acquaintances that I haven’t talked to in about 13 billion years, haven’t I? I just keep on forgetting about them.]","Serious-senpai : [Nah, yours feels more like on a completely different level.]"]},{"number":1642,"title":"Chapter 1642: Hydra Kingdom Founding Festival 7","paragraphs":["After looking through some of the stalls, it was finally time for the Sea Dragon Parade and we had to move on. What we have this time are tickets with assigned seating. There are other tickets that allow you to stand anywhere within the designated area, but even though they are less expensive, they are apparently much more crowded.","Meanwhile, the reserved seats seem to have chairs with a certain amount of space between each seat, and I imagine they’re like the seats Kuro called for us back at the Harmonic Symphony?","[Even so, it’s surprising that such a coincidence occurred. I never expected that our seats and Kaito-san’s seats would be right next to each other...... No, it’s a good thing that we can watch the show together.]","[Ahaha, you’re right. It’s quite a coincidence, isn’t it?]","I could feel my face slightly cramping as I responded to Neun-san’s words. If I were to be honest though, rather than just considering this a coincidence, it seems more natural to think that Alice had some hand in this.","With Alice’s capabilities, adjusting the seats as she pleases would likely be an easy task, and considering that Hapti-san was the one holding the tickets on their side, I’m almost certain that that was the case.","Well, not like there’s any problem with it. Just as Neun-san said, I could only see this as an advantage with us watching the show together.","We showed our tickets to the attendant, who showed us to our seats. As to be expected from reserved seats, the view of the main street from our location is excellent.","This place is located at the curve of the street and is said to be a popular spot for watching the Sea Dragon Parade.","[Speaking of which, what are you two going to do after the Sea Dragon Parade, Neun-san? Me and Alice plan to go to the plaza to watch the ceremony......]","[We intend to go to the plaza as well. I do feel embarrassed by that, but I presented that message this year, I’m curious to see how it will be publicized. Well, I had only written something bland though......]","[Well, in that case, how about hanging out together until the ceremony ends? Going to watch the ceremony in the usual way seems like it could be quite crowded, so Alice-sama, please somehow do something about it!]","[Haahhh...... No, well, that’s fine and all......]","After watching the Sea Dragon Parade, if we move to the plaza where the ceremony is held, it will be just in time for the ceremony. And since I’m interested in that message Neun-san presented, we had talked about checking that out.","And since Neun-san and Hapti-san were also planning to do the same, we discussed the idea of hanging out together until the ceremony and then going our separate ways.","Alice gives Hapti-san a somewhat exasperated look when asked to secure for them a path to the ceremony...... but seriously, their conversation was at a level where there’s no sense of incongruity between them, to the point where I might forget that they’re the same person even if I’m aware of it.","As I had such thoughts in mind, I heard the sound of drums and flutes as the Sea Dragon Parade seemed to have begun, to which I turned my gaze that way. There I saw a large dragon-shaped decoration, from its face to its body, and several people worked together to support this massive decoration with poles. Each person is positioned at the head or the body, and they synchronize their movements to create the illusion of a single large dragon in motion.","[Ohh, that’s amazing. It’s even larger than I expected, and it has quite an impressive presence......]","As Neun-san said, it kinda resembles a lion dance, but being modeled after Eingana-san, the Sea Dragon decoration is quite enormous, with nearly ten people cooperating just to support the poles holding the head portion.","Combined with the lively sound of drums and flutes, it really exudes a festival atmosphere, making it very exciting to watch.","Just as mikoshis and lion dances attracted people’s attention, the Sea Dragon Parade is quite impressive and wonderful to watch.","Their synchronized movements, which must have required a lot of practice, are impressive, but perhaps, because they were originally designed with the intention of presenting to the audience, the movements of the Sea Dragon also looked conscious of the audience’s gaze, and there are clever touches throughout that keep the viewers entertained without getting bored.","The time until the big Sea Dragon passed through the curve wasn’t so long, and before long, we could only see the back of the dragon, but the excitement of having witnessed something amazing continues to linger in my heart. It was a truly fantastic parade.","[Incidentally, this is a bit of a trivia, but when Eingana-san, the one that dragon is modeled to, saw that decoration...... She had apparently muttered, “C- Can’t you make my face a bit smaller?”. Considering her actual size, the real deal is just much younger, but it certainly is amusing that even a dragon is worrying about having a small face.]","[......I don’t really think that information is necessary right now......]","No, being a woman, it’s alright for Eingana-san to be concerned about having a small face. Whether dragons have small faces or not isn’t something I can fully grasp as a human, but I suppose that’s ultimately a personal preference...... It’s just, how should I say this...... I still feel like sharing that information here would ruin the lingering memories we had just now.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [She’s surprisingly concerned about her size? Out of the Four Great Demon Dragons, she’s second in size after Grandiereus, so I guess it isn’t that strange? Nidzveld is concerned about being small, while Eingana is concerned about being big huh......]"]},{"number":1643,"title":"Chapter 1643: Hydra Kingdoms Founding Festival 8","paragraphs":["After watching the Sea Dragon Parade, we immediately headed to the plaza in front of the House of Parliament where the ceremony was to take place. To be honest, we didn’t have much time to spare.","The Sea Dragon Parade is one of the many events of the Founding Festival, and since it’s not a government-led event specifically linked to the ceremony, there’s not much time in between.","If we want to watch the Sea Dragon Parade at the end of the procession, we will not make it in time for the start of the ceremony.","Well, I think that the main purpose of those who are going to the ceremony isn’t the ceremony itself but the message of the First Hero, so we may actually have some time if we only focus on that aspect.","[......No, I mean, there sure are a lot of people. Seriously, it’s like it’s some grand migration......]","[You’re right. F- For there to be this many people....... As expected, wouldn’t moving through them be difficult? It feels like even moving just a few meters would be rough.]","To be honest, as is the case with Neun-san, the person involved in this matter, I might have underestimated the name value of the First Hero a little. The main street was crowded with people like us, heading towards the ceremony, and with the way things are going, I didn’t feel confident that we would reach the Parliament Plaza by the start time.","The content of the message itself would probably be introduced in various magazines after the Founding Festival, but there seemed to be a huge number of people who wanted to see the moment of the announcement on the spot.","[Everyone, this way.]","[Unnn? Alice, that isn’t the way to......]","[No, this way is fine.]","Guided by Alice’s voice, I moved my gaze and saw Alice pointing to a path away from the main street. Compared to the main street, there were noticeably fewer people on that path, so this path clearly didn’t lead to the plaza. In fact, the direction the path is heading to seemed to lead further away.","As I tilted my head at her suggestion, I followed Alice and walked along the road with few pedestrians...... and arrived at a dead-end with only a wall in it.","Well, if the destination is a dead-end, it’s no wonder there’s little foot traffic here, but just as I was wondering what was going on, Alice walked towards the wall. As Alice approached the wall, vertical lines of light ran along it, and something resembling an entrance opened up.","[......Unnn? Could that be Gluttony-san’s?]","[Yes, well, I could do this myself, but they get so happy when I let them do the work in this kind of situation......]","Gluttony-san is one of her fanatics after all...... They’ll definitely be very happy to be of service to Alice. In any case, by looking at that pathway, I could sense what she was planning. It’s difficult to navigate through that crowd, so we’re going to use Gluttony-san’s Space-Time Magic for transportation.","With the Founding Festival around, Hydra Kingdom would normally have a strong Teleportation Inhibition Barrier, but it seems that those who are extremely good at Space-Time Magic, such as Gluttony-san, can ignore those barriers and teleport.","However, those who are able to do that are really high level, as even among the Six Kings’ Executives, only a limited number of people, such as Gluttony-san and Jutia-san, can do this.","As a side note, it’s said that even those who are skilled in Teleportation Magic can’t break through the single Teleportation Inhibition Barrier in the Sanctuary.","The Sanctuary is a special place that can’t be reached without Shiro-san’s permission, and unless they are on par with individuals like Kuro or Eden, it seems like you can’t even pursue the path toward the Sanctuary without Shiro-san’s permission.","[......However, even if we were to use this to get to the vicinity of the venue, it would probably be quite crowded, but is there a space for us to get in now?]","[Ah, guess you’re right. It should be even more crowded over there than the street we just left.]","[Well, it should be alright. There’s no way that Alice-sama hasn’t thought about that, so we can just pass through without worries.]","In response to Neun-san and my question, Hapti-san relaxedly entered the glowing gate-like entrance, to which Neun-san and I exchanged glances before entering as well.","Squinting our eyes slightly due to the brightness, we passed through the gate and arrived...... in what seemed to be a large room.","[Arehh? Indoors? ......Is this some kind of conference room?]","[......A- Alice-sama? Are we inside the House of Parliament?]","[That’s right. You can see the whole view from here.]","[......I think the House of Parliament was off-limits during the Founding Festival, even to their own staff though......]","[Do you really think I can’t handle something like that? Don’t worry, I’ve reserved this place properly through the official procedures.]","[Well, that was a pointless question......]","In response to Alice’s composed reply, Neun-san has a distant look in her eyes, a resigned look on her face. Well, it certainly isn’t surprising if Alice can reserve the House of Parliament.","According to what Laguna-san said, Alice should have already gained control of the majority of the parliament members, and if she just so wishes, she can apparently change the laws of Hydra Kingdom as she pleases...... Hmmm, that’s astounding.","[Nice! Now this is what we’re talking about, Alice-sama! In that case, I can sit on a chair and watch from a good spot. Let’s see, which one’s a good chair......]","[Can’t you at least be a little perturbed!?]","No, well...... That person you’re talking to is also Alice so......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [The tempo is too fast...... This isn’t good, I feel like I can see through the Author’s intentions to quickly finish off the essential events and move on to the sweet developments......]"]},{"number":1644,"title":"Chapter 1644: Hydra Kingdom Founding Festival 9","paragraphs":["With an almost illegal move of renting out the House of Parliament, we became able to sit indoors and watch the ceremony.","I was worried that we might attract attention, but the windows of the House of Parliament were arranged like the magic mirrors in my previous world, so those outside were apparently unable to see inside. So, there’s no need to worry about drawing undue attention.","As we had expected, the plaza really was bustling with an overwhelmingly large crowd, seemingly as if the place was packed with people, making me really feel the high level of attention on this event.","[Ah, look over there, Kaito-san. There’s a gorilla over there.]","[Unnn? Ahh, it really is Megiddo-san...... Megiddo-san sure stands out.]","[Well, they’ve got a massive size after all.]","I had heard in advance that Megiddo-san, who has deep ties with Hydra Kingdom, and Lillywood-san, representing the Six Kings, would be in attendance, but Megiddo-san, who is well-known to the public as the War King, standing over 10 meters tall, was immediately recognizable as she attended the ceremony.","Thinking that the area she was in would be the VIP section, I looked at the area Megiddo-san was sitting...... I saw Lillywood-san, Pandora-san, Iris-san, Frea-san, Sechs-san and other people I know in attendance.","[Ah, Iris-san and Sechs-san are also here.]","[What happened back at Symphonia Kingdom’s Founding Festival was more of a special case, as typically, it would be the Executives who attend on behalf of the Six Kings. Just as our camp had sent out Pandora, see?]","[Ahh, I see, thinking about it again, I guess that’s natural......]","[Well, they are still festivals celebrating the founding of each of Human Realm’s three countries, and since we’ve built friendly relations, it’s expected that representatives from each of the Six Kings will attend.]","[Also, even though Alice-sama says “Executives”, she isn’t just talking about the topmost executives like the Seven Princesses and the Five Generals, as ordinary executives do sometimes attend the festival as well.]","I nodded in understanding at Alice’s explanation, and then Hapti-san and Neun-san provided additional details. Indeed, now that they mentioned it, I guess that would be the case huh. Unless there are exceptional circumstances, there shouldn’t be a reason not to have at least one representative from each camp in attendance.","Until recently, someone like Isis-san didn’t have any subordinates, so it was either the person herself who attended or no one in her camp came, but now that she can provide attendees without any problems, so this time, Iris-san is the one representing their camp.","Looking closely around the area, there are also people dressed like priests, so it seems that representatives from the Gods are also attending properly.","I could also see the rulers of the other countries, Ryze-san and Chris-san, but why do I feel like they were sneaking peeks toward some famous people such as Fors-san?","[Well, it’s that, you know? As a country, they’d also probably want Kaito to attend as their representative too.]","[That’s almost certainly the case. Even if you do attend as their representative, the general public may think of you as someone related to one of the Six Kings, so the level of attention on you might not be that high, but the nobles and those in high positions know about Kaito-san well.]","While I may not be that famous among the general public, it seems I’m recognized by nobles and people in high positions within each camp, including the Six Kings’ camps, so I suppose I would certainly be someone they’d want to invite as a participant.","Well, I’ve opened a stall for Symphonia Kingdom and Archlesia Empire’s Founding Festivals...... and besides, how should I say this...... I’m not a fan of overly formal events, so I wouldn’t really want to participate in such things even if I were invited.","However, hmmm...... If Ryze-san, Chris-san or Laguna-san asked me to attend an event...... With how much I’m indebted to them usually, I would probably nod my head in agreement.","[Incidentally, those kinds of stuff are handled by Alice-chan...... the others are also firmly keeping such things in check, so there are no such invitations. No, well, the ones who kept those in check were actually part of the inviters? as well...... so if Kaito-san were to express a desire to attend, I’m sure the other party would be overjoyed.]","[Hmmm. No, sitting in VIP seats like that is a bit...... That’s why I’m really glad you’re screening those stuff away. It really helps. By the way, those others you mentioned...... Who are they?]","[Some of Human Realm’s nobles were apparently traumatized by a certain dangerous God. In fact, they’re even more scared of her than Alice-chan’s restraints, so that’s why there’s no strange invitations being sent to Kaito-san’s place.]","[......Ahh.]","Indeed, she sure is dangerous...... Unnn. If one doesn’t follow her warnings, she certainly seems even more unforgiving than Alice, and even when she was just warning them, she had probably scared them already.","However, considering that it prevents strange invitations and other such things, that’s something I’m grateful about, so I can’t really reprimand her about this too strongly...... I wish she could be a bit lenient with them though...... Though asking her that is probably impossible.","<Afterword>","Makina : [My beloved child really is kind. He is indeed like the embodiment of mercy. Unnn. I suppose I should be considerate of my beloved child’s wish...... but that’s after I finish threatening all the nobles......]"]},{"number":1645,"title":"Chapter 1645: Hydra Kingdom Founding Festival 10","paragraphs":["While we were talking about all kinds of things, the Founding Festival ceremony had officially commenced. The ceremony began with a speech by the King, Laguna-san, followed by an introduction of the VIPs and brief greetings.","Though I say that, as one would expect, the attention of the gathered audience...... was focused on a large object placed on the stage in the center of the plaza, covered with cloth under tight security.","[......Neun-san, that message is absurdly large, isn’t it?]","[Yes, I carved letters onto a slab of magically reinforced ore created by Funf-sama’s Tempering Magic. The material and other aspects are different, but Laguna asked me to make it have a similar atmosphere to the one placed in the Hero’s Hill......]","[After this Founding Festival is over, she probably plans on putting it up somewhere and turning it into a tourist attraction, don’t you think? For someone who says she wanna quit being King, just as usual, she sure gives it her all when it comes to national interest~~]","The Hero’s Hill is also famous as a tourist attraction, and it’s said that many people visit the monument there every year. That’s how great the name value of the First Hero must be.","In terms of politics, it may be a response to the strong emergence of tourist attractions from other countries, such as the floating castle created by the Gods in Symphonia Kingdom and the power spot that was under Fate-san’s Providence in Archlesia Empire.","“Now then, in a typical year, following this would have been the traditional events, including singing the national anthem, but both the gathered individuals and esteemed guests are unlikely to be interested in such things. So, let’s put the usual events behind us and get down to the main event!”","Laguna-sans’ words, delivered over Loudspeaker Magic Tool, caused the audience’s excitement to rise considerably. After nodding her head in satisfaction at the audience’s reaction, she began to speak.","“I’m sure everyone has many things they’re curious about the First Hero...... about Hikari. Due to the wish of the person, I myself can’t disclose everything. However, regarding the particular point that everyone is curious about, I have obtained permission from the person herself to discuss it here. The Hero who brought about a great change in this world...... First Hero Kujou Hikari...... still lives today!”","I could immediately tell the significant shock that ran through the audience at her declaration. Yes, that definitely must be the subject that most people here gathered here for. After the conclusion of the Treaty of Friendship, the First Hero disappeared, and neither the Six Kings nor the Supreme Gods would speak about what happened to her afterwards...... The level of public interest in this matter was so high that numerous magazines and newspaper extras discussing the possibility of the Hero’s existence were published after information about the message was released to the public.","And in response to these expectations, Laguna-san affirmed that the First Hero still lives today.","“I have no intention of speaking whether Hikari has returned to the other world or remains in this world. However, I would like to declare that Hikari is still alive, and that this message being made public is something I requested from Hikari. A message that was created very recently.”","It’s widely known that the flow of time between this world, Trinia, and the world we lived in, but the specific extent of the time difference has not been disclosed.","I, who can travel between the two worlds, know that there’s roughly about a tenfold difference...... but the time discrepancy also seems to be adjustable at the will of Omnipotent Gods such as Shiro-san and Eden-san, so I don’t think I can really rely on that information too much.","Although Laguna-san’s words confirmed the existence of the First Hero...... Whether the First Hero has returned to her original world and made contact with Laguna-san through some means, or remains in this world, possibly surpassing the lifespan of Humans through some method, is not clear. This ambiguity might spark lively discussions and various theories around again.","“Well then, there’s no point in putting on airs any further. Now, I will reveal the message from the First Hero, Kujou Hikari!”","With Laguna-san’s declaration, the cloth over the stone monument was removed, and the stone monument with Japanese characters...... otherworld script unknown to the audience.","Then, a woman who seemed to be in charge of reading the message, having received the Loudspeaker Magic Tool from Laguna-san, read out the content with a somewhat nervous look on her face.","“To everyone in Trinia, it’s Kujou Hikari. It seems that it has already been over a thousand years since I was summoned to this world, embarked on a journey, and concluded the Treaty of Friendship. While I hold this pen at Laguna’s request, many memories from that time come back to me, and I feel a sense of nostalgia. My battle was concluded with the signing of the Treaty of Happiness. I shall not return to the forefront again. However, I am truly delighted to see that all of you living in the present have inherited what I once wove, creating the peaceful and warm world I wished to see.”","Starting with such a preface, the message undoubtedly continued with Neun-san’s true feelings. The message being read aloud contains such a gentle sentiment, affirming that each and every one living in this world, keeping walking forward, is a hero in creating this peaceful world...... and many in the audience listened in silence.","Glancing to the side, I saw Neun-san gazing at such a scene...... at this world she once wished for and struggled to achieve, with a happy smile on her face.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [10...... This would end up like that, right? I mean, after reaching ?, it would be another subtitle...... This feels like the pattern where a subtitle focusing on lovey-dovey pops up, right? That’s definitely gonna happen...... Stop it......]"]},{"number":1646,"title":"Chapter 1646: Hydra Kingdom Founding Festival 11","paragraphs":["<Author’s Notes>","I’m not feeling well today, so today’s chapter is short.","After the message from the First Hero...... from Neun-san was announced, the ceremony continued. Though I say that, it would take quite a while to finish, so I don’t intend to watch the ceremony until the end.","[Then, since we have finished watching the main part of the ceremony, Kaito-san and I are gonna go now, but what about you two, Neun-san, Hapti?]","[Ah, we’ll go and talk to Laguna and Fors later.]","[There will be a break in the middle of the ceremony after all~~]","Neun-san and Hapti-san responded to Alice’s question. Our original plan was to go around together until the end of the ceremony, but Alice’s words were probably made after considering they’d want to greet Laguna-san and Fors-san.","I mean, the two of them would obviously want to talk with Laguna-san and Fors-san, as they are both part of the same Hero Party.","With that in mind, we decided to part ways with Neun-san and Hapti-san here, and Alice and I teleported again using Gluttony-san’s Teleportation Magic to go around the festival together.","[Well, coincidence it may be, going around with 4 people was also quite enjoyable.]","[Right...... By the way, Alice?]","[What is it?]","[In the end, why were you acting so suspicious today?]","[Bfuooh...... W- W- W- Wha......]","Well, we met Neun-san and Hapti-san, so I had stopped thinking about it for a moment, but I still haven’t heard the reason why Alice is being strangely tense today.","She said she would talk about it later, or rather, she made this statement that seemed to imply it would be related to me later on, and since we’re about to enter the latter half of the Founding Festival, I thought of asking her about it now.","Thereupon, Alice clearly looked agitated, her face blushing red, and her gaze moving restlessly from side to side.","[W- Why do you remember......]","[Rather, why would you think I would forget...... The way you spoke at that time gave me the impression that it wasn’t relevant then, but would be relevant later...... No, in the first place, Alice had been acting suspiciously since before, so with that something relevant that slipped off your mouth earlier, what exactly does that mean......]","[Ahh~~ There’s a delicious-looking food stall over there~~! Come on, Kaito-san, let’s check it out!]","[Eh, wait, you———– Whoa!?]","Alice, who changed the subject too forcefully, grabbed my hand and began moving at an incredible pace. Of course, I had no way to resist Alice with my strength, so I could only be helplessly pulled along.","H- Hmmm. It seems like she still doesn’t want to tell me. With her still not telling me about it now, I guess she would tell me in the evening?","[......I have already secured the place. I’ve also secretly contacted Kaito-san’s home in advance...... The preparations are complete...... All that’s left is for me to have courage......]","[Unnn? What did you just say?]","[It’s nothing!]","[......Nothing you say, it doesn’t look like it though.]","I couldn’t hear what she said because she subdued her voice, but the serious expression she had just now left quite the impression in my mind.","Seriously, what the heck is she thinking about......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Ahh, it’s over...... This is definitely heading to the seaside cottage route......]"]},{"number":1647,"title":"Chapter 1647: Within the Night As It Grows Late 1","paragraphs":["I’m curious about what’s going on with Alice’s strange attitude, but after that, I felt like she enjoyed the Founding Festival normally without any questionable behavior.","[Things are going well, eh?]","[You’re surprisingly good with your hands, aren’t you, Kaito-san? I wonder if that has something to do with the fact that you are good with the fact that you’re good at Rubik’s Cube?]","[Indeed, I guess I’m kinda good at detailed work...... Errr.]","At a street stall, they had this game where you would trace complex shapes written on a board using a pen magic tool, and the prizes one could receive seemed to vary based on how far one can advance by tracing. It’s quite challenging though, as you can’t trace the same line and stopping the pen for a certain amount of time results in disqualification.","However, as Alice pointed out, I’m quite dexterous with my hands, so I’m making good progress and was able to get past the halfway point.","Incidentally, the play equipment itself is a magic tool, so there’s no way for one to cheat when they make a mistake.","[......What about you, young lady? Are you not going to start? If you keep worrying about it before you even start, even things that could go well never will, you know?]","Disqualification for stopping the pen for a certain amount of time applies after starting. There’s no issue with waiting as long as you want before starting though.","However, it’s a relatively time-consuming game, so the shopkeeper asked Alice, who hasn’t started yet despite paying, with a puzzled tilt of the head, to which Alice looked as if she just remembered it.","[Ahh, that’s right...... There, done.]","[............Eh?]","After muttering a few words, Alice moved her pen as if she were lightly drawing a straight line before reaching the goal in a single breath.","To be honest, when it comes to this game, it’s not about visual acuity or physical abilities, and instead, the dexterity of the hands is crucial. And Alice is overwhelmingly excellent in this area.","Even if the line to be traced was only the exact thickness of a pen’s nib, she would be able to trace it without the slightest deviation.","[Come on, Kaito-san. You’re getting into the hard part~~ Are you gonna be able to clear this?]","[Kuh, the path certainly is getting all winding......]","Alice, showing a cheerful expression without a hint of concern for the bewildered shopkeeper, handed over her completed tracing. Rather than the game itself, she seemed to find watching me struggling more enjoyable.","As we were walking around some of the stalls, I heard some lively music, so we moved over there. There, in what seemed to be a plaza, people dressed in ethnic costumes were performing a lively dance.","How should I say this...... It was a unique dance, smooth and sharp in its movements. Even though I wasn’t very knowledgeable about dances, I could still tell how excellent they are.","[......Is that belly dancing?]","[It does feel like that. It’s a traditional dance from an area in Hydra Kingdom.]","[The music and dance certainly do have that kind of feel. It’s like it has history......]","[Being known for being an innovative country, Hydra Kingdom is often misunderstood as a place that only has new things, but they actually held many traditional aspects passed down from olden days. In the first place, Hydra Kingdom was a country formed by the merger of several small nations, so they also had many unique cultures...... They positively embrace new challenges while also showing respect for the old, and in festivals as big as this, there are many who perform such traditional arts.]","[Heehhh......]","Come to think of it, during the era when Neun-san traveled, rice was being grown in the remote areas, and there were unusual events such as Flying Boards, giving Hydra Kingdom the impression that they weren’t just a country brimming with new things, but with unusual things as well.","How should I say this...... Hydra Kingdom sure is an interesting country. This is just my personal impression, but I feel that the country’s policy, under Laguna-san’s lead, is to respect what the people produce. This resulted in a country that is innovative and challenging, yet still retains a variety of their traditions.","[Hearing that, I think Hydra Kingdom really is great, but does it not have faults?]","[Of course, it has. For instance, there are quite a few people who don’t resonate with the national doctrine of the country. While good traditions were undoubtedly left behind, the rapid shifts in trends mean that anything that only got half-baked popularity would quickly become obsolete. In this country, to achieve success, one must adapt to the rapid changes. Because of this, many trading companies that couldn’t adapt have withdrawn from Hydra Kingdom.]","[When you think of it that way, this country does seem to be fairly meritocratic......]","[That’s right. While it’s not the case for everyone, this is a country where individuals are often sifted through based on their abilities and luck. Well, that’s exactly why Gorilla-san likes this country though......]","Yeah, a fiercely competitive national doctrine would certainly be appealing to Megiddo-san. Also, there’s certainly Alice who casually refers to Megiddo-san as “Gorilla-san”, but with me recognizing that she’s referring to Megiddo-san as if it’s the most obvious thing in the world, I guess I’m also being a bit rude.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [What an ominous subtitle. Isn’t it kinda implying there’s gonna be an event happening at night......]"]},{"number":1648,"title":"Chapter 1648: Within the Night As It Grows Late 2","paragraphs":["As Alice and I continued to tour the Founding Festival, we came across a rather strange sight. People wearing large spherical headpieces...... too large to be called helmets, aiming a wooden stick towards a wooden elongated containers.","At a quick glance, this looks like a gathering of crazy people...... but perhaps, was that some kind of game?","[......That’s quite an outrageous thing, but what exactly is that?]","[They’re fishing.]","[Fishing? Fishing...... Ahh, is that fishing in VR!?]",".","When I asked about it, she said they were fishing. If someone else said that, I might have thought it was just a joke, but information from Alice is something I can trust. There was also no reason for her to lie to me when she knew I really didn’t know what that was.","And assuming that it was just as Alice says, I could assume that the helmet-like headpiece and that stick were something like VR goggles and controllers.","[That’s right. You see, back at the first Six Kings Festival, I unveiled some new technologies, didn’t I? They studied that VR and that’s something they developed. Well, what I presented at the Six Kings Festival was closer to an application of Spatial Isolation Barrier. Meanwhile, the fishing they’re doing over there is an application of Illusion Magic, so strictly speaking, they’re different things...... This one’s inspiration comes from that VR you’re familiar with though.]","[Heehhh...... As expected of the innovative Hydra Kingdom. They’ve already started incorporating new technology huh......]","[Well, it’s still a research in progress, so their content is still simple, and the appearance of their product is, well, like that...... but when you compare it to Kaito-san’s world, that is still something like the precursor to other games. We use magic to create things in this world, so there are various differences, but I think in about 10 years, I guess we’ll start seeing them creating some pretty advanced stuff?]","[I’m looking forward to it then. I would love to play it when it’s released.]","Perhaps, they certainly were still just fishing in wooden boxes set up as pseudo-fishing spots using Illusion Magic, but as Alice says, as it continues to develop in the future, unique games specific to this world might indeed emerge. In that case, I’m sure it would be really fun, and I’m really looking forward to playing it.","As to be expected from a festival of the innovative Hydra Kingdom, there are many curious things around and going around is fun. It’s also reassuring that if there’s anything I don’t know, I can quickly get information from Alice, so I don’t have any trouble at all.","It’s just, since we are on a date, I do want to do something lover-like......","As I moved my gaze around while having such a thought in mind, I spotted a stall with an unusually large amount of pink in it. Its signboard reads “Couple-Only Special Drink”.","[......Heehhh......]","That looks a bit over the top, but I guess something like that is good too. I have had a drink like that with Kuro and Shiro-san, and I think sharing a single drink like that would certainly be couple-like.","When I looked at the stall with such a thought in mind, Alice looked surprised, before repeatedly moving her gaze from me and that stall. It’s just a guess, but I think she might have guessed what I was thinking.","[......Kaito-san, are you out of your mind? Do you intend to shame me right here in the public......]","[Oi, don’t say it in that misleading way. Well, I thought it would be nice to do something couple-like so......]","[Haahhhh...... Good grief.]","Upon hearing my words, Alice let out a loud, deliberate-sounding sigh. Then, she looked me in the eye and told me in a strong tone.","[Kaito-san, we’ve already been dating for a considerable amount of time. It’s about time you learn how much of a sh*tty noob I am in matters of romance!]","[And you’re still saying with such confidence!?]","[Listen closely, okay? Alice-chan’s mental fortitude in matters of romance is as weak as a pr?parat. It’s astounding how much of a small fry I am. I’d like it if you don’t underestimate it!]","[For me to still be underestimating you even with how low my expectations about this matter I had of you just amazes me.]","(T/N: pr?parat is a specimen prepared on a glass slide for use with a microscope)","Well, even though she says this and that, what Alice asserts here is simply that “she’s embarrassed”. I’m well aware that Alice is shy though, and I knew she would react like this when making such a suggestion.","[Do you understand? If you realize...... how thoughtless your proposal was......]","[You say all that, but you like that kind of thing, right?]","[.......................]","Upon hearing my words, Alice averted her gaze and fell silent with an indescribably awkward expression on her face. She was unusually stumbling in her response, seemingly at a loss for words.","Yes, Alice certainly is a shy person...... but she has a romanticist side in her. She yearns for such classic lover-like situations that are very much like what you’d find from romance mangas.","[In short, if what you’re concerned about is being seen by others, we can just buy the item and move to a different location to drink it, right? Besides, since it’s Alice, you can just create a subspace, right?]","[......T- That is...... well, I- I can do that but......]","[Well, if Alice still dislikes that idea, then I’ll stop...... what do you think?]","[Ugh, ahh, uuu...... W- W- W- Well, I am Kaito-san’s girlfriend...... so if Kaito-san insists that much, I’m not really reluctant to grant your request...... W- Well, I guess it can’t be helped huh!?]","She’s blushing red, but she still had this yearning to do stuff like this, looking like she wanted to experience it. As I couldn’t help chuckling at her utterly adorable reaction, I told Alice I really wanna do it and suggested trying out the Special Drink.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Hyiihhh...... T- The sweetness level is starting to rise...... H- Help me......]"]},{"number":1649,"title":"Chapter 1649: Within the Night As It Grows Late 3","paragraphs":["After purchasing the Couples-Only Drink, we moved to the subspace Alice created. Holding the purchased drink in her hand, Alice had a forced smile on her lips.","[H- Hou...... It even has a heart-shaped straw huh, they’ve really done it. T- They’ve got a very good processing technique......]","[No, rather than that, Alice...... What is with this subspace? Why is there a building like that here that looks like a café?]","In the subspace Alice created was a stylish and sophisticated café-like building, with elegance and stylishness that wouldn’t be out of place in fashionable areas like Aoyama.","I think it would be fine if we just have a desk and chairs for us, but what’s the point of expressly creating a café in this subspace?","[Haaahhhhhh......]","[Eh? The heck is with that face, as if you’re looking at some clueless idiot......]","[Good grief, you really don’t get it at all.]","[Ah, you seriously said it out loud.]","It seemed my earlier question was quite off the mark for Alice, as she made a thoroughly exasperated expression on her face, she responded with a sharp gaze.","[Of course, you’re supposed to drink something like this on the terrace of a fashionable café!]","[......O- Ou......]","She’s being over the top again...... I’ve thought of this before, but Alice can be quite the stickler with such situations...... What she liked were clichés that seemed to come straight out of shoujo manga though......","[Even so, this feels so stereotypical that it’s quite over the top......]","[Huh? Please don’t underestimate me. I’ve said this many times before, but I’m a total wreck when it comes to romance. I’m a hopelessly inexperienced, sh*tty noob when it comes to romance! A woman who was distorted by her virginity for years! Of course, I’ve got all the textbook clichés down pat, that’s all where my knowledge is from after all!]","[No, like I said, why are you acting all impressive while saying those lines......]","Wryly smiling at Alice, who was filled with strange tension as usual, we moved to the terrace seats of the café. We sit facing each other and place our drink in the center of the table.","The table is small enough for this purpose, and drinking it at the same time doesn’t seem to be a problem. Well, there may be a problem with Alice’s mental state......","[......Then, let’s get on with it.]","[Can you please wait!?]","[Unnn?]","[I- I still need some preparations! Like, preparing my heart or settling my mentality! Ah, I’ve made sure to cast State Preservation Magic on it, so it won’t get lukewarm!]","[......Well, I’m fine waiting until when Alice thinks you’re ready...... but is this really something to be so overly dramatic about? I mean, come on, we’ve already kissed before......]","[Compared to a kiss, doesn’t this have a different kind of embarrassment to it!? This one’s, you know...... Gives you this itchy, bittersweet feeling...... You get what I mean?]","Hmmm. Well, I can’t say I don’t understand what she meant...... but yeah, it’s still a bit unclear to me.","At any rate, after waiting for a while, Alice, looking ready, nodded her head.","[Alright, I- I can do this! LET’S DO THIS!!!]","[Like I said, this isn’t really something you need to be that prepared for...... Whatever...... No, wait?]","[Unnn? What is it?]","[Since we’re facing each other like this, wouldn’t it be better to drop the mask?]","[Hah!?]","At the sudden thought I just had, Alice visibly showed astonishment and agitation in her eyes.","[N- No, no, Kaito-san...... A- About that. It’s a bit of a hurdle, like there are various high thresholds I need to pass for that...... My carefully gathered courage is wavering here......]","[It’s not like there are other people watching us, so it’s a little less embarrassing, right?]","[Do you think I don’t get embarrassed when Kaito-san looks at me like that!? Y- You plan to expose what I usually hide, intending to lick me with your gaze and put me to shame, don’t you!!!]","[Phrasing!?]","She isn’t really wrong. The content itself isn’t exactly wrong but...... those words could lead to an extremely outrageous misunderstanding. I was really glad that it was just the two of us here.","[......Haahhh...... No, well, I simply wanted to look at Alice with your mask off, and I’m not really forcing you to take it off, so don’t worry.]","[Hauu...... Guhh......]","[Then, let’s just drink......]","[......I’ll do it.]","[Unnn?]","[W- Well, like I said...... if Kaito-san wants to see it...... I’ll take it off.]","Muttering shyly in a small voice, Alice removed her mask and placed it on the table. She would usually jokingly call herself a Transcendental Beauty, but in reality, she is a beauty. Seeing her like this without her mask, I truly found her lovely.","Thereupon, Alice, who seemed restless as she fidgeted about, forcibly changed the topic with a mischievous smile.","[Ahh~~ Kaito-san, looking at the unmasked Pretty Alice-chan, you must be thinking how much of a beauty I am huh?]","[......Unnn. That’s exactly what I was thinking.]","[Howaaahh!? Ahehh!? Ah, u- umm...... Errr......]","[Ahh~~ No, well, for the time being, how about we drink?]","[......Yes.]","The atmosphere felt kinda strange. Because I had affirmed her teasing words, there was this subtle awkwardness around us, with a strangely embarrassing tension filling the air between Alice and me.","Just like that, we drank our drink together, facing each other, but perhaps, because she’s being strangely self-conscious...... I’m also feeling a strange sense of embarrassment on my end.","<Afterword>","Makina : [Unnn. As expected of Alice. For my beloved child, such weakness is seen as cute, right!?]"]},{"number":1650,"title":"Chapter 1650: Within the Night As It Grows Late 4","paragraphs":["Since we couldn’t just stay in the subspace forever, we returned to Hydra Kingdom as soon as we finished our drink. Meanwhile, Alice still looked very embarrassed, her face bright red as we held hands.","No, I swear I didn’t do anything strange. We just drank our drink like normal.","[Alice, I’ll ask just in case, but are you alright?]","[......Pfft, please don’t underestimate me. It’s a fatal wound.]","[You’re too weak......","[I’ve already told you, I’m a sh*tty noob in romance...... Well, that’s why I’m hoping for something less mentally taxing next time.]","[......We’ve never done anything particularly mentally taxing though...... Whatever.]","].","It seems like Alice wants me to spare her from embarrassing situations, situations that she thinks are mentally taxing. However, even though she said all that, Alice was delighted when we drank that drink together.","Alice loves those over-the-top scenarios, so even though she was a bit stiff at first, she looked happy and had a big smile on her face while drinking. She seemed like she got a one-two punch after receiving another damage from looking back at our situation after we finished drinking, but even when her face was blushing red, her grip was firm and her expression was somewhat joyful.","[Speaking of which, I’m changing the subject, but all things considered, this Founding Festival is peaceful, isn’t it? No, the unveiling of the First Hero’s message was a significant event, but it isn’t really that relevant to us.]","[That’s right. Basically, as long as those two Gods whose way of thinking is beyond common sense don’t make a move, things can go in any direction. Whether all Six Kings or all the Supreme Gods are present, as long as it follows the predetermined arrangement, it wouldn’t lead to much chaos. Everyone initially planned to invite people in such positions and prepared accordingly, so things would work well as long there were no unexpected surprises.]","[I see......]","Indeed, now that she mentioned it, during Symphonia Kingdom’s Founding Festival, it may have been the first instance where all the Six Kings were present, but Lillywood-san was originally planning to come, and the same goes for Archlesia Empire.","In reality, the ceremony didn’t feel all that hectic...... with the only incident coming to my mind being Megiddo-san’s sudden intrusion in Archlesia.","[As for the biggest concern, which is those two Gods, their focus is 100% on Kaito-san. So, unless Kaito-san sets up a stall or something like that, the likelihood of them coming is low. In that sense, it’s less likely for things to turn into a major fuss. Ahh, as for your next date though, my condolences.]","[......I see...... I will be going around with Shiro-san later...... Wait? With how confused I got about talks regarding parallel words, it had slipped off my mind...... but isn’t the situation where I’m going around the festival with Shiro-san in itself quite the big deal?]","[It is quite a big deal. Let me also deliver you some unfortunate news. Even if you realize it now, it’s already too late...... That parallel world temporarily created will probably be based on the start date of the Founding Festival, so even if you go warn someone like Laguna-san at this point, any message you tell her won’t be transmitted to the Laguna-san at the timeline where Kaito-san was going around with Shallow Vernal-sama.]","[......I see, it’s already over huh......]","The peace I have now is temporary, and it seems like the next event will be a definite hellish uproar. If anything, it might go far beyond the First Hero’s message.","[......N- No, but as expected, Shiro-san would have thought of such things and had taken measures to deal with it, right?]","[Hmmm. That is possible. With Shallow Vernal-sama’s recent behavior, there’s no way she wouldn’t understand the chaos that would occur around her from going around the festival. If the surroundings are in chaos, it would also be difficult for her to enjoy going around the festival with Kaito-san, and it certainly wouldn’t be an outcome Shallow Vernal-sama would desire.]","Indeed, Shiro-san’s goal is to enjoy the Founding Festival with me. Therefore, she should be aiming to avoid situations that would cause significant chaos...... In fact, if things really turned out that way, we wouldn’t be able to enjoy going around the festival at all......","(Ahh...... Fumu...... Please don’t worry about it. Of course, I will properly take precautions.)","Whoa there, that reaction just now sounded like that completely slipped off her mind...... Well, for Shiro-san, the whole parallel world situation is probably something she considered irrelevant, but it seems that she’s going to have proper measures in place tomorrow...... or rather, in the timeline when I’m going to go around with Shiro-san.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Fuuuuu, t- that’s right. Let’s calm down. Slowly lower the sweetness levels. It’s dangerous to raise the sugar level too quickly...... Let’s first settle things down......]","Makina : [Fumu...... With Serious-senpai saying that, then next chapter......]"]},{"number":1651,"title":"Chapter 1651: Within the Night As It Grows Late 5","paragraphs":["I’m a bit...... no, I’m quite worried about what will happen afterward, but for the time being, I will just think about the current moment. As we walked around, enjoying the Founding Festival, I suddenly noticed something different from the flow of a crowd.","They were making up a reasonably long line, and from the looks of it, there must be something popular at the end of that line.","[......Seeing a line that long in a festival sure is unusual. What’s over there?]","[That was a creation out of the newest magic tool...... Well, to put it very simply, it’s purikura.]","[Eh? Purikura?]","[Yes, you see, the camera-like magic tool made by Kuro-san’s company has recently become a hot topic and is spreading around the world, right? Whenever a new technology like that appears, everyone thinks of ways to use it to make a profit. And so, a relatively large trading company developed a large magic tool that utilizes Illusion Magic, allowing one to take pictures with multiple patterns of backgrounds and effects.]","[I see, purikuras are certainly new to the people in this world......]","(T/N: Purikuras are, to put it simply, Japanese photo booths. They’re photo booths that often have distinct cute and colorful aesthetics to it, usually allowing the final photos to have bright, vibrant and embellished designs, making them popular to the younger audience.)","The camera-like magic tool made by the Seditch Magic Tool Trading Company are now being used mainly in magazines and other media, but they are still expensive due to the fact that it is still new technology.","That being the case, it’s understandable that purikura would be popular to the citizens, as this allows them to experience such a magic tool.","[They haven’t been able to miniaturize it yet due to technical problems, so it seems that they needed to prepare quite an elaborate set-up using multiple magic tools. However, the customers can take home the photos they take there, so it’s inevitable that it will become popular.]","[Hmmm...... Since we’re passing by, shall we take some pictures too?]","[I suppose so. Even though there’s a line there, that magic tool isn’t as advanced as the purikuras in Kaito-san’s world, just allowing you to choose from a few patterns before taking a photo. The process seems quick, so lining up here shouldn’t take us much time.]","].","[Let’s go line up then......]","I nodded in agreement with Alice’s words as we stood in line, and I’m feeling kinda excited. After all, I’ve never taken a photo in a purikura before...... W- Well, before I came to this world, I was almost a loner, so I’ve never done normie stuff like taking photos in a purikura. I didn’t have the courage to take photos alone, and to begin with, I never had any interest in it.","However, taking purikura photos with my girlfriend...... Unlike the thoughts I previously had, even if it’s just on the level of commemorative photos, it’s something I’m looking forward to.","[While we’re at it, I’d like to take couple-like photos.]","[Fuehh!?]","[Eh? Don’t people do that in purikura booths......]","[N- No, let’s calm down, Kaito-san. We aren’t going to a purikura booth, we’re just being photographed over there...... N- No, I’m not really saying we can’t, but if we go with the flow of the moment and get carried away, this is something we could cringe about when we look back at it later. Isn’t playing it safe a better option?]","I understand what Alice is trying to say. I also understand that she’s saying this not because this might turn into a page of our black history, but simply because she’s embarrassed.","It’s just, hmmm, considering Alice’s expression and her overall vibe up to this point......","[Alice, this just my hunch...... but aren’t you quite enthusiastic about this too? Do you also want to take those kinds of pictures?]","[............W- W- W- W- What could you be talking about?]","[You’re clearly shaken there.]","Frankly, given how smart Alice is, it would be easy for her to talk me out of this if she wanted to. And her earlier words, rather than a clear rejection, her phrasing is more like “It would be better if we stop......”.","Although my intuition is 90% right, I somehow think that Alice wants me to force my way through here.","Although she’s reluctant to agree outright, she wants to do a couple-like action like that, so she wanted to make it seem like I pushed her into this and was unable to decline.","Well, let’s just go ahead and fulfill her wish.","[Alice...... I really want to have those lover-like pictures with you. I hope you’ll indulge my selfish request here and agree......]","[Ahh...... Y- Yes. Umm, I’m in your care.]","Seeing Alice grip my hand tightly, her face turning bright red, I found myself feeling warm and delighted.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [D*mn it...... T- This one’s heroine power is really high......]"]},{"number":1652,"title":"Chapter 1652: Within the Night As It Grows Late 6","paragraphs":["After about 30 minutes of waiting, our turn came around, and we were led to one of the several large box-like items. Inside the pure white interior, with a crystal in the center that seemed to be used to operate the magic tool, along with an explanatory signboard nearby.","The crystal was apparently used to change the background and take pictures. There’s a time limit of 10 minutes, and after that time, the guests are asked to leave even if they didn’t take any pictures.","[This thing looks pretty solid. They also designed it so what was inside couldn’t be seen from the outside.]","[Well, part of the reason why that is was because the photography culture hasn’t really taken root yet. There are many people who are reluctant to see other people in their photos. So, they designed it so that this place wasn’t visible from the outside, with explanations and magic tools inside for the guests to operate it on their own.]","[Heehhh...... That is...... something quite convenient for Alice, isn’t it?]","[I won’t deny it...... Alright, we have a time limit, so let’s decide on the background and such.]","Saying that, Alice operates the magic tool, and the background, or rather, the interior of this magic tool switches to various scenes. Though I say that, they only have simple ones and there aren’t many types.","There were about 10 different types of backgrounds, including meadows, beaches, and other typical places like that.","[This beach one has a pretty nice atmosphere. Ah, but they only have the night version available huh......]","[Beach...... Night......]","[Can’t this be changed to a morning version...... Really can’t huh. Huh, Alice?]","[Ah, n- n- n- n- n- no!? I- I- I- It’s nothing! C- Come on, let’s play it safe and go with a bright background! How about this meadow!!!? We don’t have much time!!! We’re running out of time!!!]","[......We still have about 7 minutes though.]","[WE DON’T HAVE TIME ANYMORE!!!]","[......O- Ou.]","Isn’t she pushing herself through this with quite the excessive vigor? Well, whatever......","With that in mind, Alice and I stand side by side in front of the meadow background. It’s fine for us to just stand normally, but since we’re aiming for a lover-like photo, I put my arm around Alice’s shoulder and gently pulled her closer.","[Whyaaahh!? Ahh, t- that’s right...... Lover-like photo......]","[You fine with this?]","[Ahh, t- that’s right...... Ah, no, Kaito-san. Our height difference makes the photo look a bit uncomfortable, so would you mind squatting down a little?]","[Should I crouch down a bit?]","There certainly is quite a height difference between Alice and me, so squatting a bit should give the photo a more romantic feel.","[No, but does squatting like this make it look alright?]","[It doesn’t feel too awkward. I mean, even if you say it’s crouching, you’re just lowering your body a bit......]","[Let’s go with this then.]","[Yes. I’ll be taking the photo then. The count will appear above the signboard, so pay attention to that.]","Following Alice’s words, I turned toward the signboard and saw large letters floating above it. It kinda looks like when I received hummingbird letters.","The countdown starts from 5, and when it reaches 0, that’s when the photo will be snapped. So, I have to keep my eyes forward and make sure I don’t close my eyes......","[———–Chuu.]","[Huh? Eh?]","I suddenly felt a soft touch on my cheek, and right after I felt taken aback by what just happened, I heard the sound of the photo being snapped. When I turned around, dumbfounded, I saw Alice with a smug smile on her bright red face, looking as if steam would start coming out of her head.","[H- Hahaha, y- you let your guard down! E- E- E- Even I can do it when I try, you know...... Haha...... Ah, wait, my face, it feels like I’ll go explode......]","Seeing Alice cover her face with both hands, the blush on her face reaching her ears, I couldn’t help feeling moved in a strange way witnessing such a brilliant self-destruction.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [What the heck are you doing!? You’re the type of person who’s too shy to do anything on your own, right!!!? Stop charging headfirst towards those sweet deve......]"]},{"number":1653,"title":"Chapter 1653: Within the Night As It Grows Late 7","paragraphs":["<Author’s Notes>","I didn’t have time to write, so today’s chapter is short.","The photo, taken with the camera magic tool, perfectly captures the scene of Alice kissing my cheek, with me looking a bit stupid, completely caught off-guard, but I still feel like it’s a photo with a considerable lover-like feel to it.","The only issue is its size. It’s big. It’s not like the typical photo size in our world, and was instead as large as an A4 sheet. Well, I suppose there are technical issues around this, and to begin with, the concept of photo size shouldn’t be prevalent at the moment, so I guess this is unavoidable.","[......N- No, ummm, Kaito-san...... Doesn’t that look a bit inappropriate? It’s already going too far as a joke, lacking any traces of shame...... It’s too perverted......]","[......No, you’re the one who did that though!?]","[W- Well~~ That’s true but...... Y- You see, I did that in the heat of the moment, and when I calmed down, the embarrassment was no joke.......]","As we stepped away from the line and looked at the photo we had taken, Alice, her face blushing red, poking her index fingers with each other, she whispered.","Even though she herself was the one who did that, she still seemed to be feeling embarrassed...... but I could still feel that she was quite happy.","[W- Well, since we went through the trouble of taking the photo, let’s keep it as a memento. Ahh, I’ve prepared Kaito-san’s too. I anticipated something like this might happen, so I bought some extras.]","[Ah, we can buy more copies huh. My bad, thank you...... Hmm?]","Saying that, I accepted the photo Alice handed to me, but the photo was neatly placed inside a beautiful picture frame.","She framed it before I knew it...... Moreover, it was excessively adorned and intricately designed. No, but what am I supposed to do with this? I definitely can’t just display this photo of us kissing on a table or somewhere else. After all, if I do, she’ll definitely start complaining about it...... I guess the idea is to just keep it as a memento for the time being?","[......Alice...... You really must like this photo huh?]","[What are you talking about? Ah, I’ve casted State Preservation Magic on it, and I’ve bought about 10 spares just in case, so if you want another one, just let me know.]","[......U- Unnn.]","She really likes that photo huh. It seems like she was just shy initially, but as she realized the photo itself turned out well, seemingly satisfied with it, she’s gradually getting hyped up.","I’m guessing she probably likes this kind of unmistakably lover-like atmosphere. She’ll probably make a smaller-sized version of this photo and pin them to a corkboard or something like that.","Well, as for me, I’m just happy to see Alice looking happy, so I don’t have any problem with it......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [..................]","Makina : [Those eyes, does that mean you’re ready? Ah, no, her hands are shaking......]"]},{"number":1654,"title":"Chapter 1654: Within the Night As It Grows Late 8","paragraphs":["After taking pictures with Alice, we continued to enjoy the festival, but at a certain point, Alice started looking restless.","It’s hard to describe, but it was as if she was on the watch for some sort of timing. It’s just, I don’t know what exactly she was on the watch for.","[Hey, Alice...... What are you so restless about?]","[Uwehh!? Ah, no~~ Ummm...... It’s no big deal, you know!? F- For real, it’s no big deal!!!]","[......Sounds like a pretty big deal though.]","She clearly looked flustered. And her face was also red...... I could tell she’s embarrassed, but I don’t know what’s the cause of it.","There’s no odd one out among the stalls we’ve been up to this point, and since some time has passed since we’ve taken a photo, it doesn’t seem like she’d feel embarrassed about it.","[A- Ahh~~ Kaito-san! There’s an interesting-looking stall over there!]","[Unnn? Over there? ......Isn’t that place already off the street?]","[It’s in such places where you can find the good stuff! Come on, let’s go.]","[You’re acting kinda suspicious...... Whatever.]","Her leading me to that area was clearly deliberate, but Alice is probably doing it knowing that I’m already suspicious of her. In that case, aware that I might catch on, had she prepared something at that stall?","Having such a thought in mind while being led by Alice, there was a lottery stall in a secluded spot off the main street.","Suspicious...... Its suspiciousness just overflows. She’s definitely up to something......","[......Hey, Alice. In the end, what are you really after?]","[What are you talking about...... Oh, they have a lottery over here. Since we’re here anyway, why don’t we try it?]","[......Hmmm. What in the world are you up to......]","Staring at Alice, who kept on feigning ignorance while tilting her head, I just did as she said and drew the lottery at the stall. They had a lottery wheel-type here, and when I turned it, a golden ball came out.","<img 2020=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-103860\" wp-content=\"\" uploads=\"\" 05=\"\" garapon-300x300.png\"=\"\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" garapon-300x300.png=\"\" 300w,=\"\" garapon-1024x1024.png=\"\" 1024w,=\"\" garapon-150x150.png=\"\" 150w,=\"\" https:=\"\" www.foxaholic.com=\"\" garapon-768x768.png=\"\" 768w,=\"\" garapon-1536x1536.png=\"\" 1536w,=\"\" garapon.png=\"\" 1800w\"=\"\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\">","(T/N: Lottery Wheel)","[Congratulations! You got the special prize!]","[......T- Thanks.]","What’s with these complicated feelings...... I mean, isn’t this totally planned!? It’s a lottery wheel where it’s already expected I’ll draw the special prize! Even if you congratulate me, I wouldn’t know how to react to that......","I mean, what even is the special prize? It’s probably got something to do with whatever Alice was aiming for......","[The special prize is a pair ticket to a luxury cottage on a private beach.]","[Eh? A- Ahh, errr...... Pair tickets for a cottage?]","[Yes. However, please note that the coupon can only be used “today”.]","[Today!?]","Stunned, I looked at the contents of the envelope I received from the stallkeeper, which contained a map and the accommodation tickets. Is there really such a thing as a lottery prize accommodation ticket that expires on the very same day?","N- No, well, this lottery was completely just a pretense for her to give this to me, so in effect, this was like a gift from Alice.","[Unnn? Errr, in other words, we’re not going home today and would be staying overnight at a cottage...... Unnn? A private beach with a cottage...... Hmmm?]","Arehh? That kinda reminds me of something. Since it’s a private beach, it would be a cottage by the seaside. And since I would be staying here today, after the Founding Festival ends...... Putting aside how long we could stay, it’s certain I will be staying here for the night.","Today is a clear, cloudless day, so the moon should be beautiful tonight.","......Illuminated by the moonlight, in a cottage by the sea?","The moment I realized what was going on, I felt heat gathering on my face. And if it’s for this reason, Alice’s suspicious behaviors before now make sense.","I mean, well, ummm, I guess Alice was ready huh. And since she handed me this ticket in the form of a lottery prize, it should be related to the “Please take me to that place” request she asked me before, a message asking me to be the one to invite her.","[Ahh~~ Errr, Alice......]","[Y- Yesh!?]","[......Since I’ve already won this, how about we spend the night here together?]","[I- I- I- I guess so. Let’s do that......]","After nodding with a face redder than I’ve ever seen from my words, Alice silently took out a shovel...... Unnn?","[Wait a minute there...... What are you doing?]","[Ah, no, my embarrassment is about to go over the limit so I’m gonna bury myself for a bit.]","[There are too many things I’d like to throw a tsukkomi at, but for the time being, calm down...... Or rather, can you not dig a hole in the middle of a city!?]","H- Hmmm...... Errr, with her being like this, is she really gonna be alright?","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......It’s over.]"]},{"number":1655,"title":"Chapter 1655: In the Cottage Illuminated by Moonlight 1","paragraphs":["<Author’s Notes>","I don’t have time at all, so today’s chapter is short.","Although it was practically given to me by Alice, I decided to set those seaside cottage accommodation pair tickets aside for the time being.","No, if I were to be too conscious of it, things might become awkward, so I’ll try not to think about it too much and shift my focus back to the Founding Festival.","[......Rather, before I knew it, the sun had gone down quite a bit huh.]","[Hyahh!? Y- Y- You’re right. It won’t be strange for the m- m -moon to be out by this time, isn’t it?]","[No, can’t you calm down? Let’s forget about all that for now and concentrate on the festival.]","[Ah, yes...... Fuuuu...... Alright, I’m good to go!]","It’s obvious even to onlookers that Alice was clearly conscious of it, so I had her compose herself for a moment. As for the Founding Festival, we plan to go around until the fireworks go off, so we still have some time left.","It would be troubling if she stayed like that all this while, so I urged Alice to compose herself, and seemingly understanding this herself, she took a deep breath and her expression visibly relaxed.","[The fireworks would be at 8 pm, right?]","[Yes, that’s about an hour and a half away.]","[Then, we could have a light dinner.]","[Ah, sounds like a good idea. Let’s do that!]","Alice, having regained her composure, or rather, returning to her usual tension upon deciding not to think about what happens later, is very excited when she hears the word “dinner”.","However, I’m slightly undecided on what to eat. I’ve already indulged in street food since this morning, and even our lunch was food we found from a food stall, so I want to try something a little different.","[Street food is great, but I also want to have a proper dinner.]","[Fumu...... I thought Kaito-san would say that, so I reserved us seats at a couple of fancy restaurants, you know?]","[Eh? Are they open today as well?]","[Yes, they’re located in a quieter area away from the bustling stall area. Also, I’ve also made reservations at a restaurant with a view of the fireworks, so it might be nice to watch them there.]","As expected of Alice, she’s quite well-prepared in every aspect of things. And the fact that she’s prepared for my actions, or rather, that she had already guessed that I’d want something other than street food, speaks to her exceptional quick thinking.","If I were to point out an issue, it’s that this quick thinking of hers isn’t being utilized at all in matters of romance...... No, well, considering that she had prepared for a dinner date, I guess you could say she is utilizing it?","[Then, let’s have dinner there...... A restaurant with a view of fireworks huh. That’s pretty much the kind of situation Alice would like, isn’t it?]","[Wha!? N- No, well...... I do like it...... but my mind was more on having a toast in the window seat......]","[That means you arranged window-side seats huh......]","[......Ah, well...... I- I did reserve for that...... Ummm, I- I wanted...... to f- flirt a bit......]","Saying that, Alice, shyly averting her gaze with a blush on her face, looked incredibly cute that I couldn’t help smiling.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Hyiiih, the title......]"]},{"number":1656,"title":"Chapter 1656: In the Cottage Illuminated by Moonlight 2","paragraphs":["The restaurant Alice had reserved was located in a slightly elevated terrain within the capital, and in the vicinity of the restaurant, or rather, in the area around the restaurant, there were no signs of any stalls or the usual hustle and bustle you’d expect from the Founding Festival. The place was surprisingly quiet and peaceful.","[It’s kind of serene, isn’t it?]","[This area is known for its high-end establishments and is frequented by the wealthy, hence the absence of stalls. Setting up stalls is prohibited here. In the Hydra Kingdom, where the authority the citizens hold is strong, people often think that this place holds equality, but in reality, the gap between the rich and the poor is rather large. Well, they have systems that provide assistance in those areas, so it’s not like there are slums or anything like that here.]","[Heehhh...... Well, with an innovation-oriented national policy and vibrant environment for individual and small businesses, there would certainly be an inevitable rise in the difference between those who succeed and those who don’t huh......]","Of course, not everyone can achieve success. A wealth disparity is a natural outcome. So, it’s no wonder that upscale areas like this exist.","It also seems like Hydra Kingdom attracts a lot of tourists, as I remember Laguna-san previously putting a lot of effort into tourism by creating beaches and the like.","Having this in mind, this upscale restaurant area also seems to be designed as an elegant district, with well-paved roads and stylish streetlights.","While I was glancing around the surroundings, we were escorted to a table by the window, offering a great view from within the restaurant. Alice had already booked the menu for us, so she only asked me about what drink I’d like, to which I decided to order a glass of red wine that matched the restaurant’s atmosphere.","Fufu, I’ve been to a lot of fancy restaurants, so I’m something of a connoisseur myself...... isn’t actually the case. To be honest, unless it’s on a different level like Shallow Grande, I wouldn’t know if a wine is good or bad.","[However, facing each other in a restaurant like this, exchanging a toast with wine in hand, doesn’t this feel like an adult date?]","[It certainly is a common sight in dramas and such. Well, a date like this feels like a classic one, but it becoming a classic just shows how good of a situation it is, doesn’t it?]","[And after enjoying a sophisticated dinner in a high-rise restaurant with a night view would be a surprise gift!]","[You really like that kind of thing huh.]","[No, no, Kaito-san. Can you not underestimate me? How many years do you think I’ve been fixated on this? I only gained my knowledge only through the media and the like, so I admire epitomes of classics like this, you know?]","Rather than Alice being a romanticist who likes the classic romance, I feel like she just enjoys these kinds of situations. Leaving aside the fact that she get all shy and can’t handle when she is the one actually doing it, she often takes action to actively experience the situations she admires, such as the case with this restaurant.","[......Ahh, but you seem to be more relaxed this time than usual.]","[Fufufu, well, it’s that, you know? Thinking about what’s after this, it’s no biggie...... No, well, I try not to desperately think about what comes after this, but putting all my efforts into that ironically makes me feel calm.]","[...................]","I thought about throwing a tsukkomi at Alice as she said that with a smug look on her face, but as it felt like her being too aware of it might make it hard for her to act properly, I just decided not to say anything unnecessary.","After all, she got so flustered that she even started to dig a hole and bury herself in it, and even now, her current state is a result of a painful bluff caused by averting her eyes with all her might.","It’s just, unnn...... I’m really sorry to Alice, but it’s because Alice is getting conscious and extremely tense like that that I can stay calm.","You know, when I see someone more flustered or nervous than myself, it just makes me calm down.","[Well, unfortunately, I don’t have a surprise gift for you.]","[Ahaha, I would be rather surprised if you had something prepared for me.]","If I had known from the start that things were going to be this way, I might have prepared something, but unfortunately, I had no prior information, so I wasn’t able to prepare anything.","Of course, Alice herself knew about it, so she just smiled happily.","Then, seemingly waiting for a pause in our conversation, dishes were brought in and we started dinner. As is the case with high-class restaurants, the course meals were served in an order just like those in French restaurants.","Alice didn’t eat a large quantity of food as she usually does, but used a knife and fork elegantly. Her refined manners were beautiful and made her seem more sophisticated than usual.","And so, after finishing the delicious course meal and enjoying some post-dinner wine while watching the fireworks, a cute cake with bright and colorful fireworks-looking decorations on it was brought in by a waitress.","[......This is a surprise cake for Alice-sama from Miyama Kaito-sama.]","[......Yeah?]","Alice looked surprised, but I was also taken aback. After all, a surprise I was completely unaware of suddenly happened under my name. Eh? What’s going on? What’s with this situation!?","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [The waitress just called Kaito’s name in kanji instead of the usual katakana. On top of that, her acting like she’s supporting Alice......]","Makina : [Fuuu, what a troublesome best friend......]","Serious-senpai : [I knew it was you!]","(T/N: Trinians refer to Kaito as ミヤマカイト, not 宮間快人)"]},{"number":1657,"title":"Chapter 1657: In the Cottage Illuminated by Moonlight 3","paragraphs":["After the surprise cake I didn’t know I arranged appeared, leaving me perplexed, Alice looked at the departing waitress with a suspicious look on her face, before lightly sighing and murmured.","[......Good grief, she’s being strangely considerate.]","[Unnn?]","[Ahh, no, it doesn’t look like she put anything weird in it anyway...... I’ll graciously accept the surprise cake from Kaito-san.]","It isn’t really a surprise from me, but if Alice deems it okay, then it should be fine. The cake has a really cute vibe to it, feeling like it’s perfect for couples.","Alice was about to eat the cake when she started looking around, seemingly searching for something.","[Arehh? They didn’t provide any forks?]","There certainly weren’t any eating utensils provided besides the cake, but just as I was wondering about it, the waitress came up to me and handed me a fork.","[This cake is one eaten by boyfriend-sama feeding it to girlfriend-sama, so the fork will only be provided to boyfriend-sama.]","[Eh? Ah, yes.]","[......Huh? N- No, come back here, Ma———- Waitress!!!]","I feed Alice. Alice was about to complain to the waitress, who informed us that the formal way of eating this cake is feeding it to one’s date, but before she could, the waitress swiftly handed me a fork and retreated to the back.","Upon seeing that, Alice’s eyes narrowed slightly and she stood up from her chair, but I hurriedly called out to her.","[Oi, Alice?]","[I’m just gonna beat up...... that waitress for a bit.]","[Stop. Rather, can’t you calm down for a sec....... It’s not like that waitress meant any harm, that’s just the way things are...... Being attacked by one of the Six Kings, that waitress would be too pitiful.]","[No, even if I seriously beat her up, it’s not like she’s gonna die anyway...... Haahhh...... Well, I guess you’re right.]","Alice seemed to be brimming with anger for some reason, but midway through, she let out a sigh with a somewhat resigned expression on her face.","Letting out a sigh of relief knowing that Alice seemed to have stopped directing her anger at the waitress, I then looked down at the fork in my hand.","[Well, if they said the cake was meant to be eaten that way, I guess we should do that...... This is a lovey-dovey situation right up Alice’s alley anyway.]","[I- I- I- I never said anything like that! I- I was just thinking a bit, just a little bit that that might be nice......]","[Anyway, it’s hard to feed each other while we’re sitting facing each other, so let’s move our seating a bit.]","[Are you not listening at all!?]","It was good that the restaurant was practically empty, allowing for some leniency in etiquette. Gently lifting my chair, I sat next to Alice, and after removing the decorative fireworks, I moved the cake closer to us.","Forking out a bite-sized piece of the cake, I offered it to the blushing Alice, who seemed to be flustered.","[Here, ahhhn.]","[Why do you look so relaxed!? Ugh, mnghh...... I’ll have some.]","It’s not really about me being composed about this or anything, it’s just that I’ve already done this before...... Heck, I’ve fed others so much that it’s making me worried my hand might get tendonitis.","After taking a bite of the cake I held out to her with a wry smile on my face, Alice, seemingly a bit shy, shifted her gaze, but I could see a hint of happiness on her face. After swallowing that bite of cake, she immediately opened her mouth again.","Finding her gesture endearing, I scooped another bite-sized piece of the cake and put it in her mouth. At that moment, an explosive sound resounded, and beautiful lights were visible outside the window.","[......Ohh, looks like the fireworks have started.]","[Right. The fireworks in Hydra Kingdom are quite large and more spectacular than those in Symphonia Kingdom and Archlesia Empire, you know?]","[I haven’t seen much of those two, so I can’t really tell the difference.]","I had set up stalls at the Founding Festival of both the Symphonia Kingdom and Archlesia Empire, and the location of my stalls was towards the outskirts, avoiding the main venue, so I didn’t get to see much of the fireworks. I caught glimpses of it through the gaps in the buildings, but I don’t recall ever watching as beautifully as it looked now.","Watching the fireworks from what could be called prime seats like this feels luxurious, and it’s enjoyable to watch...... I should thank Alice for this.","Just as I was thinking about this, Alice suddenly brought her fingers close and held the hand not holding the fork.","When I glanced at her, Alice’s gaze was directed outside the window, so I couldn’t tell if she was feeling shy or if she wasn’t really conscious of doing this, but in response to that subtle request, I held her hand, and she gripped back tightly.","While appreciating the beautiful scenery reflected in my eyes and the gentle, soft warmth in my hand...... Accompanied by an indescribable warmth in my chest, I continued to watch the fireworks.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......This is bad, it’s starting to feel like they’re gonna move to the cottage next chapter......]"]},{"number":1658,"title":"Chapter 1658: In the Cottage Illuminated by Moonlight 4","paragraphs":["After watching the fireworks at the restaurant, the Founding Festival finally came to an end. Of course, it was just that the main events may have been over, and some of the stalls were still open, but it still felt like the festival had come to an end.","I had the impression that fireworks usually mark the end of festivals like this, and I could see a flow of people who seemed to be on their way home.","[How should I say this...... The end of a festival sure has this unique loneliness to it, doesn’t it?]","[Yes, it does. This atmosphere feels the same even in a different world.]","Just as Alice said, whether it’s the world where I was born and raised or Trinia, this atmosphere feels the same. Watching the flow of people makes me feel such loneliness.","[......Well, in any case, where’s that cottage? Is it near the capital?]","[Ahh, no, the sea near the Royal Capital is basically a no-swimming zone and there are almost no beaches around here, so that cottage is in a slightly distant spot.]","[Ahh, I see. The fishing industry is active here, so there’d be a lot of ships coming and going.]","Besides, it can be noisy near the capital, and cottages on private beaches, which are likely to be high class, are more likely to be located in quieter areas.","Well, it’s safe to say that Alice’s Teleportation Magic will just lead me to that area.","[......So, when are we going to move there?]","[Ah, no, l- let’s just watch a bit longer......]","[You sure don’t know when to give up huh......]","If there’s a problem, there’s one. As usual, Alice is rather incompetent on this matter, so it seems it will take a little more time before we can move using Teleportation Magic.","In fact, if I just leave things here to Alice, it really seems like it will take a while, so I’ll suggest something where I can take the lead.","[Then, Alice, why don’t we move towards the private beach instead of directly to the cottage?]","[Eh? What do you mean?]","[No, we don’t really have to go to the cottage right away, right? We can take a leisurely walk on the beach.]","[I see...... That’s true.]","Heading directly to the cottage will undoubtedly make her conscious, so I suggested taking a stroll along the beach.","We can walk along the beach and head for the cottage. In fact, walking along the beach at night is a staple situation, and I hope to create a good atmosphere while we’re walking.","The suggestion seemed to be a good one, as after thinking for a moment, Alice nodded her head and activated her Teleportation Magic.","The sandy beach that we arrived at by Teleportation Magic was, how should I say this...... It is quite a fantastic sight. Today is a full moon, and the moonlight is quite bright, so the beach is brighter than I thought it would be with the light reflected off the sea.","[It’s quite bright and beautiful, isn’t it?]","[It is. It’s peaceful and has a nice atmosphere to it.]","[Well, if there’s one problem...... I can’t see the cottage anywhere from here, you know?]","[......It’s relatively far away from here.]","This guy seriously teleported us quite a distance from the cottage. She really is quite persistent at not giving up on this. I mean, her incompetence on matters like this is just like her but...... Well, we’re still technically within the same private beach, so the walking distance from here to that cottage shouldn’t be unreasonable.","Having such a thought in mind, I held Alice’s hand and started walking.","[Ahh, K- Kaito-san? Can’t we go a little slower? You know, let’s enjoy the scenery!]","[No, I’m walking at a pace where we can enjoy the scenery, you know...... Rather, calm down a little more.]","[You’re being unreasonable!!!]","[And your response is too forceful......]","I’m astounded by her usual antics, but even so, if I walked, Alice would properly walk and move with me. Without a pause in our pace, we walked slowly along the moonlit beach.","[By the way, what kind of cottage is it?]","[It’s one with a rather simple design. It’s designed for a small number of people, with the intended target being people with money traveling incognito.]","[I see, it’s like a hideaway huh...... Well, we have our magic box, so we can prepare drinks and food. That said, we just finished having dinner, so having some tea or coffee instead would be nice.]","[No, as far as I’m concerned, we can have another dinner after we get there, you know?]","[I’m already full though......]","Chatting about trivial things while we walked along the beach, Alice looked nervous at the beginning, taking cautious steps, but she gradually seemed to calm down, as with a smile on her face, I felt her steps becoming lighter.","Well, if she strangely raises her guard, it makes me tense too, so this is much better. As I had such a thought in mind, ahead of us, a wooden cottage illuminated by moonlight came into view.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [No, this is already sweet...... but when I think about what’s coming next...... I feel like a prisoner waiting to be executed......]"]},{"number":1659,"title":"Chapter 1659: In the Cottage Illuminated by Moonlight 5","paragraphs":["Walking along the beach during our leisurely conversation, we arrived at the cottage that would be our destination. The cottage is located on a slightly elevated spot, seemingly having a good view of the wide expanse of the ocean.","When we entered the cottage, I found that the interior was simple, but had a good sense to it, and although it wasn’t overwhelmingly spacious, it had a luxurious feel to it.","[The interior is pretty nice.]","[Right. It may not be sufficient enough as something that should be high-class but......]","[No, no, I’m more comfortable with this level of luxury. If it’s too luxurious, it would just make me feel tense......]","[Ahh~~ I get what you mean. It’s nice to have the good stuff, but we feel more at home with the kind of luxury that ordinary people can afford, rather than the royalty-like luxury.]","[Yeah, that.]","Besides, this cottage is by no means plain; it exudes a sense of luxury and is actually spacious for just the two of us———— almost too spacious even. However, considering that this cottage is something nobles use, it does have a slightly simple feel. Considering all these aspects, I suppose it’s really designed as a discreet getaway.","[N- N- N- N- N- Now then, w- w- what should we do next?]","[Like I said, calm down a little more......]","I threw a tsukkomi at Alice, who began showing agitation upon entering the cottage. For a moment, I was about to tell her “You don’t really have to push yourself, there’s always the next opportunity......”, but I swallowed those words.","Alice had truly mustered up the courage on this matter, and despite her actions, she seemed to have made up her mind. It’s just, she often acts sloppy due to embarrassment, so even if I’m intending to be considerate of Alice, suggesting such a thing here would probably only end up hurting her feelings.","[Well, there’s no need to rush. Let’s take a break like we discussed earlier, maybe have some tea. After all, we’ve been walking around all day.]","[Ahh, you’re right. Alrighty.]","Because Alice is easily flustered, I should strive to remain calm and composed even if it means pushing myself, leading her actions as much as possible.","Especially when her mind is riddled with the question “What should I do here?”, a situation where she could easily get flustered, I should be the one guiding her through.","[And so, we’ll have tea and enjoy the scenery, and since we’re finally alone, we can make out and gradually move things forward, one step at a time.]","[I- I see, in other words...... Alongside the moonlit sea and stars, holding coffee mugs, we chat on the veranda. Our free hands occasionally touch, enhancing the atmosphere with chaste, light kisses, and after that, w- w- we’ll share a bath, where we’ll exchange moderate touches, b- b- before heading towards the bed......]","[I didn’t say that much...... No, well, if that’s what you want to do, then let’s go with that......]","Given the way she’s enthusiastically describing it, it seems like her imagination is running wild with excitement. However, the desire for moments like holding a coffee mug while stargazing on a veranda, akin to a situation straight out of a romance movie, was just like Alice.","While I haven’t thought in such specific details myself, I guess following the path Alice suggested would probably be a good idea?","[......For the time being, I’ll prepare us some coffee. No, I guess hot choco would be more appropriate for the evening, wouldn’t it?]","[Ah, hot choco would be nice. A sweet drink with a sweet atmosphere...... Nice.]","[They have coffee here, but I wonder if they have hot choco?]","[I’ve got some. I’ll go prepare it.]","[......Also, are you gonna take off the mask?]","[..................I- Is it too much to ask for about 3 hours to mentally prepare myself?]","[No.]","[Ahh......]","Upon hearing my words, Alice resigned and shyly removed her mask, looking embarrassed. Although she occasionally takes off her mask when we’re alone, it seems like she prefers wearing the mask when feeling embarrassed. Even though the mask doesn’t completely hide her face, it seems to provide a sense of psychological comfort to her.","But well, the fact that she willingly agreed to take off her mask suggests that Alice herself might feel that the mask is in the way in this particular situation.","Leaving that aside, flirting while watching the sea and the stars huh...... It’s probably easier to lead her if I take staple scenarios in mind.","As for her chaste kisses request...... While she might not have explicitly requested it, taking actions in line with the momentum is necessary. If the conversation doesn’t progress at all, a certain degree of assertiveness is necessary.","Well, in any case, I hope to create a mood where Alice can feel happiness and gradually ease her nervousness.","<Afterword>","Makina : [As expected, in a situation like this, the difference in experience between my beloved child and Alice becomes obvious. Well, it’s also possible that Alice is just too much of a late-bloomer.]","Serious-senpai : [......Can I get away from here?]","Makina : [No.]","Serious-senpai : [Fghhh......]"]},{"number":1660,"title":"Chapter 1660: In the Cottage Illuminated by Moonlight 6","paragraphs":["I went out on the veranda with a mug of hot choco that Alice had prepared for me. The sea breeze at night was a little cool, but I felt comfortable, partly because the climate in Hydra Kingdom itself is quite warm.","The moon was very bright today, so the sparkle of the stars was subdued. However, the scene of the bright and large moon over the sea is undoubtedly a magnificent sight.","[That’s a spectacular view.]","[Right. Oops, Kaito-san, isn’t this your chance to say that famous line.]","[Yeah, yeah. The moon is beautiful, isn’t it?]","[Why do you say it so readily!? Can’t you at least make it more dramatic!?]","[No, it’s kinda difficult to gauge what tone I should use when the other party is waiting in anticipation, you know?]","I think it’s normal to find it difficult to speak up when someone looks as if they’re waiting for me to say those words. Rather, I believe that particular line works precisely when the other party is caught by surprise.","Putting that aside, I just wryly smiled and drank my hot choco. The sweet and warm tastes spread in my mouth, and I feel relieved.","[So, what was it again? Hands touching or something like that, right?]","[T- That’s right. At first, our fingertips would just tightly, before gradually, over time, we’d find ourselves holding hands......]","[......Tryhard.]","[Hyaahh!? W- Why did you suddenly hold my hand!?]","[Nah, it’s just, if we proceed according to Alice’s assumptions, we would take a long time...... I mean, we had already held hands just a moment ago......]","In any case, it feels like a plan coming straight from someone inept, or rather, just as Alice put it, from a sh*tty noob in love. While I do have a strong desire to fulfill Alice’s wishes as much as possible, it can be frustrating that things aren’t progressing under Alice’s lead, so I need to do some tweaking here and there to shorten up that time.","[So, what’s Alice’s assumption after that?]","[Ahh, t- t- t- that is...... Ummm, w- we’ll get even closer and get into a good mood...... and naturally, we’d exchange a light, fleeting kiss.]","[I think the mood is already pretty good. The scenery is peaceful and beautiful, and the pleasant conversation we had while walking up to this cottage was quite enjoyable.]","[That is ummm...... That certainly is the case but...... I still need...... various preparations...... to get my heart prepared......]","Upon hearing my words, Alice murmurs in a nearly imperceptible volume. In other words, she’s simply embarrassed. Though that’s certainly just like Alice, I couldn’t help but chuckle at her response.","[Why are you laughing!?]","[No, I just thought you were cute.]","[Wha!? Ah, w- w- what are you suddenly saying!?]","[Well, it’s like there’s this gap between how you are now and how you usually are, and you being all shy and meek is also kinda cute.]","[Kaito-san, aren’t you being too composed about this!?]","[If you ask me why I’m composed, that’s simply because Alice is far more nervous than I am, which makes me calmer in this situation instead.]","[Ughhhh...... T- That’s just unfair...... Even though I’m this embarrassed......]","[No, even if you tell me that......]","Alice expresses her dissatisfaction, but it’s not like I’m intentionally trying to create this situation, so I could only be at a loss when accused of being unfair.","However, Alice pouting in dissatisfaction while saying that looked so cute that I couldn’t help smiling. Placing my mug on the veranda’s railing, I held Alice by her shoulders with my free hand.","[......Ah...... Kaito-san......]","It seems like Alice understood what I was attempting to do with my actions. With a slight flinch of her body, Alice looked up to me, then she promptly closed her eyes and gently pushed her lips forward.","This would just be a chaste, light kiss, so I lightly touched Alice’s lips with mine and then moved my face away, before lightly kissing her again.","Hearing lots of “chuu” sounds, it felt different from a normal long kiss...... as repeatedly hearing such sounds makes me feel ticklish.","After a certain amount of repeated kisses, Alice started initiating kisses from her side, and not knowing who started it, we continued to lightly press our lips together over and over again for a while.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Omniscient God, share with me your wisdom! How can I escape from this sweet development!!!?]","Makina : [You have three options...... 1 Love my beloved child. 2 Love my beloved child. 3 Love my beloved child...... Now, choose which path you’d like!!!]","Serious-senpai : [Eh? No, ummm...... yeah?]"]},{"number":1661,"title":"Chapter 1661: In the Cottage Illuminated by Moonlight 7","paragraphs":["When we came back from the veranda, I checked my watch and found that it was getting reasonably late. It seems we stayed on the veranda longer than I expected, but as Alice wished...... I’m not really sure if it went exactly as she wished, but I think we made out enough.","Alice looked embarrassed, but she wasn’t as stiff as she was a while ago, and to some extent, she seemed to have gotten used to it...... or she might have given up.","[So, according to Alice’s assumptions, the next is the bath, right?]","[......W- Well, that’s right but...... hmmm. No, I’m not going to say let’s stop because I’m embarrassed even though we’ve gone this far or anything like that...... but I have a lot of bad memories in baths......]",".","[Ohh......]","Looking at Alice, who looked as if she just bit on a bitter bug, it dawned on me. I’ve had the opportunity to take a bath with Alice several times before, but she frequently ends up experiencing embarrassing incidents.","No, putting aside if these incidents just coincidentally happened or if Alice herself was just self-destructing, in any case, it seems that bath-related troubles had become some sort of minor trauma for Alice, so even if she doesn’t want to, those incidents come to her mind.","[After all, I’ve experienced various humiliations and was brought to tears at the hands of the sadistic Kaito-san. Those incidents just terrify me, and memories of embarrassment keep on flooding back into my mind.]","[Oi, don’t you start fabricating memories here. Almost all of those incidents happened because you were blowing yourself up......]","No, I’m not denying that she had embarrassing experiences in the bath, but the first incident during our first time bathing together was caused by Alice kicking the chair I was sitting on for the bath, and when we had a mixed bath with Kuro and the others, due to getting carried away after disguising herself with Transformation Magic, her magic was forcefully canceled out by Shiro-san’s Blessing.","Of course, I know that those incidents weren’t intentionally instigated by Alice, but if you ask me if that was my fault or not, then that’s a completely different story.","[No, no, Kaito-san might be a Mixed Bathing Meister with numerous experiences with various women, but I’m just an amateur. In such situations, experts should be leading and supporting amateurs properly. And so, Kaito-san was at fault.]","[That’s an extremely outlandish argument...... Rather, who the heck are you calling Mixed Bathing Meister? That’s completely false......]","[Who among your lovers have you not brought to a mixed bath?]","[............Can’t you at least not call me Meister? Makes it sound like I’m a pervert.]","Is this what being debunked feels like? In any case, I couldn’t refute anything. I mean, I have certainly had a mixed bath with each of my lovers at least once, and heck, I even have had a mixed bath with Life-san, Chronois-san, and Ein-san, who aren’t my lovers, so I really can’t refute her at all.","N- No, I certainly do feel like I have a strange connection with mixed bathing, making me wonder if I have some bathroom curse or something......","[......W- Well, umm, I guess it’s okay for lovers to take baths separately, right?]","[You ask that, but do you really think people take mixed baths with someone before they become lovers?]","[......I- In any case, let’s go to the bathroom...... Ahh, I wonder if they properly have hot water provided?]","[You’re gonna evade the question huh. Good grief...... Eh? Ahh, please wait, Kaito-san. Does the flow of things earlier lead to us heading to the bath immediately? I still need to mentally prepare myself————- Ahh, wait, don’t pull my hand...... I- I may have said something unnecessary......]","For the time being, I couldn’t stand the unbearable feeling anymore, so I forcefully grabbed Alice’s hand and headed towards the bath.","<Afterword>","Makina : [Now, which one will you choose, Serious-senpai? I respect Serious-senpai’s choice!]","Serious-senpai : [No, before I say I practically only have one choice...... that choice you gave doesn’t answer what I asked, isn’t it!?]","Makina : [Why not? It’s a proper answer though?]","Serious-senpai : [Like heck it is! I asked “How I can escape from this sweet development”!!!]","Makina : [Unnn. “No matter what you do, you can’t avoid the sweet development”, so that’s why I presented you with the answer “Just give up and love my beloved child”.]","Serious-senpai : [......Ahh...... That’s...... what you meant......]"]},{"number":1662,"title":"Chapter 1662: In the Cottage Illuminated by Moonlight 8","paragraphs":["I arrived at the changing room while somewhat forcefully pulling Alice along. Alice blushed in embarrassment, occasionally voicing complaints like “You’re being forceful” or “Let’s take it step by step”, but to begin with, if Alice genuinely resisted, there would have been no way I could have pulled and brought her along. And so, even though she was complaining, it wasn’t like she was refusing.","[I mean, we’ve already made it to the changing room, so give it up.]","[Ughh...... I- I get it. This Alice-chan, who is well-known for her tenaciousness, is finally gonna give up this time.]","[......Calling yourself well-known for tenaciousness, is that really something you yourself should say?]","[In any case, I’ve already made up my mind!!! Yes, I’ve already overcome mixed bathing several times before, so there’s no need to be scared now! This’ll be easy-peasy!!!]",".","Repeatedly claiming this’ll be easy-peasy as if trying to convince myself, it doesn’t seem like she’s composed at all. Moreover, it’s not like she overcame mixed bathing, she just basically self-destructed through them...... but for the time being, it seems like she has resolved herself.","Thereupon, Alice looked back at the door we had just entered from and held up her hand, and the door lit up for a moment.","[Unnn? What did you do just now?]","[I’ve sealed it. Not even I, myself, can open that door until a certain amount of time has passed...... It’s my resolution to not turn back on this. No, well, I could technically still get out of the bathroom using Spatial Teleportation, but it’s all about the atmosphere.]","[I see, sealing the door to cut off your way out...... The changing room isn’t that spacious though, so what’s your plan for changing clothes?]","[........................Aehh?]","She freaking self-destructed again!? This cottage may have a luxurious feel, but it’s fundamentally simple in design, so the changing room and bathtub aren’t that spacious. Well, though I say that, there’s enough space in the changing room for two people. However, as for whether an action like changing together would be something the shy Alice is comfortable with...... Well, looking at how dumbfounded she is, and the blush on her face getting redder and redder, it’s easy to know the answer.","[......So, what are you going to do? Are you going to use Spatial Teleportation and go out once...... or perhaps, while the other person is facing away, should one of us change and head to the bathroom first?]","[W- W- W- W- We can just change out of our clothes together!!! Y- Yes, this’ll be easy-peasy! Besides, considering we’re gonna bathe together after this, what’s the big deal about changing clothes together!?]","[......Don’t you seem pretty desperate?]","[I’m totally not, okay!? Only something really big can drive me to desperation!]","Alice declared, blushing and sweating heavily, that we should just change together...... but she really stinks of desperation, and the momentum brought out as she seemed to blow up is steadily piling up, seemingly leading her to self-destruction once again.","But even so, it’s not entirely without its merits that Alice, who has been so passive until now, to be heading for a more proactive direction. If it seems like she’s gonna go too far off track, I’ll rein her in, but something of this level should be alright for her.","[......Then, well, in that case, let’s change together and go in already.]","[L- L- L- L- L- Let’s do that! Kuh, Kaito-san, you’re as composed as always...... Gununu......]","[Haha......]","Alice looked frustrated and shaken, as if she had done something irreversible. Well, I can’t exactly say anything to her either...... I mean, truth be told, I don’t have as much composure either. I’m starting to feel quite nervous.","The thing is, while it’s true that I’ve experienced mixed bathing many times before...... Almost every time, our changing rooms were separate, or one of us would go in first, so this is the first time I’m changing with someone in the same room.","[Ah, errr, come to think of it, your clothes aren’t made with magic power, right?]","[Eh? Y- Yes, well, I’ve made some adjustments, so only my underwear are created with magic power...... but yes, that’s right.]","[I see......]","In the first place, people like Isis-san and Kuro created their own clothes with their magic power, so changing out of their clothes is something they can do in an instant. On the contrary, Alice wears clothes she herself crafted using actual materials, so her clothes are a bit different from theirs.","After a while, though we were a bit slow, both Alice and I started changing. With both of us falling into silence as we undressed, my heartbeats seemed to be getting quite loud, and I was getting quite nervous. No, we’re about to enter the bath together, so I find it strange that this is what I’m nervous about. It’s just, changing out of one’s clothes or seeing her in her underwear has a different kind of allure compared to being in a mixed bath...... Ahh, no, the heck am I thinking about now? I’m definitely feeling unnecessarily nervous.","[.......................]","[.......................]","I try to avert my guess as much as possible, but I occasionally catch a glimpse of Alice changing out of the corner of my eye. White huh...... I could see that she was wearing cute, intricately designed underwear.","While I felt the blood rushing to my face, after finishing changing and entering the bathroom, there was this strangely tense atmosphere between us. Well, with the two of us changing our clothes together, in a way, I guess that happening may have been inevitable.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Ahyiiihhh...... T- This is bad...... This pattern...... I feel like they’re gonna thoroughly describe what’s going on in that mixed bath...... Hyiiihh......]"]},{"number":1663,"title":"Chapter 1663: In the Cottage Illuminated by Moonlight 9","paragraphs":["<Author’s Notes>","This is a report.","An acrylic smartphone stand of “I was Caught up in the Hero Summoning, but That World is at Peace” will be on sale at Shinkigensha-sama’s mail order site. Please take a look at it if you like. I don’t have time today, so I’ll create the Activity Report article tomorrow or the day after that.","Also, this isn’t something I could surely report about, but we’re proceeding with the plan for the release of the latest volume of the LN in December. I believe we’ll be able to provide more detailed information soon.","T/N: Here’s the link: LINK .","It costs ¥2,200. Also, here’s how the aforementioned smartphone stand looks like.","<img 2020=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-104202 size-full\" wp-content=\"\" uploads=\"\" 05=\"\" f7lgaa9auaaubfz.jpg\"=\"\" alt=\"\" width=\"893\" height=\"1087\" f7lgaa9auaaubfz.jpg=\"\" 893w,=\"\" f7lgaa9auaaubfz-246x300.jpg=\"\" 246w,=\"\" f7lgaa9auaaubfz-841x1024.jpg=\"\" 841w,=\"\" https:=\"\" www.foxaholic.com=\"\" f7lgaa9auaaubfz-768x935.jpg=\"\" 768w\"=\"\" sizes=\"(max-width: 893px) 100vw, 893px\">","For the time being, I finished taking off my clothes and headed for the bathroom with Alice, towels wrapped tightly around our bodies. For some reason, without knowing why, we somehow ended up holding hands on the way, but there was hardly any conversation between us, and there was this strange tension filling the air.","Perhaps it was because we had changed together, but now even I was caught in this strangely nerve-racking atmosphere. I needed to somehow calm my nerves in this situation. After all, Alice may currently look like she’s unfazed by everything, not having any expression on her face...... but it wasn’t that she was calm by any means. On the contrary, she was on the edge, barely holding it together, and it felt like one more push, she might fall into panic.","And so, if I get nervous and tense up here, it could lead to the worst-case scenario of both of us freezing up and just letting time pass. I need to gather my determination and take the lead to prevent that from happening.","[......Ohh, the bathroom has a unique tropical look to it. There are flowers floating in the water.]","[Y- You’re right. It has this ethnic feel to it. Well~~ This kind of atmosphere is also good.]","From the wooden exterior of the cottage, I had imagined it would have a Japanese-style bathroom, but it turned out to be a stylish bath with tropical red and orange flowers floating in it.","The bath was shallow, allowing one to stretch their legs and lie down comfortably. It wasn’t overly spacious, but it was sufficient for two people to stretch their legs when inside...... No, wait? I guess my senses are off. A bath big enough for two people to bathe side by side and stretch their legs is actually quite spacious.","The bathtub at home is just too big, so it felt like my sense of space had become slightly off.","[For now, let’s wash our bodies individually and enter the bath...... It’s a clear bath, so let’s keep our towels wrapped around our body.]","[Y- Yep, alright......]","Washing each other’s backs in the bathroom is a common cliché, but it’s challenging to do it with Alice’s current state of mind. Moreover, the act of washing each other’s backs could potentially trigger Alice’s trauma, so I decided that we would both wash ourselves separately and enter the bath while our bodies were securely wrapped with a towel.","[Ah, I love the subtle scent of flowers.]","[You’re right. The temperature of the water is a little warmer, suitable for a long soak.]","[I guess so. Well, let’s just relax. In one way or another, we did a fair amount of walking and activities throughout the day.]","[Ahh, errr...... I- Is that alright?]","[Eh? Unnn? You have something you’d like to do?]","[......N- No, not really. It’s just, you know, we’re a couple, and we’re bathing together...... so wouldn’t it be better to have lovey-dovey developments or something?]","The person who was talking about having a trauma regarding mixed baths just a little while ago immediately changed their tune. Well, maybe it’s a sign that she’s gained a bit of mental leeway. The fact that we’re bathing together while our body is wrapped in a towel gives her a sense of security, and that’s probably the factor that makes her feel more at ease.","[I wish you could be more spe......cific......]","[Unnn? Kaito-san?]","[Ah, n- no, it’s nothing!]","[Hmmm?]","I turned to Alice and got surprised...... Arehh? Isn’t her towel...... kinda showing through? No, there’s no doubt that she’s wearing a towel, but it’s somehow strangely see-through, or rather, the color of her skin is quite visible...... and ummm, I got surprise attacked by those, well, protrusions on her defenseless breasts......","W- What’s going on? Our towels were supposed to be quite reliable, something that shouldn’t have become seen-through...... Is it made of such material? Anyway, due to unexpectedly seeing them so clearly, I could really feel a blush creeping up my face.","[......Huh? Kaito-san’s gaze earlier......]","[Ah, wait, Alice!]","[........................Hwoehh?]","I instinctively tried to stop Alice upon hearing the curiosity in her voice, but I was too late. Alice lowered her gaze...... and immediately stiffened. She seemed to notice the situation with her towel being extremely transparent, and her face started turning incredibly red at an alarming speed.","[Hyaaaaahhh!? W- W- W- W- Why is it so transparent...... I- I- I’m almost naked......]","[C- Calm down...... Umm, I initially saw a bit by accident, but after that, I hadn’t lowered my gaze and I’m not looking now...... Ahh, no, not that, let’s just calm down for the time being......]","I tried to reassure Alice, who was screaming and covering herself with her hands, by averting my gaze upwards and telling her not to worry. However, I was also flustered and felt like I was saying strange things.","[Rather, why is Kaito-san’s towel not transparent!?]","[Eh? Ah, you’re right...... Eh? Is it really possible that there’s such a difference in transparency between our towels?]","When Alice mentioned it, I checked my current state and realized that the towel I had wrapped around my waist wasn’t transparent at all. Well, it did cling slightly to my body due to being immersed in the water, but that was it.","wrea??.com .","I wonder if there really could be such a difference in transparency using towels provided by the same cottage? As I pondered this question, Alice seemed to have suddenly perceived something, and her expression turned to one of fury.","[......T- That d*mned bitch...... She must have swapped only my towel with a different one...... I- I’ll definitely beat her up for this later......]","I’m not entirely sure why, but she seemed to have an idea who the culprit might be, as Alice’s face was red with fury rather than embarrassment.","Perhaps, that other world God that Alice sometimes talks about may have done something. Unless it was the deed of someone on that level, it would be impossible to swap out Alice’s towel without her noticing......","<Afterword>","Makina : [Love events are always indispensable!!! After all, that’s what it says in romance mangas!!! And so, that’s a nice assist...... Well, I’m scared of what happens afterward...... I’m really scared but......]","Serious-senpai : [Agghhh...... T- That’s an unnecessary assist...... Dang it, the sugar content......]"]},{"number":1664,"title":"Chapter 1664: In the Cottage Illuminated by Moonlight 10","paragraphs":["Read the most updated version of this novel and other amazing translated novels from the original source at [","]","I’ve encountered unexpected situations while bathing together with someone to the extent that I think I’m cursed by bathrooms. It’s just, I feel like Alice is also somewhat cursed by bathrooms.","There would always be some sort of event happening...... with Alice always receiving the brunt of embarrassment. How should I say this...... It seems she had it rough.","This time, there was this incident where her towel became see-through, and after blanking out a few moments, Alice, trembling with anger, tore up a rift in the space and immediately after, the towel she had wrapped around herself turned into one that wasn’t see-through.","[Ah, you changed your towel.]","[......Yes.]","[You looked extremely embarrassed there...... Like I said, I swear I didn’t look except for the first time when it caught me off guard.]","[No, well, about that...... umm...... That’s something that will happen sooner or later...... but that happening in a way I never expected just makes me so embarrassed like crazy...... But in a way, because the embarrassment reached an extreme level, it went full circle and I felt a bit more composed, perhaps?]","[A blessing in disguise...... I guess? In any case, I’m glad that Alice didn’t escape from the bathroom.]","I think her going full circle and suddenly finding composure is real. In fact, Alice did appear a bit more composed than just a moment ago. No, she’s still embarrassed, but it seems like she wasn’t trying to escape or hide from her embarrassment. Rather, she appeared to have come to terms with what had happened to some extent.","It’s also fortunate that I didn’t get left alone in the bathtub...... That being said, the mood still does feel strangely awkward. What should I do with this situation?","What happened just now was something out of my control, but the undeniable fact remains that her towel was see-through and I had completely seen her body. To be honest, right now, the sound of my heartbeat is quite loud.","Alice said the same thing, but because that happening was just unexpected that I was too surprised at the moment to think deeply. However, as time passes a bit, I’m starting to get intensely conscious of it.","[......H- Hmmm. I can’t quite describe this mood we’re in.]","[R- Right. It’s kinda unbearable, and I can’t calm myself down......]","[For the time being, errr...... My bad.]","[Ah, no, that was an accident, and Kaito-san wasn’t at fault...... I- It’s alright.]","There’s this itchy feeling in our skin, like we’re becoming acutely aware of each other...... I certainly can’t calm myself down, but in a way, the mood isn’t entirely unpleasant.","The awkward mood influences things around us, and there’s this sense of embarrassment to it. My face feels quite warm, and when I look at Alice, her appearance from earlier comes to mind, making it difficult to have a smooth conversation with her...... However, even so, perhaps it’s my intuition telling me, but I feel that “now is the time to push forward”.","Even though her embarrassment went full circle, the fact that Alice is relatively composed and not flustered, the odd itchy feeling we both have, and the sense that we are being aware of each other———— Considering all this, I felt like this might be the best timing to go with the flow.","Therefore, while suppressing my embarrassment, I gently put my hand on Alice’s shoulders and held her in my embrace.","[Ahh...... Kaito...... -san?]","[Alice, look up a little bit......]","[Ahhh...... Y- Yes. Umm, p- please be gentle with me......]","Tracing my other hand along Alice’s jawline, I softly spoke to her ear, and seemingly having sensed my intentions, I saw Alice closing her eyes, so I leaned in and kissed her. Unlike the chaste kisses we had earlier, our lips met firmly, pressing against each other.","[......Hnn...... Nhhnnn......]","While gently embracing Alice’s delicate shoulders, I could feel the warmth in her lips, likely from the bath. Savoring the sensation as our lips met, a sweet, intoxicating mood enveloped us...... and after a while, I pulled back and spoke gently to Alice.","[......It won’t be good to stay here too long, so it’s about time we get out of here and head for the bedroom.]","[.......................]","At my words, Alice only nodded in silence with a blush on her face.","<Afterword>","Makina : [Unnn, unnn. Thanks in part to my assistance, that was a nice sweetness! Well, considering that what’s happening after this isn’t really age-appropriate for the novel, I feel like the next chapter would head straight to the next morning...... but I’m looking forward to their morning talk after their relationship has deepened! Don’t you think so? Serious-senpai......]","Serious-senpai : [......................]","Makina : [......This scenery brought about by the sea of sugar, I wonder if we can call it a seaside horizon?]","PS. Just making things clear, but the r18 stuff aren’t written by the Author Toudai. They’re fanfics written by a fellow YuuShou fan."]},{"number":1665,"title":"Chapter 1665: In the Cottage Illuminated by Moonlight 11","paragraphs":["<Author’s Notes>","I posted the article about the acrylic smartphone stands in the Activity Report.","Feeling slightly dazzled by the morning sunlight shining through the gap between the closed curtains, I slowly opened my eyes. What time is it? I feel like I’ve slept quite a bit.","I thought the light shining through the window was the morning sunlight, but it might actually have been almost noon already.","Having been awakened, I thought of raising my body up, but when I felt the sensation on my right hand, I turned my eyes and saw Alice asleep, hugging my arm.","It’s rare to see Alice sleeping like this, without being overly cautious about what’s going on around us. No, she did mention that she still has the habit of sleeping from when she was human, but Alice is generally vigilant of her surroundings. Making sure that nothing dangerous gets out of her sight, she doesn’t often sleep around others.","The fact that she’s sleeping defenselessly like she is now proves that she trusts me that much.","Hmmm, I was thinking of opening the curtains, but I also didn’t want to wake her, so should we just stay like this for a while? Just as I thought that though, the curtains opened and when I looked in that direction, I saw a familiar cat costume lightly waving their hands at me before disappearing.","Ahh, the original body may be asleep, but the clones are awake and keeping a lookout on the surroundings huh. I guess that’s just to be expected of Alice, her lack of vulnerable points in matters like this is just like her.","[......Hmm...... Kaito-san?]","[Eh? Ahh, good morning.]","[Nyuuu...... Good...... morning.]","As the room brightened from the curtains being opened, Alice seemed to have woken up. She opened her eyes slightly and called my name, to which I responded.","Thereupon, her eyes still looking slightly drowsy, Alice wrapped her arms around my back as I turned to the side facing her, snuggling further into my chest.","[It’s a bit chilly, let’s snuggle up a bit closer.]","[Unnn? Ahh, like this?]","[Yes. More tighter hug...... Haahhh...... This is happiness.]","It seems that she really was still half-asleep. Nuzzling against me, with a sweet, affectionate tone in her voice that she wouldn’t typically use, she rubbed her cheeks against mine. It felt somewhat like the gestures of a cat seeking affection, and it was truly adorable.","Following her request, I held Alice close, gently stroking her head. She seemed to be feeling comfortable, wearing a blissful smile as she softly spoke.","[Kaito-san, gimme a smooch.]","[Unnn? You wanna kiss?]","[Yes. I want to make out with Kaito-san a lot more.]","......This is just my hunch, but this guy is probably half-asleep and thinks she’s currently dreaming. What she asked me was an unusually assertive move, quite unlike the typical Alice. However, it’s possible that she usually feels a strong desire for intimacy and affection, but her shyness holds her back from expressing it openly.","Alice usually wakes up well. When I slept over at Alice’s house and when I slept together with her back at the Six Kings Festival, she didn’t show any signs of drowsiness or confusion upon waking up. But this time, Alice had just pulled out all the courage of her life and was mentally exhausted, which may have contributed to her talking half-asleep.","It feels like she wouldn’t be able to calm herself down when clarity comes to her mind later, but I had no particular reason to refuse Alice’s request. In fact, looking at how cute Alice is, my desire to make out with her grew stronger, so just as she requested, I brought my face close and kissed her on her lips.","[Nfuuu...... Kaito-san...... I love you...... chuuu...... I love you......]","Alice looked really happy as we exchanged kisses, repeatedly expressing her love over and over with her sweet voice, and my feeling of happiness also grew bigger.","But of course, it’s not like she could just continue being half-asleep for so long......","[......Ahh~~ But this...... feels too real to be a dream......]","[......Well, it’s not a dream after all.]","[Ahh~~ I see, I had a hunch like that halfway through...... but this...... isn’t a dream...... huh......]","As she muttered that, Alice turned pale, as if all blood had drained from her body, before quickly blushing bright red.","[......P- P- P- Please kill me...... I’m dying from embarrassment......]","[No, you didn’t say anything strange, so calm down......]","[N- No, I- I- I- I mean, what I usually kept inside my heart was, abababa, i- i- i- in any case——– Hnnn!?]","As Alice was about to lose her calmness upon being engulfed by confusion, I overbearingly plugged her mouth with a kiss. In a sense, I may have forcefully silenced her, but it seemed to be surprisingly effective. Alice was startled at first, but after a little while, she closed her eyes and put her hands around my back.","Well, I do really feel the desire to make out a lot with her, so I decided to make out with Alice enough to override her shyness.","<Afterword>","Makina : [When one speaks of mornings, it would have to be morning coffee! I like my coffee with only a little bit of sugar, but what about you, my children? Well, thanks to Serious-senpai, we never run out of sugar, so I guess occasionally having a sweet cup of coffee with extra sugar might be nice.]","Serious-senpai : [......(Every single time, this guy just nonchalantly eats me whenever I turn into sugar...... Does this guy not have any hesitation at all......)]"]},{"number":1666,"title":"Chapter 1666: In the Cottage Illuminated by Moonlight 12","paragraphs":["After a little time had passed after I woke up, I got out of bed, washed my face, and went to the living room of the cottage to find Alice had prepared coffee for me.","[It’s our morning coffee!]","[......I don’t think it’s morning anymore though?]","[Whose fault do you think it is!? Anyway, morning is the time when one wakes up! It’s time for us to drink coffee while watching the sun rise over the horizon!]","[H- Hmmm. Is it really my fault though...... Isn’t it more like you and your half-asleep mumbles’ fault? Well, whatever, thanks for the coffee. While we’re at it, let’s drink it on the veranda.]","[Right.]","Alice, who complained about that time when we just woke up, when she was a blushing mess while we were making out...... about how we got late from the supposed time we should be getting out of bed, but in the first place, I feel like it all started with Alice talking while she’s half-asleep.","Well, though I said that, I didn’t really see any point in arguing against it, so I just decided not to mind it, accepted the mug and went out on the veranda with Alice.","[It’s already noon-time, but the sea breeze feels so nice.]","[The temperature is warm, but the breeze feels nice. Ahh, Kaito-san, after we drink our coffee, let’s eat something. I’ll cook for us this time, so please let me know if you want something you’d like to eat.]","[Ahh, I don’t really have anything I particularly want to eat, but I want to help out in the cooking. Well, with Alice cooking, I guess I’d be more of a hindrance.]","[No, n, that is...... d- doing it together is also fun......]","Looking at Alice, who seemed a little embarrassed but said such a thing with a shy smile, I felt that she might have overcome some of her extreme shyness.","No, of course, I understand that she wouldn’t just change instantly, so if I surprised her with some kind of approach, she’d most probably get flustered and cause a commotion again......","[......Ummm, Kaito-san? You’re making a mean look over there, you know?]","[No, it’s just that you seem to have this composed air about you, but it doesn’t seem like you’ve fully overcome your shyness yet...... so I was wondering if you’d get flustered if I surprised you with something again.]","[You’re thinking of doing mean things with that mean look!? That’s a terrible hobby, making fun of how much of a sh*tty noob in love I am! Shouldn’t a good man pretend not to notice in that situation?]","[Rather than me pretending not to notice, how about you look at how you yourself are boldly declaring it......]","I smiled back at Alice, who seemed to be enjoying herself despite her complaints. Even though our relationship has progressed significantly, I still enjoy this kind of dynamic between us.","Being able to exchange light banter like this might be one of Alice’s good qualities.","[Speaking of which, are we going home right after our meal?]","[Hmmm. The cottage is still available for the rest of the day.]","[Fumu...... Come to think of it, this place was on a private beach?]","[Yes. Rather, the area visible to your eyes are all part of the private beach.]","[......It’s very spacious.]","The cottage was simple, but as to be expected from a luxury cottage, the private beach it was in seemed to be quite spacious.","[Then, how about we go for a light swim?]","[Oya, I see Kaito-san wanna see his cute girlfriend in a swimsuit.]","[Yeah, I’d really like that. When we went to the beach before, you were all stiff and guarded after all.]","[Uehh!? Ah, I- I see...... W- Well, if Kaito-san wants to see, a- as your girlfriend, I won’t strongly deny you either...... Errr, will you take a look then?]","Though Alice had this somewhat measured cuteness when she asked this, she still seemed to be struggling with a fair amount of shyness, so it seemed like she had no composure to tease me.","Of course, my response to that was already settled, so it was decided that Alice and I would play at the beach before returning, and after talking about this, we headed back into the cottage.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Wait right there! Doesn’t it seem like this arc’s still gonna continue!? We’ve already reached ?!!!]","Makina : [Ah, you’re back...... Wouldn’t it be good if the sub-title was changed? Well, it’s also possible that it just looks like the arc still continues, but they’re actually going back home already in the next chapter.]"]},{"number":1667,"title":"Chapter 1667: Memories on the Beach 1","paragraphs":["<Author’s Notes>","I was planning to bring about the closure with one more chapter, but I didn’t have much time today, so it would end up being about 2 chapters.","It would be a shame not to take advantage of the time that we’ve finally gone to a private beach, so Alice and I decided to take a quick swim together.","Fortunately, our magic boxes contained the swimsuits we had purchased for when we played on the beach before. It really is quite convenient to have various leisure goods in the magic box to cope with various situations.","[......It kinda feels strange being all alone on the beach.]","Since Alice would be changing into her swimsuit for the time being, I changed first and waited for Alice while setting up our parasol and other beach essentials.","Well, we aren’t really going all out playing here, just playing moderately, so I think a parasol and a leisure sheet should suffice.","[......T- Thank you for waiting. The Transcendental Beauty makes her entrance.]","[Unnn? Ahh, you’re here........................]","I turned around at the sound of Alice’s voice and was rendered speechless. Alice hadn’t really changed her hairdo, but she had taken off her mask and was wearing a simple black bikini-type swimsuit. She was so pretty that I was mildly shocked.","In the first place, Alice doesn’t typically dress in a way that exposes much skin, so seeing her like this is refreshing, but simply put, as a blonde, blue-eyed beauty, Alice’s current get-up suits her incredibly well.","[Ph? What’s the matter, Kaito-san? Were you charmed upon seeing your cute girlfriend in her swimsuit?]","[Yeah, it honestly exceeds what I had imagined. No, especially when you remain silent, Alice really is like a beauty on a perfect level...... Your swimsuit really suits you, and you look really cute.]","[Well~~ If you compliment me that much, I will get emb...... Unnn? That’s strange. I kinda feel like I just heard you saying it’s different when I’m talking though?]","[......Well, when you start speaking, I feel more like you’re “someone disappointing”.]","[Who the heck is a Disappointing Transcendental Beauty!?]","No, when she actually shuts up, she really is a beauty that I can’t complain about, but when she speaks, that beauty skips out of my mind and instead becomes replaced by “Alice”.","[No, it’s more like you talking really feels Alice-like. Like, your character really shows when you speak......]","[You’re being really harsh for a while now...... Hah!? Oh my, Kaito-san, I can see you hiding your embarrassment! You’re just overflowing with love with the cute Alice-chan, but you’re so embarrassed that you opt to insulting, right? No, no, I get ya. It’s that male instinct for guys to not be straightforward, yes? Good grief, even though Alice-chan could have fully received it if you could just be honest...... Well, I suppose Alice-chan is just that captivating that one just can’t be straightforward......]","[Hou, if you’re gonna say that much, then sure, I’ll shower you with my love as much as you want......]","[Whoa there, Kaito-san, please wait. Let’s calm down now...... Let’s calm down and talk things out. I do feel like I got a little carried away and got dragged along the flow...... If things head in that direction, my chances of winning is...... so, let’s calm down for the moment......]","Rather than me, it’s probably Alice who’s 100% trying to hide her embarrassment. Still, since she went and said such things, let’s ride along with her words and shower Alice with my love.","I mean, those words she said just now, couldn’t I take it as some sort of invitation? Well, whatever......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......They’re making out again...... They’re freaking making out again......]"]},{"number":1668,"title":"Chapter 1668: Memories on the Beach 2","paragraphs":["Alice, wearing her swimsuit, and I went into the sea together. Though I say that, we didn’t go into a strenuous swim, but a leisurely dip in the sea.","The climate in the Hydra Kingdom is warm, so it’s quite pleasant to take a dip in the sea.","[Kaito-san, want to go boating?]","[Yeah, relaxing on a boat would be nice.]","[I’ll get it ready then~~]","Saying this, Alice brought a big rubber boat out of nowhere. Hmmm...... She brought out something more legit than I had anticipated.","The boat isn’t the kind one would use on the ocean, but one that looks like it could be used for river rafting. Well, it has a size that can accommodate two people lying down, so using that might be a good idea.","[Lying on it feels like it would be nice. Guess we just have to be careful not to get swept away......]","[Ahh, I’ve magically regulated that, so it’s gonna be alright.]","[I see......]","Well, if we don’t have to worry about being drifted away, we can lie down on the boat and relax. With that in mind, I climbed onto the boat and laid down, to which Alice also laid down beside me.","[Hmmm, this is quite the comfortable spot to sleep in, isn’t it?]","[Yeah, you’re right. The slight shaking is very comfortable and makes me sleepy.]","With us laid down together, I looked to the side and saw Alice lying there in her swimsuit, her wet appearance somewhat sensual and erotic.","Lying on the boat floating on the sea, it felt as if we were the only ones in this space...... No, we are on a private beach, so we actually were alone together.","[......By the way, Alice.]","[What is it?]","[Are you okay? You look a little red......]","[Don’t you think good guys pretend not to notice stuff like that in situations like this!? Of course, I’m feeling embarrassed. Please don’t underestimate how much of a sh*tty noob in love I am. I still have a long way from gaining total control over stuff like this!]","[Ahaha, I see...... However, you do seem to have a little leeway. You’re at least making the conscious effort to be proactive.]","[Of course...... Like I said, I may be embarrassed, but me wanting to flirt with Kaito-san is the truth. Well, that’s why, if you’re a capable boyfriend, how about casually holding my hand here?]","Smiling at Alice, who was requesting me to hold her hand in a roundabout way, I intertwined my fingers with hers, and at the same time, I turned my body, which was lying face up, to face Alice.","Thereupon, Alice also turned her body to the side as I did...... and gently bringing her lips close, our lips briefly met. Perhaps because we had been in the sea and were a little wet, the feel of her skin on my hand felt a little different, and my heart strangely beat faster.","[......Kaito-san.]","[Unnn?]","[Ah~~ Errr, I’ve mentioned this multiple times, so I believe you’re well aware of this already, but I’m quite hopeless when it comes to romance. I think I’ll continue being a nuisance to you about this in the future as well.]","[I don’t really think you’ve ever been a nuisance but...... so?]","[Ahh, no, I don’t mean to say anything special...... it’s just, well, I’m in your care from now on.]","[Yeah, I’m also in your care......]","We both exchanged a few words, slightly testing the waters, before inadvertently bursting into chuckles. How should I say this...... It felt like the atmosphere had turned oddly serious for a moment, and it was kinda funny.","[Ahaha...... What’s with that? The mood turned kinda strange.]","[Well, that’s fine too...... Besides, that mood isn’t really that bad.]","[Right...... It’s a good mood, isn’t it? Anyhow, please continue leading this hopeless me. I want to make out more.]","[If you’re gonna declare that much, I think you could have held out...... but well, that’s just like Alice.]","After wryly smiling in return, I moved my body closer to Alice and held her close.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......Haahhh...... Haahhh...... I- It’s over...... It was rough...... really rough......]","Makina : [Alright, next up is the date with Shallow Vernal.]","Serious-senpai : [Ah...... Aaaaaahhh......]"]},{"number":1669,"title":"Chapter 1669: Re: Founding Festival 1","paragraphs":["It was evening when I returned home after my date with Alice at Hydra Kingdom’s Founding Festival and at the beach afterward.","As I lay on the bed in my room, feeling moderately tired, a thought occurred to me. Come to think of it, I’m going to be participating in the Founding Festival once again...... or rather, in a Founding Festival in a parallel dimension, but when will I switch over to that side?","(Allow me to answer that...... You had already switched over. When Kaito-san returned home, you had switched over to the day before the Founding Festival of the parallel dimension. As for why it’s the day before, it’s my consideration that it would be better for Kaito-san to have a night’s rest since you must have been tired from playing. Aren’t I a capable lover? You can compliment me, you know? Compliments make me happy.)","That’s quite the appeal she’s making there...... Well, setting that aside, taking a good night’s sleep and being able to approach the next day refreshed really is something I appreciate. I’m tired after all, and I really need a break.","By the way, there’s something I’d like to ask the considerate Shiro-san. About our date at the Founding Festival...... have you told Laguna-san or the others about this?","(No? Telling them about this doesn’t hold any meaning anyway. This dimension for the date between me and Kaito-san was created at the moment Kaito-san arrived home. It didn’t exist before that moment, so there’s no point discussing this with them beforehand. Thus, I will convey this to God of Time and Space now.)","Whoa there, with just those few words, it’s almost as if you’ve sentenced Chronois-san and Laguna-san’s stomachs to be destroyed.","To be informed that the God of Creation Shiro-san would be participating the day before the actual event, I wonder what Laguna-san’s mental state is like...... Rather, in addition to that, I wonder if there are gonna be concerns when she conveys this to the Gods?","(That’s not an issue. I have already informed the three Supreme Gods in advance about creating a parallel dimension for Kaito-san and me to go on a date. Of course, since the memories they currently have were only up until the day before the Founding Festival, if I give them a heads up, they’ll recognize that this is the parallel dimension I mentioned to them in advance and act accordingly.)","I see, that would be fine then...... Unnn? Wait a moment there. If that method was possible, wouldn’t it also be possible for you to tell Laguna-san or someone else in advance?","(Now that you mentioned it, you’re right. I’ll do that next time.)","Laguna-san is so pitiful. The Founding Festival that I experienced with Alice went smoothly without major troubles. Yes, this dimension will certainly merge with the legitimate dimension over there after the Founding Festival ends, with everyone not on Shiro-san’s level, except for me, not carrying over the memories about that dimension...... but that doesn’t mean they can just be inflicted excruciating stomach pain in this dimension.","Well, it’s already too late to be saying that now. It’s completely off my hands now, so it can’t be helped...... Let’s just think about tomorrow’s date with Shiro-san.","Based on my recognition, with Fate-san and the others supporting us, can I take it that we would be going around as ordinary participants of the Founding Festival in a way that anyone wouldn’t realize Shiro-san’s identity?","(Yes, such recognition is fine. Since we’ve already established that anyone else won’t recognize me and won’t be concerning themselves with me unless I initiate contact, you can just be reassured and be lovey-dovey with me, you know? I’m open to kissing in the middle of the street.)","].","No, Shiro-san, even if they don’t recognize you, wouldn’t the people around still be aware that I am kissing someone in the street? No, in the first place, kissing in the middle of a crowded festival is just too embarrassing, so I’d like it if you’d stop with that.","W- Well, despite my concerns, there are indeed many things I look forward to. The Founding Festival is very large, and there are many places that Alice and I haven’t been able to visit after just one day of touring, so let’s focus on those places.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [As expected of the airheaded God. She just naturally brings about stomach ache to those around her...... On Kaito’s date with Alice, there wasn’t much stomach ache inflicted on anyone, but what about this one?]"]},{"number":1670,"title":"Chapter 1670: Re: Founding Festival 2","paragraphs":["In an office in the Albert Duchy in Symphonia Kingdom, Lilia exhales lightly after finishing her paperwork. Right at that moment, Lunamaria placed a cup of tea on Lilia’s desk.","[Thank you for your hard work, you’ve reached a point where you can pause your work, right?]","[Yes, thank you for staying late with me too, Luna.]","[Fufu, I’m expecting overtime pay, okay? I’ve also told my mother I’m going to stay the night, so please lend me a room.]","[Ahh, in that case, you can use the guest room next to Aoi-san and Hina-san’s.]","[Ah, isn’t that a pretty nice room? Guess I’ll be sleeping well tonight.]","While Lunamaria usually commutes from home, there are times, especially during busy periods, when she stays overnight. As Lilia’s exclusive maid, Lunamaria is basically busy when Lilia is busy,? especially during hectic times.","This time, Lilia had to expedite several tasks in advance due to her planned participation in Hydra Kingdom’s Founding Festival from tomorrow onwards, so they had more work than usual.","[For the time being, this completes all the work that needs to be done before the Founding Festival, right?]","[Indeed. For Hydra Kingdom’s Founding Festival this year, we can directly teleport to their Capital using Teleportation Magic, so getting there fortunately won’t take much time. As I finished up the work at this hour, I should be able to get a good night’s sleep today.]","Normally, during the Founding Festival, a Teleportation Inhibition Barrier is placed over the entire capital for anti-terrorism measures, rendering direct teleportation impossible. However, Hydra Kingdom is the most advanced nation among the three countries, and this is evident in various aspects.","This time, by utilizing the latest City-wide Barrier Magic, they’ve introduced a new technology that allows Teleportation to certain sections of the city, where people who carry a Passage Recognition Magic Tool, provided by the country, are able to make use of teleportation. Thanks to these advancements, they don’t need to arrive early or stay overnight in Hydra Kingdom.","[Now, we just hope nothing else will happen on the day of the event. Isn’t that right, Milady?]","[Can you not speak of words that make me anxious? Well, aren’t things going to be alright this time? The publicization of the First Hero’s message certainly will be of great interest, but there doesn’t seem to be any indication of Kaito-san’s involvement in particular......]","[When Miyama-sama gets involved with something, things won’t end peacefully, doesn’t it? Well, it’s something I wholeheartedly agree with but......]","[No, how should I say this...... It’s just that when Kaito-san gets involved in something, I have this feeling that unexpected events not in the original plan are more likely to happen. In fact, as long as he doesn’t get involved, everything should be fine. The attendees are already known in advance, and the ceremony’s progress is well planned, so unexpected events would normally not occur...... or so it should be......]","Yes, the Founding Festival is a major event for a country, so every country would obviously make full preparations for it. Even if such an unforeseen event were to occur, it would be at a level that could be adequately handled onsite.","However, when Kaito is involved in it, there’s a high possibility that a being with extremely large influence, such as the Six Kings or the Supreme Gods, will make a move, so it’s not unusual for their multitude of countermeasures to go awry.","[However, Kaito-san isn’t running a stall this time, he’s simply participating in the festival. Plus, the person accompanying him going around the festival has been decided in advance, which makes it unlikely that unexpected changes would occur. Unless they have a reason, like visiting Kaito-san’s stall, it’s unlikely for eminent figures like the Six Kings or the Supreme Gods to suddenly appear.]","[Indeed, when you look at it that way, I suppose we may feel relieved this time.]","[Yes, that’s why I can also be at ease........................ Arehh?]","[Milady?]","Lilia, a calm smile on her lips, seemed to think everything would be fine this time, but halfway through, for some reason, her words faltered, and after a moment, she tilted her head with a somewhat troubled expression on her face.","When Lunamaria, concerned about her behavior, asked about it, Lilia hesitated for a moment before speaking somewhat anxiously.","[......Errr, Luna? The person Kaito-san is going to go around the Founding Festival together with...... “Who was it again”?]","[Eh? What are you talking about, Milady? Miyama-sama properly informed us about this beforehand, didn’t he? You know, it’s...... errr...... Oya? That’s strange. I’m confident in my memory, but I seem to have completely forgotten about it. That being the case, shall we go and ask him?]","[Ahh, no, Kaito-san might already be asleep, so there’s no need for that. I can’t seem to remember either, but I am certain I heard about who he will be with beforehand, so it should be fine.]","It was inevitable that the two couldn’t remember who was accompanying Kaito. After all, the two of them were informed in advance by Kaito that he was planning to visit Hydra Kingdom’s Founding Festival with Alice.","However, in this dimension, such a premise had changed, resulting in their current state where “they know that Kaito will be accompanied by someone, but not being able to recall who that someone is”.","Nevertheless, Lilia and Lunamaria remained optimistic. They believed that since they had confirmed this in advance, there shouldn’t be any problems...... unaware that “Shiro had presented Kaito the method of creating another dimension and going around with him, only after Kaito informed Lilia and the others”......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [I see, they have the memories of what had happened until the day before the Founding Festival, but the “Kaito going around with Alice” section in their memories seemed to have blurred...... Even so, as to be expected of the Strongest Stomachache Warrior...... With how optimistic Lilia is being, the Law of Stomachaches is gonna go strong in this one......]"]},{"number":1671,"title":"Chapter 1671: Re: Founding Festival 3","paragraphs":["Early in the morning on the day of the Hydra Kingdom’s Founding Festival, Lilia, who had been invited to the ceremony, came to the designated place by teleportation using her special magic tool.","Although there was still some time before the start of the Founding Festival ceremony, she visited the place early because she had to make preliminary greetings. Even so, it’s not necessary to arrive the day before unlike back in Archlesia Empire, so it’s somewhat carefree......","[......Unnn?]","[What’s the matter, Lili?]","[Ahh, no, it’s just that the air around feels somewhat tense...... I have a bad feeling about this.]","Lilia, accompanied by Sieglinde as her guard and Lunamaria as her aide, has come for a visit as a trio. Upon arriving in Hydra Kingdom, a rather dubious expression immediately appeared on Lilia’s face, prompting Sieglinde to ask her about it...... However, Lilia herself didn’t seem to understand the cause of her uneasy premonition and was unable to give a proper response.","[Fumu...... Luna, do you feel anything?]","[No, not really...... If Lili’s the one having a bad premonition, could it be that some unexpected event may occur or there could be a chance encounter with a high-ranking individual?]","[Please stop with the unpleasant assumptions. Well, I also have this hunch, but I don’t really have a specific basis for it...... For the time being, shall we go and greet King Laguna?]","She felt somewhat uneasy upon not being able to find a clear answer, but even though couldn’t shake off the unpleasant feeling, she quickly regained her composure and headed into the royal castle.","The guests, including Lilia, were given a magic tool that would allow them to teleport to an area near the castle, and since the castle was just a stone’s throw away, they would soon arrive there.","And it seemed like they arrived at a good moment in which Laguna was ready to meet them, as they were led directly to the room where she was staying.","After they saw off the guide who left with a bow, Lilia knocked on the door before entering the room.","[......Excuse my intrusion. Your Majesty Laguna, I have come to greet...... you?]","[......Ohh, young Lilia...... Young Lunamaria and young Sieglinde are also with you huh...... I’m glad you came, welcome.]","[U- Umm, Your Majesty Laguna? Are you alright?]","Signs of exhaustion were clearly evident in Laguna’s face that Lilia couldn’t help pointing it out, and even at a glance, she was completely worn out.","However, such a thing raises doubts in Lilia’s mind. Lilia was well aware that Laguna is the strongest in the Human Realm and was among the few powerful beings in the world as a whole.","Even if she were to fight relentlessly for three days and three nights without rest, Laguna possessed overwhelming physical strength to the point where she wouldn’t get tired that much. Therefore, Laguna’s current exhaustion seemed more likely to be mental rather than physical...... That said, considering Laguna’s cunning that belied her appearance from living for a long time and her mental strength, it was unimaginable that she would be so exhausted in the presence of Lilia that she couldn’t even keep up appearances.",".","[......Ahh, my bad. I’ve shown you quite an unseemly side. Well, last night, I went through a rather mentally challenging situation...... Haha, as expected, even I couldn’t help being thoroughly exhausted. Ahh, we were exchanging greetings, right?]","[......Your Majesty Laguna, my apologies, but I have a very bad feeling about this, so I’d like to leave and not attend......]","[Whoa there, young Lilia, that’s an extremely rude thing to do...... Young Lilia and I, we are close buddies, aren’t we? Please don’t speak of such unsympathetic words.]","[No, it’s just that attending this event is, well, my instincts...... or rather, my stomach is reacting very quickly, so I have a bad feeling about this.]","Convinced that her earlier bad premonition wasn’t mistaken, Lilia felt like returning to her mansion and shut herself in as soon as possible.","The hardships she had endured up to this point were like a premonition warning her. If she stays in this place, she will get into a situation that will lead to her stomach getting a lot of hurting......","In response to Lilia’s words, Laguna rose from her seat with a gentle smile on her lips, and placing her hands on Lilia’s shoulders, she firmly grasped them.","[Hahaha...... I shall not let you escape...... For such a time when it really matters, I definitely want young Lilia to be here.]","[Geez, you saying that “for such a time when it really matters” really makes me anxious though!? Seriously, what in the world is going on!?]","[............Do you want to know?]","[I don’t want to know! Please let me go home!!!]","Laguna restrained Lilia, who was still desperately resisting, with all her strength. Such a thing is possible because both of their strengths are somewhat evenly matched, but for Lilia, it also means that her escape route has been blocked.","Laguna and Lilia usually engage in a sparring match once a month. They have a fair amount of interactions and are on good terms, making their current relationship quite comfortable. However, in a sense, this familiarity may be causing Lilia an unexpected disaster.","Thereupon, with a gentle smile that only made Lilia feel shivers, Laguna spoke.","[......I heard that Shallow Vernal-sama is going to be here for the Founding Festival.]","[..........................]","The moment she heard those words, Lilia absentmindedly looked at the distance, her face dyed with despair. The fact that one of her hands unconsciously pressed down on her stomach was perhaps, in a sense, inevitable.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [If things are like that, it’s likely that the Gods are going to arrive the day before and set up tight security and precautions...... Ahh, wait, so that’s why Lilia had a bad feeling the moment they arrived huh......]"]},{"number":1672,"title":"Chapter 1672: Re: Founding Festival 4","paragraphs":["The God of the World, Shallow Vernal, is coming for the Founding Festival. When Lilia heard these words from Laguna, she almost lost consciousness for a moment.","Lilia had said earlier that she had a bad feeling about the current situation and wanted to leave immediately, but now that she had heard Shallow Vernal’s name from Laguna, she no longer had the option of leaving. If she were to leave now upon hearing Shallow Vernal’s name, it could be seen as an act of fleeing in fear, and such an act of disrespect wouldn’t be overlooked even for Lilia, who was held in high esteem in the God Realm.","Therefore, her option of returning home disappeared. Feeling a knot in her stomach over this, Lilia turned to Laguna and asked.","[S- Shallow Vernal-sama? S- She will be attending?]","[No, she’s apparently not coming to attend...... It’s more like she’s going to look around the Founding Festival.]","[......That definitely sounds like she’s not going around on her own.]","[Yeah, she’s obviously going around with Kaito.]","[............As I thought.]","In the first place, Shallow Vernal originally never visits the Human Realm outside of the Festival of Heroes. Therefore, it goes without saying that she has never attended any of the past Founding Festivals.","Thus, Lilia could tell that behind the situation of Shallow Vernal coming to the Founding Festival is undoubtedly the World’s Singularity Kaito, and an indescribable expression appeared on her face.","[Last night, Goddess of Time-sama suddenly appeared, looking apologetic, and conveyed this to me. After that, things had been quite hectic. In fact, most of the Higher and Lower-ranked Gods have already come, most of them having disguised themselves. The power of Goddess of Fate-sama has made it impossible for us to know who is where though.]","[I now understand why Her Majesty Laguna looked so tired.]","What came to Lilia’s mind was the scene of the date Shallow Vernal and Kaito had in the past. She distinctly remembers that during that time, the frenzied Gods had come in full force to Symphonia Kingdom’s Royal Capital, establishing an iron wall formation.","Anyhow, the Gods adhere to Shallow Vernal’s absolute authority and do not tolerate any disrespect towards her. To ensure readiness for anything, they swiftly deployed defenses across the Founding Festival venue overnight, with the three Supreme Gods taking command.","[No, I really empathize with the pain you’re feeling down in your stomach, young Lilia. After all, we can hardly take any action regarding this matter. If we act recklessly and end up disrupting Kaito’s date, there’s a possibility that it could bring about Shallow Vernal-sama’s displeasure.]","[Indeed. Moreover, it’s really hard to read Shallow Vernal-sama’s behavior when she’s with Kaito-san...... Ahh, seriously, why is this happening......]","[Even so, judging by your reaction, it seems like you are also unaware, young Lilia...... I thought it really was quite abrupt, but given Kaito’s personality, I assumed he had informed young Lilia beforehand...... No, I certainly was the one who invited Kaito. I asked him to come and invite someone to go with him. I did tell him that...... but I never thought he’d actually bring Shallow Vernal-sama......]","Although she felt a sharp pain in her stomach, Lilia couldn’t complain as she looked at Laguna, who was now holding her head, tracing the situation back to the fact that it was her who had initially urged Kaito to come to the Founding Festival. At that moment, a question suddenly popped into Lilia’s mind.","Lilia had heard in advance from Kaito that he would be going around the Founding Festival with someone. However, she had somehow forgotten who he was going with.","(......I have heard about him going around with Shallow Vernal-sama but forgot about it? No, as expected, that’s just...... Wait, was I so shocked that, in order to protect myself from the stomachache, it completely slipped off my memories?)",".","Lilia distinctly remembers that she had talked to Kaito about this beforehand. She also recalls being satisfied with the explanation he gave during that conversation, so she can’t complain to Kaito.","Unaware that they were both in another dimension, both Lilia and Laguna gently put their hands on their stomachs.","While Lilia and Laguna were associating with each other through their stomach aches, the person in question, Kaito, was......","[......Errr, Shiro-san?]","[What is it?]","[Why are we starting our date from the Sanctuary?]","[Because today is “Pattern B”.]","[......Hmm?]","For some reason, before heading out to the Founding Festival, he was having breakfast with Shallow Vernal in the Sanctuary.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Even in another dimension, Stomachache Warriors are Stomachache Warriors. Moreover, Lilia distinctly retains the memory of having heard Kaito’s explanation beforehand and being satisfied with it, so it’s difficult for her to voice any complaints...... Well, in the first place, once the Founding Festival ends, things would return back to how it was in the legitimate dimension, with both of them not actually having had any stomachaches, so I guess it should be okay......]"]},{"number":1673,"title":"Chapter 1673: Re: Founding Festival 5","paragraphs":["On the morning of the day of Hydra Kingdom’s Founding Festival, I’m currently in the Sanctuary for some reason. No, I was called by Shiro-san right after I woke up, so I only got to change and get myself ready...... I don’t understand why I was called at this moment when there’s still time until the start of the Founding Festival, nor do I know the meaning of the breakfast that was placed in front of me as if it was the most obvious thing in the world.","Well, since she had prepared it for me, I guess I’ll go eat some breakfast. It was a simple but delicious-looking breakfast made out of a croissant, soup, and salad, and immediately taking a bite of the croissant, I became speechless at how delicious it was.","Eh? What is this? It’s too delicious. Of course, it was soft and fluffy, but it was also very much to my liking. I think this was probably something Shiro-san created, as it left me almost just as shocked as when I drank Glorious Tea.","[I’m glad you liked it.]","[Yes, it’s very tasty...... Ah, no, this aside, what’s that Pattern B?]","I was in a trance from the deliciousness of the food, but when I heard Shiro-san’s voice, I mentioned something that had popped into my mind a while ago. Shiro-san said that calling me to the Sanctuary was Pattern B, but I guess there’s also Pattern A?","[My Pattern A was executed on our previous date.]","[Unnn? Which means?]","[It’s one where we meet up and head out on our date. The previous exchange “Did you wait? No, I just got here.” falls into Pattern A.]","With those words, I felt like I began to understand what Shiro-san was trying to say. Was she perhaps talking about patterns for the start of a date?","Pattern A would be where we would meet up at a set location before heading out on our date, while Pattern B would be when we meet up first, then head to our date together.","[You’re mistaken.]","[Eh? That wasn’t it?]","[Yes. Pattern A was just as you said, but Pattern B is one where “we live together and go out together”.]","[............Eh? No...... We aren’t living together though?]","[Indeed, we aren’t.]","[......No, no! When you agree to that, all you’re getting is more question marks from me though!?]","As expected of Shiro-san, she’s fully exhibiting how much of a natural airhead she is, as she continues to leave my head in a state of perpetual confusion.","[And so, taking the form of living together...... We’re having breakfast together.]","[I- Is that so...... No, well, I don’t really mind if Shiro-san’s fine with that...... Rather, in the first place, why go for such a pattern?]","[In preparation for this date, I did some studying. I obtained reference materials through a deal with Earth God, and firmly grasped the knowledge within it, so one could call me the Love Master now.]","[......Reference materials?]","[Here they are.]","Saying this, Shiro-san made multiple books appear on the table...... but no matter how I look at them, they just look like romance mangas. Errr, so basically, she studied by reading romance mangas? Well, I feel like mangas in that genre tend to be quite exaggerated. Like, they are meant to be stories read by readers, making events there more dramatic than they usually may be, so I don’t really think they’re suitable for reference...... Also, I can’t help feeling a bit uneasy about the situation where Shiro-san had apparently acquired a certain level of knowledge in something.","[Well, of course, these are just for reference. They don’t depict how it was like between me and Kaito-san, so I plan to play things by the ear in that regard.]","[O- Ohh, it’s a bit bewildering when you suddenly started saying something very sensible compared to how it was before...... Well, I approve of that. Doing things too rigidly according to a set pattern can make things awkward, so I think it’s best we take things casually and have fun.]","I felt a little more anxious for a moment, but Shiro-san has matured a lot compared to before, and from what she said, I think I should be able to rest easy to some extent.","......It’s just, things would be alright, right? Her airheadedness won’t just spark out and she won’t start saying weird things, right? It really would be great...... if things really turn out alright.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Hmm? What do you think of this pattern?]","? ? ? : [I’m not quite certain about this. With Kaito-san being optimistic, he definitely just raised a flag, but since he seems to be being cautious, then contrary to what Kaito-san is being vigilant about, this could be a pattern where Shallow Vernal-sama acts sensibly.]"]},{"number":1674,"title":"Chapter 1674: Re: Founding Festival 6","paragraphs":["Well, whether our departure method is Pattern A and B, it will not make that much difference. In the end, the Founding Festival is very lively, making it difficult for us to meet up on-site, so it’s more likely to arrange to meet up beforehand.","No, Shiro-san would be able to meet up with me in any way she wanted, but that didn’t mean there was anything wrong with that.","After finishing a delicious breakfast, we chit-chatted a bit, and at the right moment, we set off.","[It’s almost time for the festival to start, so shall we head out?]","[Indeed. It may now indeed be a good time to depart.]","Nodding at my suggestion, Shiro-san got up from her seat. Thereupon, the table and chairs disappeared and our preparations for departure were ready in an instant.","All that’s left to do is to head to the venue with Shiro-san’s Teleportation...... but Shiro-san just stares at me, showing no sign of intending to teleport.","I’ll say this now, but it’s impossible for me to teleport the two of us myself. The Sanctuary has strong teleportation inhibitors, so normal Teleportation Magic Tools can’t be used here. I have the gate-type magic tool in my room that allows teleportation to the Sanctuary, but I can only use it to return from the Sanctuary, not to teleport to other locations from there.","[......Umm, Shiro-san? Aren’t we leaving?]","[We will, but before that, aren’t you forgetting something important?]","[Eh? Something important?]","What is it? I just couldn’t immediately think of what she was talking about. It’s just, from my hunch based on my days together with Shiro-san, I just knew that she was going to say something strange.","[We can’t leave without our before-departure-kiss.]","[......Hmm?]","Whoa, so that’s what’s popping out huh. I see, I see, that certainly is a classic...... Can I throw my tsukkomi now? That’s for the scenario where one person is leaving and the other person is seeing them off, isn’t it!?","At least, it’s not the kind of thing two people do when they’re about to head out together.","[Fumu, is that how it is?]","[No, well, that scenario is more for newlyweds rather than a couple living together, but it’s certainly a common situation for when they’re about to depart, a classic even. It’s just, it isn’t really the kind of situation for when two people were departing together.]","[Even if it simply said “before departure”, it can have various meanings depending on the context huh. I see, it’s quite complex, isn’t it?]","[Right. Well then, now that the question at hand has been settled, shall we depart?]","[No, we still haven’t had our before-departure-kiss, so we can’t depart yet.]","......Well, that’s strange, are we going on a loop here? I should have explained that that doesn’t apply in the current situation, to which Shiro-san agreed and nodded.","And yet, with you responding with almost the same words, what was that “I see” of yours earlier responding to!?","[No, I understood exactly what Kaito-san meant. Including the fact that it doesn’t apply in the current situation.]","[Eh? Then......]","[Leaving that aside, I still want to kiss, so understanding that and not kissing are two separate issues.]","[.....................]","I probably have a face that clearly looks speechless right now. Without any particular logic or reasoning behind it, it was a simple, straightforward response powering her way forward which can sometimes feel refreshing.","No, I fully understood what she was saying, but when she said “Leaving that aside, I still want to kiss”...... I couldn’t really bring out any counter arguments from my side.","[......................]","[......Errr, t- then, if you’ll excuse me for a bit.]","[Enough with all that excuse me’s and just go ahead already.]","[No, that’s a bit......]","Faced with Shiro-san’s gaze, expectantly looking at me, I conceded defeat. Following Shiro-san’s request, I placed my hand on her shoulders and gently leaned in for a light, chaste kiss on her lips.","If it’s a before-departure-kiss, then something like this would be appropriate...... Also, kissing Shiro-san is something so pleasurable that it can be dangerous if I don’t consciously decide how far to go beforehand, as it can be hard to stop once I start kissing her.","[It’s not like you have to stop though? These are lips you are free to do as you pleased, you know?]","[......F- For the time being, let’s just depart!]","[Fumu, I understand.]","It’s both charming and somewhat terrifying that Shiro-san can casually say things like that. Feeling my face flush a bit, I headed towards Hydra Kingdom once again, this time to experience their Founding Festival with Shiro-san.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [S- She actually went with a surprise attack. T- Throwing a curveball right from the start, this guy really is dangerous......]"]},{"number":1675,"title":"Chapter 1675: Re: Founding Festival 7","paragraphs":["In one corner of the Royal Capital of Hydra Kingdom, overlooking the entire Royal Capital with a serious expression up in the sky, were the three Supreme Gods: Chronois, Fate and Life.","After having arranged the high-ranked and low-ranked Gods in various locations since the day before in preparation for the Founding Festival where Shallow Vernal declared she would be having her date with Kaito, they had gathered for a final check as the time for the event that was about to begin.","[As expected, the venue only has a certain set of scale. It’s impossible to assemble all the Gods like we did back in Symphonia, and there are also the regular participants in the event.]","[With my Authority, I made it so the people were generally unable to notice, approach, or speak to Shallow Vernal-sama...... However, there’s nothing I can do in situations where Shallow Vernal-sama herself approaches them.]","[We can only be helpless in that aspect. Shallow Vernal-sama’s will takes precedence over everything else. It’s just, my concern would be the possibility of them suddenly teleporting to another location, similar to what happened last time, which could potentially delay our response. I think we should prepare for contingencies as much as possible......]","What comes to the minds of the three is the memory of Shallow Vernal’s previous date in the Symphonia Kingdom, where despite their meticulous preparations, Shallow Vernal’s airheadedness got triggered, suddenly deciding to move the date towards the beach, and resulting in most of their efforts being in vain. This time, they made various assumptions to ensure that such a thing would not happen again.","After discussing several future patterns and concluding that there shouldn’t be a problem to some extent, Chronois spoke.","[It’s about to begin...... I hope things go off without a hitch......]","[Right. It would be best if Shallow Vernal-sama enjoys herself but...... Oya? God of Fate, that’s a complicated expression you’re having there. Is something the matter? Is something bothering you?]","[......Unnn. As expected, saying it now...... would be rough huh......]","The plan is already set, and currently, both Shallow Vernal and Kaito have yet to arrive, so there should be no issues...... but Fate seemed to be lost in thought, displaying seriousness that was unimaginable from her usual demeanor.","Such an expression held this certain sense of dignity to it, making Chronois and Life feel that “Fate really was the one who had grown the most among the Supreme Gods”. Perhaps, she could see things that were not visible to them......","[God of Fate, if you find something essential, just say it. We may be inexperienced compared to you, but we are still Supreme Gods, and there are lots of things we can help out with.]","[Yes, you can leave the support to us. But first, we would still need you to share some information. Tell us, God of Fate...... What is this worrying matter you have that makes you have such a stiff expression on your face?]","[............Eh?]","[ [ Eh? ] ]","Seeing Fate being lost in serious contemplation, Chronois and Life earnestly conveyed their strong determination through their eyes, but Fate, looking puzzled, tilted her head in response.","[Worrying matter? Eh? What are you talking about?]","[U- Unnn? Just now, you had something on your mind regarding Shallow Vernal-sama’s date, which is why you had a troubled expression on your face, right?]","[......Not really though?]","[......T- Then, why in the world did you have that expression on your face?]","Fate clearly looked confused at their words, but even more confused than her were Chronois and Life. By observing Fate’s reaction, they could understand that they had disparities in their perceptions. Even if that were the case though, they just couldn’t understand why Fate, who can be described as a laid-back person except when something concerns Shallow Vernal, had such a serious expression on her face.","Hearing Life’s questioning words, Fate looked away somewhat awkwardly.","[Ahh~~ Well, you see...... This is another dimension, right? It’s another dimension that branched off on the premise that Kai-chan invited Shallow Vernal-sama to the Founding Festival...... making a promise to Shallow Vernal-sama to attend the festival with her, right?]","[That’s right. Except for changing the part about who Miyama’s companion is, there’s nothing else changed from the original dimension. As for things related to Miyama’s companion, some memories have been altered to avoid certain contradictions, but overall, such understanding is correct. What of it?]","[......Well...... If that’s the case, I also want to have a festival date with Kai-chan...... but I thought, saying that now would be too late huh......]","[ [ ....................... ] ]","Upon hearing the words Fate apologetically said, veins involuntarily popped out of Chronois and Life’s foreheads. However, they understood that this was just them simply making misunderstandings and that Fate had no intention to mislead them or cause confusion, so they could only suppress their surging emotions.","[......Ahh~~ You know...... Let’s just concentrate on what’s going on here, okay?]","[Yeah, let’s do that......]","After an indescribable and complicated atmosphere passed among the three, they immediately sensed the arrival of Shallow Vernal and Kaito. In that instant, the expression of the three changed and all their attention focused on the couple on their date.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Ahh, I see, if she had realized this earlier and asked Shiro, she might have been able to benefit from the SUPER WIN SYSTEM as well...... Stop thinking up scary ideas, seriously......]"]},{"number":1676,"title":"Chapter 1676: Re: Founding Festival 8","paragraphs":["I finally arrived at the Hydra Kingdom’s Founding Festival...... for the second time. No, well, it’s not like I had a hard time arriving here because teleportation only takes a moment, and I was here before I knew it.","And the day before yesterday? No, strictly speaking, it wasn’t the day before yesterday, with only my senses feeling that way, but in any case, just as I thought back on the day I arrived here with Alice, there sure are a lot of people here.","I know that Shiro-san isn’t noticed by other people because of the high level of Recognition Inhibition Magic around her, but even so, the situation of Shiro-san being in the middle of a city is just so absurd that it makes me feel strangely nervous about this.","Well, I guess Chronois-san and the others would be more nervous than I am......","[There sure are a lot of people, don’t you think, Shiro-sa...... Eh?]","[What’s the matter, Kaito-san? Is something bothering you, like my clothes? My outfit? My attire?]","What surprised me as I turned around was that Shiro-san’s outfit had somehow changed. No, even though I knew Shiro-san could easily pull off something like that, it was quite surprising seeing her wearing a different outfit after we teleported. Well, given how much Shiro-san’s trying to appeal, I noticed the change immediately...... I mean, she is dressed quite differently from usual after all.","The reason is that Shiro-san now wears jeans-like trousers, perhaps for ease of movement, going for a casual style. For her top, she was wearing a white shirt and a cardigan-like jacket, and her hair was tied in a ponytail.","The atmosphere Shiro-san had had completely changed from what she usually had, and with her like that, even if she were recognized, I had a feeling others wouldn’t realize it was Shiro-san...... No, her visual impact might be too striking for them to notice.","Well, that aside, seeing Shiro-san wearing different clothes like this...... makes me realize all over again that she really looks good in anything. Her personal specs are just too high, and those long legs and outstanding stylishness make the pants style a perfect harmony of coolness and beauty.","[Please don’t misunderstand, this is just A-style.]","[U- Unnn? What do you mean?]","[While we’re at it, I’m going to change my outfit along the way. I’ve studied fashion, so I want to try out different outfits....... You can shower me with compliments each time, you know? Compliments make me happy. I think now would be the opportune moment, don’t you think?]","[......Well, it really does suit you incredibly well. Not only do you look beautiful, you also look cool. While it’s true that Shiro-san looks good in anything, I’m delighted to become aware of a different charm in Shiro-san than usual.]","For the time being, it seems like she’s apparently changing outfits along our date, and well, if it’s Shiro-san, she can definitely pull that off, and considering the effort she put into studying, I understand her desire to try various things.","And as for praising her outfit, with my girlfriend being so stylish, there was no way I wouldn’t compliment her. And so, when I honestly gave her my word of praise, Shiro-san nodded her head in satisfaction.","[......It’s more pleasing to my ears than I thought, so I’d like to ask for a few more compliments.]","Whoa there, she went and demanded refills of compliments. Saying such a thing so matter-of-factly is truly just like Shiro-san.","[Errr, your top is also stylish and nice. Shiro-san’s jacket complements your style well, leaning towards an elegant rather than a casual look, surprisingly suiting Shiro-san. Well, to be honest, being able to have Shiro-san, who is endowed with beauty, coolness and beauty, as my lover, I’m really fortunate...... How about that?]","After I gave her additional words of praise as she requested, Shiro-san seemed to be quite satisfied, with the corners of her lips slightly raised, seemingly content and happy. For the time being, I’m just glad I could bring a smile to her face...... but just when I was thinking that, I found my eyes widening the next moment.","After all, beyond my field of vision, there was suddenly this enormous “DOYA” emerging from the sea, rising up towards the sky and disappearing behind the clouds.","......Unbelievable. In that split second just now, I’m pretty sure she just caused significant distress to several people’s stomachs. After all, unlike back when everyone went to play on the beach, we’re currently in the midst of Hydra Kingdom’s Founding Festival in their Royal Capital. Many people would definitely witness that DOYA just now.","For the general public, the letters...... No, the Japanese letters that suddenly emerged from the sea were too large for them to think they were letters, but still, they witnessed a mysterious gigantic object suddenly rising from the sea into the sky. Laguna-san and the others would obviously see it as well.","If anything, the slight restlessness I was sensing around me was definitely not just my imagination, so Laguna-san and the others were probably holding their heads in their hands, trying to figure out how to deal with this situation.","Chronois-san and the other Gods are probably troubled too. There’s no way they can just explain to Laguna-san and the others that those giant letters that appeared were a result of Shiro-san acting all smug, so she’s probably trying to come up with a clever way to handle this...... Laguna-san, Chronois-san...... I’m worried about their stomachs.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Humongous 3D letters rising from the sea to the sky...... That scene’s just too surreal. Neun and the others who know Japanese would probably be staring blankly at it now.]"]},{"number":1677,"title":"Chapter 1677: Re: Founding Festival 9","paragraphs":["In a room in the Royal Castle of Hydra Kingdom, King Laguna was looking out the window with a stunned expression unimaginable from her usual self, her mouth so wide open that her jaw would fall off.","Of course, the cause of the incident was the humongous letters that had just appeared from under the sea and ascended to the skies. That said, she is also a veteran warrior. After a few moments, seemingly having realized something, she began to ponder...... before holding her head in her hands.","[......W- W- W- What am I supposed to do here!? If they do such a thing in such a flashy manner, how am I supposed to gloss over that...... Rather, in the first place, what the heck was that!? That seemed like letters from Hikari’s world......]","[That’s definitely Shallow Vernal-sama’s doing. From what I heard from Kaito-san, Shallow Vernal-sama seems to like making those giant letters appear, and apparently does it frequently. I remember seeing it several times myself.]","In response to the shaken Laguna, Lilia, who in the end, was unable to escape...... currently together with Laguna in the office due to her strong request, murmured. While her expression showed surprise at the unexpected situation, Lilia seemed relatively calm compared to Laguna, perhaps due to being somewhat accustomed to such abrupt events.","[It’s a good thing that Shallow Vernal-sama was in a good mood....... but how am I supposed to explain that to the citizens? It’s something that people can misunderstand as terrorism...... but Shallow Vernal-sama is essentially acting incognito...... Putting aside whether she intends to keep herself concealed from others, as she’s currently going around incognito, I’m unable to bring up her name to others......]","[I think it should be fine. As I mentioned earlier, that style of expression is frequently used by Shallow Vernal-sama. In that case, it’s not unreasonable to assume that Chronois-sama and the other Gods are aware of it, and they’ll likely take swift action to address the situation...... Wouldn’t it be a good idea to push through with it being part of the Founding Festival?]","[Ohh! As expected of young Lilia, you’re calm even before such a situation.]","[......It’s a sorrowful story, but my experience in dealing with such situations is on a different level. Also, I’m saying this as someone experienced...... but I think this is only the beginning.]","[Can you not say such frightening things......]","Lilia is someone who has overcome various stomach-aching events in the past, so to some extent, she has a tolerance for them. Well, speaking of this particular situation, it’s primarily Laguna who is suffering from stomach troubles, and Lilia, who is in the position of a guest, has relatively less harm directed at her, which contributes to her composure.","Even though under normal circumstances, this should almost be entirely unrelated to her, but being put in a position similar to Laguna’s counselor and thus being significantly affected is nothing short of amazing.","Meanwhile, the three Supreme Gods who were waiting in the sky above saw the huge letters and immediately began to act.","[It appeared much earlier than expected. It seemed that those letters were just for show, not having any actual substance to it. It had no impact whatsoever on the ocean...... So it’s possible it was produced with Illusion Magic.]","[It’s a relief that she hadn’t actually created a physical object. Her producing such a thing would have been a bit cumbersome...... God of Time and Space!]","[Yeah, we will deal with this situation according to Case 47. God of Fate, I’m counting on your support with your Authority.]","As Lilia had predicted, the Gods had also predicted that Shallow Vernal would express herself using such 3D letters, and they had already prepared a response for each pattern.","After the three of them finished checking quickly, Chronois quickly turned to the High-ranking God who was waiting behind them. The long-haired woman with her eyes covered by a large cloth is the God of Thoughts, Omoikane, a God under Chronois’ direct supervision, serving as a conduit for communication towards the High-ranking Gods and Low-ranking Gods.","[God of Thoughts, it’s Case 47!]","[Understood.]","Hearing Chronois’ words, Omoikane immediately put her hands together, seemingly praying. With her Authority, the High-ranking Gods and Low-ranking Gods are now in sync with each other’s thoughts, allowing them to share information in real-time.","(Everyone, we are dealing with a Case 47.)","(Understood. Since it manifested in the sea, I will go.)","(Since the sky is also involved, me and God of Ocean will handle it, so we’ll require replacements in our current position......)","(They’re already on their way. Both of you directly head to that spot.)","After swiftly concluding the necessary exchanges, immediately following, 3D letters emerged from the sea where the enormous appeared earlier, displaying the words “Hydra Kingdom Founding Festival begins” in the language of this world, rising into the sky in a similar manner. Simultaneously, numerous water pillars rose from the sea, accompanied by various performances, including beautiful water arches and more.","“What is taking place in the sea is a production using the latest magic tools. Please be assured that no actual waves will be generated from it.”","Next, an announcement was broadcast throughout the entire Royal Capital using Amplification Magic, summarizing that the earlier display, including the letters from before, was a surprise production using the latest magic tools. Some of the Low-ranking Gods have also already moved to the royal castle to provide explanations to Laguna.","[......For the time being, we’ve weathered the first wave...... roughly......]","[I hope things will go peacefully as it is now......]","[That really depends on Shallow Vernal-sama. We’re in a position where we can only react to her actions, so we could only stay prepared and be ready to respond at a moment’s notice.]","They can’t predict at all what actions Shallow Vernal will take. Despite having Kaito by her side, who can potentially control her actions to some extent, unexpected situations will definitely arise.","Their expressions turning serious, the Supreme Gods shifted their focus back to the Royal Capital.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......She’s the Duchess whose stomach has gone through hell and back...... She definitely got a different look on her face.]","? ? ? : [It’s really amazing how she was supposed to have nothing to do with the situation, but somehow got caught up and ended up in a position where it looks like she’s gonna get involved with everything that happens.]"]},{"number":1678,"title":"Chapter 1678: Re: Founding Festival 10","paragraphs":["<Author’s Notes>","I have to leave early tomorrow and don’t have time, so today’s chapter will be short.","Just as Shiro-san made those giant letters emerge from the sea, some kind of water performance began immediately afterwards, and we heard a voice through Amplification Magic, saying it was a production to commemorate the start of the Founding Festival.","The speed of their follow-up was unbelievable. It was so quick and precise that even I, who can grasp, or rather, who can understand the full extent of the Gods’ efforts, thought it was just a normal production.","[......Fumu. Not bad of a cooperation. This dimension isn’t the original one, but I feel joy in being able to sense and experience their growth like this.]","Saying this, Shiro-san nodded her head in satisfaction...... No, you do understand they’re following up on your actions, right!? No, from Shiro-san’s point of view, she must be pleased to see the coordination between the Gods getting stronger after the White God Festival, and I could tell she was feeling parental joy from witnessing their growth.","Besides, I’m sure the Gods don’t think of this as any sort of hardship either, and if they heard what Shiro-san just said, they’d probably cry and rejoice....... Unnn? I guess there’s no problem with it then?","[Well, for the time being, let’s get ourselves back on track. Shall we depart?]","[Indeed. Whoa, Kaito-san, it’s a disaster.]","[Yeah, yeah, your hand is free, yes? Then, let’s hold hands.]","I’ve already known Shiro-san for a reasonably long time...... No, well, compared to Shiro-san’s other acquaintances, the time I’ve known her might be relatively short, but considering we’re dating, we are much closer than the others. That’s why I believe I understand Shiro-san quite well.","In this scenario, if she were to start with such words, her next words would be “My hands are still available”, but when I went ahead and proposed holding hands, holding out my hand to her, I could see Shiro-san unusually looking shocked.","[Oya, Kaito-san has suddenly learned how to read minds?]","[It’s not that I read your mind, it’s more of a prediction based on past experience. Well, considering I also believe I know Shiro-san quite well as your lover, I’d at least be able to understand such a thing.]","[Fumu...... You know me better than anyone else, that’s quite a bold line for you to say.]","[Did I go that far with my words......?]","[To sum it up, you’re declaring “Shiro-san is mine” huh.]","[What kind of leap in logic led you to that!?]","I reflexively threw back a tsukkomi in response to her ridiculous leap in logic, but then I noticed something. Shiro-san’s voice is still as inflectionless as usual, but the corners of her lips are still slightly upturned and her remarks are even more absurd than usual.","This is just my guess, but I think she’s so happy that she got so excited. It seems she had gotten particularly thrilled when I anticipated Shiro-san’s wish and acted accordingly.","[However, it’s a fact that I’m yours though?]","[Ahaha, that is, well, it’s an honor...... Anyhow, let’s go.]","[Yes, well then, I’ll leave escorting me to you.]","Wryly smiling at such a Shiro-san, I intertwined my fingers with hers and started walking. The Founding Festival had just begun, and as I contemplated where we should go first, casting a sideways glance at the cheerful Shiro-san, a small smile formed on my lips.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [The Author’s definitely gonna change ’s subtitle and reset the count to 1...... I know my stuff! This world is designed to make me suffer!!!]","? ? ? : [That’s right.]"]},{"number":1679,"title":"Chapter 1679: Founding Festival with Shallow Vernal 1","paragraphs":["As soon as we arrived, well, there was a bit of a mess, but for the time being, I held hands with Shiro-san and we set out for the Founding Festival.","However, it sure feels strange seeing Shiro-san walking through the streets bustling with festivities like this.","[In the first place, this is the first time for me to walk around a festival venue like this.]","[Well, that’s what I thought. In that case, wouldn’t it be better if we go for the common street food stalls rather than the unusual ones? Shiro-san, do you have any places you’d like to visit or street food you’d like to try?]","I’ve already been here with Alice once, so I plan to prioritize Shiro-san’s preferences. She certainly did create a stall-like atmosphere in the Sanctuary, where we enjoyed the ambiance, set off fireworks, and such, but I want Shiro-san, who is experiencing a festival like this for the first time, to have as much as possible.","[I see, then I’d like to go to the food stalls where we can have a high level of flirting.]","[......H- Hmmm.]","The fact that she demanded for something with a high level of flirting with a straight face is very typical of Shiro-san, but I could only feel troubled by this request.","No, it’s not that I have any complaints about the flirting part. In fact, if I can have a lover-like flirting time with Shiro-san, that’s something I will enjoy too.","However, when she asks for food stalls with a high level of flirting...... Nothing comes to mind.","For example, sharing something between the two of us, eating it together might seem like something couples do, but if that’s the case, we can just do it at any food stall, so doing such a thing shouldn’t be a problem.","[Hmmm, I can’t think of anything right away.]","[Fumu...... Don’t worry. Anticipating that this might happen, I have increased my knowledge on this matter.]","[......Ah, errr, I guess so. I’d be grateful if you told me what you’d like in a more specific way......]","[I presume the act of eating soft-serve ice cream together, each from one side, had a significant degree of flirtiness in it.]","[.....................]","Well, she said something quite outrageous there...... Should we go with that though...... Should we go for the full-on idiot couple way of eating in a crowded venue like this?","Shiro-san is under the veil of an Authority, providing an effect similar to Recognition Inhibition Magic, so no one will notice her...... but I end up being recognized as “that guy who’s acting like an idiot coup with a girl in a bustling place”, wouldn’t I!? No, of course we’d move to a position where we wouldn’t disturb the traffic to some extent, but the embarrassment I feel from doing that is still tremendous......","[......Ahh, no, I’d also like to grant Shiro-san’s wish, but from what I saw last time, there was no soft-serve ice cream stall around. It’s difficult to find a place that serves them in a venue like this, and we can’t do much when something isn’t available......]","Fortunately, there was no such thing as a soft-serve ice cream stall here. Rather, soft-serve ice creams are made using magic tools in this world, so they’re a considerably expensive treat.","Compared to mechanical products, magic tools are expensive, so it’s almost impossible to find them at festivals like this, partly because it would cost them too much to set up a stall.","Since we could only be helpless when something doesn’t exist...... I’m sorry for Shiro-san, but I’m a little relieved.","However, my relief turned out to be short-lived. Shiro-san shifted her gaze slightly and looking up towards the sky, she muttered.","[I’d love to have a lovey-dovey soft-serve ice cream stall.]","Immediately afterwards, part of the stall in front of my gaze disappeared, and a stall with pink decorations, emphasizing lovey-dovey atmosphere, serving soft-serve ice cream appeared.","S- She got me! Right, I almost forgot that Shiro-san has the full support of the other Gods!!! With just a word of request, she can have it granted instantly.","Kuh, I underestimated the support power of the Gods......","[Oya? Kaito-san, there’s a soft-serve ice cream stall just over there, you know?]","[......Indeed. It just appeared, didn’t it?]","[Moreover, it seems like there are currently no other customers. We’ll have to go there.]","[Indeed. It’s so unnaturally deserted, as if some kind of Authority is being used.]","It seems that I have no choice but to be prepared for this. Rather...... There would definitely be a God tending that stall, but I wonder who’s tending it?","With this in mind, we reached the stall......","[Welcome to the Lovey-Dovey Soft Serve Ice Cream Shop!]","[.........................Long time no see, Heart-san......]","There, the Low-ranking God in charge of Hydra Kingdom was the shopkeeper with an indescribable expression on her face.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......Come to think of it, the gap between Heart’s previous line is far wider than Seigi’s......]"]},{"number":1680,"title":"Chapter 1680: Founding Festival with Shallow Vernal 2","paragraphs":["Putting aside their naming sense when they literally named this stall “Lovey-Dovey Soft-Serve Ice Cream Stall”, Heart-san, who is the shopkeeper, is the God of Love and may indeed be a suitable fit for that role.","But, however, nevertheless, there’s one thing I would like to throw a tsukkomi at right now.","[......Heart-san, you’re a God in charge of Hydra Kingdom, aren’t you?]","[Please stop with those words, that isn’t very good for my spirit...... It’s just, if I were to venture a few words, it would be that there is nothing that takes precedence over fulfilling the wishes of Shallow Vernal-sama on this occasion.]","I asked if it was okay for Heart-san, who is reasonably well-known in Hydra Kingdom, where she has her own temple, to do something like this. Heart-san, while wearing an awkward expression on her face, nevertheless firmly stated that Shiro-san is her top priority.","It’s truly a remarkable determination. Listening to Shiro-san’s request and instantly preparing such a pink-decorated stall adds incredible persuasive power to her words.","[......I see. Errr, then, we’ll have one soft-serve ice cream please.]","After ordering the lovey-dovey soft-serve ice cream, I wondered what made it different from regular soft-serve ice cream. To my surprise, what came out was a larger-than-usual cone topped with pink soft-serve ice cream.","Is this peach or strawberry flavored? It looked quite beautiful and delicious, and to ensure it wouldn’t be an obstacle when shared between the two of us, there weren’t any chocolate chips or any other toppings. Instead, it was elegantly garnished with pink-colored sauce, creating a stylish ambiance. Furthermore, the cone it was served in was quite intricate. I mean, when viewed from the top, it was shaped like a heart.","It even came with a mini stick-shaped cookie that gives it a stylish touch, making it seem like something you’d find at a trendy cafe or a chic dessert spot...... Eh? This is amazing. It really does feel like a well-thought-out soft-serve ice cream for couples. Did Heart-san prepare this right after Shiro-san mentioned her request a while ago?","Or perhaps, did they prepare it in anticipation of this kind of development? They pin-pointed that Shiro-san would ask for soft-serve ice cream? Hmmm...... I’m not sure.","[Fumu, this is quite a nice soft-serve ice cream. God of Love, good job. You did well.]","[ ! ? I- It’s an honor!!!]","When Shiro-san thanked her for her hard work, the complicated expression Heart-san had on her face before disappeared, wearing an expression that seemed deeply moved, with tears welling up in her eyes.","She appears to be incredibly delighted, as if all her fatigue has been completely swept away from her face. In reality, it seems like there are few opportunities for Shiro-san to directly address a Low-ranking God like Heart-san, so receiving a compliment and recognition from her might have deeply moved her.","After lightly bidding goodbye to Heart-san, who was bowing repeatedly with tears in her eyes, Shiro-san and I left the stall and looked for a place to eat soft-serve ice cream.","However, as this is a fairly large street, finding a good spot is....... Hmmm? For some reason, there’s some kind of strange, unnaturally empty space. It’s the kind of space that wouldn’t have been possible unless some external factor comes into play.","[That place looks good.]","[......Certainly looks good, as if it’s especially prepared...... Well, you’re right.]","I have various things I’d like to say, but to ensure that the soft-serve ice cream doesn’t melt, I decided to move to the space that was likely prepared for this purpose and enjoy the soft-serve ice cream with Shiro-san.","Shiro-san’s request involves both of us simultaneously licking the soft-serve ice cream from each side, so I’ll do just that but...... Uwahh, this feels more embarrassing than I initially thought. It’s making me feel self-conscious in a way that’s even more intense than regular kisses.","With our faces so close and at just the right distance, I find myself gazing directly at Shiro-san’s face more than usual, and our eyes meet perfectly...... I mean, her beauty remains unfairly captivating.","[It’s in a style where we’re both licking the soft-serve ice cream from both sides, ultimately leading to a kiss.]","[......First time I heard the last part though!?]","[I thought of it just now.]","Eh? Isn’t this a pretty high level of difficulty? It felt somewhat similar to a pocky game, but unlike in a pocky game where we eat stick-shaped biscuits, doing it with soft-serve ice cream is challenging. I mean, isn’t attempting this in the middle of this crowd social suicide for me? Ahh, Shiro-san already started licking.","......It seems like there’s no other choice but to gather my courage, and for the time being, ignore the gazes of those around me. Just empty my mind and continue licking the soft-serve ice cream...... And finally, I even kissed Shiro-san as she had requested.","The soft-serve ice cream must have been delicious, but I couldn’t taste any of it, leaving me with a rather uncomfortable feeling———— a cold sensation running down my spine and feeling hot on my face. Well, despite all that, the kiss did feel good, making me feel happy...... but somehow, I kinda felt like I lost something at that moment.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [He did something similar with Kuro in Symphonia, and if he also does something like that with one of his lovers in Archlesia, it’s gonna be like “Three Countries Conquered☆” achievement unlocked...... D*MN IT ALL!!!]"]},{"number":1681,"title":"Chapter 1681: Founding Festival with Shallow Vernal 3","paragraphs":["The lovey-dovey soft-serve ice cream was quite mentally damaging and even though it was just the start of our date, I think I’m already feeling tired.","[Well then, let’s move on to the stalls that aren’t serving food or beverages. We’ve just had breakfast after all.]","[I see, then since I’m the one who chose this time, I’ll leave deciding what we’ll do next time to Kaito-san. Please escort me.]","[Alright. Then, for the time being, there seem to be a lot of food and beverage stalls in this area, so let’s go to a different one.]","I had a good breakfast in the Sanctuary and also ate soft-serve ice cream, so my stomach felt pretty full. And so, I decided to look for an attraction stall for our next destination.","It seems like target shooting and the like are also a staple in this world, but this is a different world...... But target shooting is more associated with that superthingy, so for the time being, let’s decide to look for something that looks good along the way.","But well, being stalls, their size must be limited......","[......That’s quite the grand tent. Is that some kind of shop too?]","[Fumu, Kaito-san, there’s a sign over there.]","[Ahh, you’re right. Let’s see......]","After walking a bit, we arrived at a large plaza with quite a few unique-looking shops, and among them, what really caught our attention was a tent that resembled a circus in terms of its size.","“Super Dimensional Sniping Action – Target Shooting”","......Whoa there, here comes that incomprehensible thing I heard about at the Six Kings Festival. I didn’t expect I’d see it here...... Rather, is it a competition being played in this large tent!?","[Fumu, target shooting huh. It’s that competition created by Kuro, wasn’t it?]","[......Eh? This was an idea thought up by Kuro?]","[Yes, not only this, but RINGTOSS, goldfish scooping, and candy cutting were all invented and popularized by Kuro.]","[..................]","I never expected that it was Kuro who created all those games, including RINGTOSS, having the same name but are completely different from the games that they are in our world...... It seems the culprit has been surprisingly close by.","Come to think of it, Kuro seemed to have some misunderstandings here and there about our world’s culture, and now that Shiro-san mentioned it, Kuro being the one who invented those makes sense.","[Arehh? But how did Kuro acquire knowledge about them though? Did she hear about it from a previous Hero Actor...... no, but it feels like it’s quite far from the original in some aspects......]","I did remember hearing that RINGTOSS and the others are referencing the games of the same name in our world, so her basis of information must be our world’s festival stalls.","[I had informed her about them.]","[......I see.]","[However, I just couldn’t understand why she only made such strange arrangements.]","And the other culprit is much, much, much closer than I thought. Yeah, I somehow got the gist of what happened. Maybe when they talk about the other world during their usual tea time, Shiro-san explained various things, but Shiro-san tends to provide incomplete explanations or leave out many details, only focusing on crucial points.","So, I think the information was conveyed to Kuro in a fragmented, or even in a peculiar way, so Kuro arranged it in a way that made it work as a competition, which is why it ended up quite different from the original.","[......I heard that it was a pretty dangerous game, I wonder if it’s a good idea to exhibit such an event at the Founding Festival..... Unnn? It says “Adjusted Version”.]","[There’s a guide here too. It seems like they modified it to be enjoyed as an attraction rather than a competition, so there’s no need to worry about injuries. Well, even if it was the competition one, Kaito-san wouldn’t really have to worry about being injured. Don’t you think it’s quite fortunate you have such a reliable lover nearby, Kaito-san? You think so, right? I don’t mind if you speak out your thoughts, hearing it makes me happy.]","[I- I’m fortunate to have such a reliable lover.]","I just followed her completely straightforward request that’s trying to disguise itself as something roundabout. Well, in fact, Shiro-san and all my other lovers are really reliable, and I genuinely feel grateful since they have always been helping me.","Well, putting that aside, it seems that this target shooting isn’t that one that requires magic bullets or aerial combat, but is adjusted to be enjoyed as an attraction.","[In that case, I’m curious how it was like, so shall we go in?]","[Let’s go...... Wanna have a match?]","[There’s no chance for me to win, so let’s just have some normal fun.]","Regardless of what that Super Dimension Sniping Action – Target Shooting might be, I don’t feel like I stand a chance against Shiro-san in any physical competition.","No, of course, if I just tell her something, she will go easy on me...... but with what happened back when we played beach volleyball...... It’s safe not to compete.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [I never expected that following RINGTOSS, another one of the Four Heavenly Kings of the Otherworld Outrageous Competitions, Target Practice, makes its appearance here.]","T/N: Super Dimensional Sniping Action – Target Shooting, previously translated as Super “Space-Time” Sniping Action. Dunno if I had just mistranslated last time or if that chapter had been edited."]},{"number":1682,"title":"Chapter 1682: Founding Festival with Shallow Vernal 4","paragraphs":["When we entered the huge tent, wondering what exactly this Super Dimensional Sniping Action was, I found a good number of people inside.","Large numbers were floating in the air with some kind of illusion magic, and a “5 minutes before start” tag was displayed. It seems to be an attraction where the time is fixed to some extent. If that’s the case, will all the people here in this tent be able to enjoy this attraction at the same time?","While I was thinking about this, someone who looked like an attendant came around and I was handed something like an L-shaped piece of wood. What is this wood? I wonder if they’re gonna give an explanation when that time starts?","[Shiro-san, you know what target shooting is, right? What is this wood used for?]","[I dunno?]","[......Eh? Arehh?]","[That is something you don’t normally use for target shooting. However, something that’s like the other world’s gun...... gun? Anyhow, there was something that looked like the gun in the other world here, but it’s a magic tool that Kuro thought up and made based on the information I gave her, so it may look strange for Kaito-san when you see it, but at any rate, they use guns for target shooting. Is that wood perhaps a replacement for that?]","[Fumu, I see......]","It’s true that when it comes to target shooting, a cork gun is used. Now that she mentioned it, the shape of the wood is somewhat like a gun...... No, more specifically, it looks like a handgun......","[By the way, what is regular target shooting like?]","[......I’d like my reliable lover Shiro-san to teach me......]","[I- I’d like my reliable lover Shiro-san to teach me~~]","[It can’t be helped. If Kaito-san’s going to say that much, then I will explain it to you.]","[T- Thank you very much.]","[Generally speaking, target shooting is a competitive sport. Ten people simultaneously engage in combat, shooting special crystals attached to each player’s body with magic bullets within a designated field. There are various detailed rules, but each person has 5 crystals, and if all of them are hit by magic bullets or if the player themself was knocked unconscious due to the magic bullets, they are eliminated. The last person remaining in the end is the winner.]","I see, so it’s something like a battle royale game? I think there are probably some restrictions on the power and speed of those magic bullets as well.","[Rather than magic bullets, there are restrictions on the guns used. Each gun has its own magic crystals attached, and it’s prohibited to create magic bullets using one’s own magic power, so the players must use the magic power from that magic crystal. It seems like there are limitations on the magic crystals’ specifications and the number of magic crystals that can be attached, which in turn restricts the available magic power for each player. While one can technically replenish their magic power ammo by channeling their magic power into the magic crystal, the purity of the approved magic crystals is limited to 50% or less, making the process quite time-consuming.]","[Ahh, I see, so it’s like adjusting the power and bullet speed within a certain limited amount of magic power, while balancing your magic power consumption. That sounds interesting, as it seems to bring out the individuality of each player.]","High-power magic bullets consume a lot of magic power and can’t be fired in quick succession, but they pack a punch. On the other hand, smaller magic bullets have lower power, but allow for rapid fire. Each of those can also be used in various ingenious ways.","Because they are magic crystals, one can also engrave magic formulas in them, so it may also be possible to shoot magic bullets that bend and split. Of course, magic power consumption would also be larger for that......","There were a lot of strategies and it looked interesting...... Well...... That’s not even close to the target shooting I knew though!","[When I had talked about target shooting before, I heard something about aerial combat, but what is that?]","[Having limitations on the size of the field means it’s more advantageous to make use of not just the horizontal space but also vertical space. While there are restrictions on using one’s own magic power for attacks, that isn’t the case for levitation or flight.]","[Fumu fumu, thank you for teaching me about this...... It looks like fun to watch. Seems difficult for me to actually participate in though......]","[......Kaito-san, this is just a suggestion, but as expected, why don’t we have a match?]","[Eh? No, I don’t even know what the Adjusted Version is like yet......]","[It’s alright. I know what it was like.]","She probably did something like Future Sight, checked the contents of the Adjusted Version in advance, and made that suggestion. I don’t think Shiro-san has the kind of personality that would be happy to one-sidedly beat me, so does that mean it’s something I have a chance of winning to some extent?","[No, it would be impossible for Kaito-san to beat me if we were to do things normally.]","[Well, I suppose that’s true.]","[And so, I’ll give you a handicap. “I can only hit the same number of targets as you hit” and “I must not score more than 50 points on a single target”. Those two are the two handicaps.]","[Hmm?]","[You can decide if you want to take this match or not when it’s time to start and you’ve heard the explanation. Our wager is that the loser will “do any one thing” that the winner says.]","[.....................]","Although that was a very standard thing to bet on in friendly matches like this, that’s precisely why it’s a matter of concern. Does the fact that Shiro-san suggested that...... mean that she’s going to ask me to do something that I would reject if she had just normally suggested it?","H- Hmmm. I’m not sure...... That does sound like a lot of fun, and with the corners of Shiro-san’s lips slightly raised, I don’t feel like it could lead to anything bad.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Huh? What’s that airhead God aiming for now?]","? ? ? : [1. Flirting 2. Flirting 3. Flirting...... I could only guess those three things.]","Serious-senpai : [......The heck of a multiple choice is that? It all just leads to the same thing......]"]},{"number":1683,"title":"Chapter 1683: Founding Festival with Shallow Vernal 5","paragraphs":["While Shiro-san waited for my answer to her suggestion to have a match, a person with a Loudspeaker magic tool rose on the center stage.","“Ladies and gentlemen, thank you for your patience. Although very popular in Trinia, target shooting is not considered a casual challenge as it requires a relatively high level of magical skill to take part. This time, we have prepared an attraction that even children enjoy while experiencing the atmosphere of target shooting.”","And like that, the explanation began, but to summarize, what’s about to occur here in this tent are reproductions created by Illusion Magic...... thus, they’re somewhat like an illusion, where the wood we currently have in our hands now appears to be a gun, and the inside of the tent turning like the players are conducting an aerial battle, the real thrill of target shooting...... Well, it really is just a change in landscape, just giving the players the feeling like they’re in the air.","The original target shooting is one where players battle against other players, but this time, it’s an attraction and shooting at people is forbidden...... Well, since it’s purely Illusion Magic, it only appears as though magic bullets are being fired. It seems there are no real injuries even if you do actually shoot people with the illusory magic bullets, but nonetheless, shooting at people is strictly prohibited.","On top of that, flying targets appear randomly in the venue, and the format of this venue is to aim at them to score points. Each target is attached with points ranging from 100, 70, 50, 30 and 10, with more points gained when struck in the center, getting lower the further it is from the center. If you get a certain number of points, you get a prize when you leave.","In addition, it seems that they also reproduced the original target shooting...... No, calling it like that is just confusing things up in my mind, but in any case, it seems that they also reproduced TARGET SHOOTING’s magic power limitation for magic crystals, with each player having limitations to the number of shots they can take, so it follows a format where you aim for a high score within that constraint.","Indeed, even children can have fun with things being like this...... but in a way, with how customers are shooting at a target, it’s become more of a target shooting than TARGET SHOOTING.","I also understood the handicap that Shiro-san proposed earlier. In other words, Shiro-san can only hit as many targets as I do. For instance, if I hit 10 targets, Shiro-san would also be hitting 10 targets.","On top of that, Shiro-san isn’t allowed to score more than 50 points, which means that if I hit 70 or 100 points, I would have a considerable advantage, and once I hit 100 points, I would still be at a lead even if my next score was just 10.","......This match is quite advantageous for me. Looking at it the other way though, it also means that I have to have at least this much of a handicap to have a chance of beating Shiro-san....... What is clear though is that there’s a good chance that I can win depending on my performance.","After all, there’s no demerit for me at all even if I miss a target, and as long as I don’t hit the 30 points or 10 points, Shiro-san won’t be able to take the lead, and if I score 100 points, I can even recover from hitting low points quickly.","[I see. If this were the case, this could definitely be a proper match. I mean, whether I can win or not depends on my skill.]","[That’s right. Isn’t it good to have this kind of competition once in a while?]","[Hmmm, I’m still wondering what it is that Shiro-san is going to ask me but...... Alright. I accept.]","[I’m looking forward to it.]","When I told her I accepted the match, Shiro-san’s lips joyfully formed a smile. In the end, this competition is about whether I can exceed an average of 50 points.","Shiro-san is nearly omnipotent. I understand that even if this is her first time trying this game out, I know she can do things with ease, so Shiro-san will undoubtedly hit every target I hit right in the 50-point spot.","[Arehh? By the way, is their Illusion Magic going to be affected by Shiro-san’s blessing?]","[I’ve adjusted it, so there’s no problem.]","[As expected of Shiro-san. In that case, I can rest assured.]","She’s very well prepared. How should I say this...... I can feel Shiro-san’s desires...... She seems to be very motivated.","[By the way, Shiro-san, what do you intend to have me do if you win?]","[......If I tell you that now, it will probably spoil the fun. I’m going to leave that for later...... However, I’m having some second thoughts. Which way should I go here...... Well, either way is a significant advantage for me, so it’s more of a luxurious dilemma.]","As I had expected, it seems that Shiro-san really is enjoying the current situation, as she seemed to be enjoying the competition with me, including this kind of strategy and maneuvering.","Unlike the previous time we went to the beach together, Shiro-san now has a better understanding of emotions and feelings....... Having such a thought in mind, while there’s a part of me that’s anxious about what she might ask of me, the feeling of joy that Shiro-san is enjoying also increases...... How troubling.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [As for me, I’m really scared of the current Shiro because I seriously can’t tell what she’s going to propose. She won’t do anything Kaito wouldn’t like...... so it’s probably gonna be something flirting related.]"]},{"number":1684,"title":"Chapter 1684: Founding Festival with Shallow Vernal 6","paragraphs":["Having accepted the challenge from Shiro-san, I’ll find a place to wait until the match begins, making sure not to disturb the surroundings as much as possible.","Even so, this target shooting feels completely different from what I know...... Arehh? However, wait right there? Come to think of it, weren’t Tre-san doing target shooting at the White God Festival? Arehh? What does this mean?","—————Nice shots. Do you play a lot?","—————No, this is the first time I’ve played this, but ain’t I amazing? I’m totally good at “this”.","......Ahh, Tre-san certainly hadn’t said anything about what she’s playing being target practice. Tre-san has an intuitive sense of things, so when I called out to her at that time, she may have thought “Is this called target shooting in the other world?”, so she didn’t retort anything about my words.","Maybe there are some games here that were just like the target shooting I know of, but they have a different name, like Ring Targets or something.","“Well then, everyone has 30 seconds before we start. Keep trying to get a higher score until the time is up!”","Just when I was satisfied with that thought, the start time drew near. Now then...... I’ve played FPS games and tried out target shooting in festivals, but I wonder what this is gonna be like?","Just after I thought that, the scenery switched and I found myself in the sky. Whoa, this is amazing. I really feel like I’m floating in the air. If I tapped on the ground, I could properly feel the ground beneath my feet, but I couldn’t see it at all, and with the wind I was feeling at the moment, it really felt like I really was in the air.","In a sense, I was moved by the strange sensation, but soon afterward, targets appeared here and there in the air. The targets are large in size and don’t move that fast, perhaps because they have been adjusted so that even children can play with them. Aiming doesn’t seem to be a problem, but how do the bullets feel?","When I look at my hand with this in mind, the wood has somehow turned into a cool gun with a sci-fi feel. At any rate, I pointed it at a nearby target to try it out and pulled the trigger, and my magic bullet flew at a reasonable speed and hit the 70-point spot.","The bullet flies straight without any wobbling, and with this, it seems like I can do pretty well.","[Then, I would also make my shot......]","With that murmur, Shiro-san casually pulled the trigger of her gun, and the released bullet hit the target, seemingly drawing it in, cleanly at the 50-point mark.","Unnn. Well, I never expected Shiro-san to miss. This much is to be expected. However, the conditions are in my favor...... I’m already leading by 20 points, so I want to keep things going like this.","Having such a thought in mind, I started aiming for the targets one after another and shot at them...... but I didn’t do as well as I thought. The thing is, the target may be large and their movements may be slow, making them easy to hit, but because their movements are entirely random and can shift in unexpected directions, trying to aim for the high scores can sometimes result in hitting lower point values. So, accumulating points as I intended can be quite challenging.","Shiro-san perfectly hits everything at 50 points, but my points are quite inconsistent. Moreover, because it’s easy to hit, the points keep increasing rapidly, and I lost track of how many points I’ve accumulated along the way.","However, in terms of percentage of points, my situation is quite complicated. I feel like I’m in a rather risky spot.","Even so, although Shiro-san is shooting without any expression on her face, she actually seems to be having a lot of fun. Shiro-san is quite enthusiastic about playing games like this, and from my perspective, where I can easily read Shiro-san’s expressions, I can tell she’s enjoying herself, which in turn makes the experience more enjoyable for me as well.","At the very least, I consider this opportunity for me to compete with Shiro-san precious, and I’ve decided to just make the most of this chance and enjoy it to the fullest.","After a while of shooting, I heard a voice saying “one minute left”, so it was time for the last spurt. I’m still hovering around the 50-point average, and I really don’t know how the match is gonna turn out.","“Ten seconds left!”","I pulled the trigger, thinking that this shot would be my last one, and at about the same time, Shiro-san also fired. However, at that moment, I felt something out of place.","It’s difficult to explain, but intuitively...... I felt “something’s wrong”.","Then, as if to affirm my thoughts, my magic bullet hit the 50-point mark, while Shiro-san’s magic bullet hit the “30-point mark”.","[......Eh?]","Such a murmur reflexively spilled out of my mouth. Shiro-san didn’t hit the 50-point mark, but the 30-point one? Did she miss? No, that’s just not possible. Yeah, putting aside if we’re speaking about me here, but for Shiro-san, games of this level are seriously no different from child’s play, so there’s no way she could have missed her target by any chance.","In that case, did she hit the 30-point mark on purpose? But why?","As my thoughts were unable to catch up with what just happened, glowing numbers appeared. Resembling the letters of a hummingbird, it seems to be displaying the total points we earned this time...... In the same way, the total points Shiro-san earned are also displayed in front of her, so we can find out the result of our match....... The result is: “I’m 10 points higher than her”. That is to say, I won.","In front of me, surprised due to the outcome I hadn’t expected, Shiro-san had a rather cheerful smile on her face.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Is this a development Shiro was aiming for?]","? ? ? : [It seems like that last part was done on purpose, but her previous shots were done normally. Well, it seems that for Shallow Vernal-sama, it was a situation where “either result would be a delight”.]"]},{"number":1685,"title":"Chapter 1685: Founding Festival with Shallow Vernal 7","paragraphs":["To be honest, it was unexpected. Given that she expressly went to propose a match with me, I thought that Shiro-san would definitely aim for the win, but the result was my victory.","Moreover, it wasn’t that I got that win with my own ability, but in the end, Shiro-san let me win. While I was puzzled, not understanding her intention, Shiro-san spoke somewhat happily.","[It was a good match. It was a close one, but it seems Kaito-san won. With this, Kaito-san has the right to make me do whatever you want. Now then, I’m looking forward to seeing what kind of demand Kaito-san will make me. As for me, I’d like something where we can go make out......]","[ ! ? ]","I gasped when I heard Shiro-san’s words. I see, so my victory means I’ve gained the right to give Shiro-san one command. In other words, it means I can request something from Shiro-san.","Shiro-san likes it when I rely on her, so much so that she even occasionally requests me to make requests of her.","For Shiro-san, this right is an opportunity for her to receive a request from me.","That’s not all. Subtly expressing her desire with “I’d like something where we can go make out” was also a clever move. Having heard this, that means I can’t simply disregard her words and use my right with a random command.","I see, it makes it so “both sides have their advantage”...... If Shiro-san wins, she gets the opportunity to make her own request. On the other hand, if I were to win, it would create a favorable situation for Shiro-san, where she could be requested by me for something.","To be honest, I was impressed with how brilliant her plan was. Moreover, it isn’t as if I’m losing anything in particular, and as for her request, Shiro-san has only presented me with her vague desire. I myself consider the extent of affection we have between us, so I can be better prepared instead of being caught off guard with something unexpected.","[......However, hmmm, I can’t think of anything right away.]","The situation here is that, while I want to satisfy Shiro-san’s desire to make out, Shiro-san was also asking for something different from what I normally do. So, I couldn’t immediately come up with what to ask her.","For example, one good request would have been to ask her for a lap pillow. However, we are in the middle of the Founding Festival and it’s not something that we can do immediately. No, if I really asked her that, I feel like Shiro-san would really make it happen right away......","Hmmm. In short, should I ask her to do something lover-like, or since I’ve won this bet and was in this situation where Shiro-san would listen to one thing I would say, should I make her do something different from what we’ve done so far...... What a dilemma.","[Is it alright if we put this request on hold?]","[Yes, I don’t mind. However, if we don’t set a deadline...... we could end up in a situation where you won’t redeem that win no matter how much time passes, so how about this? By the end of the day, you must exercise that right in some way......]","[Alright. That’s fine.]","For the time being, it was decided that we would put this matter on hold. Now that I have some time to think, I’ll take this opportunity to carefully consider how to exercise this right while fulfilling Shiro-san’s desire.","While I was thinking like that, Shiro-san was looking at me with a happy expression on her face.","[Shiro-san?]","[Ahh, no, it’s just that it was definitely the right choice to go with this option. Of course, I’m looking forward to it, but the fact that Kaito-san is thinking this and that about how we could flirt together...... truly makes me quite happy.]","This person seriously says such things so casually, making me wonder if she’s actually just being mischievous...... but at any rate, I don’t know whether it was our earlier game of target shooting or Shiro-san’s comment, but I just fanned my slightly flushed face with my hand and headed for the tent exit with Shiro-san.","<Afterword>","? ? ? : [Kuh, that’s really one heck of a growth...... Not only does she get Kaito-san to exert himself to do some flirting, but thanks to her ability to read a person’s heart, she also gets to enjoy his thought process about how they’ll be flirting. A double delight it will be. Furthermore, she can even remember the ideas that Kaito-san may have considered and discarded, and even potentially put them into action in the future...... What a seamless plan...... I guess that’s to be expected of a God huh.]","Serious-senpai : [......It looks like they’re gonna be flirting, and things are gonna be very rough.]","T/N: Please turn-off your adblock."]},{"number":1686,"title":"Chapter 1686: Founding Festival with Shallow Vernal 8","paragraphs":["While Kaito was enjoying his time in target shooting with Shallow Vernal, Hydra Kingdom’s King Laguna was very busy preparing for the ceremony that was soon to be held, checking the reports coming up from the Gods and keeping track of Shallow Vernal.","[......Umm, Your Majesty Laguna? How long do I have to stay here?]","[I want you to stay here until things settle down! Young Lilia has far more experience than I do, so I would like to ask you for advice when I have to deal with unforeseen circumstances. I will thank you again for this later, so please!]","In this world, it is Lilia who has experienced the most stomach aches under the influence of Kaito, and Laguna wants to make use of that experience.","Her sharpened intuition told her that there was no way things would end peacefully.","[Hahaha, well, just give it up, Duchess Lilia. Laguna is very forceful at times like this. Even I got hounded by her like that...... Good gracious, I suppose it can’t be helped that Shallow Vernal-sama is coming to the festival. It’s highly unlikely that Shallow Vernal-sama would get injured or anything like that, but just in case, if she were to experience any unpleasantries, a mere apology from Laguna wouldn’t suffice.]","[I think we’ll be fine in that regard. Kaito-san is with her, and if, by any chance, Shallow Vernal-sama were to experience any unpleasantness due to our side, the Gods who couldn’t prevent such a thing from happening would likely feel responsible more than we do. In fact, as is the case in the previous incident, the Gods would act promptly, so it’s highly unlikely that we will have to take any action ourselves, don’t you think?]","[I see. Indeed, although we may suffer from stomachaches due to post-incident reports, if the Gods handle the response, we can breathe a little easier......]","Hearing Lilia’s response with a wry smile to Fors, who had been similarly recruited like that, Laguna nodded her head in understanding before her shoulders lightly relaxed.","Lunamaria, who was watching their exchange from some distance away, calls out to the nearby Sieglinde, who has a subtle, indescribable expression on her face.","[......From my experience though, when Lili gets optimistic, things won’t turn out well......]","[Hmmm. I can certainly understand Luna’s concern...... but with this current line-up, how can the situation get even worse?]","Lunamaria sensed the atmosphere was getting worse, but when asked how she thought the situation would deteriorate further, just as Sieglinde had said, she couldn’t come up with an answer.","As an exceptionally talented king, Laguna vigorously took command, and the Gods were stationed throughout the Royal Capital to respond in any situation immediately.","Unforeseen circumstances couldn’t possibly occur beyond what had already occurred...... is what they had believed.","However, such a naive assumption was shattered by Laguna’s men, who rushed into the office immediately afterwards.","[Your Majesty! It’s a disaster!]","[What is it? What happened?]","[With Shallow Vernal-sama coming to the Human Realm, she deemed it necessary to say a few words of greeting, so Founder-sama had apparently decided to come here!]","[Huh!? N- Now!?]","[Yes. Ahh, but she apparently only intended to give her greetings to Shallow Vernal-sama and won’t be participating in anything else, so greeting her is apparently unnecessary.]","[Like hell we can do that!!! Rather, when she speaks of coming to greet Shallow Vernal-sama, we must also consider Shallow Vernal-sama’s side and confirm this matter with the Gods......]","Although Founder Olivia is a being similar to the Gods, she is treated differently from the Gods and is not under the command of any of the Supreme Gods, so she has not been summoned for this situation.","However, as a deep believer of Shallow Vernal, not coming to greet Shallow Vernal on this occasion when she visits the Human World is an option that doesn’t exist, so she decided to go to the venue of her own accord and come give her greetings.","Furthermore, it goes without saying that for her, who had never left the Friendship City, her visit to the Founding Festival was an unprecedented event in history.","[......Well then, I think it’s time for me to go to the waiting room......]","[Whoa there, you’re not getting away, young Lilia...... Come on, let’s get through this difficult time together.]","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [As expected, when Kaito or Lilia gets optimistic, things would start backfiring...... and if there’s just one more person who gets optimistic with them, something will happen...... If I were to liken it to something, that would be the Three Musketeers of Optimism Flags.]","? ? ? : [......No, rather than a random insert, aren’t you the third musketeer?]","Serious-senpai : [......Eh?]","T/N: Please turn off ad-blocker."]},{"number":1687,"title":"Chapter 1687: Founding Festival with Shallow Vernal 9","paragraphs":["<Author’s Notes>","I don’t have much time, so today’s chapter will be a bit short.","Walking out of the target shooting tent, I walked around the Founding Festival venue again hand in hand with Shiro-san. Incidentally, we scored more than a certain number of points in the target shooting, netting us an assortment of sweets as a prize.","As this is a hands-on event that children can also enjoy, the prizes are probably just a freebie. However, receiving an assortment of sweets like this strangely feels rather exciting, no matter how old you are.","As I was walking along with such a thought in mind, Shiro-san suddenly stopped and shifted her gaze.","[......Shiro-san? Is something the matter?]","[Ahh, no, it isn’t that big of a deal. However, it seems Olivia has arrived in the Royal Capital.]","[Eh? Ahh, Olivia-san huh...... Eh? Olivia-san!?]","Shiro-san mentioned it so casually that I just brushed it off, but the name was so unexpected that I turned back. When she speaks of an Olivia-san, she definitely must be referring to Friendship City’s Founder Olivia-san.","[Eh? Why is Olivia-san here at the Founding Festival?]","[I dunno? She’s a long distance away from Friendship City. Isn’t she here to go sightseeing?]","[I’m quite sure that isn’t the case.]","Olivia-san basically never goes out of Friendship City. The White God Festival was just a special case, as except for that, Olivia-san herself said that she doesn’t leave Friendship City unless Shiro-san is involved...... Ahh.","That’s right. Olivia-san is a religious person who has a strong faith in Shiro-san and prays to her whenever she has free time.","Based on my discussion with her during my previous visit to Friendship City, it seems that she occasionally goes outside the temple for things like lunch. However, the majority of her time is still devoted to prayers for Shiro-san.","And Olivia-san had also left the Friendship City to come to the God Realm during the White God Festival just to pray to Shiro-san. It’s easy to imagine what Olivia-san would do if she got information that Shiro-san had come to the Human Realm.","[This is just a guess, but didn’t she come to give her greetings to Shiro-san?]","[Fumu. I see.]","[It’s just, ummm, there’s something I want to confirm...... but Olivia-san’s abilities significantly decline outside the Founding Festival, right?]","[Yes, outside the Friendship City, she should be no better than an ordinary person. If she wanted to, she could return to the Friendship City instantly, so it wouldn’t be too much of a problem......]","Yes, Shiro-san doesn’t seem to care much about it, but that’s exactly the main problem. Olivia-san has tremendous power that rivals the Supreme Gods within the Friendship City, but once outside, she possesses only the physical strength of an ordinary person. I remember this well because she was feeling quite exhausted just by climbing up a gentle hill.","Now, if you ask me whether such an Olivia-san can meet up with us on her own at this Founding Festival, where there are so many people and where she needs a certain amount of physical strength to move around...... Well, I don’t think that’s possible.","[......Shiro-san, why don’t we go to where Olivia-san is for the time being? Olivia-san probably wants to say her greetings to Shiro-san......]","[I understand. Shall we go then?]","The only thing that worries me is that Olivia-san...... well, she probably can’t use Recognition Inhibition Magic outside of Friendship City, and with her not being very aware that she’s a celebrity to begin with, wouldn’t she have caused quite a commotion around her?","Somehow, the scene of Laguna-san and the others holding their stomachs coming to my mind was probably not just my imagination.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Now that Kaito mentioned it, she’s rather unreliable outside the Friendship City, and with the person herself having no idea she’s a celebrity, the stomachache power brought by such a situation must have been incredible......]","T/N: Please turn off the ad-blockers."]},{"number":1688,"title":"Chapter 1688: Founding Festival with Shallow Vernal 10","paragraphs":["The Three Supreme Gods who were in command of the Gods from up the skies above the Hydra Kingdom...... One of them, Fate, flinched, and an indescribably troubled expression appeared on her face.","[This is bad, God of Time and Space. Trouble may be brewing...... A hard one for us to deal with.]","[What? What in the world are you———-!? Don’t tell me, Olivia’s come here!?]","Chronois had a puzzled expression in response to Fate’s mutterings, but she quickly understood the reason why Fate had such a troubled expression on her face.","The trace of magic power from teleportation to Hydra Kingdom’s Royal Capital undoubtedly belonged to Olivia. And Olivia was also the most troublesome person for the Supreme Gods to deal with.","[This is a problem. Olivia isn’t someone we can heedlessly come into contact with......]","Likewise, Life, who had sensed Olivia’s magic power, muttered with a puzzled expression on her face.","Yes, Olivia, in essence, belonged to neither the Human Realm, God Realm nor Demon Realm. She occupied a unique position, serving only the World’s God, Shallow Vernal.","To maintain her neutrality, there was an implicit understanding among the powerful figures in each realm, such as the Supreme Gods of the God Realm, the Three Rulers of the Human Realm, and the Six Kings of the Demon Realm, that they generally refrained from getting involved with Olivia, making her a rather difficult being for them to deal with.","In a sense, she’s a special existence that doesn’t belong to any of the powers...... possessing a quality that was just like the World’s Singularity Kaito, so even if they were to notice her arrival, the Supreme Gods couldn’t act immediately.","Of course, they couldn’t just leave her unattended either, so it’s necessary for them to send someone her way, but their concern now is to what level of position the person they should send be so as to avoid breaching their aforementioned tacit understanding.","It’s also for the same reason that Hydra’s King Laguna is currently also holding her head in her hands. If she carelessly shelters Olivia or invites her to her Royal Castle, she may be breaking an unspoken agreement.","[......I mean, Olivin...... She was probably only able to teleport to the Royal Capital because she activated her Teleportation Magic in the Friendship City, right? However, once she gets here, wouldn’t she only have the power of an ordinary person......]","[Yeah, that’s right. Moreover, since she basically doesn’t leave Friendship City, she’s somewhat ignorant of the ways of the world. Being that her behavior can be unreadable, she can be quite terrifying...... Hmm, this is?]","[Shallow Vernal-sama and Miyama Kaito-san are moving...... From the direction they were moving to, they were undoubtedly heading toward Olivia. This is quite helpful.]","Yes, Shallow Vernal was originally Olivia’s master, and Kaito, just like Olivia, is a singularity who doesn’t belong to any faction. Thus, it’s a very fortunate development for them that both Shallow Vernal and Kaito can deal with Olivia, as it’s challenging for them to get involved with her.","[I’m somewhat sorry about this, but I think it would be better to leave this matter to Shallow Vernal-sama and Miyama.]","[Right. Olivin would also properly listen to what the two of them will say...... For the time being, I’ll support them with my Authority, keeping those around them from noticing Olivin...... It’s not gonna work if Olivin herself decides to approach someone though. God of Thoughts, operate someone nearby under the application of Case 73 and arrange for an event by a Low-ranking God. This way, we can influence the people to some extent, so please try to reduce the number of people around Olivia and make it easier for Shallow Vernal-sama and Kai-chan to meet up with her.]","Deciding to use some factors from a plan they originally prepared for Shallow Vernal, they discussed various finer details and adapted it to address their current situation.","Meanwhile, the person in question, Olivia, was moving her gaze in a puzzled manner.","[......This is troubling. I thought I could find Shallow Vernal-sama and Miyama Kaito-sama after arriving and head over to give my greetings...... but come to think of it, I couldn’t use Detection Magic outside Friendship City. For the time being, let’s just ask someone for directions.]","Outside Friendship City, Olivia, whose abilities are no different from ordinary people, had no way of finding out where Shallow Vernal and Kaito were in this large Royal Capital.","Within the Friendship City Hikari, she was almost omnipotent and could perform various tasks. Moreover, she rarely left the boundaries of Friendship City, so she was almost unaware of her capabilities. However, coming to a different place like this, she keenly felt the decline in her abilities.","However, in her case, she could immediately return to Friendship City, so she believed that once she finished her greetings with Shallow Vernal and Kaito, she could quickly return to Friendship City without any issues.","Yes, as usual, she was new to crowds. She didn’t even know that there exists a flow of people in such a place.","[Oi, I heard the Gods are having a surprise event over there.]","[Eh? For real!? Let’s go!]","[If we don’t go there soon, if they have slots, they’ll fill up fast!]","In a strange turn of events, the move taken by the Gods to keep Olivia from strangely getting caught up in trouble backfired. Hearing about a performance organized by the Gods, people started moving in unison, and Olivia had no way to resist the flow.","[Eh? Ahh, move a, wait...... Ahh, where are all these people...... Umm, hey......]","Olivia looked flustered as she was literally being swept away by the flow of people. This wasn’t good, at this rate, she could end up moving to a completely unfamiliar place, and there was even the possibility of her getting lost...... but unfortunately, even though she understood her predicament, there was no way for her to escape, and her feeling of flusteredness continued to grow.","But at that moment, a hand reaches out and grabs Olivia’s wrist, pulling her in tightly.","[Olivia-san!]","[Ahh...... Huehh? ———— ! ? ! ? ? ! ? ! ? ! ? ! ? !]","She was able to escape, thanks to Kaito who arrived just in time and pulled her away from the crowd. However, during the process, Kaito ended up pulling Olivia close, embracing her in the process. At that moment————- Olivia’s thoughts were completely painted white.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [W- Whaaaaattttt!? T- This is impossible! T- This is...... this is...... a surprise attack!?]","T/N: Please turn off the ad-blocker."]},{"number":1689,"title":"Chapter 1689: Founding Festival with Shallow Vernal 11","paragraphs":["That was really close. I was moving with Shiro-san to the place where Olivia-san was, and fortunately, due to some kind of event, the road was empty and we were able to get there smoothly.","As soon as we got there, we saw Olivia-san being swept away by the flow of people, and we rushed to her rescue. It was really close. If she had been swallowed by that flow of people, it would have been very difficult to meet up with her.","[Olivia-san, are you alright?]","[....................................]","[U- Ummm?]","Olivia-san, who I rescued as quickly as possible and held to my chest, had stiffened with her eyes wide open, seriously not moving even a bit. She was so beautifully frozen, as if time had stopped, that I got worried. When I called out to her, Olivia-san’s shoulders flinched in response immediately.","[Hahh!? A- Awawawawa, m- m- my apolo—-, ah no, I thank you for sav—-, n- no, my apologies for my impropriety, u- u- umm, you’re very robust, no, not that......]","[F- For the time being, please calm down!]","Just when I thought her mind had restarted, her mind now seemed to be bugged, as she started panicking. She was panicking so much that the word “frantic” had never fit her so perfectly up to this point.","At any rate, her speech was incoherent and she didn’t seem to have calmed down at all, so I first tried to calm her down.","[......Ah, y- yes...... I’ve shown you something unsight...... ly?]","[Unnn?]","That seemed to have worked, as Olivia-san regained some of her composure, but when her gaze moved and she saw the nearby Shiro-san, she stiffened again.","[......Ah, S- Shallow Vernal-sama......]","[It’s been a while.]","In response to Olivia-san’s trembling murmurs, Shiro-san spoke in her usual manner, but Olivia-san’s face didn’t just turn pale, her face directly became white...... and smoothly letting go of my hand, she slammed her forehead to the ground and prostrated herself.","[M- M- M- M- M- My apologies! I heard that Shallow Vernal-sama and Miyama Kaito-sama were present, so I came to offer my greetings. I solemnly swear that I had no intention of interfering with Shallow Vernal-sama’s time, and I only intended to offer a brief greeting before promptly departing! N- N- Not only did my misfortune trouble Miyama Kaito-sama, but I’ve also been unbelievably disrespectful for being late in Shallow Vernal-sama......]","[ ? ? ]","It seems that Olivia-san is concerned about being slow to notice Shiro-san due to her getting stiff from nervousness, but Olivia-san, who was speaking with a level of determination greater than ever before, was somehow just like her.","Well, Shiro-san herself just seemed to be puzzled at her words, seemingly wondering how exactly was Olivia-san being disrespectful, so it doesn’t seem like she considers Olivia-san’s actions as disrespectful.","Well, putting that aside...... Even though we’re out of the way, we’re still in the middle of the main street, you know!? If she’s gonna do all that, we would be in the center of attention...... Arehh? That didn’t happen?","Hmmm, we’re somehow not being noticed by anyone in an unnatural way. This must be Fate-san’s Authority or something like that at work. No, I’m rather grateful that this situation isn’t noticed by those around us but......","[For the time being, Olivia-san, please calm down.]","[I can’t. F- For me to do such blasphemy...... Even if one were to dismember and parade me through the streets, it wouldn’t be enough for the enormity of my sin.......]","[You didn’t commit any. I mean, Shiro-san doesn’t even care about it...... Right?]","[Putting aside caring or not, I can’t even understand how our earlier exchange was disrespectful though?]","[It’s alright. I don’t understand it either...... However, Olivia-san seems to be bothered by it, so could you please tell her not to worry about it?]","Anyhow, Olivia-san is too serious and her faith in Shiro-san isn’t half-hearted at all, so she’s very concerned that she has been rude to Shiro-san, and even now, she’s so apologetic while kneeling in a dogeza, trembling, making me feel uncomfortable.","And so, when I asked Shiro-san if she could tell Olivia-san that she didn’t mind, Shiro-san nodded once before calling out to Olivia-san.","[Raise your head, Olivia.]","[Ha!]","[About the earlier matter, I don’t particularly mind. “You and Kaito-san also have the freedom to date each other”. However, it’s my turn today, so if you want to have your festival date with Kaito-san, do it next time.]","[......Hoehh?]","The Airhead God went and said something outrageous. And Olivia-san, stiffening like a cat cast out into space, left quite the impression in my mind.","<Afterword>","Airhead God : (She’s apparently being disrespectful...... I see, she was ashamed for interfering with my lovey-dovey date with Kaito-san. Come to think of it, I hadn’t informed Olivia about the SUPER WIN SYSTEM. I’ll explain to her the details now...... While I’m at it, I suppose “I’ll also make her memories here carry over to the original timeline”?)","T/N: Please turn off the ad-blocker."]},{"number":1690,"title":"Chapter 1690: Founding Festival with Shallow Vernal 12","paragraphs":["Hearing the words Shiro-san just naturally said, Olivia-san stiffened, and from the expression on her face, I got the impression that her mind was unable to catch up with what had just been said.","After a little while, Olivia-san’s mind seemed to have finally caught up, and with an expression that was a mix of 60% confusion, 20% apologetic and 20% embarrassment, she timidly called out to Shiro-san.","(T/N: Japan and their contradictory word, Kyoushuku/恐縮 again. The 1st 20% mentioned there is Kyoushuku, which could either mean “apologizing for inconveniencing someone”, “feeling shame” or “expressing gratitude”. I usually translate this word based on context, but I can’t really do that in this sentence, so just keep in mind that Olivia may be feeling apologetic here, feeling ashamed or was quite thankful with Shiro’s idea.)","[......Ummm, Shallow Vernal-sama. May I have permission to speak?]","[I allow it.]","[My gratitude...... Ummm, I’m very sorry to seem to disagree with Shallow Vernal-sama’s words, but I swear that Miyama Kaito-sama and I aren’t in a romantic relationship. I’m humbly grateful for the friendship we have, but it’s a friendship that is maintained with proper decorum, and there are no impure emotions involved.]","[Fumu. I understand. So you’re saying “you’re making your approach hereafter” then.]","[......Shallow Vernal-sama?]","This right here, Shiro-san fully exhibits her established reputation as a natural airhead. She’s acting as if she understands what’s going on, but in reality, she doesn’t understand anything. Meanwhile, Olivia-san can’t knowingly deny Shiro-san’s opinions, so she seems to be at a loss as to how to explain herself, as she keeps on glancing at me, seemingly asking for help.","[Shiro-san, that’s not what she meant. Olivia-san was saying that she doesn’t have any kind of favorable feelings towards me at the moment. Of course, as a friend, she does have some level of affection towards me...... right?]","[Ahh, no, such a statement is something very difficult for me to agree with...... and I can’t tell falsehoods before Shallow Vernal-sama...... but, well...... I- I do feel the emotion called bashfulness......]","Arehh? I joined the conversation with the intention of assisting her, but Olivia-san just appeared even more troubled now than before. By her wording, I suppose I may have said something that wasn’t quite right.","I’m getting the feeling that the part about “any kind of favorable feelings” was particularly mistaken. Assuming that Olivia-san has favorable feelings towards me, even if it can’t be called romantic feelings, it’s not surprising that the earnest Olivia-san would consider agreeing with my words earlier to be an act of lying to Shiro-san.","[......W- What should I do, agreeing is disrespectful, but denying it is also disrespectful...... but keeping my silence before the two esteemed beings is also disrespectful...... As expected, should I not now be severely punished for what I have done?]","[Olivia.]","[Ha!]","[Let’s talk over there for a while. Kaito-san, you stay here for a few minutes.]","[Eh? Yes, alright.]","Seemingly having the intention of speaking with Olivia-san alone, Shiro-san’s eyes somehow seemed to convey the thought “Leave it to me”.","Shiro-san can be considered Olivia-san’s immediate superior, and it does seem like it would be better to just leave this matter to her. It’s just, I’m a little...... no, I’m fairly...... I’m considerably...... well, anxious, but Shiro-san’s emotional growth has been quite remarkable, so she should be able to handle this conversation well...... or so I’d like to hope.","Shallow Vernal, having moved to a position where they can’t be heard by Kaito, called out to the apologetic-looking Olivia.","[I won’t deem your words disrespectful at this moment, so I give you permission to honestly speak your thoughts. Just to confirm, but you have some level of favorable feelings for Kaito-san, is that correct?]","[O- Of course, I do hold a favorable opinion of Kaito-san as a person, and I can’t deny that I personally rely on him to some extent. These days, when I am not praying, I often think about Miyama Kaito-sama, and disrespectful such thoughts may be, there are many times when I feel the desire to meet him, so even though I lose my composure a little in front of Miyama Kaito-sama, that’s really about it.]","[......Isn’t that love already?]","Olivia is an extremely earnest person, so when Shallow Vernal declared that she was given permission to honestly speak her thoughts, Olivia expressed her feelings as she truly felt them.","As a matter of fact, when it comes to whether Olivia has positive feelings towards Kaito...... She does have them. However, her lack of interpersonal experience makes it impossible for her to determine whether she is feeling admiration based on respect or she’s feeling romantic feelings prevailing over affection.","[I see, you’ve had extremely limited opportunities to interact with others until now. Well, this isn’t something for me to say, but it seems like you’re still immature in matters of the heart.]","[It is as Shallow Vernal-sama says. I have no words to respond to it.]","[Well then, Olivia. I have one task for you.]","[Ha, by your word!]","[It can be done at any time after the Founding Festival. You are to invite Kaito-san on a date. The content of your date is something you must think about, but other than that, there are no restrictions. This is a necessary step for you to understand emotions more deeply.]","[......Y- Yes...... I shall entertain Miyama Kaito-sama......]","[You are to go on a date with him.]","[......U- Understood.]","Olivia was puzzled, but for her, Shallow Vernal’s will was absolute. She isn’t sure if it was just her imagination or not, but even as she felt like her body temperature was rising a little bit, if Shallow Vernal ordered her to do something, she would just do it.","[Ahh, I’ll also tell you about the SUPER WIN SYSTEM and inform you about carrying over your memories.]","[......SUPER WIN? I- I apologize for my ignorance. What in the world is that......]","[Let me explain.]","And just like that, after receiving a detailed expression from Shallow Vernal, Olivia, upon learning that this timeline’s memories would be carried over to the original timeline, once again had an expression akin to a cat cast out into space.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [I- I hadn’t expected this...... Not even this Serious-senpai Eyes had seen a scenario of Olivia’s date being confirmed while he’s on a date with Shiro......]"]},{"number":1691,"title":"Chapter 1691: Stomachache Abates","paragraphs":["<Author’s Notes>","I got home extremely late, so today’s chapter is short.","After waiting, Shiro-san and Olivia-san seemed to have finished their discussion and returned. As expected of Shiro-san, she had calmed Olivia-san down well...... wasn’t the case at all. I feel like Olivia-san is more nervous than before they started talking, seemingly as if she had been given an impossible task.","[Olivia-san, are you alright?]","[I’m very embarrassed to say this, but I can’t speak fallacies before Miyama Kaito-sama, so I would like to refrain from responding to that question.]","Giving such an answer totally sounds like she’s not alright at all though...... Hmmm. Nope, got no clue what’s going on. She’s glancing my way, seemingly unable to settle herself down, but I don’t know why.","While I was tilting my head thinking that, Shiro-san called out to me.","[You need not be that flustered. You can take action when the time is right, so there’s no need to do it today.]","[U- Understood. I will gain some knowledge and ask for advice first before putting it into action.]","H- Hmmm. I don’t really get what’s going on, but Olivia-san seemed to have comprehended something, so I guess it’s alright?","[......Well then, I have accomplished my purpose, and I can’t disturb Shallow Vernal-sama and Miyama Kaito-sama, so I will take my leave.]","[Arehh? Is it alright not seeing Laguna-san and the others?]","[Yes, it’s not advisable for me to attend ceremonies in my position...... However, I suppose you’re right. It might indeed be polite to say a few words of greetings to them first.]","Those words were something I spoke reflexively. Olivia-san is well-known even in the Human Realm, so wondering whether it’s alright if she doesn’t greet the King, Laguna-san, I asked her that...... but I may have asked something unnecessary.","If I hadn’t unnecessarily spoken, Olivia-san would have returned immediately, but it feels like my words had shifted her thinking towards greeting Laguna-san.","[It’s just right, as it seems like Lilia is also near her current location.]","[Is that so? Lilia Albert, if I’m not mistaken, was one of Miyama Kaito-sama’s lovers, and was a noble with close ties to the God Realm, wasn’t she?]","[Yes...... She had received the True Blessing of God of Time and Space.]","Unnn? Just now, I felt like Shiro-san was unusually having second thoughts, as if she was hesitant to say something...... Ah, no, rather than that, Lilia-san is in trouble. With the flow of the conversation, it definitely feels like things are heading in a direction that’s inconvenient for Lilia-san......","[Moreover, I had also given her a castle.]","[What!? She’s someone who had directly received Shallow Vernal-sama’s kindness...... So that’s how it is. During the White God Festival, I had been conducting myself under the prayer etiquette and hadn’t exchanged greetings with her back then, but if she’s such an important figure, it would be a good idea to extend my greetings to her.]","Ahh, this is bad. Lilia-san is in danger. The flag of her getting a stomachache had just been raised......","[Fumu, greeting the Lilia of this timeline would hold no meaning for the Lilia in the original timeline...... Ahh, no, I suppose it won’t be a problem if Lilia just carries over her memories of this timeline to the original timeline. With that, you could simply greet her as usual.]","[Thank you from the bottom of my heart for your generosity......]","......Why is Lilia-san always going through such...... No, that aside, why is Lilia-san even with Laguna-san? Was it simply that she had just given her greetings at this time?","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Why are you doing such a horrible (memory transfer) thing to her......]"]},{"number":1692,"title":"Chapter 1692: Stomachache Direct Delivery","paragraphs":["When Olivia-san decided to greet Lilia-san, I hesitated whether I should intervene or not. I was worried that Lilia-san might get another stomachache, but at the same time, I also felt that perhaps interacting with Olivia-san would be to her benefit.","I don’t know much about noble connections, but Olivia-san is a big name in the Human Realm and the head of the Friendship City with whom is normally difficult to establish a connection.","Would it perhaps be better to have a connection with powerful figures in the Human Realm, rather than the people of authority from the Demon Realm or God Realm, such as the Six Kings’ Executives or the Gods? Hmmm, I don’t know.","[Well then, I’m heading for the Royal Castle. Shallow Vernal-sama, Miyama Kaito-sama, thank you for your time.]","[......Eh? Ah, please wait, Olivia-san. How are you planning to get to the Royal Castle?]","[That is, of course, on foot?]","I had been lost in thought, but I reflexively raised my voice upon hearing her words. For the time being, I think it’s fine for Olivia-san to go and greet Laguna-san and Lilia-san. If I contacted Lilia-san via hummingbird ahead of time, she would probably feel less stomachache.","But before that, I need to know how Olivia-san is going to get to the Royal Castle...... Olivia-san’s physical strength is below that of an average person while she’s outside Friendship City, and honestly speaking, I don’t think she will be able to reach the Royal Castle on foot along the roads crowded with people at this Founding Festival.","As a matter of fact, when we just came here, she was being swept away by the flow of people......","[Umm, there’s a lot of people around, and I don’t really want you turning out like earlier, so I think it would be better if you think of another way......]","[Miyama Kaito-sama, that’s very kind of you. However, please do not worry. As expected, even if this place is outside the Friendship City, I have enough stamina to walk to the Royal Castle.]","[No, that might be the case in normal times...... but with how crowded the place is now, if you go to the Royal Castle, you will also have to pass through the plaza in front of the House of Parliament, right? The area around there is even more crowded than here, and I don’t think you can make good progress walking through there with the flow of people.]","Olivia-san is being somewhat optimistic when it comes to matters like this. I mean, since she basically doesn’t leave Friendship City, she tends to assess her abilities based on her abilities within Friendship City.","Also, this is just my guess, but she probably perceives herself as having the same level of ability as an average person outside the Friendship City...... when in fact, even among average people, she lacks quite a bit in terms of stamina. If anything, her fitness is far below that of the average person, but she herself seemed to be unaware of this.","When I was wondering if I could somehow persuade her successfully, Shiro-san lightly nodded and spoke.","[I also understand Kaito-san’s concerns. Plus, if you were to walk from here at this time, you might arrive just in time for the ceremony’s start, making it difficult for you to make your greetings. That being the case, I will see you off.]","[T- That won’t do, it would be a great disrespect to trouble Shallow Vernal-sama......]","[I don’t mind. Well then, I will see you off.]","[My sincerest gratitude......]","It was decided that Shiro-san would teleport Olivia-san, and Olivia-san, deeply moved by Shiro-san’s consideration, assumed a posture of prayer before Shiro-san and expressed her gratitude.","After giving a nod in response to her prayer, Shiro-san lightly waves her hand and Olivia-san disappears. Well, for the time being, with that, it wouldn’t be like Olivia-san isn’t able to reach the Royal Castle...... Ahh, wait, I was planning to contact Lilia-san, wasn’t I......","In the office of the Royal Castle in the Hydra Kingdom, the sudden visit of the Founder had brought confusion, but even so, the situation was being brought under control for the time being, thanks in part to their cooperation with the Gods.","[......According to the Gods, Founder-sama has safely met up with Kaito.]","[That’s a relief. I’m sure that Founder-sama’s objective is Shallow Vernal-sama and Kaito-san, so as soon as she finishes talking to the two of them, she will return home, so we can be relieved.]","[Yeah. I’m also sorry for holding you up here for so long, young Lilia. The starting time of the ceremony is getting closer, so for now, let’s leave matters here to my subordinates while we make our preparations to head to the venue.]","[You’re right. I don’t feel like this ends our worries here, but as long as an emergency situation doesn’t occur...... It’s safe to say we’ve reached a temporary pause then.]","Since they’ve overcome the worst of the chaos, they can leave the rest to their subordinates and as long as there are no emergencies related to Shallow Vernal, they can just focus on attending the ceremony.","They are already aware that there’s still a good possibility that something might happen later, but just as they were thinking they’ve overcome the critical moment of the day, as if to sneer at the relaxed atmosphere they had around them...... the center of the room was bathed in light, and Olivia appeared.","[ [ ......Huh? ] ]","It’s no wonder that the expressions of Laguna and Lilia, who witnessed this happening, were dyed with bewilderment.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [A- As expected of Shiro, how terrifying...... A special delivery, directly to the stomach...... I wonder what will happen to their stomachs ......]"]},{"number":1693,"title":"Chapter 1693: And the Stomachache Continues.....","paragraphs":["The office in the Royal Castle of Hydra Kingdom was now enveloped in a heavy, indescribable silence. The reason for this was simple and clear: the sudden appearance of Founder Olivia.","This is a matter of course, but the Royal Castle is equipped with an extremely powerful Teleportation Inhibition Barrier, so the fact that she appeared by directly teleporting is one of the reasons for their surprise. However, even more than that was their surprise for the fact that for the first time in the history of the Human Realm, the Founder had visited the Royal Castle of a specific country, and if they were to be honest, they weren’t quite sure what to make of the situation.","In such a situation, Olivia calmly looked around and upon spotting Laguna, she nodded lightly.","[I apologize for the abrupt visit. It’s been a long time since the Festival of Heroes, hasn’t it, Laguna Dia Hydra?]","[Y- Yes, it’s been a while. If you don’t mind me asking, how did you teleport here?]","[I was kindly sent off by Shallow Vernal-sama. Being that today is your celebration for your Founding Festival, she inferred I should quickly finish with my greetings......]","[I- I see, Shallow Vernal-sama’s huh...... In that case, it makes sense that you can disregard the Teleportation Inhibition Barrier.]","Olivia’s position in the world is very complicated, making Laguna quite tense, speaking while carefully choosing her words.","However, she was inwardly quite surprised. This is because she hadn’t expected Olivia to come to greet her......","[My apologies for the unexpected visit this time.]","[Ahh, no......]","[..................]","[Errr......]","[Now that I have finished my greetings to Laguna Dia Hydra, I will continue on and give my greetings to Lilia Albert.]","[Heaah!?]","The one who was truly astonished when she heard Olivia’s words, which were delivered in an indifferent manner, was Lilia. As Lilia looked as if the words “Why me!?” were clearly written on her face, Olivia came closer and spoke.","[It’s the first time we’ve met since the White God Festival, hasn’t it? I couldn’t greet you directly at that time, but I wanted to greet you, who had a deep connection with the God Realm and is so highly regarded that you had received a special gift from Shallow Vernal-sama.]","[Ah, y- yes. Errr...... With all due respect, what is this special gift from Shallow Vernal-sama?]","[Shallow Vernal-sama has given you a castle floating in the skies, hasn’t she? You must have felt extremely honored and at the same time, deeply grateful to Shallow Vernal-sama for her kindness.]","[........................Yes.]","Lilia just swallowed a lot of words and thoughts down her throat. That castle had indeed been bestowed to her by Shallow Vernal, but in reality, it was just used as a venue for Kaito’s birthday, and it was handed over to Lilia by chance because Kaito said he didn’t need it...... It’s not like Shallow Vernal gave it to Lilia as a reward or anything like that.","However, there’s no way she could say such a thing. The person in front of her isn’t only the leader of Friendship City, but is also the Head of the sole and absolute religion in the world, which worships Shallow Vernal. In the presence of such a person, she can’t speak carelessly.","In addition, it can be said that this is the first time Lilia has exchanged words with Olivia, and at this point, she doesn’t know her temperament. What she does know is that she holds strong faith towards Shallow Vernal, and she judged that she should avoid making statements that could displease her.","As Lilia pressed on her stomach, stinging from pain, she spoke, hoping that this conversation of theirs would end quickly...... and having seen Olivia’s exchange with Laguna earlier, it was clear to Lilia that Olivia had a reserved personality and didn’t engage in unnecessary conversation. Therefore, this conversation of theirs would probably end soon...... Of course, there’s no way such a wish of Lilia’s will come true.","[I have also heard about you from Miyama Kaito-sama. Like how you’re also Miyama Kaito-sama’s lover......]","[Ah, yes. That’s right.]","[That’s wonderful...... Fumu......]","Observing Olivia’s expression as she uttered a few words and seemed to be contemplating something, Lilia became even more nervous. From her recent statement, she understood that the conversation had shifted towards Kaito. If that were the case, she couldn’t predict what would happen next.","In contrast, Olivia was still pondering. This is because a little while ago, Shallow Vernal told her to ask Kaito out on a date. At that time, Olivia received a strict command from Shallow Vernal to come up with a dating plan as well, and thus, Olivia intended to gather knowledge from books, consult with her acquaintance Kaori, and put together a plan.","And now, she found herself talking with Kaito’s lover, Lilia...... and thought that there could be no better person to consult regarding dating Kaito than her.","(......Did Shallow Vernal-sama perhaps anticipate all this...... As expected of the Great God of the world. Her eyes indeed gaze far into the future.)","Olivia concluded that even the chance encounter and introduction to Lilia this time were part of Shallow Vernal’s intentions...... Of course, it was all just a coincidence, and Shallow Vernal actually hadn’t thought that far ahead.","[......Lilia Albert. I would like to personally talk with you about a number of things. Would you be willing to make some time for me after this Founding Festival?]","[Haehh? Ah, y- y- yes! O- Of course!!!]","[My gratitude......]","Of course, Lilia had no way of knowing Olivia’s inner thoughts, so in response to Olivia’s active attempt to interact with her, she was inwardly shouting “Why meeee!?” in her heart.","The stomachache didn’t seem like it would subside anytime soon.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [She really is like a Stomachache Black Hole that you can only wonder if she’s cursed...... It feels like a stomachache flag for Kaori had just been nonchalantly raised, but even so, the Strongest Stomachache Warrior really is just on a different caliber.]"]},{"number":1694,"title":"Chapter 1694: Noontime Founding Festival with Shallow Vernal 1","paragraphs":["After Olivia-san was sent off by Shiro-san via teleportation, Shiro-san and I went back to our date in the Founding Festival.","No, when I think about what Laguna-san and Lilia-san’s current situation was like, I do feel sorry for them, but even if that were the case, there’s nothing I can do about it now.","I mean, just at this instance, isn’t it that I’m not in any way at fault here? The one at fault for teleporting Olivia-san here was Shiro-san, and since she had done it almost by surprise, it was difficult for me to infer her intentions beforehand.","Well, if you trace the reason why Shiro-san and Olivia-san came to the Founding Festival in the first place, I can’t really respond with anything even if they say it was my fault......","[The ceremony is about to start, so it looks like the Founding Festival is finally in full swing.]","[Which also means it’s the crucial moment for our date.]","[Well, you aren’t exactly wrong...... I guess?]","I could see the flow of people heading towards the plaza in front of the House of Parliament, so it seemed that the ceremony’s scheduled time was approaching.","Well, I’ve already seen what the ceremony was like last iteration, and Shiro-san herself doesn’t seem particularly interested, so I guess we can just normally enjoy the festival without heading to the plaza in front of the House of Parliament.","Better yet, many people are heading to see the message from the First Hero, so the streets might be relatively empty and easy to move around.","Speaking of which, with all that has happened today, it felt like a considerable amount of time had passed, but the fact that the ceremony is starting just now means it’s still quite early in the day.","It really does feel like this would be the crucial moment of the festival, but when I think about all the things that had happened up to this point, I feel a little anxious.","[By the way, Kaito-san. Do you not have anything you want to say to me?]","[Something I want to say, what am———— Huh?]","Tilting my head at Shiro-san’s abrupt words, I turned towards her and was surprised. It was because Shiro-san, who had been wearing casual clothing just a moment ago, had changed into a different outfit in the blink of an eye.","She was wearing an elegant, long dress with a white base and patterns resembling blue flowers. On her head was a largish white hat, covering her hair, loosely swept in front of her shoulders...... No, even the length of her hair had changed.","She said she would change her outfit along the way, but I never expected the change would make me this surprised! Putting aside the length of her hair, which I think Shiro-san could obviously adjust, I found myself mesmerized by her different, yet captivating look.","If the one earlier was a casual and lively Shiro-san, she’s currently dressed like a neat and elegant lady.","It goes without saying that Shiro-san’s appearance was that of a peerless beauty, and when she wore such elegant white-based clothes, I felt her beauty held mystery within it.","Meanwhile, Shiro-san herself seemed to be intensely radiating this aura that seemed to say “Come on, please compliment me”.","[......Errr, I was surprised at your sudden change in outfit, but your clothes also suit you very well. Shiro-san has, how should I say this...... this mysterious beauty in you, so that kind of neat and clean clothing really suits you, and that largish hat also looks very lovely.]","[Fufu, thank you. I’m glad to hear that...... so I’d like to have some more.]","Whoa there, she went and asked for another round of compliments...... Since she seems to like it, there’s a chance that it would also go like this later.","[Your hairstyle looks great as well. It’s refreshing seeing the length of your hair different from usual, and the way it flows on your shoulders gives off a mature and composed vibe. Combined with Shiro-san’s usual charm, you’ve become incredibly attractive to the point where just looking at you makes my heart race.]","Of course, all of the things I said were true and no lie is being told. Shiro-san is incredibly charming, and getting the chance to see her in a different way like this makes me delighted.","Upon hearing my words of praise, the corners of Shiro-san’s lips had clearly lifted, forming into a smile. It seems she’s quite satisfied.","Just as I was thinking that...... colorful lights went up into the sky from all over the city...... and the words “Greatly Satisfied” were drawn in huge rainbow letters in the sky.","......She’s come up with something new. At that moment, I also felt like I heard the sound of Chronois-san and the others’ stomachs being broken.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [The God who Naturally Destroys Stomachs...... Also, that subtitle...... Does that mean there’s also gonna be a Nighttime one? What, you gonna make out a lot at that time?]"]},{"number":1695,"title":"Chapter 1695: Noontime Founding Festival with Shallow Vernal 2","paragraphs":["Shiro-san, whose attire and atmosphere had changed, walked hand in hand with me along the streets celebrating the Founding Festival. Looking back now, it seems like there wasn’t much of a crowd from the beginning, and we were able to move smoothly. How should I say this...... The flow of people is so good that we can head in the direction we want to go.","Normally, I would think that we were lucky...... but well, such a flow of people is definitely something artificially set up, or perhaps, this was due to the power of Gods. I deeply respect their generous support, as in order to preserve Shiro-san’s new reaction from earlier, a state-of-the-art magic tool had been developed...... or so the pretext was, a magic tool which now shows a spectacle resembling sky art.","No, if this weren’t a different timeline and I had actually shifted back to the original timeline, it would seriously be baffling how many of these mysterious magic tools developed through new techniques have been created solely for this Founding Festival alone.","[Kaito-san, wouldn’t something like that be good?]","[Eh? That is...... What is that? Boxes? No, are those the back parts of a carriage?]","When I looked in the direction Shiro-san was talking about, there was something like a box just to the right for two people, and a significant line had formed in front of it.","It kinda has this image of being a Ferris wheel gondola that has been detached from the wheel and placed there...... but seriously, what is that?","[It’s something resembling the Ferris wheel in Kaito-san’s world.]","[Ahh, I did think those looked a bit like Ferris wheel gondolas, but so that’s how it is...... Then, I suppose those moves?]","[Yes, it floats in the air and goes around a predetermined course around the Royal Capital.]","[I see, yeah, that’s why it seems to be so popular.]","I’ve been to the Royal Capital several times before, but I don’t recall seeing gondolas flying in the sky like this, so I guess it’s probably something they only bring out during events like the Founding Festival. It’s probably made with various barriers and magic techniques forming an equilibrium? In any case, it seems to be a rare attraction that you can only experience on occasions like this. That’s why there’s such a long queue.","[It seems to be one of the top three attractions recommended for couples at this Founding Festival.]","[It feels like something contrived by someone, I mean, we just conveniently arrived in front of this ride.]","[No, I guided us here. I wanted to have a lovey-dovey date with Kaito-san after all.]","[What frightening honesty......]","The fact that Shiro-san declared “I intentionally brought you here” without any hesitation or even any attempts to deceive me is truly just like Shiro-san. I really love this honest side of her.","[......Shouldn’t you say that out loud?]","[What?]","[You know, the last part. I wouldn’t mind if you omit quite a lot of parts of your earlier thought.]","[......There’s a lot of people here, so maybe later.]","[Fumu...... Let’s just consider it good that I’ve secured a definite promise from you.]","Well, I don’t really have any hesitation when it comes to telling my lover, Shiro-san, that I love her. I’m only embarrassed to say it in such a crowded place like in front of a popular attraction at the Founding Festival. If we were alone, I could have said it as much as she wanted......","[......Hou, as much as I wanted huh?]","[Ah......]","Oops. Well, that ain’t good. This really isn’t good...... I feel like I’m seeing her excitement and joy in her eyes.","I feel like she’s gonna be demanding a lot when we’re alone together.","[......F- For the time being, let’s get in line.]","[You’re right. I’ll just look forward to having that later.]","[L- Let’s be lenient, okay......]","That was a verbal slip...... No, it’s not really verbal, but it’s because I had carelessly thought “as much as she wanted” in my mind, so I’m certainly willing to accept it, but I’d really like to have some moderation. Mainly, I’d like it if she’d keep it to the limits of a human...... No, please never use Lilia-san as the standard either......","While feeling somewhat anxious about the future, we queued up for a long time. The queue is really long, as to be expected from a popular attraction. If this attraction goes around the Royal Capital, even if they have many gondolas, it doesn’t seem like the turnover would be good and it may take us quite a long time here.","[Thank you for your patience. Well then, please allow me to explain.]","[———Fuahh!? Eh? Arehh?]","[......Customer?]","Why the heck are we at the “front of the queue” before I knew it? Why are people who were in line just a moment ago standing behind us, looking as if everything’s normal? What’s going on, it’s as if time has been erased...... No, something definitely happened here!","Shiro-san...... No, I don’t think Shiro-san did anything here. Shiro-san wouldn’t have minded too much about lining up together with me. However, when I think about whether the Gods can tolerate the act of “Shiro-san waiting in line”, it would likely be quite impossible for them, so it’s natural to assume they had intervened...... They really are too generous with their support.","<Afterword>","Volume 14 of the Light Novel will be released on December 19th. For the official website, please see the Activity Report article~~","Also, here’s Volume 14’s cover.","*Activity Report Article*","We are very sorry for the long wait. The release date for Volume 14 of the Light Novel has been set for December 19th.","The link to the official homepage is down below!","“I Got Caught up in a Hero Summoning, but That World is At Peace Volume 14”","And here’s the cover!","It’s a scene from the Six Kings Festival, where Kaito’s eating lunch with Isis on top of Magnawell’s head.","Isis’ attire for the Six Kings Festival is also exceptionally beautiful.","We’ll also be releasing more character rough drafts, so please look forward to it~~","(T/N: Activity Report article also posted the image, so the repeat. Well, we can never have too much daitenshi.)"]},{"number":1696,"title":"Chapter 1696: Noontime Founding Festival with Shallow Vernal 3","paragraphs":["By some mysterious force, we got into the gondola without waiting for our turn. No, I don’t really know if they call it gondola here or not, but it looks like a gondola, so I’ll just call it that.","When entering the gondola, I glanced at the side and saw a sign that said “Height Limit: 3m or less”. There are many different species of people of varying heights in this world, so having such a sign certainly makes sense...... but I don’t usually see that many huge people in the city.","The reason is that people with a physique of over 3 meters are almost exclusively among Demons, and despite their differences in skills, all Demons can use magic.","Demons with large physiques are taught at an early age by their parents or other members of the same species how to use magic to change their body size or Humanization Magic. It’s some kind of etiquette, and even Megiddo-san mostly takes on a humanoid form when coming to the Human Realm’s cities for that reason.","[The interior seems simple. There’s plenty of room for two people, but it might be a bit cramped for four people or more.]","We entered the gondola and sat down. It really does feel similar to a Ferris wheel gondola, and when there are two people inside, sitting facing each other feels just right.","......Doing it that way feels just right...... but Shiro-san sat down next to me with a casual expression on her face, as if her actions were a matter of course.","[......Umm, Shiro-san? In this situation, wouldn’t it be more natural for us to sit opposite each other?]","[I suppose so. However, I wanted to sit next to Kaito-san, so I’m sitting next to you.]","[W- When you say it like that, I can’t say any complaints back anymore. Let’s stay like this then.]","The gondola seemed to be quite stable, and I also don’t mind Shiro-san sitting next to me, so there’s no problem at all.","Soon after, the gondola slowly began to float in the air. According to the attendant’s explanation, it takes about 20 minutes to slowly circle over the Royal Capital.","[Ohh, this is rather amazing. For something this big to be floating in the air......]","[It’s actually just moving as if tracing a trajectory drawn up in a magic technique. The box itself only has Levitation applied to it, and is being pulled along by other magic tools.]","[I see......]","[Now then, Kaito-san, let’s confirm an important fact.]","[Yes?]","The view from the gondola in the sky, overlooking the Royal Capital crowded with many people, is a pretty good view. Especially during the Founding Festival, the scene is lively and enjoyable even when viewed from the sky.","[......It’s just the two of us now, isn’t it?]","[..........................]","What comes back to my mind is my own statement from a little while ago...... The line which Shiro-san described as a “definite promise”. And then, how conveniently, we discovered this attraction “by chance”.","C- Could it be, Shiro-san...... Were you aiming for this development? N- No, wait, let’s calm down here. Right, that promise was made after we discovered the attraction...... However, it is true that it’s now just the two of us and it’s no exaggeration to say we got a good atmosphere between us.","[Twenty minutes, we have a reasonable amount of time, and I’m looking forward to this.]","[......I- I suppose so.]","The incredibly refreshing smile on Shiro-san’s face left quite an impression in my mind. It seems like this is going to be a long 20 minutes.","......Wait, this really is just going to be 20 minutes, right? There’s no Time Manipulation or anything like that that’s gonna happen, right?","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Ah, this looks bad......]"]},{"number":1697,"title":"Chapter 1697: Noontime Founding Festival with Shallow Vernal 4","paragraphs":["Now then, if you ask whether the situation is good or bad, I would say it’s not good...... Currently, it’s just Shiro-san and I in this small box, and I’m now sure how much I can trust that 20 minutes the attendant told us...... In other words, there’s no way out.","......No, I suppose this wouldn’t be just limited to inside this gondola huh. I- In any case, what’s clear is that to resolve this situation, I need to make Shiro-san satisfied.","That being the case, it’s even possible that this gondola will never reach its goal unless Shiro-san is satisfied.","[......Errr, Shiro-san, in the end, what am I supposed to do? Do I just do what we talked about earlier?]","[I suppose so. First, put your hands around my waist and hug me.]","[....................]","Arehh? That’s weird? Was that what we were talking about earlier? Wasn’t this about voicing out how I love her, which I had just been inwardly thinking about before? What’s its connection to hugging her waist......","[This is very important.]","[I wonder about that. Even though you have such an intense expression on your face, I’m sorry, but from past experiences, it feels like the reason isn’t important at all.]","[I read a book that had a scene like that, so I wanted to do it too.]","[See, I knew it!]","Is she trying to fulfill her other requests in the midst of the confusion? No, I definitely feel like that’s the case...... Kuh, well, that kind of situation certainly feels like it was straight out of a romance manga.","Although it occurs less frequently than a shoulder embrace, it might be quite suitable at a moment like this in terms of creating an intimate atmosphere.","[......Umm, apart from doing that, is that all? Would you be satisfied if I held you by the waist and verbally expressed myself as I promised earlier?]","[No, there’s more.]","[I guess I’ll hear you out. Please go ahead......]","[First, you put your arm around my waist, drawing me close, and then with your free hand, you cradle the back of my head, pulling me closer to your chest. And then, you whisper words of love into my ear...... or so would be good, yes.]","She came up with something that’s about seven times more difficult than I thought it would be. Situations like that only make me think that it’s limited only to handsome dudes, so making me actually execute such a thing feels quite embarrassing.","For example, if a cool man full of adult charm like Ozma-san does it, it might look good, but if I do something like that, won’t it just look weird? That would just add a new layer of embarrassment......","[To me though, Kaito-san is the coolest guy in the world, so wouldn’t you have more than enough requirements for that?]","[Ugh......]","She sure nonchalantly says embarrassing stuff like that so straightforwardly...... When she tells me something like that, I don’t feel like grumbling anymore...... and well, I feel quite happy, to be honest...... Hmmm. Guess I can’t really tease Alice about this anymore, I might also be a pretty easy guy after all.","I’ve received Shiro-san’s sincere feelings, and if she thinks that much of me, I want to fulfill her requests...... Unnn, well, let’s get myself ready then...... Since we’re all on our own anyway, it’s not like we would draw any attention to ourselves.","With that determination in mind, as I sat next to Shiro-san, just as she requested, I put my arm around her waist and drew her close...... The softness of her body and the pleasant touch as if my fingers were being sucked into her flesh even through her clothes, just as usual, all of her body feels like a cheat.","Then, with my other hand, I held Shiro-san’s head up to my chest. Her hair feels amazing and smells great, but as expected, doing this really makes my heart racing.","As I felt my face heating up, I leaned in towards Shiro-san’s ear...... and whispered.","[......Shiro-san, I love you.]","I tried to convey my feelings for Shiro-san as best as I could in the words I whispered...... Now then, what would her reaction be? As I was thinking that, Shiro-san lifted her face from my chest and had a surprisingly obvious change in her expression. She was all smiles. It seems like she really liked it.","[This is much better than I imagined. It feels very nice.]","[A- Ahaha, I was a little embarrassed, but if Shiro-san is that happy about it, then it was worth doing.]","[Yes. In that case, I’d like to repeat it to me “about a hundred more times”.","[Fuahh!?]","There’s no doubt that she liked it very much. However, she seemed to like it so much...... that she ordered seconds.","Glancing out of the gondola, I saw that the scenery didn’t seem to be moving at all...... so I suppose this gondola will not move until I’ve done it 100 times.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [It’s all useless...... By turning my mind into complete nothingness, the damage I receive is reduced. L- Like hell I’m gonna fall in a place like this......]","? ? ? : [Even when you empty your mind, “damage reduction” is your limit huh.]"]},{"number":1698,"title":"Chapter 1698: Noontime Founding Festival with Shallow Vernal 5","paragraphs":["I have come to the realization that people have to take responsibility for their own words, and there’s a difference between saying something and actually doing it.","What I want to say here...... is that doing it 100 more times ended up actually taking up quite a long time.","[Well, I’m glad Shiro-san seems satisfied...... but isn’t it about time for the gondola to move?]","[The gondola is still moving. It’s just that I’ve stretched out time, so it’s only moving a fraction of a second.]","[When it has taken this long and it’s not moving visibly, I don’t even want to imagine how long it will take for us to reach the end, so let’s get moving.]","[You’re right. Once I’ve given you my return gift, I’ll turn back time to its original speed.]","[......Return gift?]","Eh? What, there’s more? Judging from her statement, she seems to be implying it’s gonna be a return gift for my earlier actions, but if that’s the case, this makes me a bit anxious.","It’s because, as you can see, Shiro-san is in such a good mood right now. Shiro-san is literally beaming with joy. It seems that, from Shiro-san’s perspective, she has had plenty of lovey-dovey moments. Shiro-san in this state certainly looks very lovely, but I’m worried about what she might do when she’s this pumped up.","[It means exactly what it means. Like this......]","[Whoa!? Ah, eh? By return gift, you mean......]","In the blink of an eye, Shiro-san wrapped an arm around my waist and pulled me close. It was a recreation of what I had done to Shiro-san earlier, and with Shiro-san’s strength, it was easy for her to pull me in.","However, I’d like to pause things here for a bit. I understand the meaning of her returning such a thing back, but this may be a little troubling...... Even if Shiro-san is trying to recreate my earlier actions, there’s a big difference between me doing it and Shiro-san doing it.","Yes, it’s her breasts...... Her chest. If things turn out the same development as before, Shiro-san will then hold my head with her other hand to her chest. In that case, my face would naturally end up being buried in Shiro-san’s ample chest.","Also, while my thoughts were racing and I was feeling flustered, I couldn’t voice out my thoughts, so I couldn’t stop Shiro-san’s actions and I also wasn’t able to ask her to wait.","No, Shiro-san can read my mind, so she should be able to perceive my thoughts, but it seems she’s just gonna ignore my inner voice, as she puts her free hand around the back of my head and hugs me without any hesitation at all.","[ ~ ~ ! ? ! ? ]","Then, just as I was thinking Shiro-san’s chest looms in my field of vision, immediately afterwards, I can no longer see anything, and my face is enveloped by something soft and warm.","There’s still Shiro-san’s pleasant fragrance that tickles the nostrils, but there’s this dizziness that threatened to overwhelm my senses in an instant...... but things don’t end there just yet.","[......Kaito-san, I love you.]","A voice with a hint of sweetness whispered so close to my ear that her breath brushed against it...... and a tingling feeling of pleasure ran down my back.","Just as how ASMR exists in my previous world, the pleasure derived from the auditory senses isn’t to be underestimated. Not only that, it’s done by Shiro-san, who even has a voice that seems to hold the beauty of heaven within it.","Moreover, what’s more is that...... she spoke her words not with her usual inflectionless voice, but a voice that firmly contained the heat of her emotions...... It’s really starting to make my head spin. I can clearly feel Shiro-san’s feelings for me, and it has more destructive power than I had imagined.","[......Well then, 99 more to go.]","[......Huh? Ah, no, please wai———-]","The Supreme Gods, who had been watching at a reasonable distance from Kaito and Shallow Vernal’s gondola, exhaled lightly.","[For the time being, I suppose this means we can have a break for the next 20 minutes? Of course, we still can’t let our guards down but......]","[Yes, you’re right...... Oya? God of Fate? Is something the matter?]","While they managed to respond to Shallow Vernal’s heightened excitement, such as dealing with emerging 3D letters, they found themselves a moment of respite when they thought they could take a breather from tasks such as guiding people and adjusting stalls. However, at such a moment, Fate’s face gradually turned paler.","[Ah, this is bad. This is really bad...... Some kind of tremendous force is moving...... Nope, nope, that’s just impossible! I can’t stop that with my power...... Shallow Vernal-sama’s excitement is increasing even further...... S- Something of a greater scale, unlike any other is coming!!!]","[W- What!?]","[N- No way, what in the world is———— This is!?]","Right after Fate urgently conveyed those words, Chronois and Life turned pale as they gazed at the sky that had seemingly been painted over, changing into a starry sky, and a dazzling meteor shower of the word “happiness” filling the sky.","With the day suddenly turning to night, those attending the Founding Festival stopped to look up at the spectacular view of shooting stars filling the sky.","Given the considerable distance, most people would likely just perceive them as regular shooting stars rather than falling words, but even someone with exceptional eyesight could only see them as Japanese words, of which they don’t know the meaning. Amidst the colorful meteor shower that filled the already beautiful sky, which seemed impossible to replicate with existing magic tools, a sight so beautiful that many people’s eyes lit up...... The three Supreme Gods looked at the shooting stars with eyes like that of a dead fish.","[......Nope, it’s over. That’s completely a global event over there.]","[How do we even patch things up here? Could even patch it up? I mean, can we even do something about it......]","[......Wouldn’t patching up this situation be impossible unless there’s some special intervention from Shallow Vernal-sama?]","Fate, Chronois, and Life whispered, their faces filled with indescribable sorrow.","Meanwhile, Laguna and Lilia, who had moved to the ceremony venue, also looked up at the sky and had expressions of despair on their faces. Fortunately, however, it was clearly not a situation that could be handled by human hands, so the response would have to be left to the Gods...... Of course, that didn’t mean the pains in their stomach would go away......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [I- It’s also doing a lot of damage to my stomach...... All this flirting is really a danger to the stomach......]","? ? ? : [Can you please stop adding weird new settings like watching people get lovey-dovey will damage your stomach?]"]},{"number":1699,"title":"Chapter 1699: Noontime Founding Festival with Shallow Vernal 6","paragraphs":["<Author’s Notes>","I worked overtime and got home late, so today’s chapter is a little short.","Shiro-san gave me a return gift, giving back exactly what I did to her and telling me she loved me a hundred times, and it really had quite a destructive power.","Even now that it’s over, I still feel a bit lightheaded. I almost forgot what we were doing at the moment, but I shook my head lightly and regained my composure.","[For the time being, can we turn back the speed of the gondola?]","[It’s already returned to normal though?]","[Eh? Ah, you’re right.]","Even though a lot of time should have passed quite a while ago, when I mentioned that the world hasn’t progressed in time at all, it appears that the time that was continuously delayed has somehow returned to its original state.","Indeed, when I look outside the window, the scenery really is changing, so it seems like the flow of time has returned to normal. Though I say that, when I look at the scenery, it doesn’t seem like we’ve moved very far from the starting point, so I suppose I could say we started moving just a little while ago?","[......Unnn?]","[Is something the matter?]","[Ahh, no...... Something kinda feels a bit strange...... Hmmm.]","I’m not really sure, but something feels rather out of place with the view from outside the window. The reason for that is because, naturally, I’m overlooking the venue of the Founding Festival, so I can see many people, but strangely, everyone seems to be looking our way...... or rather, they’re looking at the sky.","Moreover, is it just my imagination that some of them seem to be in a praying posture and even shedding tears?","Following the gazes of those people, I looked at the sky, but I didn’t see anything unusual. Perhaps fireworks or something went off while I was flirting with Shiro-san.","[......Well, there doesn’t seem to be anything there. Anyhow, while we’re at it, let’s enjoy the view.]","[You’re right. By the way, Kaito-san, I realized something......","[Unnn?]","[We haven’t kissed yet, you know?]","[Hmmm?]","What is this, she clearly started saying strange things again. I wonder from the bottom of my heart, when in the world did we start talking about kissing? That doesn’t connect in any way to our earlier conversation though!?","[I see, Kaito-san does have a point.]","[Right!? We were talking about the scenery, but the change towards that topic is too sudden, isn’t it!?]","[Indeed.]","[..................]","[..................]","Ahh, not explaining the reason or steering the conversation in a way that feels seamless, she’s just gonna agree huh......","Eh? What’s gonna happen now? The development of things, I mean......","[Kaito-san.]","[Yes?]","[We haven’t kissed yet, you know?]","She’s gonna push it forward!? This God, without trying to justify herself or provide any reasons, she’s just gonna force her way through her request!?","N- No, it’s not that I don’t understand what’s going on here. Since just a moment ago, we were openly expressing our mutual affection and creating a good atmosphere, so I guess she probably wants to keep the momentum going...... but when such a strong demand is made, it completely ruins the atmosphere, you know!?","[......Wait, why did everything outside stop again!?]","T- This is gonna be that, right? I feel like we won’t move forward again until we kiss......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Another serving of lovey-dovey supreme?]","? ? ? : [Another serving of stomachache supreme, rather......]"]},{"number":1700,"title":"Chapter 1700: Noontime Founding Festival with Shallow Vernal 7","paragraphs":["It has now become necessary to fulfill Shiro-san’s request in order for the gondola that had stopped again to move, but errr...... would a normal kiss be fine?","[......Fumu.]","Ahh, wait. Don’t start looking like you’re pondering about it...... Normal is fine, so let’s just go with the normal one! Given that kisses with Shiro-san are too incredibly pleasant that it’s risky, it would be troublesome if our kisses took a strange turn.","She’s probably thinking of a favorable situation from a romance manga or something else she had read before. However, since patterns like this often lead to her saying something outrageous, it’s dangerous if I don’t take action promptly.","[Shiro-san! I don’t think we should rely on references or anything of that sort for this kind of thing. What’s important is love, it’s better for us to do things our way without being influenced by others...... Errr, I’m getting slightly confused even though I’m saying this myself, but let’s forget about reference materials for once!]","[Fumu, in other words, Kaito-san is going to give me lots of viscous and moist lovey-dovey kisses filled with love?]","[......I can’t say I could give you that viscous and moist part, but they would certainly be filled with my love......]","[I see...... In that case, I’ll leave leading the kiss to Kaito-san.]","Although it was a somewhat forceful suggestion, it seems like I successfully got Shiro-san to agree, allowing me to take the lead in these kisses.","......No, wait, doesn’t this also have a pretty high hurdle!? W- What should I do? I feel like she’s expecting something a bit unconventional, not just a regular hug and kisses.","I mean, I’m sitting next to her on the gondola seat at the moment, so our bodies were quite close to each other, and perhaps the topic makes me conscious about it, as I can clearly see Shiro-san’s soft lips in my field of vision.","While wondering what I should do, I reached out my hands and putting my arm around Shiro-san’s waist first, I brought her into my embrace. It’s just like when I hugged her and told her I loved her.","In reality, we’re quite glued to each other, and we’re in a situation where a lovey-dovey moment fits quite well.","And then, with my other hand, instead of resting it on the back of Shiro-san’s head, I gently placed it under her chin, coaxing her face towards me by slightly lifting her face up. It’s that so-called “ago-kui”, but when it’s done in a situation where I’m also embracing her waist, it might come off as a bit cheeky, making me feel a little embarrassed.","(T/N: ago-kui = an act where one suddenly lifts another’s face by their chin in a domineering, yet romantic fashion)","But you know, this slightly assertive atmosphere feels different from the usual...... and thinking that I want her to be satisfied with this, I slide the hand that was embracing Shiro-san’s waist up to her back, and holding her even tighter, I press our lips together.","[......Hnn.]","Kissing Shiro-san’s lips, which were as soft and sweet as always, makes me almost feel like I’m melting, and submerged in this pleasant sensation, I need to make sure to keep my composure, as the pleasure is so intense that I feel like I might get too caught up in the ecstasy of it all.","Just like that, I was engulfed in the mind-melting comfort of our kiss for a while, and after some time, our lips parted.","[......Errr...... How was that?]","[Having Kaito-san being a bit more assertive than usual feels nice. I liked it very much.]","[I- I’m glad to hear that.]","[Well then, 99 more times please.]","[......You’re kidding, right?]","Eh? That 100 times is the same as that one when I told her I love her, right? No, no, why are you making 100 times the default!?","As expected, kissing 100 times...... It’s too difficult, too time-consuming, and with how pleasurable it is kissing Shiro-san that it seriously makes my head spin, doing that too often is too dangerous......","[......Stare~~]","She’s looking at me with expectant eyes. With eyes filled with intense anticipation, she’s literally speaking the word “stare” while looking at me. Kuh, w- what should I do...... it feels awkward trying to ignore her request, but doing it a hundred times is just......","[......Can we just limit it to 10 times?]","[Well then, 9 more times please.]","For the time being, I proposed a compromise, and Shiro-san agreed more readily than I had expected. Wait, was this all part of Shiro-san’s plans? Considering Shiro-san’s recent behavior, it wouldn’t be surprising if all of this was calculated.","[Me wanting to kiss Kaito-san that much is true though. Being able to do such a thing would have made me extremely happy.]","[Ugh, like I said, saying such things so straightforwardly is just unfair...... Haahhh...... Nine more times then. After that, please don’t stop the gondola again.]","[I understand.]","While looking at the delighted Shiro-san , I let out a light sigh...... Well, even still, I realized I don’t really mind going along Shiro-san’s whims.","After all, at her core, she only held straightforward affection towards me...... Despite the occasional times I feel troubled, I find being with her quite pleasing, and with that thought in mind, I once again placed my hand under Shiro-san’s chin and brought our faces close.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [As I thought, with this Airhead God, isn’t the sweetness level too high!? I mean, with her aggressive approaches, combined with how easily swayed Kaito is, the level of lovey-doveyness they end up gets too high that it’s too painful!!!]","? ? ? : [......I don’t really care how Serious-senpai finds it painful, but it looks like things are gonna be rough for those outside again.]"]}]);
